ext` and a missing-actuator guard; say so in Testing Feedback.\\n- Headless Firefox has no WebGL2 here. Do not block on it. WebKit WebGL2 and Chromium WebGPU plus WebGL2 are the bar.\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"b97c72db-b116-4724-9f6b-25c5c59a5a8a"}
