{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_34","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Resuming from where I left off.\n\nBuilding a Trauma Center-inspired surgical action game. The simulation is partially written but missing operation modules, so sim.js cannot be imported yet. I will read the current files first, then write the nine operation modules to unblock the simulator, fix known bugs, build the bot, and run smoke tests.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The sim still cannot load because the nine operations are missing. I am checking the live spawn and phase code, then adding those operations so a real step can run."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7531c535-d244-4b5a-9d99-42ca7baad63f-0","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"scaffold","content":"Scaffold dev folder, RNG title, package, hub client, build, test runner","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"sim","content":"Headless sim: beat, vitals, scoring, tools, gifts, checkpoints, all ops and strains","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"bot-tests","content":"Bot, data lint, sim tests green including Normal/Easy/idle invariants","status":"pending"},{"id":"view","content":"Three.js toon/ink field, instruments, HUD, pad/mouse/keys","status":"pending"},{"id":"story-audio","content":"Story scenes, busts, procedural music, effects, voices","status":"pending"},{"id":"shell","content":"Menus, chart, free play, settings, glyphs, touch, save, about, attract, dev","status":"pending"},{"id":"multi","content":"Couch co-op and hub session until harness passes","status":"pending"},{"id":"finish","content":"parScore, authoring note, exit interview, root HTML, verification logs","status":"pending"}],"merge":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7531c535-d244-4b5a-9d99-42ca7baad63f-1","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"enterPhase|flags\\.stabilized|rawSpawn|function spawn","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Co