{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_40","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Beat timing starts at zero for both count and phase.\n\nPhase crossing 1 triggers beat 1. Windup occurs during beat 4. Adagio core covers beats 3 and 4.\n\nThe adagio core should cover beats 3 and 4, not 2 and 3. I will update the condition to `count % 4 === 3 || count % 4 === 0`.\n\nCoda core opens on the first beat of every fourth bar. It stays open for two beats, decrementing by the number of beats fired each step.\n\nThe coda core timer decrements by the number of beats fired each step. It opens at 2, drops to 1 on the same beat event, and closes at 0 on the next. The window is roughly one beat rather than two.\n\nThe coda core timer should initialize to 3 instead of 2. This gives it a full two-beat window after the opening decrement, matching the plan.\n\nThe coda core timer should initialize to 2. The same-frame decrement immediately reduces it to 1, leaving a single beat of core time. This matches the plan's two-beat window.\n\nThe coda core timer will initialize to 3. This gives a two-beat window after the opening decrement.\n\nThe `e.strain = true` line must be removed. It breaks strain identity and interferes with export and phase clearing.\n\nLink severing must update `chain.links` inside `trySever`.\n\nReheal clears `link.cut` but leaves the entity cut flag until `stepLegato` sync. The last two cuts are repaired when the wrong link is chosen.\n\n`stepLegato` sets grabbable based on `link.cut`, `link.tray`, and `link.holder`. If every link is in a tray, the chain dies.\n\nLink entities need x1, y1, x2, y2 for severing. `afterSpawn` provides these coordinates.\n\nstepLegato updates x and y but not x1 or y2, so it is safe if links do not move.\n\ntrySever must set link.cut on the data itself. I will patch tools.js.\n\nForceps on a cut link makes it grabbable. Links are not embedded, so release over a tray trays them. pullHeld exits early for non-embedded entities, which suits bot hold-and-release behavior.\n\nCutting requires seat.speed of at least 0.4 and a segment intersection. The bot must swipe across the segment rather than simply sit on it.\n\nScalpel starts within 0.08 of points[0], then follows within tolerance 0.055. Speed above 1.8 forces rough mode.\n\nThe bot should move at roughly 1.2 feet per second along the target line.\n\nGel application paints cells inside a 0.16 radius zone with 90% coverage, so the bot must raster that rectangle.\n\nSuture requires visiting gates in stitch order within 0.07 times tolerance. The bot can tie by flicking or by waiting 1.5 seconds; the latter downgrades flawless to clean. An alternate action also triggers tying.\n\nScanner dwell must last 0.6 seconds within 0.3 distance of hidden objects. Hidden entities are not known to the bot, but exportState includes their coordinates.\n\nHidden unmarked entities must be omitted from exportState entirely. The plan forbids revealing their coordinates before the scanner marks them.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4b62463e-ebad-4038-a011-16c46217d898-19","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js","offset":1,"limit":140}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4b62463e-ebad-4038-a011-16c46217d898-20","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/data/ops/index.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4b62463e-ebad-4038-a011-16c46217d898-21","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"## 5\\.|Broken Glass|parScore|teaches","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/PLAN.md"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4268,"output_tokens":2493,"cache_read_input_tokens":57728,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"6001be08-2e1e-4ddc-b604-733036c7a33d"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-4b62463e-ebad-4038-a011-16c46217d898-19","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→import { createTuning, resolveDifficulty } from '../config/tuning.js';\\nimport { clampTip, DT, inDrape } from './field.js';\\nimport { FieldPhysics } from './physics.js';\\nimport { makeRng, hashString } from './rng.js';\\nimport { rankFor } from './scoring.js';\\nimport { stepStrains } from './strains.js';\\nimport { moveSeat, stepTools } from './tools.js';\\nimport { getOp } from '../data/ops/index.js';\\n\\n10→const COLORS = ['#e8443a', '#3b82f6', '#22c55e', '#f5b700'];\\nconst WHEEL = ['scalpel', 'forceps', 'suction', 'gel', 'suture', 'laser', 'scanner', 'clamp'];\\n\\nfunction playersOf(p) {\\n  if (typeof p === 'number') {\\n    return Array.from({ length: Math.max(1, p) }, (_, i) => ({ id: i, name: `Seat ${i + 1}`, color: COLORS[i % 4] }));\\n  }\\n  if (!p?.length) return [{ id: 0, name: 'You', color: COLORS[0] }];\\n  return p.map((pl, i) => ({ id: pl.id ?? i, name: pl.name || `Seat ${i + 1}`, color: pl.color || COLORS[i % 4] }));\\n}\\n20→\\nexport class Sim {\\n  constructor(opts = {}) {\\n    const op = typeof opts.op === 'string' ? getOp(opts.op) : opts.op;\\n    if (!op) throw new Error('operation required');\\n    this.op = structuredClone(op);\\n    this.tuning = opts.tuning ?? createTuning();\\n    this.diff = resolveDifficulty(opts.difficulty || 'resident');\\n    this.rng = opts.rng || makeRng(opts.seed ?? 1);\\n    this.cheats = { lockVitals: false, freezeTimer: false, infiniteComposure: false, infiniteClamps: false, timeScale: 1, ...(opts.cheats || {}) };\\n30→    this.couch = !!opts.couch;\\n    this.network = !!opts.network;\\n    this.consult = opts.consult || null;\\n    this.doctor = op.doctor === 'both' || op.doctor === 'ines' ? (op.doctor === 'ines' ? 'ines' : 'ren') : (op.doctor || 'ren');\\n    if (op.doctor === 'both') this.doctor = 'ren';\\n    const players = playersOf(opts.players);\\n    this.countScale = op.id === 'grand-rounds' ? 1 + 0.5 * (players.length - 1) : 1;\\n    this.grHp = op.id === 'grand-rounds' ? 1 + 0.25 * (players.length - 1) : 1;\\n    this.hpScale = this.grHp * this.diff.hp;\\n    this.mods = {\\n40→      drain: this.diff.drains * (this.consult === 'careful' ? 0.8 : 1),\\n      tool: this.consult === 'aggressive' ? 1.25 : 1,\\n      score: (this.consult === 'careful' ? 0.9 : 1) * (this.consult === 'aggressive' ? 1.15 : 1),\\n      hp: this.diff.hp,\\n      tol: this.diff.tol * (op.brain ? 0.75 : 1),\\n    };\\n    this.noFail = !!op.noFail;\\n    this.noTimer = !!op.noTimer;\\n    this.noRank = !!op.noRank;\\n    this.notes = !!opts.notes;\\n50→    this.rankCap = this.notes ? 'B' : null;\\n    this.vitals = 100;\\n    this.vitalsMin = 100;\\n    this.timer = (op.timer || 0) * this.diff.timers;\\n    if (this.consult === 'careful') this.timer += 60;\\n    if (this.consult === 'aggressive') this.timer = Math.max(45, this.timer - 40);\\n    this.timerMax = this.timer;\\n    this.score = 0;\\n    this.misses = 0;\\n    this.bestCombo = 0;\\n60→    this.tick = 0;\\n    this.time = 0;\\n    this.phaseIndex = 0;\\n    this.phaseTime = 0;\\n    this.entities = [];\\n    this.nextId = 1;\\n    this.events = [];\\n    this.flags = {};\\n    this.failCount = {};\\n    this.clampsUsed = 0;\\n70→    this.arrest = null;\\n    this.arrestsSurvived = 0;\\n    this.hushPhase = null;\\n    this.hushT = 0;\\n    this.sforzandoT = 0;\\n    this.over = false;\\n    this.failed = null;\\n    this.complete = false;\\n    this.rank = null;\\n    this.sinceProgress = 0;\\n80→    this.barkCd = 0;\\n    this.lastBark = '';\\n    this.beat = { bpm: op.bpm || 72, phase: 0, count: 0, bar: 0 };\\n    this.beatEvents = [];\\n    this.shockers = [];\\n    this.injected = 0;\\n    this.sharedSiteCd = 0;\\n    this.physics = opts.physics === false ? null : new FieldPhysics();\\n    this.seats = players.map((pl, i) => this.makeSeat(pl, i));\\n    this.activeSite = op.sites[0].id;\\n90→    for (const s of this.seats) s.site = this.activeSite;\\n    this.checkpoint = null;\\n    this.report = null;\\n    this.enterPhase();\\n  }\\n\\n  makeSeat(pl, index) {\\n    return {\\n      id: pl.id, index, name: pl.name, color: pl.color, out: false,\\n      x: -1.05, y: 0.62 - index * 0.12, prevX: -1.05, prevY: 0.62,\\n100→      vx: 0, vy: 0, speed: 0,\\n      tool: 'gel', use: 0, steady: false,\\n      composure: 0, combo: 0, bestCombo: 0, score: 0,\\n      syringeCd: 0, syringeHold: 0, charge: 0, charging: false,\\n      laserTime: 0, laserVent: 0, site: this.op.sites[0].id,\\n      stats: { Cuts: 0, Stitches: 0, Burns: 0, Saves: 0, Accuracy: 100 },\\n      graded: 0, clean: 0, misses: 0,\\n      cmd: {}, prev: {},\\n    };\\n  }\\n110→\\n  get scalpelTol() { return this.tuning.scalpelTol * this.mods.tol; }\\n  get stitchGateR() { return this.tuning.stitchGateR * this.mods.tol; }\\n  get missLimit() { return Math.max(1, Math.round(this.tuning.missLimit * (this.diff.miss / 8))); }\\n\\n  beatScale() {\\n    const cheat = this.cheats.timeScale ?? 1;\\n    if (this.hushPhase === 'inhale') return 0;\\n    if (this.arrest?.stopsBeat) return 0;\\n    if (this.hushPhase === 'wash') return this.tuning.hushTimeScale * cheat;\\n120→    return cheat;\\n  }\\n\\n  drainScale() {\\n    if (this.hushPhase === 'inhale' || this.arrest?.holdVitals) return 0;\\n    if (this.hushPhase === 'wash') return this.tuning.hushTimeScale;\\n    return 1;\\n  }\\n\\n  timerScale() {\\n130→    const cheat = this.cheats.timeScale ?? 1;\\n    if (this.hushPhase === 'inhale') return 0;\\n    if (this.hushPhase === 'wash') return this.tuning.hushTimeScale * cheat;\\n    return cheat;\\n  }\\n\\n  giftFor(seat) {\\n    if (this.forceGift) return this.forceGift;\\n    if (this.couch || this.network) return seat.index % 2 === 0 ? 'hush' : 'sforzando';\\n    return this.doctor === 'ines' ? 'sforzando' : 'hush';\\n140→  }\",\"content_concise\":\"1→import { createTuning, resolveDifficulty } from '../config/tuning.js';\\nimport { clampTip, DT, inDrape } from './field.js';\\nimport { FieldPhysics } from './physics.js';\\nimport { makeRng, hashString } from './rng.js';\\nimport { rankFor } from './scoring.js';\\nimport { stepStrains } from './strains.js';\\nimport { moveSeat, stepTools } from './tools.js';\\nimport { getOp } from '../data/ops/index.js';\\n\\n10→const COLORS = ['#e8443a', '#3b82f6', '#22c55e', '#f5b700'];\\nconst WHEEL = ['scalpel', 'forceps', 'suction', 'gel', 'suture', 'laser', 'scanner', 'clamp'];\\n\\nfunction playersOf(p) {\\n  if (typeof p === 'number') {\\n    return Array.from({ length: Math.max(1, p) }, (_, i) => ({ id: i, name: `Seat ${i + 1}`, color: COLORS[i % 4] }));\\n  }\\n  if (!p?.length) return [{ id: 0, name: 'You', color: COLORS[0] }];\\n  return p.map((pl, i) => ({ id: pl.id ?? i, name: pl.name || `Seat ${i + 1}`, color: pl.color || COLORS[i % 4] }));\\n}\\n20→\\nexport class Sim {\\n  constructor(opts = {}) {\\n    const op = typeof opts.op === 'string' ? getOp(opts.op) : opts.op;\\n    if (!op) throw new Error('operation required');\\n    this.op = structuredClone(op);\\n    this.tuning = opts.tuning ?? createTuning();\\n    this.diff = resolveDifficulty(opts.difficulty || 'resident');\\n    this.rng = opts.rng || makeRng(opts.seed ?? 1);\\n    this.cheats = { lockVitals: false, freezeTimer: false, infiniteComposure: false, infiniteClamps: false, timeScale: 1, ...(opts.cheats || {}) };\\n30→    this.couch = !!opts.couch;\\n    this.network = !!opts.network;\\n    this.consult = opts.consult || null;\\n    this.doctor = op.doctor === 'both' || op.doctor === 'ines' ? (op.doctor === 'ines' ? 'ines' : 'ren') : (op.doctor || 'ren');\\n    if (op.doctor === 'both') this.doctor = 'ren';\\n    const players = playersOf(opts.players);\\n    this.countScale = op.id === 'grand-rounds' ? 1 + 0.5 * (players.length - 1) : 1;\\n    this.grHp = op.id === 'grand-rounds' ? 1 + 0.25 * (players.length - 1) : 1;\\n    this.hpScale = this.grHp * this.diff.hp;\\n    this.mods = {\\n40→      drain: this.diff.drains * (this.consult === 'careful' ? 0.8 : 1),\\n      tool: this.consult === 'aggressive' ? 1.25 : 1,\\n      score: (this.consult === 'careful' ? 0.9 : 1) * (this.consult === 'aggressive' ? 1.15 : 1),\\n      hp: this.diff.hp,\\n      tol: this.diff.tol * (op.brain ? 0.75 : 1),\\n    };\\n    this.noFail = !!op.noFail;\\n    this.noTimer = !!op.noTimer;\\n    this.noRank = !!op.noRank;\\n    this.notes = !!opts.notes;\\n50→    this.rankCap = this.notes ? 'B' : null;\\n    this.vitals = 100;\\n    this.vitalsMin = 100;\\n    this.timer = (op.timer || 0) * this.diff.timers;\\n    if (this.consult === 'careful') this.timer += 60;\\n    if (this.consult === 'aggressive') this.timer = Math.max(45, this.timer - 40);\\n    this.timerMax = this.timer;\\n    this.score = 0;\\n    this.misses = 0;\\n    this.bestCombo = 0;\\n60→    this.tick = 0;\\n    this.time = 0;\\n    this.phaseIndex = 0;\\n    this.phaseTime = 0;\\n    this.entities = [];\\n    this.nextId = 1;\\n    this.events = [];\\n    this.flags = {};\\n    this.failCount = {};\\n    this.clampsUsed = 0;\\n70→    this.arrest = null;\\n    this.arrestsSurvived = 0;\\n    this.hushPhase = null;\\n    this.hushT = 0;\\n    this.sforzandoT = 0;\\n    this.over = false;\\n    this.failed = null;\\n    this.complete = false;\\n    this.rank = null;\\n    this.sinceProgress = 0;\\n80→    this.barkCd = 0;\\n    this.lastBark = '';\\n    this.beat = { bpm: op.bpm || 72, phase: 0, count: 0, bar: 0 };\\n    this.beatEvents = [];\\n    this.shockers = [];\\n    this.injected = 0;\\n    this.sharedSiteCd = 0;\\n    this.physics = opts.physics === false ? null : new FieldPhysics();\\n    this.seats = players.map((pl, i) => this.makeSeat(pl, i));\\n    this.activeSite = op.sites[0].id;\\n90→    for (const s of this.seats) s.site = this.activeSite;\\n    this.checkpoint = null;\\n    this.report = null;\\n    this.enterPhase();\\n  }\\n\\n  makeSeat(pl, index) {\\n    return {\\n      id: pl.id, index, name: pl.name, color: pl.color, out: false,\\n      x: -1.05, y: 0.62 - index * 0.12, prevX: -1.05, prevY: 0.62,\\n100→      vx: 0, vy: 0, speed: 0,\\n      tool: 'gel', use: 0, steady: false,\\n      composure: 0, combo: 0, bestCombo: 0, score: 0,\\n      syringeCd: 0, syringeHold: 0, charge: 0, charging: false,\\n      laserTime: 0, laserVent: 0, site: this.op.sites[0].id,\\n      stats: { Cuts: 0, Stitches: 0, Burns: 0, Saves: 0, Accuracy: 100 },\\n      graded: 0, clean: 0, misses: 0,\\n      cmd: {}, prev: {},\\n    };\\n  }\\n110→\\n  get scalpelTol() { return this.tuning.scalpelTol * this.mods.tol; }\\n  get stitchGateR() { return this.tuning.stitchGateR * this.mods.tol; }\\n  get missLimit() { return Math.max(1, Math.round(this.tuning.missLimit * (this.diff.miss / 8))); }\\n\\n  beatScale() {\\n    const cheat = this.cheats.timeScale ?? 1;\\n    if (this.hushPhase === 'inhale') return 0;\\n    if (this.arrest?.stopsBeat) return 0;\\n    if (this.hushPhase === 'wash') return this.tuning.hushTimeScale * cheat;\\n120→    return cheat;\\n  }\\n\\n  drainScale() {\\n    if (this.hushPhase === 'inhale' || this.arrest?.holdVitals) return 0;\\n    if (this.hushPhase === 'wash') return this.tuning.hushTimeScale;\\n    return 1;\\n  }\\n\\n  timerScale() {\\n130→    const cheat = this.cheats.timeScale ?? 1;\\n    if (this.hushPhase === 'inhale') return 0;\\n    if (this.hushPhase === 'wash') return this.tuning.hushTimeScale * cheat;\\n    return cheat;\\n  }\\n\\n  giftFor(seat) {\\n    if (this.forceGift) return this.forceGift;\\n    if (this.couch || this.network) return seat.index % 2 === 0 ? 'hush' : 'sforzando';\\n    return this.doctor === 'ines' ? 'sforzando' : 'hush';\\n140→  }\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhi