{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_58","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The broken glass task finished in 103.7 seconds.\n\nThe broken glass task scored 8947 with zero misses. It needs about 4.3 more seconds to hit the 108-second target. I'll slow the gel speed from 0.58 to 0.52 to add roughly 4 seconds.\n\nThe gel speed idea is being reconsidered. The bot already finished in 103 seconds, so the gels may not be the bottleneck. A longer scanner dwell or extra tray trips are now being explored to add the needed time.\n\nA full run of all story operations is planned to gauge total time. The finish and clean gels will be enlarged, and a shard moved to a farther corner to add a tray trip.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-dddb4966-e0bb-42aa-830f-09fd07f74d32-68","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/smoke.mjs","old_string":"const id = process.argv[2] || 'broken-glass';\nconst diff = process.argv[3] || 'resident';\nconst sim = new Sim({ op: id, seed: 1, difficulty: diff, physics: false });\nconst t0 = Date.now();\nconst n = play(sim, {}, 200000);\nconst wall = Date.now() - t0;\nconst op = sim.op;\nconsole.log(JSON.stringify({\n  id,\n  steps: n,\n  wall,\n  over: sim.over,\n  complete: sim.complete,\n  failed: sim.failed,\n  phase: sim.phase?.id,\n  phaseIndex: sim.phaseIndex,\n  time: Math.round(sim.time * 10) / 10,\n  frac: Math.round((sim.time / op.timer) * 1000) / 1000,\n  vitals: Math.round(sim.vitals * 10) / 10,\n  vitalsMin: Math.round(sim.vitalsMin * 10) / 10,\n  score: sim.score,\n  misses: sim.misses,\n  rank: sim.rank,\n  timer: Math.round(sim.timer),\n  entities: sim.entities.filter((e) => e.alive && !e.tray).map((e) => e.kind + ':' + e.site + (e.hidden ? ':hid' : '')),\n}, null, 2));","new_string":"const ids = process.argv.slice(2);\nconst list = ids.length ? ids : ['broken-glass', 'growth-spurt', 'adagio', 'staccato', 'legato', 'fermata', 'coda', 'last-patient', 'grand-rounds'];\nfor (const id of list) {\n  const sim = new Sim({ op: id, seed: 1, difficulty: 'resident', physics: false });\n  const t0 = Date.now();\n  const n = play(sim, {}, 250000);\n  const wall = Date.now() - t0;\n  const op = sim.op;\n  const left = sim.entities.filter((e) => e.alive && !e.tray).map((e) => `${e.kind}@${e.site}${e.hidden ? '?' : ''}${e.clamped ? 'c' : ''}`);\n  console.log([\n    id.padEnd(14),\n    sim.complete ? 'OK' : 'FAIL:' + sim.failed,\n    'ph=' + (sim.phase?.id || ''),\n    't=' + (sim.time).toFixed(1),\n    'frac=' + (sim.time / op.timer).toFixed(3),\n    'vmin=' + sim.vitalsMin.toFixed(1),\n    'miss=' + sim.misses,\n    'score=' + sim.score,\n    'rank=' + (sim.rank?.id || '-'),\n    'wall=' + wall,\n    'left=' + left.slice(0, 8).join(','),\n  ].join(' '));\n}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":838,"output_tokens":1306,"cache_read_input_tokens":172416,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"1a0e0771-80ea-43fb-8bcd-cb4f973b0e49"}
