{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_66","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The last patient is now handled. Time is not a concern.\n\nVitals minimum is 15, but the last patient only needs to complete. Broken glass remains at 43.1%. Growth is stuck on close with two clamped bleeders, though the objective matches the pattern and should unclamp.\n\nThe close phase failed at time 335.7 because the unclamp action was too slow or not firing. The timer reached zero before the phase completed.\n\nThe timer scale is 1, so the close phase should have failed at sim.time 330. The log reading 335.7 suggests a possible misread.\n\nThe timer reading is not the priority. The close phase failed because unclamp could not finish before time expired. Travel to the clamped bleeders likely took too long.\n\nGrowth is too slow. The close phase started too late, so the bot must move faster or the operation shortened.\n\nAdagio timed out on grande. Vitals dropped to 33.6 and never recovered above 35. Bleeders remained clamped. Scratches were placed on the tray instead of being killed with gel. The core-only laser is too slow for 150 HP.\n\nAdagio's grande phase is too slow. The bot likely misses core laser windows because it moves or gets distracted by bleeders and scratches.\n\nStaccato cannot find hidden holes on the stomach site. The scanner only checks the current seat's site, so it never detects entities on other sites.\n\nThe bot raster scans only the current site. Hidden holes on other sites are missed. The fix is to cycle through all sites during a pass. The scanner will advance to the next site after finishing each one.\n\nStaccato's four holes are all on the stomach site. The bot starts on bowel after wave one and scans forever without switching. I will make the scanner cycle sites after each full raster pass. Hidden-only phases will switch sooner. This should fix Staccato's 360-second stall.\n\nLegato and Coda cannot cut their links. Fermata's circleCut is also incomplete. The bot likely gets confused at the loop end or fails to follow tight curves. I will fix the link bug first. GR dies at 116 seconds because legato never finishes, waves overlap too hard, and strains drain. I will fix the links before debugging the other cuts.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-064ecc8d-1ee0-4b28-8755-962283240bbb-79","name":"write","input":{"content":"import { Sim } from '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js';\nimport { botInput } from '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js';\n\nconst sim = new Sim({ op: 'legato', seed: 1, physics: false });\nsim.skipTo('chain');\nlet cuts = 0;\nfor (let i = 0; i < 1800; i++) {\n  const frame = botInput(sim, { id: 0 }, {});\n  if (i % 60 === 0) {\n    const s = sim.state;\n    const me = s.seats[0];\n    const active = s.entities.find((e) => e.kind === 'link' && e.index === e.chainActive && !e.cut);\n    const cutN = s.entities.filter((e) => e.kind === 'link' && e.cut).length;\n    console.log(i, 'pos', me.x.toFixed(2), me.y.toFixed(2), 'tool', frame.tool, 'use', frame.use, 'stick', (frame.x||0).toFixed(2), (frame.y||0).toFixed(2),\n      'active', active ? `${active.index}@${active.x1?.toFixed?.(2)},${active.y1?.toFixed?.(2)}-${active.x2?.toFixed?.(2)},${active.y2?.toFixed?.(2)}` : '-',\n      'cuts', cutN, 'vit', s.vitals.toFixed(0));\n  }\n  sim.input(0, frame);\n  sim.step();\n  if (sim.events.some((e) => e.type === 'sever' || e.type === 'miss' || e.type === 'reheal')) {\n    console.log(' ev', sim.events.filter((e) => e.type === 'sever' || e.type === 'nick' || e.type === 'reheal' || e.type === 'grade').map((e) => e.type + (e.grade || '')).join(','));\n  }\n}\nconsole.log('phase', sim.phase?.id, 'miss', sim.misses, 'over', sim.over, sim.failed);\n","file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/dbg3.mjs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":813,"output_tokens":2034,"cache_read_input_tokens":185984,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"c51fbe86-0cf8-4e7a-a7ee-28bdaeb87c45"}
