{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_78","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Growth-spurt fails at close with two clamped bleeders.\n\nThe close phase's done condition already requires all clamps off, so phaseCleared returns false while bleeders remain clamped. This prevents completePhase from setting needUnclamp. The bot should unclamp once the objective matches \"Close\" and the candidate list is empty.\n\nThe candidate list should be empty if only clamped bleeders remain, since unclamped bleeders are skipped during closing. The bot still fails to unclamp, so either the objective does not match or flags.closing is not set.\n\nexportState omits flags, so the bot loses its closing state across saves. The unclamp command itself is broken. After unclamping, something reclamps the bleeders. The phase never reaches a state where only clamps remain until the timer expires. Numbers are unchanged from before the fix, which is odd because the fix should prevent reclamping during closing.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6d6aa2e5-ead7-4f1b-ba18-06d85118d6bf-9","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"objective|closing|allClamps|gelZone|spawn","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src","glob":"**/growth*.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6d6aa2e5-ead7-4f1b-ba18-06d85118d6bf-10","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"flags|objective|phaseTools","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6d6aa2e5-ead7-4f1b-ba18-06d85118d6bf-11","name":"list_dir","input":{"target_directory":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-