,116,99,104,101,115,44,32,102,101,101,100,101,114,115,32,124,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":11,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/PLAN.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":235,\"content\":\"- **Scanner.** Hold Use: an x-ray circle of `scannerRadius` around the tip. Hidden things inside are visible; 0.6 s of dwell **marks** them (ping), and they stay marked. Hidden things can't be touched by other tools until marked. A dwell of 1 s on Tremolo pins it.\"},{\"line_number\":252,\"content\":\"| **Crescendo** | *crescendo (n.): gradually getting louder. She is about to get very loud.* | A hairpin \\\"<\\\" wedge wrapped into a ring that widens | Size grows by `0.02 + 0.015 × live feeders` per second, from 0.2 to 1. Drain `1 + 6 × size` vitals/s. Four feeders (HP 40) regrow every 16 beats. At size 1: **Fortissimo**: -20 vitals, 2 bleeders, size resets to 0.6 | Kill all feeders: the ring shrinks and shows a circular cut line. Scalpel the circle, Forceps it out | One new voice every bar |\"},{\"line_number\":254,\"content\":\"| **Coda** | *coda (n.): the tail. The part that ends everything.* | Coda sign (circle and cross) as a core, two long baton arms on Rapier chains, a tailcoat membrane | **Beat 1 Downbeat:** ring telegraphs one beat early; the baton slams, -6 vitals and a scratch, unless you Laser the baton 0.5 s during the wind-up. **Beat 3 Cue:** spawns 2 notes or a small Adagio. **Every 4th bar a rest:** the core opens for 2 beats, Laser ×3. At 66% and 33% of HP 300 it moves to another site and its arms regrow; sever the arms to reach it. At 0: long Forceps pull (embed 0.6) | All of it | All the motifs in counterpoint, with the Dies Irae (§11) on organ |\"},{\"line_number\":312,\"content\":\"2. **Crescendo:** feeders, Fortissimo threat, cut out the ring.\"},{\"line_number\":324,\"content\":\"3. **Recapitulation (aorta):** Crescendo, then a Fermata arrest. Every monitor in the hospital audibly falls into time with hers.\"},{\"line_number\":338,\"content\":\"3. **2:15, Legato and Crescendo:** a chain on the bowel, a ring on the heart.\"},{\"line_number\":516,\"content\":\"**Scanner:** a world-space circle in the site material's `colorNode`, replacing the surface with cyan-on-navy hatching inside `scannerRadius` (verified).\"},{\"line_number\":574,\"content\":\"| Strains (skinned) | Adagio `crawl` and `bite`, Tremolo `shiver` and `flee`, Legato `slither` and `jerk`, Crescendo `swell`, Fermata `open` and `close`, Coda `conduct`, `downbeat`, `cue`, `rest` |\"},{\"line_number\":632,\"content\":\"- **Loop (about 3 minutes):** a story snippet (Bea and Ren, S1 lines) → Op 1 shards and stitching → Op 2 incision and clamps → the Hush moment → Adagio laser and forceps → Staccato swarm → Tremolo → Legato with Sforzando → Crescendo and a Fermata Defib → Coda with site switching → rank stamp → logo → repeat.\"},{\"line_number\":667,\"content\":\"| | `scannerRadius` | 0.3 | 0.15–0.5 | Reveal circle (fu) |\"},{\"line_number\":678,\"content\":\"| | `spawnRateMult` | 1 | 0.3–2.5 | Notes, scratches, feeders |\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-91a911ef-f8da-4e33-8d14-7c4de7ffcd52-25","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"40→  if (Math.abs(den) < 1e-12) return null;\\n  const t = ((c.x - a.x) * qpy - (c.y - a.y) * qpx) / den;\\n  const u = ((c.x - a.x) * rpy - (c.y - a.y) * rpx) / den;\\n  if (t >= 0 && t <= 1 && u >= 0 && u <= 1) return { t, u, x: a.x + rpx * t, y: a.y + rpy * t };\\n  return null;\\n}\\n\\nexport function polyLen(points) {\\n  let n = 0;\\n  for (let i = 1; i < points.length; i++) n += hypot(points[i][0] - points[i - 1][0], points[i][1] - points[i - 1][1]);\\n50→  return n;\\n}\\n\\nexport function projectPoly(points, x, y) {\\n  let best = null;\\n  let base = 0;\\n  for (let i = 1; i < points.length; i++) {\\n    const hit = distPointSeg(x, y, points[i - 1][0], points[i - 1][1], points[i][0], points[i][1]);\\n    const seg = hypot(points[i][0] - points[i - 1][0], points[i][1] - points[i - 1][1]);\\n    const along = base + hit.t * seg;\\n60→    if (!best || hit.d < best.d) best = { d: hit.d, x: hit.x, y: hit.y, along };\\n    base += seg;\\n  }\\n  return best;\\n}\\n\\nexport function angDiff(a, b) {\\n  let d = a - b;\\n  while (d > Math.PI) d -= Math.PI * 2;\\n  while (d < -Math.PI) d += Math.PI * 2;\\n70→  return d;\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"40→  if (Math.abs(den) < 1e-12) return null;\\n  const t = ((c.x - a.x) * qpy - (c.y - a.y) * qpx) / den;\\n  const u = ((c.x - a.x) * rpy - (c.y - a.y) * rpx) / den;\\n  if (t >= 0 && t <= 1 && u >= 0 && u <= 1) return { t, u, x: a.x + rpx * t, y: a.y + rpy * t };\\n  return null;\\n}\\n\\nexport function polyLen(points) {\\n  let n = 0;\\n  for (let i = 1; i < points.length; i++) n += hypot(points[i][0] - points[i - 1][0], points[i][1] - points[i - 1][1]);\\n50→  return n;\\n}\\n\\nexport function projectPoly(points, x, y) {\\n  let best = null;\\n  let base = 0;\\n  for (let i = 1; i < points.length; i++) {\\n    const hit = distPointSeg(x, y, points[i - 1][0], points[i - 1][1], points[i][0], points[i][1]);\\n    const seg = hypot(points[i][0] - points[i - 1][0], points[i][1] - points[i - 1][1]);\\n    const along = base + hit.t * seg;\\n60→    if (!best || hit.d < best.d) best = { d: hit.d, x: hit.x, y: hit.y, along };\\n    base += seg;\\n  }\\n  return best;\\n}\\n\\nexport function angDiff(a, b) {\\n  let d = a - b;\\n  while (d > Math.PI) d -= Math.PI * 2;\\n  while (d < -Math.PI) d += Math.PI * 2;\\n70→  return d;\\n}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/field.js\",\"offset\":40,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"  if (Math.abs(den) < 1e-12) return null;\\n  const t = ((c.x - a.x) * qpy - (c.y - a.y) * qpx) / den;\\n  const u = ((c.x - a.x) * rpy - (c.y - a.y) * rpx) / den;\\n  if (t >= 0 && t <= 1 && u >= 0 && u <= 1) return { t, u, x: a.x + rpx * t, y: a.y + rpy * t };\\n  return null;\\n}\\n\\nexport function polyLen(points) {\\n  let n = 0;\\n  for (let i = 1; i < points.length; i++) n += hypot(points[i][0] - points[i - 1][0], points[i][1] - points[i - 1][1]);\\n  return n;\\n}\\n\\nexport function projectPoly(points, x, y) {\\n  let best = null;\\n  let base = 0;\\n  for (let i = 1; i < points.length; i++) {\\n    const hit = distPointSeg(x, y, points[i - 1][0], points[i - 1][1], points[i][0], points[i][1]);\\n    const seg = hypot(points[i][0] - points[i - 1][0], points[i][1] - points[i - 1][1]);\\n    const along = base + hit.t * seg;\\n    if (!best || hit.d < best.d) best = { d: hit.d, x: hit.x, y: hit.y, along };\\n    base += seg;\\n  }\\n  return best;\\n}\\n\\nexport function angDiff(a, b) {\\n  let d = a - b;\\n  while (d > Math.PI) d -= Math.PI * 2;\\n  while (d < -Math.PI) d += Math.PI * 2;\\n  return d;\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":71}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-91a911ef-f8da-4e33-8d14-7c4de7ffcd52-26","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"330→function moveCoda(sim, e) {\\n  const sites = sim.op.sites.map((s) => s.id);\\n  const i = sites.indexOf(e.site);\\n  e.site = sites[(i + 1) % sites.length];\\n  for (const a of sim.entities) if (a.kind === 'baton' && a.parent === e.id) a.alive = false;\\n  sim.spawn({ kind: 'baton', site: e.site, parent: e.id, at: [e.x - 0.28, e.y], hp: 15 });\\n  sim.spawn({ kind: 'baton', site: e.site, parent: e.id, at: [e.x + 0.28, e.y], hp: 15 });\\n  sim.events.push({ type: 'codaMove', site: e.site });\\n}\\n\\n340→function stepBleeder(sim, e, dt) {\\n  if (e.clamped) {\\n    e.need = 'wait';\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  e.need = 'clamp';\\n  const world = sim.drainScale();\\n  sim.hurt(1 * dt * world, 'bleed');\\n  if (!e.pool) {\\n    const pool = sim.spawn({ kind: 'pool', site: e.site, at: [e.x, e.y + 0.05], vol: 0.2, cap: 0.55 });\\n350→    e.pool = pool.id;\\n  }\\n  const pool = sim.entities.find((p) => p.id === e.pool && p.alive);\\n  if (pool) pool.vol += 0.35 * dt * world;\\n}\\n\\nfunction stepPool(sim, e, dt) {\\n  if (e.vol > e.cap) {\\n    e.overflowed = true;\\n    e.covers = true;\\n360→    sim.hurt(0.4 * dt * sim.drainScale(), 'overflow');\\n    for (const g of sim.entities) {\\n      if (g.alive && g.site === e.site && dist(g.x, g.y, e.x, e.y) < 0.2 && g.kind !== 'pool') g.covered = true;\\n    }\\n    if ((sim.overflowBark || 0) <= 0) {\\n      sim.bark('overflow');\\n      sim.overflowBark = 4;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  if (sim.overflowBark > 0) sim.overflowBark -= dt;\\n370→}\\n\\nexport function hpOf(base, sim) {\\n  return base * sim.tuning.strainHpMult * sim.mods.hp * sim.grHp;\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"330→function moveCoda(sim, e) {\\n  const sites = sim.op.sites.map((s) => s.id);\\n  const i = sites.indexOf(e.site);\\n  e.site = sites[(i + 1) % sites.length];\\n  for (const a of sim.entities) if (a.kind === 'baton' && a.parent === e.id) a.alive = false;\\n  sim.spawn({ kind: 'baton', site: e.site, parent: e.id, at: [e.x - 0.28, e.y], hp: 15 });\\n  sim.spawn({ kind: 'baton', site: e.site, parent: e.id, at: [e.x + 0.28, e.y], hp: 15 });\\n  sim.events.push({ type: 'codaMove', site: e.site });\\n}\\n\\n340→function stepBleeder(sim, e, dt) {\\n  if (e.clamped) {\\n    e.need = 'wait';\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  e.need = 'clamp';\\n  const world = sim.drainScale();\\n  sim.hurt(1 * dt * world, 'bleed');\\n  if (!e.pool) {\\n    const pool = sim.spawn({ kind: 'pool', site: e.site, at: [e.x, e.y + 0.05], vol: 0.2, cap: 0.55 });\\n350→    e.pool = pool.id;\\n  }\\n  const pool = sim.entities.find((p) => p.id === e.pool && p.alive);\\n  if (pool) pool.vol += 0.35 * dt * world;\\n}\\n\\nfunction stepPool(sim, e, dt) {\\n  if (e.vol > e.cap) {\\n    e.overflowed = true;\\n    e.covers = true;\\n360→    sim.hurt(0.4 * dt * sim.drainScale(), 'overflow');\\n    for (const g of sim.entities) {\\n      if (g.alive && g.site === e.site && dist(g.x, g.y, e.x, e.y) < 0.2 && g.kind !== 'pool') g.covered = true;\\n    }\\n    if ((sim.overflowBark || 0) <= 0) {\\n      sim.bark('overflow');\\n      sim.overflowBark = 4;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  if (sim.overflowBark > 0) sim.overflowBark -= dt;\\n370→}\\n\\nexport function hpOf(base, sim) {\\n  return base * sim.tuning.strainHpMult * sim.mods.hp * sim.grHp;\\n}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/strains.js\",\"offset\":330,\"limit\":50,\"raw_output\":\"function moveCoda(sim, e) {\\n  const sites = sim.op.sites.map((s) => s.id);\\n  const i = sites.indexOf(e.site);\\n  e.site = sites[(i + 1) % sites.length];\\n  for (const a of sim.entities) if (a.kind === 'baton' && a.parent === e.id) a.alive = false;\\n  sim.spawn({ kind: 'baton', site: e.site, parent: e.id, at: [e.x - 0.28, e.y], hp: 15 });\\n  sim.spawn({ kind: 'baton', site: e.site, parent: e.id, at: [e.x + 0.28, e.y], hp: 15 });\\n  sim.events.push({ type: 'codaMove', site: e.site });\\n}\\n\\nfunction stepBleeder(sim, e, dt) {\\n  if (e.clamped) {\\n    e.need = 'wait';\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  e.need = 'clamp';\\n  const world = sim.drainScale();\\n  sim.hurt(1 * dt * world, 'bleed');\\n  if (!e.pool) {\\n    const pool = sim.spawn({ kind: 'pool', site: e.site, at: [e.x, e.y + 0.05], vol: 0.2, cap: 0.55 });\\n    e.pool = pool.id;\\n  }\\n  const pool = sim.entities.find((p) => p.id === e.pool && p.alive);\\n  if (pool) pool.vol += 0.35 * dt * world;\\n}\\n\\nfunction stepPool(sim, e, dt) {\\n  if (e.vol > e.cap) {\\n    e.overflowed = true;\\n    e.covers = true;\\n    sim.hurt(0.4 * dt * sim.drainScale(), 'overflow');\\n    for (const g of sim.entities) {\\n      if (g.alive && g.site === e.site && dist(g.x, g.y, e.x, e.y) < 0.2 && g.kind !== 'pool') g.covered = true;\\n    }\\n    if ((sim.overflowBark || 0) <= 0) {\\n      sim.bark('overflow');\\n      sim.overflowBark = 4;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  if (sim.overflowBark > 0) sim.overflowBark -= dt;\\n}\\n\\nexport function hpOf(base, sim) {\\n  return base * sim.tuning.strainHpMult * sim.mods.hp * sim.grHp;\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":374}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"f072bd34-e2b9-4629-a49c-19678acec907"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_84","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The plan specifies four HP 40 feeders that regrow every 16 beats.\n\nAt 88 BPM, the 16-beat window is about 10.9 seconds. Four feeders need roughly 5.3 seconds to kill at full laser DPS, plus travel time. The spawn positions are being calculated from a radius of 0.28.\n\nFeeders are spaced 0.32 units apart. Travel time between them is roughly 1.6 seconds, plus approach to the first, totaling about 8 seconds. This fits inside the 10.9-second window.\n\nHowever, Fortissimo spawns bleeders at priority 90, which outranks feeder priority 77. The bot will leave the feeders to clamp those bleeders, causing the feeders to regrow. The laser also needs venting after six seconds.\n\nThe laser only accumulates damage while the bot is within 0.03 units of a target. Four feeders need about 5.3 seconds to kill, which fits entirely inside the six-second continuous fire window, so no venting occurs.\n\nFortissimo bleeders grow at 0.08 units per second. They reach size one in roughly ten seconds, which aligns with the feeder clearing window.\n\nThe bot must kill all four feeders before Fortissimo fires and before beat 16. If it succeeds, the exposed flag triggers and the regrowth loop stops. The window is tight: roughly ten seconds from phase start. During that time, crescendo drains about forty-six vitals while Fortissimo adds another twenty.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-33afa77f-8e97-4a7d-a93e-83c8363a03c7-27","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/config/tuning.js","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-33afa77f-8e97-4a7d-a93e-83c8363a03c7-28","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function blocked|tipSpeed|seat.speed|stickCurve|function applyInput|cmd\\.","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim","glob":"*.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2285,"output_tokens":2206,"cache_read_input_tokens":68608,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"907893db-c106-4db5-a9eb-6167b7abfe87"}
