{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_89","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The onRemoved function does not set alive to false.\n\nTray entities are excluded from strainDead but remain exportable while alive. A leftover filter likely removes them. I will write a debug script to log fermata state every five seconds.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The close-phase clamps and the crescendo ring are stalling for different reasons. I’ll log both on the shipped sim before changing numbers."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7b3cfdcd-7867-48b6-bd4f-84bd6b0d40d9-36","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/smoke.mjs","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":771,"output_tokens":440,"cache_read_input_tokens":83072,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"244f872c-4c25-45a7-8a31-6d94dbe17566"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-7b3cfdcd-7867-48b6-bd4f-84bd6b0d40d9-36","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→import { Sim } from '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js';\\nimport { play } from '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js';\\n\\nconst ids = process.argv.slice(2);\\nconst list = ids.length ? ids : ['broken-glass', 'growth-spurt', 'adagio', 'staccato', 'legato', 'fermata', 'coda', 'last-patient', 'grand-rounds'];\\nfor (const id of list) {\\n  const sim = new Sim({ op: id, seed: 1, difficulty: 'resident', physics: false });\\n  const t0 = Date.now();\\n  const n = play(sim, {}, 250000);\\n10→  const wall = Date.now() - t0;\\n  const op = sim.op;\\n  const left = sim.entities.filter((e) => e.alive && !e.tray).map((e) => `${e.kind}@${e.site}${e.hidden ? '?' : ''}${e.clamped ? 'c' : ''}`);\\n  console.log([\\n    id.padEnd(14),\\n    sim.complete ? 'OK' : 'FAIL:' + sim.failed,\\n    'ph=' + (sim.phase?.id || ''),\\n    't=' + (sim.time).toFixed(1),\\n    'frac=' + (sim.time / op.timer).toFixed(3),\\n    'vmin=' + sim.vitalsMin.toFixed(1),\\n20→    'miss=' + sim.misses,\\n    'score=' + sim.score,\\n    'rank=' + (sim.rank?.id || '-'),\\n    'wall=' + wall,\\n    'left=' + left.slice(0, 8).join(','),\\n  ].join(' '));\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→import { Sim } from '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js';\\nimport { play } from '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second 