{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_99","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Fermata completes in 65.\n\nArrest holds vitals at 15, but the bot invariant requires min vitals ≥ 35. This creates a conflict because vitalsMin records the low of 14.2. The plan may need to exclude vitalsMin from arrest holds since the flatline is scripted.\n\nRaising the arrest hold to 40 would fix the min vitals check but violates the plan's requirement that vitals hold at 15. Fermata and coda both fail this check, while last-patient is unaffected.\n\nThe `hurt()` method updates vitalsMin whenever vitals drop below the current minimum. Because the arrest hold is a scripted floor, vitalsMin cannot be restored afterward. The only viable fix is to exclude the arrest hold from vitalsMin tracking.\n\napplyVitalsBounds also updates vitalsMin. The arrest hold sets vitals to 15 each frame, which can trigger that update and lower vitalsMin further. Fermata's minimum of 14.2 suggests damage still slipped through or the update order was wrong. The fix is to prevent vitalsMin from dropping below its pre-arrest value during the hold.\n\nSimply capping vitalsMin at 15 still fails the 35 requirement. The acceptance criterion is that vitals never fell below 35 from surgical mistakes, so the scripted arrest hold must be excluded from vitalsMin tracking entirely. Every code path that updates vitalsMin needs to be found and skipped while an arrest hold is active. Fermata ends with vitals at 45 but vitalsMin remains 14.2 because the arrest floor was recorded.\n\nExcluding the scripted arrest hold from vitalsMin reveals a deeper problem. During the antidote phase, the patient's vitals drop to 15 because the previous arrest hold persists after it ends. They then syringe up to 45. The real minimum during that phase is roughly 27 from bleeding before the clamp. This means fermata's true lowest point is below 35 from actual surgical damage, not just the scripted floor.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e683f3a1-e299-4946-9cfd-c3d7d6244614-56","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"vitalsMin|hold at 15|15 vitals|minimum vitals|arrest","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/PLAN.md","head_limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":12578,"output_tokens":1113,"cache_read_input_tokens":121728,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"4709d6e0-8186-4d44-b83b-e45795a78869"}
