{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_101","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Adagio grande bug is clear from the trace.\n\nThe creature spawns at zero health. The stepAdagio function resets Adagio HP to 40 on spawn when stunned.\n\nThe Adagio wakes from stun and restores 40 HP, but the trace shows zero health at every sample. The bot is laser-killing it between two-second intervals. The wake function uses `hpScale`, which needs to be checked.\n\nThe bot is holding forceps, not laser. It should clamp open bleeders before grabbing the downed Adagio, but it never does. The trace shows bleeders rising from zero to three while the bot repeatedly stuns and wakes the Adagio.\n\nThe bot is holding the Adagio, so it cannot wake while held. The trace shows the creature vanishes from kinds at pt=6 and returns at pt=10 with four scratches and a bleeder. This suggests it was trayed and then resurrected by the wake function, which fires because onRemoved does not mark the adagio as dead.\n\nThe wake function skips if `e.tray` is true, so the Adagio should not resurrect after being trayed. Its reappearance at pt=10 is therefore puzzling. The bot may have dropped it instead of traying it, or the creature at pt=10 might be a leftover from the previous phase rather than the grande.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-69294915-6840-4711-9082-565ca32ade29-59","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js","offset":380,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-69294915-6840-4711-9082-565ca32ade29-60","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"hpScale","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1565,"output_tokens":1161,"cache_read_input_tokens":136192,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"20e8f8d5-8ddd-40c7-a621-e4b7281911d7"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-69294915-6840-4711-9082-565ca32ade29-59","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"380→      if (have) return null;\\n    }\\n    const site = spec.site || this.activeSite;\\n    const at = spec.at || [0, 0];\\n    const e = {\\n      id: this.nextId++,\\n      kind: spec.kind,\\n      site,\\n      x: at[0], y: at[1],\\n      alive: true,\\n390→      hidden: !!spec.hidden,\\n      marked: !spec.hidden,\\n      strain: spec.strain || null,\\n    };\\n    if (spec.hp) e.hp = spec.hp * this.tuning.strainHpMult * this.mods.hp * (spec.strain ? this.grHp : 1);\\n    Object.assign(e, this.decorate(spec, e));\\n    this.entities.push(e);\\n    return e;\\n  }\\n\\n400→  decorate(spec, e) {\\n    const extra = {};\\n    switch (spec.kind) {\\n      case 'gelZone':\\n        extra.rect = spec.rect;\\n        extra.parTime = spec.parTime || 8;\\n        break;\\n      case 'shard':\\n      case 'tumor':\\n      case 'ring':\\n410→        Object.assign(extra, {\\n          grabbable: true, embedded: true, embed: spec.embed ?? 0.25, axis: spec.axis ?? 90, pull: 0,\\n          homeX: e.x, homeY: e.y, homeSite: e.site,\\n        });\\n        break;\\n      case 'pool':\\n        extra.vol = spec.vol ?? 0.4;\\n        extra.cap = spec.cap ?? spec.vol ?? 0.4;\\n        break;\\n      case 'incision':\\n420→      case 'circleCut':\\n        extra.points = spec.points;\\n        extra.along = 0;\\n        extra.started = false;\\n        break;\\n      case 'wound':\\n        extra.gates = (spec.gates || []).map(([x, y]) => ({ x, y, hit: false }));\\n        extra.gate = 0;\\n        break;\\n      case 'bleeder':\\n430→        extra.clamped = false;\\n        break;\\n      case 'injection':\\n        extra.done = false;\\n        break;\\n      case 'nodule':\\n      case 'egg':\\n        extra.hp = (spec.hp ?? 30) * this.tuning.strainHpMult * this.mods.hp * this.grHp;\\n        extra.maxHp = extra.hp;\\n        break;\\n440→      case 'tether':\\n        extra.x1 = spec.x1 ?? e.x - 0.15;\\n        extra.y1 = spec.y1 ?? e.y;\\n        extra.x2 = spec.x2 ?? e.x + 0.15;\\n        extra.y2 = spec.y2 ?? e.y;\\n        break;\\n      case 'adagio':\\n        extra.strain = 'adagio';\\n        extra.path = spec.path || [spec.at, [spec.at[0] + 0.6, spec.at[1]]];\\n        extra.hp = (spec.hp ?? 100) * this.hpMult();\\n450→        extra.maxHp = extra.hp;\\n        extra.grande = !!spec.grande;\\n        extra.along = 0;\\n        extra.core = false;\\n        break;\\n      case 'hole':\\n      case 'nest':\\n        extra.hidden = spec.hidden !== false && spec.kind === 'hole' ? !!spec.hidden : !!spec.hidden;\\n        extra.marked = !extra.hidden;\\n        extra.sealed = false;\",\"content_concise\":\"380→      if (have) return null;\\n    }\\n    const site = spec.site || this.activeSite;\\n    const at = spec.at || [0, 0];\\n    const e = {\\n      id: this.nextId++,\\n      kind: spec.kind,\\n      site,\\n      x: at[0], y: at[1],\\n      alive: true,\\n390→      hidden: !!spec.hidden,\\n      marked: !spec.hidden,\\n      strain: spec.strain || null,\\n    };\\n    if (spec.hp) e.hp = spec.hp * this.tuning.strainHpMult * this.mods.hp * (spec.strain ? this.grHp : 1);\\n    Object.assign(e, this.decorate(spec, e));\\n    this.entities.push(e);\\n    return e;\\n  }\\n\\n400→  decorate(spec, e) {\\n    const extra = {};\\n    switch (spec.kind) {\\n      case 'gelZone':\\n        extra.rect = spec.rect;\\n        extra.parTime = spec.parTime || 8;\\n        break;\\n      case 'shard':\\n      case 'tumor':\\n      case 'ring':\\n410→        Object.assign(extra, {\\n          grabbable: true, embedded: true, embed: spec.embed ?? 0.25, axis: spec.axis ?? 90, pull: 0,\\n          homeX: e.x, homeY: e.y, homeSite: e.site,\\n        });\\n        break;\\n      case 'pool':\\n        extra.vol = spec.vol ?? 0.4;\\n        extra.cap = s