{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_113","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"moveSeat uses seat.cmd. The frame is applied via input() before step.\n\nThe logged frame shows x=0.456, so the command was passed correctly. But the position remains 0.111 after step, meaning the movement did not happen.\n\nAim assist is pulling the seat back toward the center. The seat at 0.111 is within 0.12 of the center, so the 0.07 pull is active and likely overriding the movement command.\n\nThe stick pushes the seat right by 0.0083 each frame, while aim assist pulls it left by roughly 0.0078. These forces nearly cancel out, leaving the seat stabilized just inside the 0.12 center radius.\n\nThe seat never reaches the 0.22 circle because aim assist traps it at ~0.11 before it can travel that far.\n\nFermata likely finished early because the tip was already on the ring when the feeder was killed, or the feeder sat outside the 0.12 bubble so the bot followed the ring path.\n\nThe fix is to change nearestGuide for circleCut so it guides toward the next point along the cut instead of the center.\n\nThe fix uses `pointAt(e, e.along || 0)` for circleCut guidance. This aligns with incision behavior and keeps the aim-assist radius near the path point. The Tray also needs to set alive=false so extracted strains stop spawning hazards.\n\nArrest must save vitals before holding and restore them only after a successful shock. VitalsMin should not be recorded during the hold.\n\nAdagio wake is blocked while the body sits on the tray because alive is false.\n\nFermata's restored minimum vitals must subtract real damage from pre-arrest values. The antidote bleeder needs to stay above 35, and starting at 70 allows two seconds of bleeding.\n\nThe fermata time band is only about fifteen percent of the total duration. It will be padded after all operations finish.\n\nstepFermata sets vitals to 15 every frame. During the arrest hold, applyVitalsBounds must skip updating vitalsMin because it would otherwise lock the minimum at 15. hurt() already returns early during hold, so no extra guard is needed there.\n\nThe arrest hold must save vitals before lowering them to 15. On a successful shock, the bot restores those saved values and clamps them between 0 and 100.\n\nWeak shocks keep the arrest active and leave vitals at 15. Multiple arrests chain correctly because each one saves the restored vitals from the previous hold.\n\nThe tray sets alive=false in releaseItem after onRemoved, so shard pools spawn before the body is marked dead.\n\nLinks are marked as tray entities during onRemoved, so stepLegato still detects them correctly even after the link entity itself is set to dead.\n\nThe grande fight should proceed normally because the bot will clamp bleeders and laser the core. The prior death came from tray hazards, not the body being alive. This needs verification after the fixes are applied.\n\nThe circle guide fix should unblock the coda recap.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ded8784c-1cc4-4f8d-a78d-8f17e4a1ecfc-73","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/tools.js","old_string":"    else if (e.kind === 'circleCut' && !e.done) p = { x: e.x, y: e.y };","new_string":"    else if (e.kind === 'circleCut' && !e.done && e.points) p = pointAt(e, e.along || 0);"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ded8784c-1cc4-4f8d-a78d-8f17e4a1ecfc-74","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/tools.js","old_string":"    e.tray = true;\n    e.site = 'tray';","new_string":"    e.tray = true;\n    e.alive = false;\n    e.site = 'tray';"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ded8784c-1cc4-4f8d-a78d-8f17e4a1ecfc-75","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js","old_string":"  beginArrest(a) {\n    this.arrest = { clock: a.clock || 8, tutorial: !!a.tutorial, stopsBeat: true, holdVitals: true, source: 0 };\n    this.vitals = Math.min(this.vitals, 15);","new_string":"  beginArrest(a) {\n    const savedVitals = this.vitals;\n    this.arrest = { clock: a.clock || 8, tutorial: !!a.tutorial, stopsBeat: true, holdVitals: true, source: 0, savedVitals };\n    this.vitals = Math.min(this.vitals, 15);"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ded8784c-1cc4-4f8d-a78d-8f17e4a1ecfc-76","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js","old_string":"  applyVitalsBounds() {\n    if (this.vitals < this.vitalsMin) this.vitalsMin = this.vitals;","new_string":"  applyVitalsBounds() {\n    if (!this.arrest?.holdVitals && this.vitals < this.vitalsMin) this.vitalsMin = this.vitals;"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ded8784c-1cc4-4f8d-a78d-8f17e4a1ecfc-77","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/strains.js","old_string":"  if (!sim.arrest && e.stage === 'attack') {\n    sim.arrest = {\n      clock: 8,\n      tutorial: !!e.tutorial,\n      stopsBeat: true,\n      holdVitals: true,\n      source: e.id,\n    };\n    sim.vitals = Math.min(sim.vitals, 15);","new_string":"  if (!sim.arrest && e.stage === 'attack') {\n    sim.arrest = {\n      clock: 8,\n      tutorial: !!e.tutorial,\n      stopsBeat: true,\n      holdVitals: true,\n      source: e.id,\n