{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_125","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The laser pass-through had no effect on the coda outcome. It still fails identically at t=82 with a score of 24138.\n\nThe laser still missed the open core. HP remained stuck at 263. I will log coreOpen status, seat position versus coda position, baton HP, and laser use to find why damage stops.\n\nThe bot likely cannot reach the coda core during the two-beat window because it is still traveling from batons. When the core is closed, no job targets it, so the bot simply lasers batons instead of waiting on the core.\n\nThe travel time to the open core is only 0.3 seconds, well inside the 1.3-second window, so the bot should reach it. Yet logs show zero damage across many windows, meaning it never arrives. I am now checking whether coreOpen might last for just one frame or if the core timer logic is causing the state to vanish too quickly.\n\nThe core timer logic is sound: it stays open for three beat events. The bot's state export also confirms it reads the coreOpen flag correctly. Since HP remains frozen at 263 after the first hit, every later window is completely ineffective. I am now checking whether moveCoda is set to 198.\n\nHP 263 is above the 198 moveCoda threshold, so the bot remains on heart. The first damage hit and then stopped. Continuous laser use triggers a six-second vent every six seconds, which pauses damage for 1.5 seconds; this cycle should still allow core hits between vents. I will log seat position, coda coordinates, coreOpen status, HP, and laserVent state every half-second for twenty seconds of conductor.\n\nThe first 37 damage points came from a single window. I traced the core timer logic and confirmed it decrements by beats.length inside stepCoda, so the opening beat is included in that subtraction.\n\nThe bot may be targeting the wrong coda entity, or its state export might not reflect the true coreOpen flag. I will also check whether the laser is hitting nearby notes first, since the search picks the nearest target within 0.05 and notes are closer than the core.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bb049f88-c1d0-45ad-add7-e1dc5f135e90-100","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/dbg-coda.mjs","content":"import { Sim } from '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js';\nimport { botInput } from '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js';\n\nconst sim = new Sim({ op: 'coda', seed: 1, difficulty: 'resident', physics: false });\nlet n = 0;\nlet last = -1;\nwhile (!sim.over && n < 12000) {\n  const st = sim.state;\n  for (const s of st.seats) sim.input(s.id, botInput(sim, { id: s.id }, {}));\n  sim.step();\n  n += 1;\n  if (sim.phase?.id !== 'conductor') continue;\n  const sec = Math.floor(sim.phaseTime * 2);\n  if (sec === last) continue;\n  last = sec;\n  const c = sim.entities.find((e) => e.alive && e.kind === 'coda');\n  const seat = sim.seats[0];\n  const bats = sim.entities.filter((e) => e.alive && e.kind === 'baton').map((b) => Math.round(b.hp));\n  const seen = st.entities?.find?.((e) => e.kind === 'coda');\n  console.log(JSON.stringify({\n    pt: +sim.phaseTime.toFixed(1), v: +sim.vitals.toFixed(1),\n    hp: c ? Math.round(c.hp) : null, open: !!c?.coreOpen, seen: !!seen?.coreOpen,\n    tool: seat.tool, use: +seat.use.toFixed(2), vent: +(seat.laserVent || 0).toFixed(2),\n    sx: +seat.x.toFixed(2), sy: +seat.y.toFixed(2), site: seat.site, cs: c?.site,\n    bats, notes: sim.entities.filter((e) => e.alive && e.kind === 'note').length,\n    spores: sim.entities.filter((e) => e.alive && e.kind === 'spore').length,\n    scratches: sim.entities.filter((e) => e.alive && e.kind === 'scratch').length,\n  }));\n  if (sim.phaseTime > 18) break;\n}\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":920,"output_tokens":1915,"cache_read_input_tokens":179328,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"d617ea63-7620-4245-a528-75696c9d1d1a"}
