{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_128","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The plan specifies a 0.5-second laser during the wind-up.\n\nHP 15 at 30 DPS equals exactly 0.5 seconds, so it will remain unchanged. The bot will pre-position instead. The telegraph condition will be expanded to trigger on beats 3 and 4.\n\nExtending the telegraph to two beats is a deviation from the plan's one-beat requirement. Lowering baton HP to 8 would allow a single beat of warning instead.\n\nBaton HP is set to 9. The bot will camp at the start so travel begins immediately. It will prefer notes over camping and use spores. A syringe will be skipped if a core is open.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4795a745-1d3b-4985-978b-d84ee3d40d26-103","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js","old_string":"    else if (e.kind === 'baton' && e.hp > 0) { job = 'beam'; prio = 96; }\n    else if (e.kind === 'coda' && e.hp > 0 && e.coreOpen) { job = 'beam'; prio = 97; }\n    else if (e.kind === 'coda' && e.grabbable) { job = 'grab'; prio = 70; }","new_string":"    else if (e.kind === 'baton' && e.hp > 0 && e.windup) { job = 'beam'; prio = 96; }\n    else if (e.kind === 'coda' && e.hp > 0 && e.coreOpen) { job = 'beam'; prio = 97; }\n    else if (e.kind === 'coda' && e.hp > 0) { job = 'wait'; prio = 64; }\n    else if (e.kind === 'coda' && e.grabbable) { job = 'grab'; prio = 70; }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4795a745-1d3b-4985-978b-d84ee3d40d26-104","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js","old_string":"  const bleeding = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind