{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_131","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Coda now survives the full conductor timer.\n\nCoda was extracted alive but the phase did not complete. Batons remain in the scene, so the cleared baton check fails.\n\nThe fight reached 570 seconds. That is 1.04 of the timer, likely from hush time scaling. Killing batons when coda is trayed would let the phase finish at nearly the same time, which would still exceed the limit.\n\nThe conductor fight took 527 seconds. That is too slow. Core windows are rare and the boss heals constantly. The fight needs to finish in about 230 seconds so the whole operation lands near 342 seconds. The damage rate must roughly double.\n\nThe core window lasts only about one second. That is too brief for the boss to take damage. Extending it to four beats would give the team more time to attack.\n\nThe camp command steers the player toward the east edge instead of placing them directly on the coda before it opens.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-740bc33c-d61b-4c78-9ff5-f691be4daefb-109","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/dbg-coda.mjs","old_string":"  const sec = Math.floor(sim.phaseTime * 2);\n  if (sec === last) continue;\n  last = sec;","new_string":"  const sec = Math.floor(sim.phaseTime / 10);\n  if (sec === last) continue;\n  last = sec;"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-740bc33c-d61b-4c78-9ff5-f691be4daefb-110","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/dbg-coda.mjs","old_string":"  if (sim.phaseTime > 18) break;\n}","new_string":"}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":480,"output_tokens":1027,"cache_read_input_tokens":190080,"cache_creation_input_