\\":false,\\\"tool\\\":\\\"gel\\\",\\\"use\\\":0,\\\"vent\\\":0,\\\"sx\\\":0.97,\\\"sy\\\":0.2,\\\"site\\\":\\\"heart\\\",\\\"bats\\\":[9,9],\\\"notes\\\":0,\\\"spores\\\":0,\\\"scratches\\\":0}\\n{\\\"pt\\\":480,\\\"v\\\":53.8,\\\"hp\\\":null,\\\"open\\\":false,\\\"seen\\\":false,\\\"tool\\\":\\\"gel\\\",\\\"use\\\":0,\\\"vent\\\":0,\\\"sx\\\":0.97,\\\"sy\\\":0.2,\\\"site\\\":\\\"heart\\\",\\\"bats\\\":[9,9],\\\"notes\\\":0,\\\"spores\\\":0,\\\"scratches\\\":0}\\n{\\\"pt\\\":490,\\\"v\\\":53.8,\\\"hp\\\":null,\\\"open\\\":false,\\\"seen\\\":false,\\\"tool\\\":\\\"gel\\\",\\\"use\\\":0,\\\"vent\\\":0,\\\"sx\\\":0.97,\\\"sy\\\":0.2,\\\"site\\\":\\\"heart\\\",\\\"bats\\\":[9,9],\\\"notes\\\":0,\\\"spores\\\":0,\\\"scratches\\\":0}\\n{\\\"pt\\\":500,\\\"v\\\":53.8,\\\"hp\\\":null,\\\"open\\\":false,\\\"seen\\\":false,\\\"tool\\\":\\\"gel\\\",\\\"use\\\":0,\\\"vent\\\":0,\\\"sx\\\":0.97,\\\"sy\\\":0.2,\\\"site\\\":\\\"heart\\\",\\\"bats\\\":[9,9],\\\"notes\\\":0,\\\"spores\\\":0,\\\"scratches\\\":0}\\n{\\\"pt\\\":510,\\\"v\\\":53.8,\\\"hp\\\":null,\\\"open\\\":false,\\\"seen\\\":false,\\\"tool\\\":\\\"gel\\\",\\\"use\\\":0,\\\"vent\\\":0,\\\"sx\\\":0.97,\\\"sy\\\":0.2,\\\"site\\\":\\\"heart\\\",\\\"bats\\\":[9,9],\\\"notes\\\":0,\\\"spores\\\":0,\\\"scratches\\\":0}\\n{\\\"pt\\\":520,\\\"v\\\":53.8,\\\"hp\\\":null,\\\"open\\\":false,\\\"seen\\\":false,\\\"tool\\\":\\\"gel\\\",\\\"use\\\":0,\\\"vent\\\":0,\\\"sx\\\":0.97,\\\"sy\\\":0.2,\\\"site\\\":\\\"heart\\\",\\\"bats\\\":[9,9],\\\"notes\\\":0,\\\"spores\\\":0,\\\"scratches\\\":0}\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"command\":\"node \\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/dbg-coda.mjs\\\"\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Sample coda HP every 10 seconds\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6%2Fwork/01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710/terminal/call-e8fc9144-6e6e-4f94-bd67-e3d34ff72c16-112.log\",\"total_bytes\":8983}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"60f0cf20-02c5-4d86-ae35-7de3709ce0a5"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_134","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The coda HP hits null by the conductor's pt=60.\n\nThe bot stalls at IV with gel after the coda dies. Batons remain alive but cannot be lasered because stepCoda only runs while the coda is alive, so their windup never initializes.\n\nThe fix is to kill the coda's batons in `onRemoved` when the coda dies. This lets the phase end. The conductor phase also needs notes, spores, and pools cleared. One scratch remains at pt=60 and should be gelled.\n\nThe total fight time is only about 185 seconds, or 32% of the 570-second limit. That is too fast and needs padding later.\n\nThe minimum health dropped to 4.2 during the fight because scratches were not gelled early enough. The bot must gel scratches sooner and syringe earlier to keep vmin above 35.\n\nSyringe at 55 during the coda phase would heal the bot before the crash.\n\nAt pt=10 the bot already had 5 scratches and 300 HP, yet health dropped to 4.2. The damage rate of 4.5 per second overwhelmed the syringe's 5 per second heal. Killing batons during windup would not block downbeat scratches, so that fix is insufficient. The root cause is the scratch and spore flood itself.\n\nScratches come from missed downbeats. At pt=50 the bot is lasering the open core, so damage works but vitals still crash.\n\nThe fix is to gel scratches first whenever vitals are below 70 and scratches exist, giving them priority over camping. Syringe at 50 when scratches are present. This stops the drain before vitals drop.\n\nScratches should be raised to priority 93, above notes at 88 and below windup batons at 96. This lets the bot gel them between core and windup laser windows. Notes must stay high so they do not become spores.\n\nScratches and bleeders both get priority 90. Bleeders are checked first, but distance breaks ties. This will not break other ops: when the core is open, laser priority 93 beats scratch priority 90, so adagios still get shot.\n\nScratch priority 90 ties with clamp at 90, so a clamp might wait one scratch longer. Feeders at 94 still beat scratches. The syringe threshold stays at 40.\n\nRecap ended at 48.7 HP, so the dip to 4 happened during the conductor. Raising scratch priority should be enough to keep vitals above 35 without extra healing.\n\nThe bot must also clear notes, spores, and any remaining pools before the phase ends. Bleeders are clamped, but they may have left pools behind.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-33af9afa-cc14-4dd3-b061-680c41fafeab-113","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js","old_string":"  onRemoved(e) {\n    if (e.kind === 'link') {","new_string":"  onRemoved(e) {\n    if (e.kind === 'coda') {\n      for (const a of this.entities) if (a.alive && a.kind === 'baton' && a.parent === e.id) a.alive = false;\n    }\n    if (e.kind === 'link') {"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-33af9afa-cc14-4dd3-b061-680c41fafeab-114","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js","old_string":"    else if (e.kind === 'spore' || e.kind === 'scratch') { job = 'spot'; prio = 82; }","new_string":"    else if (e.kind === 'spore' || e.kind === 'scratch') { job = 'spot'; prio = 90; }"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4257,"output_tokens":1742,"cache_read_input_tokens":191872,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"81801830-c48d-4401-b421-c6be56c29855"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-33af9afa-cc14-4dd3-b061-680c41fafeab-113","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"  onRemoved(e) {\\n    if (e.kind === 'link') {\",\"new_string\":\"  onRemoved(e) {\\n    if (e.kind === 'coda') {\\n      for (const a of this.entities) if (a.alive && a.kind === 'baton' && a.parent === e.id) a.alive = false;\\n    }\\n    if (e.kind === 'link') {\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"  onRemoved(e) {\\n    if (e.kind === 'link') {\",\"old_line\":732,\"new_string\":\"  onRemoved(e) {\\n    if (e.kind === 'coda') {\\n      for (const a of this.entities) if (a.alive && a.kind === 'baton' && a.parent === e.id) a.alive = false;\\n    }\\n    if (e.kind === 'link') {\",\"new_line\":732,\"context_before\":\"    return 'bea';\\n  }\\n\\n\",\"context_after\":\"      const chain = this.entities.find((c) => c.id === e.chain);\\n      const link = chain?.links?.[e.index];\\n      if (link) link.tray = true;\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-33af9afa-cc14-4dd3-b061-680c41fafeab-114","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"    else if (e.kind === 'spore' || e.kind === 'scratch'