{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_136","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Coda died at t=131 on the conductor. It had moved to the lung site and was at vmin -3.\n\nScratch priority 90 may be causing the faster death. Gel on scratches pulls away from the coda camp, interrupting baton windups and increasing downbeats. The new site's threats might also be killing them. Previously they survived with vmin 4 by t=125.\n\nReverting scratch priority to 82 would still leave vitals at 4 and fail the >=35 check. The real problem is that scratches are piling up and driving vitals down.\n\nHush should slow drains to 0.25 for seven seconds once vitals fall below fifty, but the conductor still reaches zero. The next idea is to set the conductor's starting vitals to eighty instead of forty-eight.\n\nStarting the conductor at eighty would leave vitals near forty-six, still below the thirty-five threshold. The recap crescendo drained thirty-eight points from eighty-six to forty-eight, which is by design. Making recap less draining is another option.\n\nStarting the conductor at eighty-eight vitals would leave a forty-one point floor after the recap drain. That clears the thirty-five threshold. The plan includes `vitals` as a legal begin action.\n\nUsing `{ vitals: 40 }` would add forty points to the current forty-eight, but that is risky if variance pushes the drop larger. `vitalsSet 85` is safer and will be tested next. Higher vitals also lower tempo pressure, which could shrink the damage profile.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-292b1d45-0a9c-4da4-88c7-f8bc51e8754e-116","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js","old_string":"    else if (e.kind === 'spore' || e.kind === 'scratch') { job = 'spot'; prio = 90; }","new_string":"    else if (e.kind === 'spore' || e.kind === 'scratch') { job = 'spot'; prio = 84; }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-292b1d45-0a9c-4da4-88c7-f8bc51e8754e-117","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/data/ops/coda.js","old_string":"      id: 'conductor',\n      objective: 'End the conductor',\n      tools: ['laser', 'forceps', 'gel', 'clamp'],\n      spawn: [{ kind: 'coda', site: 'heart', at: [0, 0.02], hp: 300 }],","new_string":"      id: 'conductor',\n      objective: 'End the conductor',\n      tools: ['laser', 'forceps', 'gel', 'clamp'],\n      begin: [{ vitalsSet: 88 }],\n      spawn: [{ kind: 'coda', site: 'heart', at: [0, 0.02], hp: 300 }],"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":637,"output_tokens":1420,"cache_read_input_tokens":198016,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"c19c5b6d-df55-47ab-b50d-d115d0f53524"}
