ose t=59.4 frac=0.141 vmin=68.3 miss=0 score=11961 rank=A wall=71 left=bleeder@heart\\ncoda           OK ph=last-stop t=251.8 frac=0.442 vmin=32.5 miss=0 score=75586 rank=S wall=378 left=bleeder@heart,bleeder@lung,bleeder@lung,bleeder@lung\\nlast-patient   OK ph=one-shock t=3.6 frac=0.090 vmin=100.0 miss=0 score=4208 rank=- wall=2 left=bleeder@heart\\ngrand-rounds   OK ph=rounds t=178.7 frac=0.596 vmin=42.8 miss=0 score=26165 rank=S wall=208 left=bleeder@bowel,bleeder@heart,bleeder@bowel,bleeder@bowel\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"command\":\"node \\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/smoke.mjs\\\"\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Smoke all ops after healAt 58 change\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6%2Fwork/01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710/terminal/call-7db92014-9ee4-4b35-9713-9a21a89bf7d5-1.log\",\"total_bytes\":1144}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"09a39386-d55b-467d-8712-a93763d76a83"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_143","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The healAt 58 change broke adagio. It now times out at t=335.\n\nAdagio still has leftover gelZone@liver, wounds, and a clamped bleeder. The bot syringes too often from scratch healAt 58 and misses the gel close. Coda improved to t=251.8 and frac=0.442 but vmin=32.5 is still under 35. Score jumped to 75586. I will narrow or revert healAt 58 so it does not trigger on all scratches.\n\nAdagio is stuck in the gel close phase. It has leftover gelZone@liver, two wounds, and a clamped bleeder. The healAt 58 threshold is forcing repeated IV trips during close. Once all scratches are gone, healAt drops to 40.\n\nThe leftover gelZone@liver is not from scratch wounds. Extra syringe trips during the fight ate the time budget for close, causing the timeout at t=335.7. Previously adagio finished at t=97.8 with vmin=39.5.\n\nThe 238-second gap points to a loop. Adagio likely spawned continuously, keeping vitals below 58 and forcing repeated IV trips. Even after death, wounds may keep draining vitals during close, causing the bot to oscillate between syringing and gelling instead of finishing coverage.\n\nThe fix is to raise healAt only when a living coda exists, not globally for all scratches. Adagio was fine at healAt 40.\n\nFor coda, the remaining gap is 2.5 points below the 35 minimum. Raising healAt to 62 when a coda is alive should push the landing close enough.\n\nRaising healAt to 62 would land near 39 vitals, but it risks blocking Hush. The bot syringes before Hush, so starting at 62 means vitals drop to 50–62 and the syringe fires first. Hush only triggers when the syringe is on cooldown or blocked by core open or bleeding. I need to verify the exact decide order.\n\nThe decide order confirms syringe fires before Hush. Raising healAt to 64 for a living coda only would start the trip earlier and land higher. The 32.5 vmin is just the landing of that trip.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Coda is close (251.8s, vitals 32.5) but the higher heal threshold made Adagio time out on the gel close. I’ll narrow that threshold to the coda fight and inspect how close phases are built."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-697069b5-500d-4378-80fc-4609d760e81a-2","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"healAt|const hot|coreNow","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-697069b5-500d-4378-80fc-4609d760e81a-3","name":"list_dir","input":{"target_directory":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/data/ops"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1136,"output_tokens":1409,"cache_read_input_tokens":34560,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"b5a520d3-53d0-48f1-93af-85555748d881"}
