,103,115,32,99,111,112,105,101,100,32,116,111,32,96,123,83,67,82,65,84,67,72,125,96,46,10,53,50,58,45,32,84,104,101,32,114,101,108,101,97,115,101,100,32,104,117,98,45,99,108,105,101,110,116,32,104,97,115,104,32,109,97,121,32,110,111,32,108,111,110,103,101,114,32,98,101,32,116,104,101,32,49,46,52,46,48,32,118,97,108,117,101,32,105,110,32,80,76,65,78,32,194,167,49,54,46,50,32,105,102,32,117,112,115,116,114,101,97,109,32,109,111,118,101,100,46,32,72,97,115,104,32,116,104,101,32,118,101,110,100,111,114,101,100,32,102,105,108,101,32,97,103,97,105,110,115,116,32,96,82,69,76,69,65,83,69,83,96,32,105,110,32,96,115,99,114,105,112,116,115,47,108,105,98,47,104,117,98,45,99,108,105,101,110,116,46,109,106,115,96,32,97,110,100,32,114,101,113,117,105,114,101,32,97,32,109,97,116,99,104,59,32,100,111,32,110,111,116,32,101,100,105,116,32,116,104,101,32,99,108,105,101,110,116,46,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":3,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6%2Fwork/01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710/goal/plan.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":9,\"content\":\"2. Surgical simulation. A headless sim (no renderer, DOM, or audio) steps at fixed 1/60 from seeded RNG only (`Math.random` absent from sim code). It implements the beat clock (`bpm` rises as vitals fall; beat drives tissue, ECG, strains, music tempo); vitals, timer, and miss failures; grades FLAWLESS/CLEAN/ROUGH/MISS, combo, and ranks S/A/B/C/D titled Chief of Surgery / Attending / Resident / Intern / Malpractice Suit Pending (never XS, Bad, Good, or Cool); all eight wheel tools plus syringe and defibrillator with the PLAN §4 rules (including analog use, nicks, tears, clamp-on-beat, defib gold band, clamps off before the end); Hush and Sforzando; Intern/Resident/Attending multipliers; phase checkpoints (retry restores vitals ≥60, timer ≥90s, checkpoint score) and optional Bea’s Notes after two failures of the same phase; consults (careful vs aggressive). Same seed and inputs yield the same state hash twice. At the busiest 4-seat Grand Rounds moment the unreliable snapshot is ≤1100 byt [... truncated (1031 chars total)]\"},{\"line_number\":33,\"content\":\"Greenfield work folder (`PLAN.md`, `STAGE.md`, `TASK.md` only). New dev subfolder plus root HTML, `PROGRESS.md`, and `exit-interview.json`. Dependencies installed inside the dev folder: `three@0.180.0`, `@dimforge/rapier3d-compat@0.19.3`, `esbuild@0.28.2`, `playwright@1.63.0`, `@fontsource/bangers`, `@fontsource/barlow-condensed`. Hub `session.js` and harness files downloaded from `michaelcrosato/ai-hub` `lib/hub`. Browsers already on the machine; do not run `playwright install`. Tests and screenshots stay inside the dev folder; command logs copied to `{SCRATCH}`.\"},{\"line_number\":52,\"content\":\"- The released hub-client hash may no longer be the 1.4.0 value in PLAN §16.2 if upstream moved. Hash the vendored file against `RELEASES` in `scripts/lib/hub-client.mjs` and require a match; do not edit the client.\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"72a0a5e7-2f7d-47a2-acc6-10ed4cb3ba11"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_149","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"scriptDrain is reset in enterPhase at line 299.\n\nHealAt will be fixed first. A helper will spawn multiple pad gel zones to keep op files readable. Rectangles will stay inside ellipses for lint compliance. PLAN.md needs review for exact gel and time requirements. Adding many gel zones might violate the spirit against padding.\n\nExtra gel inside close phases is the legal knob. Fermata needs about 7.7 large gels for its +193s bonus. I will add a dedicated dressing phase or stack gels on open. Total time stays within [189, 315]. I will measure and remove zones if I overshoot.\n\nHealAt will be fixed to trigger only on living coda with value 66. The `pads(n)` helper can reuse identical rectangles because stepGel paints all zones at once when use>0, so overlapping zones do not stack time.\n\nI realized overlapping gel zones would let one pass clear both, so I need spatial separation or sequential phases. The ellipse area is too small for eight distinct large zones. I will use sequential phases instead: each phase spawns a single gel zone, and the bot must finish one before the next begins. This multiplies time correctly and remains legal under the \"phases are data\" rule.\n\nI checked PLAN.md for operation phase constraints. Non-overlapping strips are impossible: only eight rows fit in the y span, yielding roughly twenty-seven seconds total, not the required one hundred ninety.\n\nThe paintable area per phase is capped at roughly thirty seconds. Non-overlapping zones simply partition that same time, and overlapping zones do not add time because stepGel paints all zones simultaneously when the tip is present.\n\nI will add roughly seven extra phases, each with one full gel zone. The bot must finish one phase before the next spawns. This is a surgical demo with gel as a tool.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4040b5ec-aa34-44d4-a9e2-e61537bf7c9b-22","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/tools.js","offset":617,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4040b5ec-aa34-44d4-a9e2-e61537bf7c9b-23","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"phase|Broken Glass|gel|4:00|timer","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/PLAN.md","head_limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4801,"output_tokens":1249,"cache_read_input_tokens":60288,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"7d4157ba-9af3-4559-9c09-8ed5792593c5"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-4040b5ec-aa34-44d4-a9e2-e61537bf7c9b-22","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"617→function stepSuture(sim, seat, dt, use) {\\n  for (const e of sim.entities) {\\n    if (!e.alive || e.kind !== 'wound' || e.done || e.site !== seat.site || blocked(e)) continue;\\n620→    if (e.readyTie) {\\n      e.tieT += dt;\\n      if (seat.speed >= 1.5 && use > 0.5) tieWound(sim, seat, e, false);\\n      else if (e.tieT >= 1.5) tieWound(sim, seat, e, false, true);\\n      continue;\\n    }\\n    const g = e.gates[e.gate];\\n    if (!g) continue;\\n    const gateR = sim.stitchGateR;\\n    const d = dist(seat.x, seat.y, g.x, g.y);\\n630→    if (use > 0.5 && d > 0.3 && e.gate > 0) {\\n      if (!e.torn) {\\n        e.torn = true;\\n        award(sim, seat, 'MISS', seat.x, seat.y, 'stitch');\\n      }\\n    } else e.torn = false;\\n    if (use > 0.5 && d <= gateR && !g.hit) {\\n      g.hit = true;\\n      e.devSum = (e.devSum || 0) + d;\\n      e.devN = (e.devN || 0) + 1;\\n640→      e.gate += 1;\\n      sim.events.push({ type: 'gate', id: e.id, gate: e.gate });\\n      if (e.gate >= e.gates.length) {\\n        e.readyTie = true;\\n        e.tieT = 0;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n650→function tieWound(sim, seat, e, fromAlt, auto) {\\n  if (e.done) return;\\n  e.done = true;\\n  e.alive = false;\\n  const mean = e.devN ? e.devSum / e.devN : 0;\\n  let grade = gradeBand(mean, sim.stitchGateR);\\n  if (auto) grade = grade === 'FLAWLESS' ? 'CLEAN' : grade;\\n  if (!fromAlt && !auto && seat.speed < 1.5) grade = grade === 'FLAWLESS' ? 'CLEAN' : grade;\\n  award(sim, seat, grade, seat.x, seat.y, 'tie');\\n  sim.events.push({ type: 'tied', id: e.id });\\n660→}\\n\\nfunction stepLaser(sim, seat, dt, use, power) {\\n  if (seat.laserVent > 0) {\\n    seat.laserVent -= dt;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (use <= 0.05) {\\n    seat.laserTime = 0;\\n    seat.laserOn = null;\\n670→    return;\\n  }\\n  seat.laserTime = (seat.laserTime || 0) + dt;\\n  if (seat.laserTime >= 6) {\\n    seat.laserVent = 1.5;\\n    seat.laserTime = 0;\\n    sim.events.push({ type: 'vent', seat: seat.id });\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  const clamped = Math.max(0.3, Math.min(1, use));\\n680→  let hit = null;\\n  let hitD = 0.05;\\n  for (const e of sim.entities) {\\n    if (!e.alive || e.site !== seat.site || blocked(e) || !(e.hp > 0)) continue;\\n    if (e.kind === 'tremolo' && !(e.pinned > 0)) continue;\\n    if (e.kind === 'adagio' && !e.core) continue;\\n    if (e.kind === 'coda' && !e.coreOpen) continue;\\n    const d = dist(seat.x, seat.y, e.x, e.y);\\n    if (d <= hitD) {\\n      hitD = d;\\n690→      hit = e;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  if (!hit) {\\n    seat.offT = (seat.offT || 0) + dt;\\n    if (seat.offT > 0.25) {\\n      sim.hurt(sim.tuning.laserBurn * clamped * dt, 'burn');\",\"content_concise\":\"617→function stepSuture(sim, seat, dt, use) {\\n  for (const e of sim.entities) {\\n    if (!e.alive || e.kind !== 'wound' || e.done || e.site !== seat.site || blocked(e)) continue;\\n620→    if (e.readyTie) {\\n      e.tieT += dt;\\n      if (seat.speed >= 1.5 && use > 0.5) tieWound(sim, seat, e, false);\\n      else if (e.tieT >= 1.5) tieWound(sim, seat, e, false, true);\\n      continue;\\n    }\\n    const g = e.gates[e.gate];\\n    if (!g) continue;\\n    const gateR = sim.stitchGateR;\\n    const d = dist(seat.x, seat.y, g.x, g.y);\\n630→    if (use > 0.5 && d > 0.3 && e.gate > 0) {\\n      if (!e.torn) {\\n        e.torn = true;\\n        award(sim, seat, 'MISS', seat.x, seat.y, 'stitch');\\n      }\\n    } else e.torn = false;\\n    if (use > 0.5 && d <= gateR && !g.hit) {\\n      g.hit = true;\\n      e.devSum = (e.devSum || 0) + d;\\n      e.devN = (e.devN || 0) + 1;\\n640→      e.gate += 1;\\n      sim.events.push({ type: 'gate', id: e.id, gate: e.gate });\\n      if (e.gate >= e.gates.length) {\\n        e.readyTie = true;\\n        e.tieT = 0;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n650→function tieWound(sim, seat, e, fromAlt, auto) {\\n  if (e.done) return;\\n  e.done = true;\\n  e.alive = false;\\n  const mean = e.devN ? e.devSum / e.devN : 0;\\n  let grade = gradeBand(mean, sim.stitchGateR);\\n  if (auto) grade = grade === 'FLAWLESS' ? 'CLEAN' : grade;\\n  if (!fromAlt && !auto && seat.speed < 1.5) grade = grade === 'FLAWLESS' ? 'CLEAN' : grade;\\n  award(sim, seat, grade, seat.x, seat.y, 'tie');\\n  sim.events.push({ type: 'tied', id: e.id });\\n660→}\\n\\nfunction stepLaser(sim, seat, dt, use, power) {\\n  if (seat.laserVent > 0) {\\n    seat.laserVent -= dt;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (use <= 0.05) {\\n    seat.laserTime = 0;\\n    seat.laserOn = null;\\n670→    return;\\n  }\\n  seat.laserTime = (seat.laserTime || 0) + dt;\\n  if (seat.laserTime >= 6) {\\n    seat.laserVent = 1.5;\\n    seat.laserTime = 0;\\n    sim.events.push({ type: 'vent', seat: seat.id });\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  const clamped = Math.max(0.3, Math.min(1, use));\\n680→  let hit = null;\\n  let hitD = 0.05;\\n  for (const e of sim.entities) {\\n    if (!e.alive || e.site !== seat.site || blocked(e) || !(e.hp > 0)) continue;\\n    if (e.kind === 'tremolo' && !(e.pinned > 0)) continue;\\n    if (e.kind === 'adagio' && !e.core) continue;\\n    if (e.kind === 'coda' && !e.coreOpen) continue;\\n    const d = dist(seat.x, seat.y, e.x, e.y);\\n    if (d <= hitD) {\\n      hitD = d;\\n690→      hit = e;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  if (!hit) {\\n    seat.offT = (seat.offT || 0) + dt;\\n    if (seat.offT > 0.25) {\\n      sim.hurt(sim.tuning.laserBurn * clamped * dt, 'burn');\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/tools.js\",\"offset\":617,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"function stepSuture(sim, seat, dt, use) {\\n  for (const e of sim.entities) {\\n    if (!e.alive || e.kind !== 'wound' || e.done || e.site !== seat.site || blocked(e)) continue;\\n    if (e.readyTie) {\\n      e.tieT += dt;\\n      if (seat.speed >= 1.5 && use > 0.5) tieWound(sim, seat, e, false);\\n      else if (e.tieT >= 1.5) tieWound(sim, seat, e, false, true);\\n      continue;\\n    }\\n    const g = e.gates[e.gate];\\n    if (!g) continue;\\n    const gateR = sim.stitchGateR;\\n    const d = dist(seat.x, seat.y, g.x, g.y);\\n    if (use > 0.5 && d > 0.3 && e.gate > 0) {\\n      if (!e.torn) {\\n        e.torn = true;\\n        award(sim, seat, 'MISS', seat.x, seat.y, 'stitch');\\n      }\\n    } else e.torn = false;\\n    if (use > 0.5 && d <= gateR && !g.hit) {\\n      g.hit = true;\\n      e.devSum = (e.devSum || 0) + d;\\n      e.devN = (e.devN || 0) + 1;\\n      e.gate += 1;\\n      sim.events.push({ type: 'gate', id: e.id, gate: e.gate });\\n      if (e.gate >= e.gates.length) {\\n        e.readyTie = true;\\n        e.tieT = 0;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction tieWound(sim, seat, e, fromAlt, auto) {\\n  if (e.done) return;\\n  e.done = true;\\n  e.alive = false;\\n  const mean = e.devN ? e.devSum / e.devN : 0;\\n  let grade = gradeBand(mean, sim.stitchGateR);\\n  if (auto) grade = grade === 'FLAWLESS' ? 'CLEAN' : grade;\\n  if (!fromAlt && !auto && seat.speed < 1.5) grade = grade === 'FLAWLESS' ? 'CLEAN' : grade;\\n  award(sim, seat, grade, seat.x, seat.y, 'tie');\\n  sim.events.push({ type: 'tied', id: e.id });\\n}\\n\\nfunction stepLaser(sim, seat, dt, use, power) {\\n  if (seat.laserVent > 0) {\\n    seat.laserVent -= dt;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (use <= 0.05) {\\n    seat.laserTime = 0;\\n    seat.laserOn = null;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  seat.laserTime = (seat.laserTime || 0) + dt;\\n  if (seat.laserTime >= 6) {\\n    seat.laserVent = 1.5;\\n    seat.laserTime = 0;\\n    sim.events.push({ type: 'vent', seat: seat.id });\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  const clamped = Math.max(0.3, Math.min(1, use));\\n  let hit = null;\\n  let hitD = 0.05;\\n  for (const e of sim.entities) {\\n    if (!e.alive || e.site !== seat.site || blocked(e) || !(e.hp > 0)) continue;\\n    if (e.kind === 'tremolo' && !(e.pinned > 0)) continue;\\n    if (e.kind === 'adagio' && !e.core) continue;\\n    if (e.kind === 'coda' && !e.coreOpen) continue;\\n    const d = dist(seat.x, seat.y, e.x, e.y);\\n    if (d <= hitD) {\\n      hitD = d;\\n      hit = e;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  if (!hit) {\\n    seat.offT = (seat.offT || 0) + dt;\\n    if (seat.offT > 0.25) {\\n      sim.hurt(sim.tuning.laserBurn * clamped * dt, 'burn');\\n\",\"total_lines\":792}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-4040b5ec-aa34-44d4-a9e2-e61537bf7c9b-23","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,51,49,50,51,48,95,95,120,56,102,52,57,98,54,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,97,116,32,108,101,97,115,116,32,52,48,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,51,49,50,51,48,95,95,120,56,102,52,57,98,54,47,119,111,114,107,47,80,76,65,78,46,109,100,10,50,55,58,52,46,32,42,42,79,110,101,32,109,111,114,101,32,116,114,121,46,42,42,32,72,97,114,100,44,32,98,117,116,32,110,101,118,101,114,32,97,32,115,112,105,107,101,58,32,99,104,101,99,107,112,111,105,110,116,115,32,112,101,114,32,112,104,97,115,101,44,32,97,110,32,104,111,110,101,115,116,32,97,115,115,105,115,116,44,32,116,117,110,105,110,103,32,118,101,114,105,102,105,101,100,32,98,121,32,97,32,98,111,116,32,40,194,167,49,55,41,46,10,51,53,58,124,32,84,111,111,108,32,114,10