\":261,\"content\":\"    seat.syringeHold = 0;\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"462a4477-dcee-4344-90be-0be9ea1c52f2"}
