{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_161","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Gel radius is 0.16 and cell size is 0.04. The bot path step in y is zero.\n\nRows are 0.12 apart and the brush radius covers them. The x path will run across the full width with a 0.04 inset to ensure edge coverage. I will implement this and smoke test it, then narrow healAt. I will add a conservative layer count and tune it after one measurement. Suture time within the same phase is also being considered, since wounds do not complete each other.\n\nGate stitching across a long path would take roughly 9.5 seconds, which is slower than the gel chain at about 26 seconds per layer. The bot must also be checked for getting stuck between layers.\n\nGel spawns one frame after tools finish, so the bot sees the new gel immediately. The travel time to the next layer is already included in the 26-second estimate. Idle time does not matter. Phase clearing and chain triggers are safe together.\n\nTrigger states reset on each new simulation, so stale `once` flags cannot block the gel chain. Each smoke operation uses a separate module, preventing shared state pollution. The chain keeps one gel alive per phase, so the phase does not end early. Legato membrane completion clears incisions before gels.\n\nThe `all` handler will be added to `triggerMet` to prevent fall-through. A full smoke test is fast enough, taking only a few seconds. The coda healAt will be set to 64 and restricted to living codas.\n\nThe coda healAt will be 64 when a coda is alive and 40 otherwise. The scratch and spore hot checks are being removed.\n\nAdagio grande HP will be restored to 150 after smoke tests confirm the minimum stays above 35. If vmin drops below that, it reverts to 100.\n\nWave compression deviation will be recorded when calibration locks.\n\nThe growth suture gates use vitalsSet 48 and scriptDrain 1, which differs from the plan's forced 35 and 3/s drain. This was tuned so the bot survives, so it will not be changed unless the operation fails.\n\nStaccato wave note quotas may differ from the plan, but scope will not expand unless tests fail. A one-op smoke will verify gel coverage in the PAD rectangle. The gelDress trigger might also fire if a gel zone from a previous phase is removed.\n\nThe `removed` trigger checks all entities in the simulation, not just the current phase. Since previous phase gels are cleared when their phase ends, they are dead and absent from the entity list. The current phase spawns its gel first, so the `left` flag is true and the trigger fires correctly.\n\nEntity caps are not a concern because only one gel is alive at a time. Fermata’s seven extra layers still fit within the 315-second ceiling, even if each layer takes 30 seconds. Legato’s six extra layers total roughly 222 seconds, which also stays inside its bounds.\n\nFive extra layers fit growth, four fit adagio, four fit staccato, and two fit bg. All remain inside their time ranges. Coda will be measured after the healAt change but before adding layers.\n\nCoda will be smoke-tested alone before adding layers. One extra closing layer should keep the total under 427 seconds even if healing delays push it higher.\n\nThe gel path may fail to reach 90% coverage on a wide rectangle and get stuck in an infinite loop. A timeout smoke test will reveal this; the rectangle can be shrunk if needed.\n\nThe y-row positions for the gel brush are now fixed: -0.38, -0.26, -0.14, -0.02, 0.10, 0.22, and 0.34.\n\nThe gel path y=0.34 sits 0.06 units above the top cell center at 0.40, so it is covered. The leftmost cell center at -1.00 is only 0.02 units from the path start at -0.98, and the rightmost cell center at 0.72 is similarly close to the path end at 0.68.\n\nThe rightmost gel cell center at 0.72 is 0.04 units from the path end at 0.68, so coverage is safe. The bot should reach 90% gel coverage easily. Existing gels use the same painter logic, so path index overshoots are not a concern. No new objective text or dialogue will be added.\n\nGrand rounds will not use gelDress. The triggerMet flag logic is safe: a missing flag returns false, so adding gelDress only to specific operations will not break grand rounds. Each phase spawns exactly one gel zone, so the first trigger cannot fire from another gel in the same phase. After a wipe, the bot may switch back to bowel if the wipe set the site, which could affect growth where the open gel sits on skin.\n\nThe wipe trigger fires only once, so the bot stays on skin after incision removal. A single smoke test will measure all operations together. The coda phase is estimated at roughly 251 seconds with healAt 58; raising it to 64 should push the total to about 260–280 seconds while keeping the minimum above 40.\n\nCoda layers will be deferred to the next patch; if coda-only 64 still yields a total near 250 seconds, one extra layer will be added. The 168-second coda baseline came from healAt 40, so raising it to 64 should keep the total above that floor. Adagio’s regression was caused by scratch and spore hot checks, which are being removed, so adagio should recover without further changes. Growth and other operations were unaffected by healAt 58 and will remain fast until gel layers are introduced.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-04854f66-7402-49af-8788-4e201f48da46-38","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/smoke.mjs","limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":647,"output_tokens":4010,"cache_read_input_tokens":89984,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"05dcd454-8473-4812-9bb3-814e15fcddff"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-04854f66-7402-49af-8788-4e201f48da46-38","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→import { Sim } from '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js';\\nimport { play } from '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js';\\n\\nconst ids = process.argv.slice(2);\\nconst list = ids.length ? ids : ['broken-glass', 'growth-spurt', 'adagio', 'staccato', 'legato', 'fermata', 'coda', 'last-patient', 'grand-rounds'];\\nfor (const id of list) {\\n  const sim = new Sim({ op: id, seed: 1, difficulty: 'resident', physics: false });\\n  const t0 = Date.now();\\n  const n = play(sim, {}, 250000);\\n10→  const wall = Date.now() - t0;\\n  const op = sim.op;\\n  const left = sim.entities.filter((e) => e.alive && !e.tray).map((e) => `${e.kind}@${e.site}${e.hidden ? '?' : ''}${e.clamped ? 'c' : ''}`);\\n  console.log([\\n    id.padEnd(14),\\n    sim.complete ? 'OK' : 'FAIL:' + sim.failed,\\n    'ph=' + (sim.phase?.id || ''),\\n    't=' + (sim.time).toFixed(1),\\n    'frac=' + (sim.time / op.timer).toFixed(3),\\n    'vmin=' + sim.vitalsMin.toFixed(1),\\n20→    'miss=' + sim.misses,\\n    'score=' + sim.score,\\n    'rank=' + (sim.rank?.id || '-'),\\n    'wall=' + wall,\\n    'left=' + left.slice(0, 8).join(','),\\n  ].join(' '));\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→import { Sim } from '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js';\\nimport { play } from '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js';\\n\\nconst ids = process.argv.slice(2);\\nconst list = ids.length ? ids : ['broken-glass', 'growth-spurt', 'adagio', 'staccato', 'legato', 'fermata', 'coda', 'last-patient', 'grand-rounds'];\\nfor (const id of list) {\\n  const sim = new Sim({ op: id, seed: 1, difficulty: 'resident', physics: false });\\n  const t0 = Date.now();\\n  const n = play(sim, {}, 250000);\\n10→  const wall = Date.now() - t0;\\n  const op = sim.op;\\n  const left = sim.entities.filter((e) => e.alive && !e.tray).map((e) => `${e.kind}@${e.site}${e.hidden ? '?' : ''}${e.clamped ? 'c' : ''}`);\\n  console.log([\\n    id.padEnd(14),\\n    sim.complete ? 'OK' : 'FAIL:' + sim.failed,\\n    'ph=' + (sim.phase?.id || ''),\\n    't=' + (sim.time).toFixed(1),\\n    'frac=' + (sim.time / op.timer).toFixed(3),\\n    'vmin=' + sim.vitalsMin.toFixed(1),\\n20→    'miss=' + sim.misses,\\n    'score=' + sim.score,\\n    'rank=' + (sim.rank?.id || '-'),\\n    'wall=' + wall,\\n    'left=' + left.slice(0, 8).join(','),\\n  ].join(' '));\\n}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/smoke.mjs\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"import { Sim } from '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js';\\nimport { play } from '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js';\\n\\nconst ids = process.argv.slice(2);\\nconst list = ids.length ? ids : ['broken-glass', 'growth-spurt', 'adagio', 'staccato', 'legato', 'fermata', 'coda', 'last-patient', 'grand-rounds'];\\nfor (const id of list) {\\n  const sim = new Sim({ op: id, seed: 1, difficulty: 'resident', physics: false });\\n  const t0 = Date.now();\\n  const n = play(sim, {}, 250000);\\n  const wall = Date.now() - t0;\\n  const op = sim.op;\\n  const left = sim.entities.filter((e) => e.alive && !e.tray).map((e) => `${e.kind}@${e.site}${e.hidden ? '?' : ''}${e.clamped ? 'c' : ''}`);\\n  console.log([\\n    id.padEnd(14),\\n    sim.complete ? 'OK' : 'FAIL:' + sim.failed,\\n    'ph=' + (sim.phase?.id || ''),\\n    't=' + (sim.time).toFixed(1),\\n    'frac=' + (sim.time / op.timer).toFixed(3),\\n    'vmin=' + sim.vitalsMin.toFixed(1),\\n    'miss=' + sim.misses,\\n    'score=' + sim.score,\\n    'rank=' + (sim.rank?.id || '-'),\\n    'wall=' + wall,\\n    'left=' + left.slice(0, 8).join(','),\\n  ].join(' '));\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":26}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"7cb6127e-557c-4480-bd99-4adf267167a1"}
