{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_163","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-317ae8c0-2ba5-437e-9079-b51cfe7fc4e8-40","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/field.js","limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":554,"output_tokens":98,"cache_read_input_tokens":95104,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"834860b2-f105-4425-b316-99fc2edbb7dc"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-317ae8c0-2ba5-437e-9079-b51cfe7fc4e8-40","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→export const DT = 1 / 60;\\nexport const TRAY = { x: 1.62, y: 0.2, hw: 0.28, hh: 0.42 };\\nexport const IV = { x: 1.02, y: 0.22 };\\n\\nexport const clamp = (v, a, b) => Math.max(a, Math.min(b, v));\\nexport const hypot = (x, y) => Math.hypot(x, y);\\n\\nexport function inDrape(x, y) {\\n  return (x / 1.4) ** 2 + (y / 0.85) ** 2 <= 1 + 1e-6;\\n10→}\\n\\nexport function clampTip(x, y) {\\n  return [clamp(x, -1.55, 1.9), clamp(y, -0.95, 0.95)];\\n}\\n\\nexport function overTray(x, y) {\\n  return Math.abs(x - TRAY.x) <= TRAY.hw && Math.abs(y - TRAY.y) <= TRAY.hh;\\n}\\n\\n20→export function dist(ax, ay, bx, by) {\\n  return hypot(ax - bx, ay - by);\\n}\\n\\nexport function distPointSeg(px, py, ax, ay, bx, by) {\\n  const abx = bx - ax;\\n  const aby = by - ay;\\n  const len2 = abx * abx + aby * aby || 1e-12;\\n  const t = clamp(((px - ax) * abx + (py - ay) * aby) / len2, 0, 1);\\n  const qx = ax + abx * t;\\n30→  const qy = ay + aby * t;\",\"content_concise\":\"1→export const DT = 1 / 60;\\nexport const TRAY = { x: 1.62, y: 0.2, hw: 0.28, hh: 0.42 };\\nexport const IV = { x: 1.02, y: 0.22 };\\n\\nexport const clamp = (v, a, b) => Math.max(a, Math.min(b, v));\\nexport const hypot = (x, y) => Math.hypot(x, y);\\n\\nexport function inDrape(x, y) {\\n  return (x / 1.4) ** 2 + (y / 0.85) ** 2 <= 1 + 1e-6;\\n10→}\\n\\nexport function clampTip(x, y) {\\n  return [clamp(x, -1.55, 1.9), clamp(y, -0.95, 0.95)];\\n}\\n\\nexport function overTray(x, y) {\\n  return Math.abs(x - TRAY.x) <= TRAY.hw && Math.abs(y - TRAY.y) <= TRAY.hh;\\n}\\n\\n20→export function dist(ax, ay, bx, by) {\\n  return hypot(ax - bx, ay - by);\\n}\\n\\nexport function distPointSeg(px, py, ax, ay, bx, by) {\\n  const abx = bx - ax;\\n  const aby = by - ay;\\n  const len2 = abx * abx + aby * aby || 1e-12;\\n  const t = clamp(((px - ax) * abx + (py - ay) * aby) / len2, 0, 1);\\n  const qx = ax + abx * t;\\n30→  const qy = ay + aby * t;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/field.js\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":30,\"raw_output\":\"export const DT = 1 / 60;\\nexport const TRAY = { x: 1.62, y: 0.2, hw: 0.28, hh: 0.42 };\\nexport const IV = { x: 1.02, y: 0.22 };\\n\\nexport const clamp = (v, a, b) => Math.max(a, Math.min(b, v));\\nexport const hypot = (x, y) => Math.hypot(x, y);\\n\\nexport function inDrape(x, y) {\\n  return (x / 1.4) ** 2 + (y / 0.85) ** 2 <= 1 + 1e-6;\\n}\\n\\nexport function clampTip(x, y) {\\n  return [clamp(x, -1.55, 1.9), clamp(y, -0.95, 0.95)];\\n}\\n\\nexport function overTray(x, y) {\\n  return Math.abs(x - TRAY.x) <= TRAY.hw && Math.abs(y - TRAY.y) <= TRAY.hh;\\n}\\n\\nexport function dist(ax, ay, bx, by) {\\n  return hypot(ax - bx, ay - by);\\n}\\n\\nexport function distPointSeg(px, py, ax, ay, bx, by) {\\n  const abx = bx - ax;\\n  const aby = by - ay;\\n  const len2 = abx * abx + aby * aby || 1e-12;\\n  const t = clamp(((px - ax) * abx + (py - ay) * aby) / len2, 0, 1);\\n  const qx = ax + abx * t;\\n  const qy = ay + aby * t;\\n\",\"total_lines\":71}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"2cab6546-58e0-4b5d-99a8-ad5d1a96cb80"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_164","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Reviewing STAGE.md to identify tasks for PLAN.md and TASK.md.\n\nConfirmed gel and bot tip positions are inside the bounds. Analyzed trigger ordering for gel removal and incision removal to prevent duplicate execution.\n\nConfirmed incision removal takes priority over gel removal. Ready to edit the phase files. Will update bot healAt and bump coda velocity if vmin remains low. Will export gelDress from shape.js and import it. The broken-glass finish phase will trigger gelDress('arm', 2). The growth-spurt open phase will trigger the incision wipe and gelDress('skin', 5).\n\nAdagio open triggers gelDress('liver', 4). Staccato open triggers gelDress('bowel', 4). Legato membrane triggers gelDress('brain', 6). Fermata open triggers gelDress('heart', 7). The bot completes all incisions before any gel layers. Chain triggers cannot fire mid-gel.\n\nThe gel rectangle will be a named module export so gelDress can reuse it. The parTime of 40 seconds is appropriate for the large zone. I am watching for bot coverage stalls.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ece4b096-68c7-4fda-a4a2-3f63ebf0107d-41","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"sinceProgress","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":534,"output_tokens":830,"cache_read_input_tokens":95616,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"2ae0db6a-495c-480e-be0a-e2b120d5f566"}
