{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_172","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Scratch rate is 0.4 for coda at line 292 and 0.\n\nAdagio scratch rate is 5. Combined with spore 0.3, the drain reaches 2.3/s, matching the 2.4/s target. Bleeders are clamped and do not add to the drain. The missing syringe during vitals below 64 while coda is active may be caused by bleeding, a stuck cooldown, or coreNow remaining true. I will check the export state fields and whether bleeding is the blocker.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-91f0f076-4b7e-4f71-baf2-b8af8a31755c-64","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/dbg-vmin.mjs","old_string":"  const frameDrop = prevV - sim.vitals;\n  if (sim.vitalsMin < prevMin - 0.4 && (sim.vitalsMin < 50 || frameDrop > 2)) {","new_string":"  if (sim.time > 64 && sim.time < 80 && n % 30 === 0) {\n    const st = sim.state;\n    const seat = st.seats[0];\n    const openB = st.entities.filter((e) => e.kind === 'bleeder' && !e.clamped).length;\n    const scratches = st.entities.filter((e) => e.kind === 'scratch').length;\n    console.log('win', sim.time.toFixed(2), 'v', sim.vitals.toFixed(1), 'tool', seat.tool, 'xy', seat.x.toFixed(2), seat.y.toFixed(2), 'cd', seat.syringeCd, 'comp', seat.composure, 'openB', openB, 'scr', scratches, 'hush', sim.hushPhase || '-');\n  }\n  const frameDrop = prevV - sim.vitals;\n  if (false && sim.vitalsMin < prevMin - 0.4 && (sim.vitalsMin < 50 || frameDrop > 2)) {"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2181,"output_tokens":654,"cache_read_input_tokens":108160,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"bbd27a6c-ac33-49fc-b333-3b858e20b557"}
