{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_179","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I left a redundant if/else block that returns syringeAt in both branches.\n\nHolding the syringe at the IV during cooldown is correct pre-positioning. The redundant if/else will be removed after testing. A long cooldown could cause the bot to miss the baton before the shot.\n\nCommit clears immediately after the shot because cooldown exceeds 2.4 seconds. The bot does not linger at the IV during cooldown.\n\nA bug was found where the bot re-commits after a shot if vitals remain below 50. This causes it to stand at the IV and miss beat 4. The fix is to prevent a new commit when the cooldown is still above one second.\n\nThe commit condition now requires the cooldown to be under 0.4 seconds. This prevents re-committing while the shot is still on cooldown, so the bot heals every other bar.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-69573052-5cd8-425d-932e-f412f05d4b2d-74","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js","old_string":"  if (mem.healCommit && (state.vitals >= 58 || (me.syringeCd || 0) > 2.4 || !codaUp)) mem.healCommit = false;\n  // Leave for the IV on beat 2 so the shot lands before the next wind-up.\n  // Finishing that shot still costs the following downbeat, so do it from a high vitals.\n  if (codaUp && !coreNow && (mem.healCommit || (beat === 2 && state.vitals < 50)) && (!bleeding || state.vitals < 22)) {\n    mem.healCommit = true;\n    if ((me.syringeCd || 0) <= 0) return syringeAt(me, IV.x, IV.y, tuning, opts);\n    return syringeAt(me, IV.x, IV.y, tuning, opts);\n  }\n  const healAt = 40;\n  if (!codaUp && !coreNow && !windup && state.vitals < healAt && (me.syringeCd || 0) <= 0 && (!bleeding || state.vitals < 22)) {","new_string":"  if (mem.healCommit && (state.vitals >= 58 || (me.syringeCd || 0) > 2.4 || !codaUp)) mem.healCommit = false;\n  // Start the IV trip on beat 2, while the baton is quiet, and finish the shot\n  // even if the bar rolls forward. The next downbeat still lands; leaving from\n  // a higher vitals keeps that hit above the floor.\n  const canStart = beat === 2 && state.vitals < 50 && (me.syringeCd || 0) <= 0.4;\n  if (codaUp && !coreNow && (mem.healCommit || canStart) && (!bleeding || state.vitals < 22)) {\n    mem.healCommit = true;\n    return syringeAt(me, IV.x, IV.y, tuning, opts);\n  }\n  if (!codaUp && !coreNow && !windup && state.vitals < 40 && (me.syringeCd || 0) <= 0 && (!bleeding || state.vitals < 22)) {"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5032,"output_tokens":1465,"cache_read_input_tokens":121728,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"58799507-a336-4afc-b46f-bb4885644631"}
