{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_190","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Coda doctor is 'both'. giftFor returns hush unless the doctor is 'ines'.\n\nThe bot probably won't swap doctors. Hush should be placed before syringe when coda is up, comp is 100, and vitals are below 50. Syringe should heal around 48% health so it doesn't constantly leave.\n\nThe conductor should start with composure 100 so hush is available immediately. Hush can be fired during windup without issue.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6e543139-5087-4909-99ff-c59da25500ae-88","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"timerScale|this\\.time","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6e543139-5087-4909-99ff-c59da25500ae-89","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"composureGain|composure \\+=","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":876,"output_tokens":701,"cache_read_input_tokens":142336,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"a3925801-9c7f-4c6a-a9fc-b34696b8df47"}
