{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_193","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Laser hits award points. During core windows, multiple damage ticks may trigger awards.\n\nHush activates when comp fills to 100 and vitals dip below 50. In the working run it fired at t=76.5 after the dip. If hush fired at t=75 with comp at 95, the dip would have occurred before comp reached 100.\n\nHush-first would not have prevented the dip unless composure started at 100. With composure at 100 and vitals entering at 48.7, hush would fire immediately on the first bot frame if checked before syringe. The first downbeat is an inhale freeze followed by seven seconds of 0.25x speed. Composure may refill during laser washes and chain hushes. healAt returns to 40 for coda so the bot does not abandon the field for IV while vitals are 50-64.\n\nScratch priority reverts to 84 for coda. The conditional 92 risked pulling the bot off the baton to gel. During hush drains are slow, so vitals may stay above 40; if they drop below, syringe triggers instead. Gift checks will precede syringe when coda is active.\n\nGift before syringe globally would let hush replace suturing when vitals are low and composure is full. That could improve survival but might alter clear times for other ops already in band. The change will be limited to coda.\n\nThe codaUp check in candidates will revert to a simple boolean. The messy gate will be removed.\n\nCoda windup will skip syringe so the first bars kill batons while hush is active. Hush slows the beat fourfold, making windup last about 2.6 seconds and baton kills easy. healAt 46 should keep vitals high enough to avoid most syringes.\n\nThe plan is smoke coda only. If it survives with a high minimum vitals but the timing is off, gel layers will be added; otherwise the run will be traced again.\n\nspecial returns tool: me.tool and use 0, and the rising edge of special triggers the gift.\n\nThe rising-edge logic is confirmed: special fires once on the first frame and then stops because composure drops to zero. The coda doctor swap also checks out, defaulting to hush when the doctor is 'both'.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3403fc17-29d8-4405-9ae5-2a443d0b8264-94","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js","old_string":"    else if (e.kind === 'spore' || e.kind === 'scratch') {\n      const codaUp = state.entities.some((c) => c.kind === 'coda' && c.hp > 0);\n      job = 'spot'; prio = codaUp ? 92 : 84;\n    }","new_string":"    else if (e.kind === 'spore' || e.kind === 'scratch') { job = 'spot'; prio = 84; }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3403fc17-29d8-4405-9ae5-2a443d0b8264-95","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js","old_string":"  const bleeding = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'bleeder' && !e.clamped);\n  const coreNow = state.entities.some((e) => (e.kind === 'coda' && e.coreOpen) || (e.kind === 'adagio' && e.hp > 0 && e.core));\n  const codaUp = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'coda' && e.hp > 0);\n  const messy = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'scratch' || e.kind === 'spore');\n  const healAt = codaUp ? 64 : 40;\n  // Gel a scratch before walking to the IV. The walk is where a downbeat used to land under 35.\n  if (!coreNow && state.vitals < healAt && (me.syringeCd || 0) <= 0 && (!bleeding || state.vitals < 22) && (!messy || state.vitals < 38)) {\n    return syringeAt(me, IV.x, IV.y, tuning, opts);\n  }\n\n  if ((me.composure || 0) >= 100 && state.vitals < 50) {\n    return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, special: true, tool: me.tool };\n  }","new_string":"