{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_207","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Starting to write a script.\n\nIdle and sloppy simulations should finish in about 8–30 seconds. The 250,000-step limit covers the longest idle operation.\n\nIdle should fail except for the last patient. Sloppy rank must be C or better. Grand Rounds must complete at 2, 3, and 4 seats; the time band applies to normal bot performance, but multi-seat splits may finish faster.\n\nThe 45–75% time target applies to the single-player normal bot. Multiplayer scaling is handled separately by the count formula. Ready to write and run the script.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-91d40f56-f8a1-4aed-92e8-984efcba6522-124","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/bots.mjs","old_string":"","new_string":"import { Sim } from '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js';\nimport { play } from '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js';\n\nconst ops = ['broken-glass', 'growth-spurt', 'adagio', 'staccato', 'legato', 'fermata', 'coda', 'last-patient', 'grand-rounds'];\nconst order = { S: 0, A: 1, B: 2, C: 3, D: 4 };\n\nfunction line(tag, sim) {\n  const frac = sim.op.timer ? (sim.time / sim.op.timer).toFixed(3) : '-';\n  console.log([\n    tag.padEnd(16),\n    sim.op.id.padEnd(14),\n    sim.complete ? 'OK' : 'FAIL:' + sim.failed,\n    't=' + sim.time.toFixed(1),\n    'frac=' + frac,\n    'vmin=' + sim.vitalsMin.toFixed(1),\n    'rank=' + (sim.rank?.id || '-'),\n    'score=' + sim.score,\n  ].join(' '));\n}\n\nconsole.log('-- sloppy easy --');\nfor (const id of ops) {\n  if (id === 'last-patient') continue;\n  const sim = new Sim({ op: id, seed: 1, difficulty: 'easy', physics: false });\n  play(sim, { noise: 0.03, reactionDelay: 0.25 }, 400000);\n  line('sloppy', sim);\n}\n\nconsole.log('-- idle --');\nfor (const id of ops) {\n  const sim = new Sim({ op: id, seed: 1, difficulty: 'resident', physics: false });\n  let n = 0;\n  while (!sim.over && n < 400000) { sim.step(); n += 1; }\n  line('idle', sim);\n}\n\nconsole.log('-- grand rounds seats --');\nfor (const seats of [1, 2, 3, 4]) {\n  const sim = new Sim({ op: 'grand-rounds', seed: 1, difficulty: 'resident', physics: false, players: seats });\n  play(sim, {}, 400000);\n  line('gr' + seats, sim);\n}\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1986,"output_tokens":1364,"cache_read_input_tokens":162944,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"8f752135-0e13-4e50-9d58-0626ac756490"}
