{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_213","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The sloppy bot's reaction delay causes the scalpel to drift off the incision line and suture to miss gates.\n\nWrong-link severs also occur. The plan requires the sloppy bot to rank C or better on Easy. The steer function already slows near targets based on delay, but use=1 is applied too late and cut paths lead by 0.12. Adjusting miss detection would affect the human game and normal bot scores, so the delayed control itself must be fixed.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-685e25c1-b6e1-46f2-bd31-0ee4263ab9ba-131","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/miss.mjs","old_string":"","new_string":"import { Sim } from '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js';\nimport { botInput } from '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js';\n\nconst id = process.argv[2] || 'growth-spurt';\nconst seats = Number(process.argv[3] || 1);\nconst mode = process.argv[4] || 'sloppy';\nconst sim = new Sim({\n  op: id, seed: 1, physics: false,\n  difficulty: mode === 'sloppy' ? 'easy' : 'resident',\n  players: seats,\n});\nconst opts = mode === 'sloppy' ? { noise: 0.03, reactionDelay: 0.25 } : {};\nconst counts = {};\nlet n = 0;\nwhile (!sim.over && n < 400000) {\n  for (const s of sim.state.seats) sim.input(s.id, botInput(sim, { id: s.id }, opts));\n  sim.step();\n  for (const e of sim.events) {\n    if (e.type === 'grade' && e.grade === 'MISS') {\n      const key = (sim.phase?.id || '') + ':' + e.why;\n      counts[key] = (counts[key] || 0) + 1;\n    }\n  }\n  n += 1;\n}\nconsole.log(id, mode, 'seats', seats, sim.complete ? 'OK' : 'FAIL:' + sim.failed, 'miss', sim.misses, 't', sim.time.toFixed(1));\nconsole.log(counts);\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1010,"output_tokens":809,"cache_read_input_tokens":171520,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"655ef572-64b7-4ddb-b0ee-51aa97236371"}
