{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_224","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"d=99 indicates no tether or link was alive at the nick moment.\n\nThe bot is scalpel-cutting empty space. Tethers are already severed, but the bot continues swiping at the tumor area and chain location.\n\nThe bot is likely holding a delayed scalpel command from a dead target. The 0.25-second delay queue keeps use=1 active after the tether or link is severed, so the swipe continues past the nick threshold.\n\nThe nick timestamps are only 1.15 seconds apart, so the 0.4-second cooldown resets after each cut. The bot keeps choosing scalpel use continuously. It is unclear what it would cut in the tumor phase once all tethers are gone.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-27d9a78e-7640-48d9-a47a-f538fce78550-145","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js","offset":815,"limit":20}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-27d9a78e-7640-48d9-a47a-f538fce78550-146","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js","offset":200,"limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":627,"output_tokens":814,"cache_read_input_tokens":187008,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"eb41c614-b7fd-4901-83a3-194c7ee7ed0e"}
