{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_240","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will read STAGE.md and follow its instructions. I will complete all tasks from PLAN.md that can be done on this computer. I will ensure all items from TASK.md are present in the folder.\n\nI am resuming bot calibration for the Trauma Center surgical game. I will retest four untested bot.js edits: grab() lead timing, coda hush gate vitals, beat-3 baton approach, and GR 2-seat arrest site-switch. The renderer will not start until sloppy Easy reaches ≥C on every op and GR seats 1-4 are complete. I will verify the current code, run targeted smoke tests, and update the todo list.\n\nI am locating the project root and scratch directory. I will inspect bot.js to confirm the edits are saved, then run the existing smoke scripts for sloppy legato, sloppy coda, and GR 2 seats.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The last bot edits are on disk and untested. I'll re-run sloppy legato, sloppy coda, and the two-seat Grand Rounds against the shipped sim before changing anything else."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-52443ba0-6086-43f5-9d4e-9e6aa7893f35-0","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"scaffold","content":"Scaffold dev folder, RNG title, package, hub client, build, test runner","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"sim","content":"Headless sim: beat, vitals, scoring, tools, gifts, checkpoints, all ops and strains","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"bot-tests","content":"Retest sloppy legato/coda and GR seats, then lock Normal parScores","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"view","content":"Three.js toon/ink field, instruments, HUD, pad/mouse/keys","status":"pending"},{"id":"story-audio","content":"Story scenes, busts, procedural music, effects, voices","status":"pending"},{"id":"shell","content":"Menus, chart, free play, settings, glyphs, touch, save, about, attract, dev","status":"pending"},{"id":"multi","content":"Couch co-op and hub session until harness passes","status":"pending"},{"id":"finish","content":"parScore, authoring note, exit interview, root HTML, verification logs","status":"pending"}],"merge":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-52443ba0-6086-43f5-9d4e-9e6aa7893f35-1","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function grab|function approach|vitals < 62|beatInBar === 3|eye.site","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-52443ba0-6086-43f5-9d4e-9e6aa7893f35-2","name":"list_dir","input":{"target_directory":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":20919,"output_tokens":1055,"cache_read_input_tokens":13696,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"d949bf03-154d-4708-98df-f2c7558998b0"}
