{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-de0d8768-70e9-4767-80fb-1b8e8c05e53f-28","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"385→\\n  const list = candidates(state, me).filter((c) => !claims.has(c.e.id));\\n  if (list.length) {\\n    const pick = list[0];\\n    claims.add(pick.e.id);\\n390→    return actOn(state, me, pick.job, pick.e, mem, tuning, opts);\\n  }\\n\\n  const closing = /^close\\\\b/i.test(state.objective || '') || !!state.flags?.closing || !!state.flags?.needUnclamp;\\n  if (closing) {\\n    const clamped = state.entities.find((e) => e.kind === 'bleeder' && e.clamped && !claims.has(e.id));\\n    if (clamped) {\\n      claims.add(clamped.id);\\n      return unclamp(me, clamped, mem, tuning, opts, state);\\n    }\\n400→  }\\n\\n  const tools = state.phaseTools || [];\\n  if (tools.includes('syringe') && !state.flags?.stabilized && /stab/i.test(state.objective || '')) {\\n    return syringeAt(me, IV.x, IV.y, tuning, opts);\\n  }\\n  if (tools.includes('scanner') && !closing) return scan(state, me, mem, tuning, opts);\\n  return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, tool: me.tool || 'gel' };\\n}\\n\\n410→/** One input frame for one seat. Reads `sim.state` only. */\\nexport function botInput(sim, seat, opts = {}) {\\n  const stateNow = sim.state;\\n  const root = rootOf(sim);\\n  if (root.tick !== stateNow.tick) {\\n    root.tick = stateNow.tick;\\n    root.state = stateNow;\\n    root.claims = new Set();\\n  }\\n  const state = root.state;\\n420→  const id = typeof seat === 'number' ? seat : seat.id;\\n  const me = state.seats.find((s) => s.id === id);\\n  if (!me || me.out) return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0 };\\n  const mem = seatMem(root, id);\\n  const frame = decide(state, me, mem, opts, root.claims);\\n  if (opts.noise) {\\n    frame.x = (frame.x || 0) + (mem.rng() - 0.5) * 2 * opts.noise;\\n    frame.y = (frame.y || 0) + (mem.rng() - 0.5) * 2 * opts.noise;\\n  }\\n  const delay = Math.max(0, Math.round((opts.reactionDelay || 0) * 60));\\n430→  mem.queue.push(frame);\\n  if (mem.queue.length <= delay) return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0 };\\n  return mem.queue.shift();\\n}\\n\\n/** Drive every seat from the bot until the operation ends. */\\nexport function play(sim, opts = {}, maxSteps = 1e7) {\\n  let n = 0;\\n  while (!sim.over && n < maxSteps) {\\n    const ids = sim.state.seats.map((s) => s.id);\",\"content_concise\":\"385→\\n  const list = candidates(state, me).filter((c) => !claims.has(c.e.id));\\n  if (list.length) {\\n    const pick = list[0];\\n    claims.add(pick.e.id);\\n390→    return actOn(state, me, pick.job, pick.e, mem, tuning, opts);\\n  }\\n\\n  const closing = /^close\\\\b/i.test(state.objective || '') || !!state.flags?.closing || !!state.flags?.needUnclamp;\\n  if (closing) {\\n    const clamped = state.entities.find((e) => e.kind === 'bleeder' && e.clamped && !claims.has(e.id));\\n    if (clamped) {\\n      claims.add(clamped.id);\\n      return unclamp(me, clamped, mem, tuning, opts, state);\\n    }\\n400→  }\\n\\n  const tools = state.phaseTools || [];\\n  if (tools.includes('syringe') && !state.flags?.stabilized && /stab/i.test(state.objective || '')) {\\n    return syringeAt(me, IV.x, IV.y, tuning, opts);\\n  }\\n  if (tools.includes('scanner') && !closing) return scan(state, me, mem, tuning, opts);\\n  return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, tool: me.tool || 'gel' };\\n}\\n\\n410→/** One input frame for one seat. Reads `sim.state` only. */\\nexport function botInput(sim, seat, opts = {}) {\\n  const stateNow = sim.state;\\n  const root = rootOf(sim);\\n  if (root.tick !== stateNow.tick) {\\n    root.tick = stateNow.tick;\\n    root.state = stateNow;\\n    root.claims = new Set();\\n  }\\n  const state = root.state;\\n420→  const id = typeof seat === 'number' ? seat : seat.id;\\n  const me = state.seats.find((s) => s.id === id);\\n  if (!me || me.out) return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0 };\\n  const mem = seatMem(root, id);\\n  const frame = decide(state, me, mem, opts, root.claims);\\n  if (opts.noise) {\\n    frame.x = (frame.x || 0) + (mem.rng() - 0.5) * 2 * opts.noise;\\n    frame.y = (frame.y || 0) + (mem.rng() - 0.5) * 2 * opts.noise;\\n  }\\n  const delay = Math.max(0, Math.round((opts.reactionDelay || 0) * 60));\\n430→  mem.queue.push(frame);\\n  if (mem.queue.length <= delay) return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0 };\\n  return mem.queue.shift();\\n}\\n\\n/** Drive every seat from the bot until the operation ends. */\\nexport function play(sim, opts = {}, maxSteps = 1e7) {\\n  let n = 0;\\n  while (!sim.over && n < maxSteps) {\\n    const ids = sim.state.seats.map((s) => s.id);\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js\",\"offset\":385,\"limit\":55,\"raw_output\":\"\\n  const list = candidates(state, me).filter((c) => !claims.has(c.e.id));\\n  if (list.length) {\\n    const pick = list[0];\\n    claims.add(pick.e.id);\\n    return actOn(state, me, pick.job, pick.e, mem, tuning, opts);\\n  }\\n\\n  const closing = /^close\\\\b/i.test(state.objective || '') || !!state.flags?.closing || !!state.flags?.needUnclamp;\\n  if (closing) {\\n    const clamped = state.entities.find((e) => e.kind === 'bleeder' && e.clamped && !claims.has(e.id));\\n    if (clamped) {\\n      claims.add(clamped.id);\\n      return unclamp(me, clamped, mem, tuning, opts, state);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  const tools = state.phaseTools || [];\\n  if (tools.includes('syringe') && !state.flags?.stabilized && /stab/i.test(state.objective || '')) {\\n    return syringeAt(me, IV.x, IV.y, tuning, opts);\\n  }\\n  if (tools.includes('scanner') && !closing) return scan(state, me, mem, tuning, opts);\\n  return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, tool: me.tool || 'gel' };\\n}\\n\\n/** One input frame for one seat. Reads `sim.state` only. */\\nexport function botInput(sim, seat, opts = {}) {\\n  const stateNow = sim.state;\\n  const root = rootOf(sim);\\n  if (root.tick !== stateNow.tick) {\\n    root.tick = stateNow.tick;\\n    root.state = stateNow;\\n    root.claims = new Set();\\n  }\\n  const state = root.state;\\n  const id = typeof seat === 'number' ? seat : seat.id;\\n  const me = state.seats.find((s) => s.id === id);\\n  if (!me || me.out) return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0 };\\n  const mem = seatMem(root, id);\\n  const frame = decide(state, me, mem, opts, root.claims);\\n  if (opts.noise) {\\n    frame.x = (frame.x || 0) + (mem.rng() - 0.5) * 2 * opts.noise;\\n    frame.y = (frame.y || 0) + (mem.rng() - 0.5) * 2 * opts.noise;\\n  }\\n  const delay = Math.max(0, Math.round((opts.reactionDelay || 0) * 60));\\n  mem.queue.push(frame);\\n  if (mem.queue.length <= delay) return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0 };\\n  return mem.queue.shift();\\n}\\n\\n/** Drive every seat from the bot until the operation ends. */\\nexport function play(sim, opts = {}, maxSteps = 1e7) {\\n  let n = 0;\\n  while (!sim.over && n < maxSteps) {\\n    const ids = sim.state.seats.map((s) => s.id);\\n\",\"total_lines\":445}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-de0d8768-70e9-4767-80fb-1b8e8c05e53f-29","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"30→export function moveSeat(sim, seat, dt) {\\n  const f = seat.cmd;\\n  const tun = sim.tuning;\\n  const prevX = seat.x;\\n  const prevY = seat.y;\\n  let x = seat.x;\\n  let y = seat.y;\\n  const steady = !!f.steady;\\n  const held = sim.entities.find((e) => e.alive && e.holder === seat.id && e.embedded);\\n  if (f.source === 'abs') {\\n40→    const tx = Number.isFinite(f.x) ? f.x : x;\\n    const ty = Number.isFinite(f.y) ? f.y : y;\\n    if (held) {\\n      const dx = tx - x;\\n      const dy = ty - y;\\n      const mag = Math.hypot(dx, dy);\\n      const max = 4 * dt;\\n      if (mag > max && mag > 0) {\\n        x += (dx / mag) * max;\\n        y += (dy / mag) * max;\\n50→      } else {\\n        x = tx;\\n        y = ty;\\n      }\\n    } else {\\n      x = tx;\\n      y = ty;\\n      const gate = nearestGate(sim, seat, x, y);\\n      if (gate && dist(x, y, gate.x, gate.y) < 0.12) {\\n        x += (gate.x - x) * 0.1 * dt * 12;\\n60→        y += (gate.y - y) * 0.1 * dt * 12;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  } else {\\n    const sx = f.x || 0;\\n    const sy = f.y || 0;\\n    const mag = Math.hypot(sx, sy);\\n    if (mag > 0.12) {\\n      const sm = Math.min(1, mag);\\n      const speed = tun.tipSpeed * sm ** tun.stickCurve * (steady ? tun.steadyFactor : 1);\\n70→      x += (sx / mag) * speed * dt;\\n      y += (sy / mag) * speed * dt;\\n    }\\n    if (tun.aimAssist > 0) {\\n      const g = nearestGuide(sim, x, y, seat);\\n      if (g && dist(x, y, g.x, g.y) < 0.12) {\\n        const pull = tun.aimAssist * dt * 12;\\n        x += (g.x - x) * pull;\\n        y += (g.y - y) * pull;\\n      }\\n80→    }\\n  }\\n  [seat.x, seat.y] = sim.clampTip(x, y);\\n  seat.vx = (seat.x - prevX) / dt;\\n  seat.vy = (seat.y - prevY) / dt;\\n  seat.speed = Math.hypot(seat.vx, seat.vy);\\n  seat.prevX = prevX;\\n  seat.prevY = prevY;\\n}\\n\\n90→function nearestGuide(sim, x, y, seat) {\\n  let best = null;\\n  let bestD = 0.12;\\n  for (const e of sim.entities) {\\n    if (!e.alive || e.site !== seat.site || e.covered) continue;\\n    let p = null;\\n    if (e.kind === 'incision' && !e.done) p = pointAt(e, e.along || 0);\\n    else if (e.kind === 'wound' && !e.done) p = e.gates[e.gate] || null;\\n    else if (e.kind === 'circleCut' && !e.done && e.points) p = pointAt(e, e.along || 0);\\n    if (!p) continue;\",\"content_concise\":\"30→export function moveSeat(sim, seat, dt) {\\n  const f = seat.cmd;\\n  const tun = sim.tuning;\\n  const prevX = seat.x;\\n  const prevY = seat.y;\\n  let x = seat.x;\\n  let y = seat.y;\\n  const steady = !!f.steady;\\n  const held = sim.entities.find((e) => e.alive && e.holder === seat.id && e.embedded);\\n  if (f.source === 'abs') {\\n40→    const tx = Number.isFinite(f.x) ? f.x : x;\\n    const ty = Number.isFinite(f.y) ? f.y : y;\\n    if (held) {\\n      const dx = tx - x;\\n      const dy = ty - y;\\n      const mag = Math.hypot(dx, dy);\\n      const max = 4 * dt;\\n      if (mag > max && mag > 0) {\\n        x += (dx / mag) * max;\\n        y += (dy / mag) * max;\\n50→      } else {\\n        x = tx;\\n        y = ty;\\n      }\\n    } else {\\n      x = tx;\\n      y = ty;\\n      const gate = nearestGate(sim, seat, x, y);\\n      if (gate && dist(x, y, gate.x, gate.y) < 0.12) {\\n        x += (gate.x - x) * 0.1 * dt * 12;\\n60→        y += (gate.y - y) * 0.1 * dt * 12;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  } else {\\n    const sx = f.x || 0;\\n    const sy = f.y || 0;\\n    const mag = Math.hypot(sx, sy);\\n    if (mag > 0.12) {\\n      const sm = Math.min(1, mag);\\n      const speed = tun.tipSpeed * sm ** tun.stickCurve * (steady ? tun.steadyFactor : 1);\\n70→      x += (sx / mag) * speed * dt;\\n      y += (sy / mag) * speed * dt;\\n    }\\n    if (tun.aimAssist > 0) {\\n      const g = nearestGuide(sim, x, y, seat);\\n      if (g && dist(x, y, g.x, g.y) < 0.12) {\\n        const pull = tun.aimAssist * dt * 12;\\n        x += (g.x - x) * pull;\\n        y += (g.y - y) * pull;\\n      }\\n80→    }\\n  }\\n  [seat.x, seat.y] = sim.clampTip(x, y);\\n  seat.vx = (seat.x - prevX) / dt;\\n  seat.vy = (seat.y - prevY) / dt;\\n  seat.speed = Math.hypot(seat.vx, seat.vy);\\n  seat.prevX = prevX;\\n  seat.prevY = prevY;\\n}\\n\\n90→function nearestGuide(sim, x, y, seat) {\\n  let best = null;\\n  let bestD = 0.12;\\n  for (const e of sim.entities) {\\n    if (!e.alive || e.site !== seat.site || e.covered) continue;\\n    let p = null;\\n    if (e.kind === 'incision' && !e.done) p = pointAt(e, e.along || 0);\\n    else if (e.kind === 'wound' && !e.done) p = e.gates[e.gate] || null;\\n    else if (e.kind === 'circleCut' && !e.done && e.points) p = pointAt(e, e.along || 0);\\n    if (!p) continue;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/tools.js\",\"offset\":30,\"limit\":70,\"raw_output\":\"export function moveSeat(sim, seat, dt) {\\n  const f = seat.cmd;\\n  const tun = sim.tuning;\\n  const prevX = seat.x;\\n  const prevY = seat.y;\\n  let x = seat.x;\\n  let y = seat.y;\\n  const steady = !!f.steady;\\n  const held = sim.entities.find((e) => e.alive && e.holder === seat.id && e.embedded);\\n  if (f.source === 'abs') {\\n    const tx = Number.isFinite(f.x) ? f.x : x;\\n    const ty = Number.isFinite(f.y) ? f.y : y;\\n    if (held) {\\n      const dx = tx - x;\\n      const dy = ty - y;\\n      const mag = Math.hypot(dx, dy);\\n      const max = 4 * dt;\\n      if (mag > max && mag > 0) {\\n        x += (dx / mag) * max;\\n        y += (dy / mag) * max;\\n      } else {\\n        x = tx;\\n        y = ty;\\n      }\\n    } else {\\n      x = tx;\\n      y = ty;\\n      const gate = nearestGate(sim, seat, x, y);\\n      if (gate && dist(x, y, gate.x, gate.y) < 0.12) {\\n        x += (gate.x - x) * 0.1 * dt * 12;\\n        y += (gate.y - y) * 0.1 * dt * 12;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  } else {\\n    const sx = f.x || 0;\\n    const sy = f.y || 0;\\n    const mag = Math.hypot(sx, sy);\\n    if (mag > 0.12) {\\n      const sm = Math.min(1, mag);\\n      const speed = tun.tipSpeed * sm ** tun.stickCurve * (steady ? tun.steadyFactor : 1);\\n      x += (sx / mag) * speed * dt;\\n      y += (sy / mag) * speed * dt;\\n    }\\n    if (tun.aimAssist > 0) {\\n      const g = nearestGuide(sim, x, y, seat);\\n      if (g && dist(x, y, g.x, g.y) < 0.12) {\\n        const pull = tun.aimAssist * dt * 12;\\n        x += (g.x - x) * pull;\\n        y += (g.y - y) * pull;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  [seat.x, seat.y] = sim.clampTip(x, y);\\n  seat.vx = (seat.x - prevX) / dt;\\n  seat.vy = (seat.y - prevY) / dt;\\n  seat.speed = Math.hypot(seat.vx, seat.vy);\\n  seat.prevX = prevX;\\n  seat.prevY = prevY;\\n}\\n\\nfunction nearestGuide(sim, x, y, seat) {\\n  let best = null;\\n  let bestD = 0.12;\\n  for (const e of sim.entities) {\\n    if (!e.alive || e.site !== seat.site || e.covered) continue;\\n    let p = null;\\n    if (e.kind === 'incision' && !e.done) p = pointAt(e, e.along || 0);\\n    else if (e.kind === 'wound' && !e.done) p = e.gates[e.gate] || null;\\n    else if (e.kind === 'circleCut' && !e.done && e.points) p = pointAt(e, e.along || 0);\\n    if (!p) continue;\\n\",\"total_lines\":799}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"a084b0b7-16e9-47db-b4f2-47373708cd25"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_257","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The bot returns a stick item with coordinates at zero and no tool selected.\n\nThe stuck position yields no candidates. Possible causes include a mismatched chainActive index, the link being cut or a holder/tray, or timing issues. I will dump the entities at the stuck frame.\n\nNoise on zero coordinates produces a stick magnitude below the 0.12 deadzone, so the tip stays still and speed reads zero. The link entity may be inactive.\n\nstepLegato only marks entities dead for trays. The chain is alive, so chainActive should be defined. I suspect something clears chainActive after stepLegato. I will also check if link 0 lost its coordinates or was hidden.\n\nThe first link may have a vertical segment. A missed swipe that rehealed should still leave it as a candidate. Links are not hidden, so they are not filtered from export. Candidates do not check phase tools, so the chain phase is irrelevant. The stuck frame is at t=207 in the chain phase with the objective \"Sever the chain from the tail\".","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-75b5802e-868e-4975-9a56-d3b38b2a6c07-30","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"stepLegato|function stepStrains|beats","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/strains.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4206,"output_tokens":831,"cache_read_input_tokens":71808,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"0d037b76-3c32-4deb-bc41-dfe0d112af80"}
