{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_260","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The bug is now clear. chain.active is 0, but link index 0 is CUT and TRAYED.\n\nThe link entity is missing from the export because it is trayed. The stepLegato logic only reattaches links that are cut but not trayed or held. Active index shifts down by one on sever. The tail was at index 11, then 10, and somehow active became 0. Now examining the reheal function.\n\nreheal sets active to the first uncut link via findIndex, not the tail. This causes active to land on index 1 instead of the highest uncut tail. The dump confirms active is 0 while link 0 is cut and trayed.\n\nThe trySever function decrements active even when the link is already trayed. Reattach sets active to the reattaching link's index. The dump shows link 0 was successfully trayed, so active must have been set to 0 afterward by some other mechanism.\n\nThe exact failure sequence is now clear. After the tail was cut and trayed, a wrong-link sever triggered a heal. Because only the head link remained uncut, findIndex of !cut returned 0. This incorrectly set active to the head index instead of the tail.\n\nThe correct tail-most uncut link should be the next cut target, not the head. A wrong cut on link 5 should restore active to index 9, not 0.\n\nThe bot severs the head link at index 0. Active drops to 0 and that link becomes trayed. The remaining links are no longer active. The dead head entity is not a swipe candidate. The bot freezes. The fix should set active to the highest uncut, untrayed index after a heal.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1685b3a0-eca0-4332-8d16-fe7acbbcebea-33","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"legato|reattach|wrong link|reheal|active","path":"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6%2Fwork/01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710/goal/plan.md","head_limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1162,"output_tokens":1334,"cache_read_input_tokens":78464,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"601fb87f-6e16-448b-a985-1613f4186a1d"}
