p to four seats on one screen; two pads join, move two tips independently, and both score. The real hub harness passes all of: 2 players; 3 players and 4 players at ~150 ms ±50 ms and 5% loss; host-leave; server copy; and the 4-player case again on WebGL2 — each with `__hubCheck.pass === true` and no console line starting with `[AIHub]`. The standalone harness sequence (Enter, Space, Enter, Space) throws [... truncated (1031 chars total)]\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"0fd6ef96-a2fe-4ea8-8cea-f38d00012232"}
