{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_265","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Sloppy legato passed with rank A, 4 misses capped at 12, and a time of 270.\n\nNormal legato remains perfect at t=195, score 29795, rank S. Sloppy coda fails vitals at t=98.6 in phase recap with vmin -0.1 and miss 0. It died during recap before reaching the conductor. Previously it survived to timeout in development.\n\nThe grab change likely caused the sloppy coda to die earlier. It now grabs things at the wrong time, possibly interfering with feeder beaming or causing press-while-moving issues.\n\nThe grab change may not be the real cause. Crescendo is not grabbable until exposed, and feeders are beamed rather than grabbed. The failure might instead come from forceps presses during approach or from recap containing a legato. I will read coda.js to inspect the recap phase.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-627ce1a8-2b67-4fdf-adf3-822971c1aaa6-40","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/data/ops/coda.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":514,"output_tokens":653,"cache_read_input_tokens":87424,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"0f9130f1-a437-4b37-a59a-5c94748125a0"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-627ce1a8-2b67-4fdf-adf3-822971c1aaa6-40","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→import { gel, gelDress, gates, line } from './shape.js';\\n\\nconst crawl = [[-0.45, 0.08], [0.2, 0.16], [0.35, -0.1]];\\n\\nexport default {\\n  id: 'coda',\\n  chapter: 4,\\n  title: 'Coda',\\n  doctor: 'both',\\n10→  swap: true,\\n  consult: true,\\n  voice: 'pip',\\n  scene: { before: 'S13', after: 'S14' },\\n  patient: {\\n    name: 'Beatrice Okonkwo', age: 58, job: 'Head nurse',\\n    note: 'Do not be dramatic about this.',\\n    followUp: 'Discharged herself. Is back in OR 3. Has opinions.',\\n  },\\n  timer: 570,\\n20→  bpm: 92,\\n  parScore: 34249,\\n  music: 'coda',\\n  teaches: ['coda', 'adagio', 'staccato', 'tremolo', 'legato', 'crescendo', 'fermata', 'defib', 'hush', 'sforzando'],\\n  sites: [\\n    { id: 'heart', organ: 'heart' },\\n    { id: 'lung', organ: 'lung' },\\n    { id: 'aorta', organ: 'aorta' },\\n  ],\\n  phases: [\\n30→    {\\n      id: 'exposition',\\n      objective: 'Clear the heart',\\n      tools: ['laser', 'forceps', 'gel', 'scalpel'],\\n      spawn: [\\n        { kind: 'adagio', site: 'heart', at: [-0.4, 0.05], hp: 80, path: crawl },\\n        { kind: 'hole', site: 'heart', at: [0.25, -0.12], hidden: false, quota: 6, strain: 'staccato' },\\n      ],\\n      done: { cleared: ['adagio', 'hole', 'note', 'spore', 'scratch'] },\\n      say: [{ at: 0, who: 'pip', mood: 'shaky', text: \\\"'Suction before you can't see.' She underlined that twice.\\\" }],\\n40→    },\\n    {\\n      id: 'development',\\n      objective: 'Clear the lung',\\n      tools: ['scanner', 'laser', 'scalpel', 'forceps', 'clamp'],\\n      spawn: [\\n        { kind: 'tremolo', site: 'lung', at: [-0.2, 0.12], hp: 40 },\\n        { kind: 'tremolo', site: 'lung', at: [0.3, -0.1], hp: 40 },\\n        { kind: 'legato', site: 'lung', at: [0.7, 0.02], links: 8 },\\n        { kind: 'bleeder', site: 'heart', at: [-0.1, 0.05] },\\n50→      ],\\n      done: { cleared: ['tremolo', 'scratch'], strainDead: 'legato', clamped: true, poolsClear: true },\\n      say: [{ at: 0, who: 'pip', mood: 'reading', text: \\\"'The other site is also your patient.' There is a little arrow.\\\" }],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: 'recap',\\n      objective: 'Clear the aorta',\\n      tools: ['laser', 'scalpel', 'forceps', 'defib'],\\n      begin: [{ wipe: 'fermata' }],\\n      spawn: [\\n60→        { kind: 'crescendo', site: 'aorta', at: [0, 0.02], size: 0.15 },\\n      ],\\n      on: [\\n        {\\n          when: { removed: 'crescendo' },\\n          once: true,\\n          do: [{ spawn: { kind: 'fermata', site: 'aorta', at: [0.05, 0.05], hp: 60, needed: 9 } }],\\n        },\\n      ],\\n      done: { strainDead: 'crescendo', arrests: 1, poolsClear: true },\\n70→      say: [{ at: 0, who: 'pip', mood: 'small', text: \\\"'If the room starts keeping her time, you are late.'\\\" }],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: 'conductor',\\n      objective: 'End the conductor',\\n      tools: ['laser', 'forceps', 'gel', 'clamp'],\\n      begin: [{ composure: 100 }],\\n      spawn: [{ kind: 'coda', site: 'heart', at: [0, 0.02], hp: 300 }],\\n      done: { strainDead: 'coda', cleared: ['note', 'spore', 'scratch', 'baton'], poolsClear: true },\\n      say: [{ at: 0, who: 'pip', mood: 'steady', text: \\\"'Beat one is a lie unless you cut the stick. Then take the center when it bows.'\\\" }],\\n80→    },\\n    {\\n      id: 'closing',\\n      objective: 'Close every site',\\n      tools: ['suture', 'gel', 'forceps'],\\n      spawn: [\\n        { kind: 'wound', site: 'heart', at: [-0.2, 0.05], gates: gates(-0.4, 0.1, 0.35, 0.02, 6) },\\n        { kind: 'wound', site: 'lung', at: [-0.15, 0], gates: gates(-0.35, 0.05, 0.4, -0.05, 6) },\\n        { kind: 'wound', site: 'aorta', at: [0, 0], gates: gates(-0.3, 0.08, 0.4, -0.06, 6) },\\n        { kind: 'gelZone', site: 'heart', rect: gel(-0.7, -0.24, 0.45, 0.24), parTime: 10 },\\n90→      ],\\n      on: gelDress('heart', 12),\\n      done: { cleared: ['wound', 'gelZone'], allClampsOff: true },\\n      say: [{ at: 0, who: 'pip', mood: 'hope', text: \\\"'Leave the room the way you found her. Stubborn.'\\\" }],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: 'last-stop',\\n      objective: 'Bring her back',\\n      tools: ['defib'],\\n      begin: [{ event: 'arrest', clock: 8 }, { forceGift: 'hush' }, { composure: 100 }],\\n100→      done: { arrests: 2 },\\n      say: [{ at: 0, who: 'ren', mood: 'quiet', text: 'No hint. Just the paddles. Stay with her.' }],\\n    },\\n  ],\\n};\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→import { gel, gelDress, gates, line } from './shape.js';\\n\\nconst crawl = [[-0.45, 0.08], [0.2, 0.16], [0.35, -0.1]];\\n\\nexport default {\\n  id: 'coda',\\n  chapter: 4,\\n  title: 'Coda',\\n  doctor: 'both',\\n10→  swap: true,\\n  consult: true,\\n  voice: 'pip',\\n  scene: { before: 'S13', after: 'S14' },\\n  patient: {\\n    name: 'Beatrice Okonkwo', age: 58, job: 'Head nurse',\\n    note: 'Do not be dramatic about this.',\\n    followUp: 'Discharged herself. Is back in OR 3. Has opinions.',\\n  },\\n  timer: 570,\\n20→  bpm: 92,\\n  parScore: 34249,\\n  music: 'coda',\\n  teaches: ['coda', 'adagio', 'staccato', 'tremolo', 'legato', 'crescendo', 'fermata', 'defib', 'hush', 'sforzando'],\\n  sites: [\\n    { id: 'heart', organ: 'heart' },\\n    { id: 'lung', organ: 'lung' },\\n    { id: 'aorta', organ: 'aorta' },\\n  ],\\n  phases: [\\n30→    {\\n      id: 'exposition',\\n      objective: 'Clear the heart',\\n      tools: ['laser', 'forceps', 'gel', 'scalpel'],\\n      spawn: [\\n        { kind: 'adagio', site: 'heart', at: [-0.4, 0.05], hp: 80, path: crawl },\\n        { kind: 'hole', site: 'heart', at: [0.25, -0.12], hidden: false, quota: 6, strain: 'staccato' },\\n      ],\\n      done: { cleared: ['adagio', 'hole', 'note', 'spore', 'scratch'] },\\n      say: [{ at: 0, who: 'pip', mood: 'shaky', text: \\\"'Suction 