{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_267","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Recap tools are laser, scalpel, forceps, and defib. No clamp.\n\nThe bot cannot clamp fortissimo bleeders. Eight bleeders means two fortissimos firing simultaneously. The crescendo stayed at size 1 because feeders respawned every 10.4 seconds while the laser was delayed and slow. Killing four feeders takes about eight to ten seconds, which is too slow against the growth timer.\n\nThe crescendo reaches size 1 in about 10.6 seconds from its starting value of 0.15. After that it resets to 0.6 and grows to size 1 every five seconds. Each fortissimo deals -20 damage plus two bleeders. The bot must kill four feeders before the first fortissimo fires. It needs to get within 0.03 units and hold the laser.\n\nThe delayed approach overshoots or arrives late. The laser press should start before arrival so the beam fires as soon as the tip reaches the feeder. The `beam()` function only holds the laser when distance is under 0.04. With a 0.25 second delay, the activation command arrives after that window.\n\nThe delayed laser stays off for the entire approach plus 0.25 seconds after arrival because queued steers shift the tip away from the activation window. The hit radius is 0.05, so firing earlier would help. For zero delay, the current 0.04 threshold remains. For positive delay, the function will check distance against a wider threshold.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-609967ec-5527-4efa-a22a-f4097bfd48fa-43","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function stepLaser","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/tools.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3159,"output_tokens":1107,"cache_read_input_tokens":90112,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"af8ab461-d4c0-4053-b94b-1d59a9def8d8"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-609967ec-5527-4efa-a22a-f4097bfd48fa-43","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,51,49,50,51,48,95,95,120,56,102,52,57,98,54,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,49,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,51,49,50,51,48,95,95,120,56,102,52,57,98,54,47,119,111,114,107,47,65,108,105,118,101,32,105,110,32,67,111,109,109,111,110,32,84,105,109,101,45,84,114,97,117,109,97,32,67,101,110,116,101,114,58,32,83,101,99,111,110,100,32,79,112,105,110,105,111,110,45,103,114,111,107,45,52,46,55,45,120,104,105,103,104,45,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,51,49,50,51,48,47,115,114,99,47,115,105,109,47,116,111,111,108,115,46,106,115,10,54,55,54,58,102,117,110,99,116,105,111,110,32,115,116,101,112,76,97,115,101,114,40,115,105,109,44,32,115,101,97,116,44,32,100,116,44,32,117,115,101,44,32,112,111,119,101,114,41,32,123,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":1,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/tools.js\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":676,\"content\":\"function stepLaser(sim, seat, dt, use, power) {\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"