,110,118,32,98,101,105,110,103,32,115,101,116,46,10,40,85,115,101,32,96,110,111,100,101,32,45,45,116,114,97,99,101,45,119,97,114,110,105,110,103,115,32,46,46,46,96,32,116,111,32,115,104,111,119,32,119,104,101,114,101,32,116,104,101,32,119,97,114,110,105,110,103,32,119,97,115,32,99,114,101,97,116,101,100,41,10],\"output_for_prompt\":\"exit: 0\\nPHASE exposition t 0.0 v 100.0\\nPHASE development t 24.2 v 83.6\\nPHASE recap t 79.9 v 46.9\\nt 79.9 v 46.9 tool suction use 1.00 spd 0.00 pos -0.10 0.10 size 0.15 exp false feeds 4 34,34,34,34 bleed 0 scorch 0 fort 0 laser 2\\nt 81.9 v 44.0 tool laser use 1.00 spd 0.00 pos 0.02 0.20 size 0.31 exp false feeds 3 34,34,34 bleed 0 scorch 0 fort 0 laser 3\\nt 83.9 v 39.8 tool laser use 1.00 spd 0.00 pos 0.28 0.02 size 0.44 exp false feeds 3 10,34,34 bleed 0 scorch 11 fort 0 laser 3\\nt 86.0 v 34.9 tool laser use 0.00 spd 0.00 pos 1.02 0.22 size 0.60 exp false feeds 4 4,34,34,34 bleed 0 scorch 11 fort 0 laser 3\\nt 88.0 v 43.7 tool laser use 1.00 spd 0.00 pos 0.24 0.01 size 0.76 exp false feeds 4 4,34,34,17 bleed 0 scorch 11 fort 0 laser 3\\nt 90.0 v 36.6 tool laser use 0.00 spd 1.07 pos 0.76 0.12 size 0.88 exp false feeds 2 34,34 bleed 0 scorch 11 fort 0 laser 5\\nt 92.0 v 43.6 tool laser use 0.00 spd 0.92 pos 0.80 0.14 size 0.98 exp false feeds 4 34,34,34,34 bleed 0 scorch 11 fort 0 laser 5\\nt 94.0 v 22.7 tool clamp use 1.00 spd 0.00 pos 0.20 0.02 size 0.74 exp false feeds 4 34,34,34,34 bleed 2 scorch 11 fort 1 laser 5\\nt 96.0 v 12.2 tool clamp use 0.00 spd 0.26 pos 1.07 0.23 size 0.90 exp false feeds 4 34,34,34,34 bleed 2 scorch 11 fort 1 laser 5\\nt 98.1 v 3.6 tool clamp use 0.00 spd 0.74 pos 0.26 0.04 size 0.66 exp false feeds 4 34,34,34,34 bleed 4 scorch 11 fort 2 laser 5\\nEND vitals t 98.6 v 0.0 {\\\"say\\\":3,\\\"tool\\\":50,\\\"burst\\\":3,\\\"grade\\\":45,\\\"note\\\":3,\\\"bark\\\":3400,\\\"hint\\\":8,\\\"downed\\\":2,\\\"wake\\\":1,\\\"sealed\\\":1,\\\"grip\\\":9,\\\"tray\\\":9,\\\"phase\\\":2,\\\"jerk\\\":11,\\\"clamp\\\":4,\\\"site\\\":48,\\\"pin\\\":3,\\\"lasered\\\":5,\\\"sever\\\":8,\\\"hush\\\":3,\\\"drained\\\":4,\\\"scorch\\\":11,\\\"stabilize\\\":3,\\\"fortissimo\\\":2,\\\"fail\\\":1}\\n(node:115914) Warning: The 'NO_COLOR' env is ignored due to the 'FORCE_COLOR' env being set.\\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"command\":\"node /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/trace-recap.mjs\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Trace sloppy coda recap death\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6%2Fwork/01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710/terminal/call-e4db2193-262d-4a25-b3ee-372c66de3b2e-46.log\",\"total_bytes\":2425}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"492c4a9c-3358-4f9b-b17a-9defed40e190"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_271","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The trace is very informative.\n\nRecap starts at t=79.9 with 4 feeders at 34 HP. The bot fires slowly and misses while scorching the patient. At t=83.9 one feeder drops to 10 HP. The bot then syringes the IV at t=86 because vitals were below 40. Vitals rise to 43.7 but drain occurs during the trip. By t=90 only two feeders remain.\n\nAt t=92 all four feeders respawn at full HP. The laser count jumps from three to five, so two more were killed. This means the previous two feeders died and four fresh ones spawned.\n\nThe four feeders at 34 HP may have been undamaged because the bot missed them. Fortissimo strikes twice around t=93 and vitals crash to 22 before death. The bot tries to clamp but the recap tools do not include it. The log still shows four clamp events, some from development.\n\nClamp attempts fail because the bot selects the job without checking phase tool availability. At t=94 it targets a bleeder directly, but bleed count stays at 2. The tool is rejected before it can take effect.\n\nThe death is caused by feeders respawning faster than delayed laser kills can eliminate them. Continuous scorch damage from missed shots, two fortissimo strikes, open bleeders, and syringe trips interrupting the laser also contribute. The proposed fix is to start the laser earlier so the delayed beam hits the feeder on arrival, while avoiding early firing that causes scorch.\n\nThe scorch happens because the bot arrives late and overshoots the feeder, so its laser tip burns the patient instead of hitting the target.\n\nKeeping feeder priority above syringe during crescendo would prevent the bot from abandoning the feeders. At t=86 vitals were 34.9, below the 40 heal threshold, so the bot syringed the IV. That trip takes roughly three to four seconds, during which crescendo grows from 0.60 to 0.76 and feeders respawn.\n\nLowering the heal threshold during crescendo is risky because normal coda vitals may never dip that low. A safer gate would block syringes when a crescendo is unexposed and reactionDelay is positive, unless vitals fall below 22 or 28.\n\nA concrete implementation would detect an unexposed crescendo and lower the heal threshold to 24 when reactionDelay is positive. This only affects sloppy mode. Laser accuracy remains the separate problem.\n\nThe bot does hit feeders occasionally. At t=83.9 it struck a 10 HP target, so the scorch is only a minor issue.\n\nThe real losses are the syringe trip and the respawn. If the bot had stayed on the feeders, it might have killed all four before size hit 1.\n\nAt t=90 the bot was winning with two feeders left at 36.6 vitals. By t=92 size was 0.98 and four full feeders respawned. The remaining feeders reset to 34 HP.\n\nThe two feeders at t=90 were fully healthy survivors. The bot killed the damaged ones and left the untouched ones alone. It then killed those survivors too slowly. The kill rate was only three feeders in ten seconds. Four kills are needed before the next respawn at beat 16. Once all four die, the crescendo exposes and no further respawns occur.\n\nThe math shows four feeders could be killed in about seven and a half seconds if the laser never missed and the bot never left. The trace reveals long idle periods and the bot was often in the wrong place. At t=81.9 it fired use 1 at speed 0 while stuck at position (0.02, 0.20), so the beam never moved toward the crescent-shaped feeders.\n\nThe bot abandoned a nearly dead feeder at 4 HP when it syringed the IV at t=86. That feeder had been reduced to 4 HP while the bot was away. This abandonment is the core bug.\n\nA 24 HP heal threshold during crescendo would keep the bot at t=86 and let it finish the feeder. Vitals would drop to roughly 21 over five seconds from crescendo drain alone, but no fortissimo strike would occur. Killing all four feeders within about six seconds from t=84 should still allow size to reach 1.0 before the next respawn.\n\nThe heal threshold during crescendo will be set to 22 HP, matching the bleeder yield floor. This prevents the bot from syringing the IV while feeders are still alive. The simulation must also be checked to see if it allows using a tool that is not in the current phase's available tools.\n\nThe beam delay is not the main problem once the bot is on target, so I will not adjust it yet. I will change only the heal gate first and retest to verify that normal mode remains untouched.\n\nThe concrete code sets `healAt` to 22 when an unexposed crescendo exists and reactionDelay is positive. This change sits right where the syringe check reads the threshold, so it should work cleanly. A more complex feeder-health gate was considered but skipped for now. Recap starts at 46.9 vitals, which already places feeder priority above bleeder priority.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f28ceba8-2687-471d-8a5e-75267a39515c-47","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"phase\\.tools|seat\\.tool|toolLock|allowed","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/tools.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1070,"output_tokens":2819,"cache_read_input_tokens":96896,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"a8a80207-0fc7-434d-a20b-5000f7d341d3"}
