{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_276","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Progress is being made. The system now stays on lasers longer.\n\nKill rate improved to 6 by t=92. At t=90 two feeders remained at 34 and 14 HP, with size 0.83. The system left for IV at v=22 and died after feeders respawned to 4 and size hit 0.95. Lowering healAt to 12 might finish the last two feeders before leaving. Drain rate at size 0.83 is roughly 3.6 per second.\n\nIf the system stays at v=22, it could kill the last two feeders in about three seconds and drop to roughly 11. Exposing would stop drain and growth, but cutting the circle and extracting before other things would be risky. V=11 is dangerous without fortissimo. The syringe at v=22 is what prevents death.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3db8fd01-d5be-4efe-a8a4-fddff19ce293-55","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"laserBurn","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":974,"output_tokens":1059,"cache_read_input_tokens":103552,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"977540f6-7219-4275-bfb2-df7b4a2bcf6a"}
