set.\\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"command\":\"node /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/trace-recap.mjs\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Retrace sloppy coda after faster beam\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6%2Fwork/01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710/terminal/call-4db01469-0e59-4d3c-9835-02482bcc6eb1-59.log\",\"total_bytes\":2836}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"22d59909-364c-429c-8e17-11653a874f18"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_280","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The recap crescendo was exposed and extracted.\n\nThe conductor died at t=121. The 246-frame scorch burn is not the culprit. Previously the conductor survived to timeout at 850.\n\nThe conductor started at only 19.7 vitals, far below the usual 54.9. The arrest saved roughly 19.7 vitals before the drop to 15, and perfect defib restored them. Hush should have triggered immediately, yet the boss still died in 21 seconds.\n\nHush may not have triggered because the core was open or composure was not 100. Even with slowed damage, 19.7 vitals cannot survive five downbeats at drainMult 0.6.\n\nDownbeats occur roughly every 2.6 seconds at bpm 92, so five downbeats total about 13 seconds. The 7-second hush window likely contains only one, leaving the remaining four to strike after it ends. The bot’s action order prioritizes hush first when vitals are below 62 and composure is full, then syringe if vitals fall below 46. This sequence may not allow enough time to kill batons during their windup.\n\nThe trace shows the bot reached 19.7 vitals at t=92.2 while exposed, then 15 at t=96.2 during the laser. The fermata spawned only after the crescendo was removed. Syringing earlier, before the fermata drained vitals, would have saved far more health than the current 15.\n\nThe bot never had a chance to syringe between extraction and arrest. At t=92.2 it was at 19.7 vitals, which is below the 40 threshold, yet it did not act. The core was not open and no coda windup was active, so the only remaining blockers would be cooldown or bleeding.\n\nThe syringe cooldown was the only remaining blocker. Bleeding is zero and vitals are below 22, so the check should have passed. The bot likely skipped the scalpel because its cooldown was still active.\n\nThe cooldown theory is wrong. The last syringe was used during development, so by t=92 the three-second cooldown was long gone. Swelling was also already false once the crescendo was exposed. The bot still did not syringe at 19.7 vitals.\n\nThe 0.25-second tool delay cannot explain why scalpel was executed for two seconds at 19.7 vitals. The crescendo entity still exists in state, so it is not removed prematurely. A living adagio core may be blocking the syringe check. Something else about the coda state may also be interfering.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b7555fab-5ea1-48f9-8b8f-16dc3f9723aa-60","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js","offset":360,"limit":50}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1198,"output_tokens":1703,"cache_read_input_tokens":108672,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"03f2becf-ed15-4265-8c11-91234776648d"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-b7555fab-5ea1-48f9-8b8f-16dc3f9723aa-60","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"360→  if (mem.altId === e.id) {\\n    mem.altId = 0;\\n    return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, alt: false };\\n  }\\n  mem.altId = e.id;\\n  return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, alt: true, tool: 'forceps' };\\n}\\n\\nfunction decide(state, me, mem, opts, claims) {\\n  const tuning = state.tuning;\\n370→  const held = state.entities.find((e) => e.holder === me.id);\\n  if (held) return carry(me, held, tuning, opts);\\n\\n  if (state.arrest) {\\n    const eye = state.entities.find((e) => e.kind === 'fermata' && e.hp > 0);\\n    if (eye && !state.arrest.tutorial) {\\n      if (eye.site && eye.site !== me.site) {\\n        const idx = state.sites.indexOf(eye.site);\\n        const f = steer(me, eye.x, eye.y, 0.9, tuning, opts);\\n        if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n380→        f.use = 0;\\n        return f;\\n      }\\n      return beam(me, eye, tuning, opts);\\n    }\\n    return shock(me, opts);\\n  }\\n\\n  const bleeding = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'bleeder' && !e.clamped);\\n  const coreNow = state.entities.some((e) => (e.kind === 'coda' && e.coreOpen) || (e.kind === 'adagio' && e.hp > 0 && e.core));\\n390→  const codaUp = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'coda' && e.hp > 0);\\n  const windup = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'baton' && e.hp > 0 && e.windup);\\n  if (codaUp && (me.composure || 0) >= 100 && state.vitals < 62 && !coreNow) {\\n    return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, special: true, tool: me.tool };\\n  }\\n  const swelling = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'crescendo' && !e.exposed);\\n  const healAt = codaUp ? 46 : (swelling && (opts.reactionDelay || 0) > 0 ? 8 : 40);\\n  if (!coreNow && !(codaUp && windup) && state.vitals < healAt && (me.syringeCd || 0) <= 0 && (!bleeding || state.vitals < 22)) {\\n    return syringeAt(me, IV.x, IV.y, tuning, opts);\\n  }\\n400→\\n  if (!codaUp && (me.composure || 0) >= 100 && state.vitals < 50) {\\n    return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, special: true, tool: me.tool };\\n  }\\n\\n  const list = candidates(state, me, opts).filter((c) => !claims.has(c.e.id));\\n  if (list.length) {\\n    const pick = list[0];\\n    claims.add(pick.e.id);\\n    return actOn(state, me, pick.job, pick.e, mem, tuning, opts);\",\"content_concise\":\"360→  if (mem.altId === e.id) {\\n    mem.altId = 0;\\n    return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, alt: false };\\n  }\\n  mem.altId = e.id;\\n  return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, alt: true, tool: 'forceps' };\\n}\\n\\nfunction decide(state, me, mem, opts, claims) {\\n  const tuning = state.tuning;\\n370→  const held = state.entities.find((e) => e.holder === me.id);\\n  if (held) return carry(me, held, tuning, opts);\\n\\n  if (state.arrest) {\\n    const eye = state.entities.find((e) => e.kind === 'fermata' && e.hp > 0);\\n    if (eye && !state.arrest.tutorial) {\\n      if (eye.site && eye.site !== me.site) {\\n        const idx = state.sites.indexOf(eye.site);\\n        const f = steer(me, eye.x, eye.y, 0.9, tuning, opts);\\n        if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n380→        f.use = 0;\\n        return f;\\n      }\\n      return beam(me, eye, tuning, opts);\\n    }\\n    return shock(me, opts);\\n  }\\n\\n  const bleeding = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'bleeder' && !e.clamped);\\n  const coreNow = state.entities.some((e) => (e.kind === 'coda' && e.coreOpen) || (e.kind === 'adagio' && e.hp > 0 && e.core));\\n390→  const codaUp = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'coda' && e.hp > 0);\\n  const windup = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'baton' && e.hp > 0 && e.windup);\\n  if (codaUp && (me.composure || 0) >= 100 && state.vitals < 62 && !coreNow) {\\n    return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, special: true, tool: me.tool };\\n  }\\n  const swelling =