2,100,111,119,110,32,27,91,51,51,109,54,27,91,51,57,109,10,40,110,111,100,101,58,49,52,50,51,53,51,41,32,87,97,114,110,105,110,103,58,32,84,104,101,32,39,78,79,95,67,79,76,79,82,39,32,101,110,118,32,105,115,32,105,103,110,111,114,101,100,32,100,117,101,32,116,111,32,116,104,101,32,39,70,79,82,67,69,95,67,79,76,79,82,39,32,101,110,118,32,98,101,105,110,103,32,115,101,116,46,10,40,85,115,101,32,96,110,111,100,101,32,45,45,116,114,97,99,101,45,119,97,114,110,105,110,103,115,32,46,46,46,96,32,116,111,32,115,104,111,119,32,119,104,101,114,101,32,116,104,101,32,119,97,114,110,105,110,103,32,119,97,115,32,99,114,101,97,116,101,100,41,10],\"output_for_prompt\":\"exit: 0\\nPHASE recap t 78.1 v 49.4\\nPHASE conductor t 104.5 v 34.7\\nt 104.5 v 34.7 hush null comp 100 beat 174 bar 2 tool laser use 0.00 pos 0.06 0.05 hp 255 open false bats 9,9 down 0 site aorta\\nt 106.0 v 34.7 hush wash comp 0 beat 175 bar 3 tool forceps use 1.00 pos 0.85 0.13 hp 255 open false bats 9,9 down 0 site aorta\\nt 107.5 v 34.7 hush wash comp 10 beat 176 bar 4 tool laser use 0.00 pos 1.16 0.16 hp 255 open false bats 9,9 down 0 site heart\\nt 109.0 v 31.1 hush wash comp 15 beat 177 bar 1 tool laser use 1.00 pos 0.25 0.07 hp 255 open false bats 9,7 down 1 site heart\\nt 110.5 v 31.0 hush wash comp 15 beat 177 bar 1 tool gel use 1.00 pos -0.01 -0.08 hp 255 open false bats 9,2 down 1 site heart\\nt 112.1 v 31.0 hush wash comp 20 beat 178 bar 2 tool laser use 0.00 pos 0.00 0.04 hp 255 open false bats 9,2 down 1 site heart\\nt 113.6 v 27.3 hush null comp 20 beat 181 bar 1 tool forceps use 0.00 pos -0.19 0.07 hp 255 open false bats 2,9 down 2 site heart\\nt 115.1 v 22.0 hush null comp 25 beat 185 bar 1 tool laser use 1.00 pos 0.29 0.08 hp 255 open false bats 9,5 down 3 site heart\\nt 116.6 v 21.1 hush null comp 30 beat 188 bar 4 tool laser use 1.00 pos 0.23 0.04 hp 255 open false bats 9,2 down 3 site heart\\nt 118.1 v 19.0 hush null comp 35 beat 192 bar 4 tool laser use 0.00 pos -0.24 0.07 hp 248 open false bats 9,2 down 3 site heart\\nt 119.6 v 14.1 hush null comp 35 beat 195 bar 3 tool laser use 0.00 pos 0.80 0.19 hp 248 open false bats 2,9 down 4 site heart\\nt 121.2 v 7.5 hush null comp 35 beat 199 bar 3 tool laser use 0.00 pos 1.09 0.23 hp 248 open false bats 9,9 down 5 site heart\\nt 122.7 v 0.2 hush null comp 35 beat 203 bar 3 tool laser use 0.00 pos 1.10 0.24 hp 248 open false bats 9,9 down 6 site heart\\nEND vitals t 122.8 v 0.0 down 6\\n(node:142353) Warning: The 'NO_COLOR' env is ignored due to the 'FORCE_COLOR' env being set.\\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"command\":\"node /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/trace-boss.mjs\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Trace sloppy coda conductor fight\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6%2Fwork/01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710/terminal/call-553819c9-5b92-49e6-adab-1e0fcc31b7cc-77.log\",\"total_bytes\":2511}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"b4870d5f-4d35-4d9f-9594-aac2e18bbb87"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_296","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The conductor starts at site AORTA. The seat remains on the aorta from the fermata.\n\nCoda spawns on HEART. The bot site-switches to heart at t=107.5 near the tray, not on the coda. Coda HP stays full at 255 throughout the fight. The bot never damages the core. CoreOpen remains false in all samples.\n\nBaton HP drops to 2 but resets at the beat end. The 0.25s delay prevents finishing them before the downbeat. At t=119.6 the bot wanders toward IV and misses the rest.\n\nAt t=110 the bot uses tool GEL on a scratch instead of waiting on the baton. The gel spot priority is 84 versus windup 96, so after the downbeat it cleans scratches rather than finishing the kill.\n\nThe laser stops before the baton dies because the hit radius is only 0.05. If the tip lands at 0.08 distance, the shot misses entirely.\n\nThe bot switches targets between the two batons. Both get partial damage but neither dies because it keeps flipping between them. The target selector favors the closer baton, so movement and noise make it jump back and forth. The fix is to lock onto one baton and stick with it until it is dead.\n\nA `pickBaton` helper is drafted to lock the bot onto one baton. It checks the existing `mem.batonId` first and keeps that target if still alive. Otherwise it sorts the remaining batons by distance and claims the nearest one.\n\nThe `pickBaton` helper is now wired into the `decide` function. It runs at the start of each decision when a baton is alive and the bot is on the same site as the target. The bot locks onto that baton through beat 3 and 4, then clears the lock once the baton dies or the downbeat arrives.\n\nThe bot should site-switch to the coda's heart site when it locks onto a baton, since the seat starts on aorta. The core never opens because bar counting likely never hits %4===0; the single HP drop may be a missed brief window or scorch damage.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-922f94c7-b6e7-4c5f-b750-7a6860fada13-78","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"this\\.beat\\.bar|beat\\.bar|bar \\+=|beatInBar","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1012,"output_tokens":1402,"cache_read_input_tokens":140160,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"edba0a67-1245-41e4-88fd-75df6e23d03c"}
