{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_302","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Bats still have almost no health remaining at time step 116.\n\nThe baton is only one tick short of death. The laser hits at 0.28, 0.07 with 1 HP remaining, but the beat ends before the final damage point. Adding roughly 0.05 seconds of beam time should finish it off. Arming earlier is one option.\n\nStarting the delayed bot's approach on beat 2 would let it pre-arm the laser before beat 4. Currently beat 3 is used for approach while the laser stays off, so the first 0.25 seconds of beat 4 remain without damage.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-77528030-c304-4d0c-ad96-9a0101faf6c0-88","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js","old_string":"      if (state.beatInBar === 3 && !bat.windup) return approach(me, bat, tuning, opts);\n      return beamBaton(me, bat, tuning, opts);","new_string":"      // Beat 3 is early for a delayed hand: the queued beam lands as the wind-up starts.\n      return beamBaton(me, bat, tuning, opts);"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":917,"output_tokens":1387,"cache_read_input_tokens":151552,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"3874e203-9525-4af8-815e-06fb2cbaae4a"}
