h wash comp 20 beat 178 bar 2 tool laser use 0.00 pos -0.01 0.02 hp 255 open false bats 9,3 down 0 site heart\\nt 113.6 v 30.9 hush null comp 20 beat 181 bar 1 tool forceps use 0.00 pos -0.19 0.07 hp 255 open false bats 6,9 down 1 site heart\\nt 115.1 v 29.2 hush null comp 30 beat 185 bar 1 tool laser use 0.00 pos 0.14 0.08 hp 255 open false bats 9,9 down 1 site heart\\nt 116.6 v 28.6 hush null comp 30 beat 188 bar 4 tool laser use 1.00 pos 0.32 0.10 hp 255 open false bats 9,5 down 1 site heart\\nt 118.1 v 22.2 hush null comp 30 beat 192 bar 4 tool laser use 1.00 pos -0.16 0.05 hp 251 open false bats 9,7 down 2 site heart\\nt 119.6 v 16.9 hush null comp 35 beat 195 bar 3 tool forceps use 1.00 pos 0.26 0.01 hp 251 open false bats 6,9 down 3 site heart\\nt 121.2 v 13.9 hush null comp 40 beat 199 bar 3 tool laser use 0.00 pos 0.77 0.19 hp 251 open false bats 9,9 down 3 site heart\\nt 122.7 v 8.2 hush null comp 40 beat 202 bar 2 tool laser use 0.00 pos 1.01 0.22 hp 251 open false bats 9,9 down 4 site heart\\nt 124.2 v 0.8 hush null comp 40 beat 206 bar 2 tool laser use 0.00 pos 0.29 0.10 hp 251 open true bats 9,9 down 5 site heart\\nEND vitals t 124.6 v 0.0 down 5\\n(node:151530) Warning: The 'NO_COLOR' env is ignored due to the 'FORCE_COLOR' env being set.\\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"command\":\"node /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/trace-boss.mjs\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Trace conductor with early baton beam\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6%2Fwork/01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710/terminal/call-a5a040ee-d36f-4956-9587-42ca006786f8-89.log\",\"total_bytes\":2689}","i