{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_314","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Core damage fell from 255 to 240, then to 222, and finally to 209.\n\nHP per opening remains only ~15, far below the target of 70. Vitals drain at roughly 1.25 per second even without downbeats. The core damage is still too low because the system is lasering the baton at position 0.32 instead of the core. The coreNow block is not taking priority, or the position update is delayed.\n\nThe system was close enough to the core to trigger use 1, but it barely moved. Position only shifted from 0.32 to 0.34 in 1.5 seconds, so the laser never sprinted toward the core. The 15 damage came from that brief moment of proximity rather than sustained targeting.\n\nThe bot remained locked on the baton for the entire opening. The `coreOpen` export is `e.coreOpen || undefined`, so the bot reads the same flag as the entity. If the entity sees the core open, the bot should too, yet it did not. The cause of this mismatch is still unknown.\n\nThe export filter includes alive entities, so Coda should be visible. Duplicate `core:` fields in the export may be overwriting values and corrupting the state.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0ef0d91e-1051-4c1e-a680-bfaf2f9f0abf-104","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js","offset":825,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1477,"output_tokens":870,"cache_read_input_tokens":167424,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"1cecb6e6-9fe8-437a-91cb-6c742313d86e"}
