{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_315","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"coreOpen is exported and visible to the bot.\n\nThe baton tip stays on the baton despite the core block running first. The 0.25-second delay is too short to explain the 1.5-second hold. I suspect core.x in state might be set to the baton position rather than the coda.\n\nThe bot never returned beamCore. It kept returning beamBaton, so the tip stayed near 0.32. coreOpen was true but coreNow was false. The adagio clause short-circuit in the coreNow check is now suspected.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ba44f2c1-1ae4-4671-a70c-65f799ac3de5-105","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js","offset":385,"limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1591,"output_tokens":561,"cache_read_input_tokens":168832,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"f9b2ae39-f62c-41d5-a4aa-a5cb30ec7b43"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-ba44f2c1-1ae4-4671-a70c-65f799ac3de5-105","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"385→  }\\n  if (mem.altId === e.id) {\\n    mem.altId = 0;\\n    return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, alt: false };\\n  }\\n390→  mem.altId = e.id;\\n  return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, alt: true, tool: 'forceps' };\\n}\\n\\nfunction decide(state, me, mem, opts, claims) {\\n  const tuning = state.tuning;\\n  const held = state.entities.find((e) => e.holder === me.id);\\n  if (held) return carry(me, held, tuning, opts);\\n\\n  if (state.arrest) {\\n400→    const eye = state.entities.find((e) => e.kind === 'fermata' && e.hp > 0);\\n    if (eye && !state.arrest.tutorial) {\\n      if (eye.site && eye.site !== me.site) {\\n        const idx = state.sites.indexOf(eye.site);\\n        const f = steer(me, eye.x, eye.y, 0.9, tuning, opts);\\n        if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n        f.use = 0;\\n        return f;\\n      }\\n      return beam(me, eye, tuning, opts);\\n410→    }\\n    return shock(me, opts);\\n  }\\n\\n  const bleeding = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'bleeder' && !e.clamped);\\n  const coreNow = state.entities.some((e) => (e.kind === 'coda' && e.coreOpen) || (e.kind === 'adagio' && e.hp > 0 && e.core));\\n  const codaUp = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'coda' && e.hp > 0);\\n  const windup = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'baton' && e.hp > 0 && e.windup);\\n  if (codaUp && (me.composure || 0) >= 100 && state.vitals < 62 && !coreNow) {\\n    return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, special: true, tool: me.tool };\\n420→  }\\n  const swelling = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'crescendo' && !e.exposed);\\n  const slow = (opts.reactionDelay || 0) > 0;\\n  // A delayed hand that leaves the conductor for the IV misses the baton and eats the downbeat.\\n  const healAt = codaUp ? (slow ? 12 : 46) : (swelling && slow ? 8 : 40);\\n  if (!coreNow && !(codaUp && windup) && state.vitals < healAt && (me.syringeCd || 0) <= 0 && (!bleeding || state.vitals < 22)) {\\n    return syringeAt(me, IV.x, IV.y, tuning, opts);\\n  }\\n\\n  if (!codaUp && (me.composure || 0) >= 100 && state.vitals < 50) {\\n430→    return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, special: true, tool: me.tool };\\n  }\\n\\n  if (slow && coreNow) {\\n    const core = state.entities.find((e) => (e.kind === 'coda' && e.coreOpen) || (e.kind === 'adagio' && e.hp > 0 && e.core));\\n    if (core) {\\n      if (core.site && core.site !== me.site) {\\n        const idx = state.sites.indexOf(core.site);\\n        const f = steer(me, core.x || 0, core.y || 0, 1.1, tuning, opts);\\n        if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n440→        f.use = 0;\\n        return f;\\n      }\\n      return beamCore(me, core, tuning, opts);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  if (slow && codaUp && !coreNow) {\\n    const bats = state.entities.filter((e) => e.kind === 'baton' && e.hp > 0);\\n    if (bats.length) {\\n450→      let bat = bats.find((b) => b.id === mem.batonId);\\n      if (!bat) {\\n        bat = bats.slice().sort((a, b) => {\\n          const da = Math.hypot(a.x - me.x, a.y - me.y) + (a.site === me.site ? 0 : 3);\\n          const db = Math.hypot(b.x - me.x, b.y - me.y) + (b.site === me.site ? 0 : 3);\\n          return da - db;\\n        })[0];\\n        mem.batonId = bat.id;\\n      }\\n      if (bat.site && bat.site !== me.site) {\\n460→        const idx = state.sites.indexOf(bat.site);\\n        const f = steer(me, bat.x || 0, bat.y || 0, 0.9, tuning, opts);\\n        if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n        f.use = 0;\\n        return f;\",\"content_concise\":\"385→  }\\n  if (mem.altId === e.id) {\\n    mem.altId = 0;\\n    return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, alt: false };\\n  }\\n390→  mem.altId = e.id;\\n  return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, alt: true, tool: 'forceps' };\\n}\\n\\nfunction decide(state, me, mem, opts, claims) {\\n  const tuning = state.tuning;\\n  const held = state.entities.find((e) => e.holder === me.id);\\n  if (held) return carry(me, held, tuning, opts);\\n\\n  if (state.arrest) {\\n400→    const eye = state.entities.find((e) => e.kind === 'fermata' && e.hp > 0);\\n    if (eye && !state.arrest.tutorial) {\\n      if (eye.site && eye.site !== me.site) {\\n        const idx = state.sites.indexOf(eye.site);\\n        const f = steer(me, eye.x, eye.y, 0.9, tuning, opts);\\n        if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n        f.use = 0;\\n        return f;\\n      }\\n      return beam(me, eye, tuning, opts);\\n410→    }\\n    return shock(me, opts);\\n  }\\n\\n  const bleeding = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'bleeder' && !e.clamped);\\n  const coreNow = state.entities.some((e) => (e.kind === 'coda' && e.coreOpen) || (e.kind === 'adagio' && e.hp > 0 && e.core));\\n  const codaUp = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'coda' && e.hp > 0);\\n  const windup = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'baton' && e.hp > 0 && e.windup);\\n  if (codaUp && (me.composure || 0) >= 100 && state.vitals < 62 && !coreNow) {\\n    return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, special: true, tool: me.tool };\\n420→  }\\n  const swelling = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'crescendo' && !e.exposed);\\n  const slow = (opts.reactionDelay || 0) > 0;\\n  // A delayed hand that leaves the conductor for the IV misses the baton and eats the downbeat.\\n  const healAt = codaUp ? (slow ? 12 : 46) : (swelling && slow ? 8 : 40);\\n  if (!coreNow && !(codaUp && windup) && state.vitals < healAt && (me.syringeCd || 0) <= 0 && (!bleeding || state.vitals < 22)) {\\n    return syringeAt(me, IV.x, IV.y, tuning, opts);\\n  }\\n\\n  if (!codaUp && (me.composure || 0) >= 100 && state.vitals < 50) {\\n430→    return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, special: true, tool: me.tool };\\n  }\\n\\n  if (slow && coreNow) {\\n    const core = state.entities.find((e) => (e.kind === 'coda' && e.coreOpen) || (e.kind === 'adagio' && e.hp > 0 && e.core));\\n    if (core) {\\n      if (core.site && core.site !== me.site) {\\n        const idx = state.sites.indexOf(core.site);\\n        const f = steer(me, core.x || 0, core.y || 0, 1.1, tuning, opts);\\n        if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n440→        f.use = 0;\\n        return f;\\n      }\\n      return beamCore(me, core, tuning, opts);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  if (slow && codaUp && !coreNow) {\\n    const bats = state.entities.filter((e) => e.kind === 'baton' && e.hp > 0);\\n    if (bats.length) {\\n450→      let bat = bats.find((b) => b.id === mem.batonId);\\n      if (!bat) {\\n        bat = bats.slice().sort((a, b) => {\\n          const da = Math.hypot(a.x - me.x, a.y - me.y) + (a.site === me.site ? 0 : 3);\\n          const db = Math.hypot(b.x - me.x, b.y - me.y) + (b.site === me.site ? 0 : 3);\\n          return da - db;\\n        })[0];\\n        mem.batonId = bat.id;\\n      }\\n      if (bat.site && bat.site !== me.site) {\\n460→        const idx = state.sites.indexOf(bat.site);\\n        const f = steer(me, bat.x || 0, bat.y || 0, 0.9, tuning, opts);\\n        if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n        f.use = 0;\\n        return f;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js\",\"offset\":385,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"  }\\n  if (mem.altId === e.id) {\\n    mem.altId = 0;\\n    return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, alt: false };\\n  }\\n  mem.altId = e.id;\\n  return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, alt: true, tool: 'forceps' };\\n}\\n\\nfunction decide(state, me, mem, opts, claims) {\\n  const tuning = state.tuning;\\n  const held = state.entities.find((e) => e.holder === me.id);\\n  if (held) return carry(me, held, tuning, opts);\\n\\n  if (state.arrest) {\\n    const eye = state.entities.find((e) => e.kind === 'fermata' && e.hp > 0);\\n    if (eye && !state.arrest.tutorial) {\\n      if (eye.site && eye.site !== me.site) {\\n        const idx = state.sites.indexOf(eye.site);\\n        const f = steer(me, eye.x, eye.y, 0.9, tuning, opts);\\n        if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n        f.use = 0;\\n        return f;\\n      }\\n      return beam(me, eye, tuning, opts);\\n    }\\n    return shock(me, opts);\\n  }\\n\\n  const bleeding = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'bleeder' && !e.clamped);\\n  const coreNow = state.entities.some((e) => (e.kind === 'coda' && e.coreOpen) || (e.kind === 'adagio' && e.hp > 0 && e.core));\\n  const codaUp = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'coda' && e.hp > 0);\\n  const windup = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'baton' && e.hp > 0 && e.windup);\\n  if (codaUp && (me.composure || 0) >= 100 && state.vitals < 62 && !coreNow) {\\n    return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, special: true, tool: me.tool };\\n  }\\n  const swelling = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'crescendo' && !e.exposed);\\n  const slow = (opts.reactionDelay || 0) > 0;\\n  // A delayed hand that leaves the conductor for the IV misses the baton and eats the downbeat.\\n  const healAt = codaUp ? (slow ? 12 : 46) : (swelling && slow ? 8 : 40);\\n  if (!coreNow && !(codaUp && windup) && state.vitals < healAt && (me.syringeCd || 0) <= 0 && (!bleeding || state.vitals < 22)) {\\n    return syringeAt(me, IV.x, IV.y, tuning, opts);\\n  }\\n\\n  if (!codaUp && (me.composure || 0) >= 100 && state.vitals < 50) {\\n    return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, special: true, tool: me.tool };\\n  }\\n\\n  if (slow && coreNow) {\\n    const core = state.entities.find((e) => (e.kind === 'coda' && e.coreOpen) || (e.kind === 'adagio' && e.hp > 0 && e.core));\\n    if (core) {\\n      if (core.site && core.site !== me.site) {\\n        const idx = state.sites.indexOf(core.site);\\n        const f = steer(me, core.x || 0, core.y || 0, 1.1, tuning, opts);\\n        if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n        f.use = 0;\\n        return f;\\n      }\\n      return beamCore(me, core, tuning, opts);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  if (slow && codaUp && !coreNow) {\\n    const bats = state.entities.filter((e) => e.kind === 'baton' && e.hp > 0);\\n    if (bats.length) {\\n      let bat = bats.find((b) => b.id === mem.batonId);\\n      if (!bat) {\\n        bat = bats.slice().sort((a, b) => {\\n          const da = Math.hypot(a.x - me.x, a.y - me.y) + (a.site === me.site ? 0 : 3);\\n          const db = Math.hypot(b.x - me.x, b.y - me.y) + (b.site === me.site ? 0 : 3);\\n          return da - db;\\n        })[0];\\n        mem.batonId = bat.id;\\n      }\\n      if (bat.site && bat.site !== me.site) {\\n        const idx = state.sites.indexOf(bat.site);\\n        const f = steer(me, bat.x || 0, bat.y || 0, 0.9, tuning, opts);\\n        if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n        f.use = 0;\\n        return f;\\n\",\"total_lines\":531}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"1e6f8412-d451-41ee-a17a-14cf841415d5"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_316","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The code looks correct. The reaction delay is 15 frames.\n\nThe core is only open for about 78 frames. The trace samples are too sparse to capture the opening movement. The CORE frame dump was from a previous run.\n\nThe 15 HP damage is far below the expected 45. The laser likely hits the baton instead of the coda because stepLaser targets the nearest entity within 0.05. The arrival may also be too late to catch the full opening window.\n\nThe path from the starting baton to the coda passes clear of the other baton, so the laser should not hit it. The total travel time is roughly 0.5 seconds, which fits comfortably inside the 1.3-second opening window. The low damage suggests the actual window may be shorter than expected. I am now checking the log timestamps to count beats more precisely.\n\nThe core is only open for about one beat. The delay plus travel time consumes the entire window, leaving just 0.17 seconds of damage. That matches the observed 15 HP loss exactly. I am now re-examining the timer logic to confirm this.\n\nThe timer logic shows the core stays open for two full beat intervals. It opens on beat 173, remains open through beat 174, and closes at the start of beat 175. That is about 1.3 seconds at 92 BPM. The earlier assumption that it lasted only one beat was wrong.\n\nThe 1.5-second gap between samples covers three beats, giving a beat period of roughly 0.5 seconds. That is close enough to the expected 0.65 seconds. I will re-run the fight and filter for CORE lines to verify the exact opening and closing timestamps.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5bcb5515-da47-4787-80a3-cae94681de1c-106","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/trace-boss.mjs","old_string":"  if (phase === 'conductor' && codaNow?.coreOpen && dumped < 30) {","new_string":"  if (phase === 'conductor' && (codaNow?.coreOpen || dumped > 0) && dumped < 80) {"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1836,"output_tokens":1286,"cache_read_input_tokens":170368,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"c12c161e-cdcc-4a69-b7b7-cdff448683e6"}
