{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_344","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Normal mode remains unchanged. Sloppy mode shows burst 8 and popped 9.\n\nPops improved slightly but still die at 131.5 with 3 downbeats. The singe helps but is not enough. Eight bursts still spawn eight spores. The bot may miss notes because it leaves the core prelude and the note bursts while it is away. The note sits at +0.2 and the core at 0, so the distance is 0.2 which exceeds the 0.14 threshold.\n\nThe note spawns on beat 3. The bot has roughly 0.65 seconds to singe it before the beat 4 prelude pulls it away. That is more than enough time. The note should pop during beat 3 if the bot is already on the baton. It likely does not because the bot is not yet on the baton at that moment.\n\nThe logs show the bot camps the baton and kills notes. Eight bursts still occur, so the bot is likely often outside the 0.14 radius. Notes stack at the same position but should pop together if the bot is present.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1e85a9d7-41a9-4333-940a-970c5749179d-138","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js","offset":466,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":514,"output_tokens":1158,"cache_read_input_tokens":203264,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"9167ee5c-2d45-443e-82cf-09d0f9686dd2"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-1e85a9d7-41a9-4333-940a-970c5749179d-138","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"466→  if (slow && codaUp && !coreNow) {\\n    const bats = state.entities.filter((e) => e.kind === 'baton' && e.hp > 0);\\n    if (bats.length) {\\n      let bat = bats.find((b) => b.id === mem.batonId);\\n470→      if (!bat) {\\n        bat = bats.slice().sort((a, b) => {\\n          const da = Math.hypot(a.x - me.x, a.y - me.y) + (a.site === me.site ? 0 : 3) + (a.x < 0 ? 0.35 : 0);\\n          const db = Math.hypot(b.x - me.x, b.y - me.y) + (b.site === me.site ? 0 : 3) + (b.x < 0 ? 0.35 : 0);\\n          return da - db;\\n        })[0];\\n        mem.batonId = bat.id;\\n      }\\n      if (bat.site && bat.site !== me.site) {\\n        const idx = state.sites.indexOf(bat.site);\\n480→        const f = steer(me, bat.x || 0, bat.y || 0, 0.9, tuning, opts);\\n        if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n        f.use = 0;\\n        return f;\\n      }\\n      // Beat 3 is early for a delayed hand: the queued beam lands as the wind-up starts.\\n      return beamBaton(me, bat, tuning, opts);\\n    }\\n  }\\n  if (!codaUp) mem.batonId = 0;\\n490→\\n  const list = candidates(state, me, opts).filter((c) => !claims.has(c.e.id));\\n  if (list.length) {\\n    const pick = list[0];\\n    claims.add(pick.e.id);\\n    return actOn(state, me, pick.job, pick.e, mem, tuning, opts);\\n  }\\n\\n  const closing = /^close\\\\b/i.test(state.objective || '') || !!state.flags?.closing || !!state.flags?.needUnclamp;\\n  if (closing) {\\n500→    const clamped = state.entities.find((e) => e.kind === 'bleeder' && e.clamped && !claims.has(e.id));\\n    if (clamped) {\\n      claims.add(clamped.id);\\n      return unclamp(me, clamped, mem, tuning, opts, state);\\n    }\\n  }\",\"content_concise\":\"466→  if (slow && codaUp && !coreNow) {\\n    const bats = state.entities.filter((e) => e.kind === 'baton' && e.hp > 0);\\n    if (bats.length) {\\n      let bat = bats.find((b) => b.id === mem.batonId);\\n470→      if (!bat) {\\n        bat = bats.slice().sort((a, b) => {\\n          const da = Math.hypot(a.x - me.x, a.y - me.y) + (a.site === me.site ? 0 : 3) + (a.x < 0 ? 0.35 : 0);\\n          const db = Math.hypot(b.x - me.x, b.y - me.y) + (b.site === me.site ? 0 : 3) + (b.x < 0 ? 0.35 : 0);\\n          return da - db;\\n        })[0];\\n        mem.batonId = bat.id;\\n      }\\n      if (bat.site && bat.site !== me.site) {\\n        const idx = state.sites.indexOf(bat.site);\\n480→        const f = steer(me, bat.x || 0, bat.y || 0, 0.9, tuning, opts);\\n        if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n        f.use = 0;\\n        return f;\\n      }\\n      // Beat 3 is early for a delayed hand: the queued beam lands as the wind-up starts.\\n      return beamBaton(me, bat, tuning, opts);\\n    }\\n  }\\n  if (!codaUp) mem.batonId = 0;\\n490→\\n  const list = candidates(state, me, opts).filter((c) => !claims.has(c.e.id));\\n  if (list.length) {\\n    const pick = list[0];\\n    claims.add(pick.e.id);\\n    return actOn(state, me, pick.job, pick.e, mem, tuning, opts);\\n  }\\n\\n  const closing = /^close\\\\b/i.test(state.objective || '') || !!state.flags?.closing || !!state.flags?.needUnclamp;\\n  if (closing) {\\n500→    const clamped = state.entities.find((e) => e.kind === 'bleeder' && e.clamped && !claims.has(e.id));\\n    if (clamped) {\\n      claims.add(clamped.id);\\n      return unclamp(me, clamped, mem, tuning, opts, state);\\n    }\\n  }\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js\",\"offset\":466,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"  if (slow && codaUp && !coreNow) {\\n    const bats = state.entities.filter((e) => e.kind === 'baton' && e.hp > 0);\\n    if (bats.length) {\\n      let bat = bats.find((b) => b.id === mem.batonId);\\n      if (!bat) {\\n        bat = bats.slice().sort((a, b) => {\\n          const da = Math.hypot(a.x - me.x, a.y - me.y) + (a.site === me.site ? 0 : 3) + (a.x < 0 ? 0.35 : 0);\\n          const db = Math.hypot(b.x - me.x, b.y - me.y) + (b.site === me.site ? 0 : 3) + (b.x < 0 ? 0.35 : 0);\\n          return da - db;\\n        })[0];\\n        mem.batonId = bat.id;\\n      }\\n      if (bat.site && bat.site !== me.site) {\\n        const idx = state.sites.indexOf(bat.site);\\n        const f = steer(me, bat.x || 0, bat.y || 0, 0.9, tuning, opts);\\n        if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n        f.use = 0;\\n        return f;\\n      }\\n      // Beat 3 is early for a delayed hand: the queued beam lands as the wind-up starts.\\n      return beamBaton(me, bat, tuning, opts);\\n    }\\n  }\\n  if (!codaUp) mem.batonId = 0;\\n\\n  const list = candidates(state, me, opts).filter((c) => !claims.has(c.e.id));\\n  if (list.length) {\\n    const pick = list[0];\\n    claims.add(pick.e.id);\\n    return actOn(state, me, pick.job, pick.e, mem, tuning, opts);\\n  }\\n\\n  const closing = /^close\\\\b/i.test(state.objective || '') || !!state.flags?.closing || !!state.flags?.needUnclamp;\\n  if (closing) {\\n    const clamped = state.entities.find((e) => e.kind === 'bleeder' && e.clamped && !claims.has(e.id));\\n    if (clamped) {\\n      claims.add(clamped.id);\\n      return unclamp(me, clamped, mem, tuning, opts, state);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\",\"total_lines\":550}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"35723edf-f050-408a-bd9d-7270af21a665"}
