{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_349","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Dead batons remain exported with zero health.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-63f4e8f9-bc5d-4d3d-8fa5-43b9450e63ff-6","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/tools.js","offset":640,"limit":90}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":888,"output_tokens":299,"cache_read_input_tokens":38912,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"a9110ca2-cf36-4a92-ab57-344d94725e6c"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-63f4e8f9-bc5d-4d3d-8fa5-43b9450e63ff-6","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"640→    const g = e.gates[e.gate];\\n    if (!g) continue;\\n    const gateR = sim.stitchGateR;\\n    const d = dist(seat.x, seat.y, g.x, g.y);\\n    if (use > 0.5 && d > 0.3 && e.gate > 0) {\\n      if (!e.torn) {\\n        e.torn = true;\\n        award(sim, seat, 'MISS', seat.x, seat.y, 'stitch');\\n      }\\n    } else e.torn = false;\\n650→    if (use > 0.5 && d <= gateR && !g.hit) {\\n      g.hit = true;\\n      e.devSum = (e.devSum || 0) + d;\\n      e.devN = (e.devN || 0) + 1;\\n      e.gate += 1;\\n      sim.events.push({ type: 'gate', id: e.id, gate: e.gate });\\n      if (e.gate >= e.gates.length) {\\n        e.readyTie = true;\\n        e.tieT = 0;\\n      }\\n660→    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction tieWound(sim, seat, e, fromAlt, auto) {\\n  if (e.done) return;\\n  e.done = true;\\n  e.alive = false;\\n  const mean = e.devN ? e.devSum / e.devN : 0;\\n  let grade = gradeBand(mean, sim.stitchGateR);\\n670→  if (auto) grade = grade === 'FLAWLESS' ? 'CLEAN' : grade;\\n  if (!fromAlt && !auto && seat.speed < 1.5) grade = grade === 'FLAWLESS' ? 'CLEAN' : grade;\\n  award(sim, seat, grade, seat.x, seat.y, 'tie');\\n  sim.events.push({ type: 'tied', id: e.id });\\n}\\n\\nfunction stepLaser(sim, seat, dt, use, power) {\\n  if (seat.laserVent > 0) {\\n    seat.laserVent -= dt;\\n    return;\\n680→  }\\n  if (use <= 0.05) {\\n    seat.laserTime = 0;\\n    seat.laserOn = null;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  seat.laserTime = (seat.laserTime || 0) + dt;\\n  if (seat.laserTime >= 6) {\\n    seat.laserVent = 1.5;\\n    seat.laserTime = 0;\\n690→    sim.events.push({ type: 'vent', seat: seat.id });\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  const clamped = Math.max(0.3, Math.min(1, use));\\n  let hit = null;\\n  let hitD = 0.05;\\n  for (const e of sim.entities) {\\n    if (!e.alive || e.site !== seat.site || blocked(e) || !(e.hp > 0)) continue;\\n    if (e.kind === 'tremolo' && !(e.pinned > 0)) continue;\\n    if (e.kind === 'adagio' && !e.core) continue;\\n700→    if (e.kind === 'coda' && !e.coreOpen) continue;\\n    const d = dist(seat.x, seat.y, e.x, e.y);\\n    if (d <= hitD) {\\n      hitD = d;\\n      hit = e;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  if (!hit) {\\n    seat.offT = (seat.offT || 0) + dt;\\n    if (seat.offT > 0.25) {\\n710→      sim.hurt(sim.tuning.laserBurn * clamped * dt, 'burn');\\n      seat.burned = true;\\n      sim.events.push({ type: 'scorch', x: seat.x, y: seat.y });\\n    }\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  seat.offT = 0;\\n  // A beam on a baton also singes a cue sitting just beside it.\\n  for (const note of sim.entities) {\\n    if (!note.alive || note.kind !== 'note' || note.site !== seat.site || note === hit) continue;\\n720→    if (dist(seat.x, seat.y, note.x, note.y) > 0.14) continue;\\n    note.burnT = (note.burnT || 0) + dt;\\n    if (note.burnT >= 0.25) popNote(sim, seat, note);\\n  }\\n  if (hit.kind === 'note') {\\n    hit.burnT = (hit.burnT || 0) + dt;\\n    if (hit.burnT >= 0.25) popNote(sim, seat, hit);\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  let dps = sim.tuning.laserDps * clamped * power;\",\"content_concise\":\"640→    const g = e.gates[e.gate];\\n    if (!g) continue;\\n    const gateR = sim.stitchGateR;\\n    const d = dist(seat.x, seat.y, g.x, g.y);\\n    if (use > 0.5 && d > 0.3 && e.gate > 0) {\\n      if (!e.torn) {\\n        e.torn = true;\\n        award(sim, seat, 'MISS', seat.x, seat.y, 'stitch');\\n      }\\n    } else e.torn = false;\\n650→    if (use > 0.5 && d <= gateR && !g.hit) {\\n      g.hit = true;\\n      e.devSum = (e.devSum || 0) + d;\\n      e.devN = (e.devN || 0) + 1;\\n      e.gate += 1;\\n      sim.events.push({ type: 'gate', id: e.id, gate: e.gate });\\n      if (e.gate >= e.gates.length) {\\n        e.readyTie = true;\\n        e.tieT = 0;\\n      }\\n660→    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction tieWound(sim, seat, e, fromAlt, auto) {\\n  if (e.done) return;\\n  e.done = true;\\n  e.alive = false;\\n  const mean = e.devN ? e.devSum / e.devN : 0;\\n  let grade = gradeBand(mean, sim.stitchGateR);\\n670→  if (auto) grade = grade === 'FLAWLESS' ? 'CLEAN' : grade;\\n  if (!fromAlt && !auto && seat.speed < 1.5) grade = grade === 'FLAWLESS' ? 'CLEAN' : grade;\\n  award(sim, seat, grade, seat.x, seat.y, 'tie');\\n  sim.events.push({ type: 'tied', id: e.id });\\n}\\n\\nfunction stepLaser(sim, seat, dt, use, power) {\\n  if (seat.laserVent > 0) {\\n    seat.laserVent -= dt;\\n    return;\\n680→  }\\n  if (use <= 0.05) {\\n    seat.laserTime = 0;\\n    seat.laserOn = null;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  seat.laserTime = (seat.laserTime || 0) + dt;\\n  if (seat.laserTime >= 6) {\\n    seat.laserVent = 1.5;\\n    seat.laserTime = 0;\\n690→    sim.events.push({ type: 'vent', seat: seat.id });\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  const clamped = Math.max(0.3, Math.min(1, use));\\n  let hit = null;\\n  let hitD = 0.05;\\n  for (const e of sim.entities) {\\n    if (!e.alive || e.site !== seat.site || blocked(e) || !(e.hp > 0)) continue;\\n    if (e.kind === 'tremolo' && !(e.pinned > 0)) continue;\\n    if (e.kind === 'adagio' && !e.core) continue;\\n700→    if (e.kind === 'coda' && !e.coreOpen) continue;\\n    const d = dist(seat.x, seat.y, e.x, e.y);\\n    if (d <= hitD) {\\n      hitD = d;\\n      hit = e;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  if (!hit) {\\n    seat.offT = (seat.offT || 0) + dt;\\n    if (seat.offT > 0.25) {\\n710→      sim.hurt(sim.tuning.laserBurn * clamped * dt, 'burn');\\n      seat.burned = true;\\n      sim.events.push({ type: 'scorch', x: seat.x, y: seat.y });\\n    }\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  seat.offT = 0;\\n  // A beam on a baton also singes a cue sitting just beside it.\\n  for (const note of sim.entities) {\\n    if (!note.alive || note.kind !== 'note' || note.site !== seat.site || note === hit) continue;\\n720→    if (dist(seat.x, seat.y, note.x, note.y) > 0.14) continue;\\n    note.burnT = (note.burnT || 0) + dt;\\n    if (note.burnT >= 0.25) popNote(sim, seat, note);\\n  }\\n  if (hit.kind === 'note') {\\n    hit.burnT = (hit.burnT || 0) + dt;\\n    if (hit.burnT >= 0.25) popNote(sim, seat, hit);\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  let dps = sim.tuning.laserDps * clamped * power;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/tools.js\",\"offset\":640,\"limit\":90,\"raw_output\":\"    const g = e.gates[e.gate];\\n    if (!g) continue;\\n    const gateR = sim.stitchGateR;\\n    const d = dist(seat.x, seat.y, g.x, g.y);\\n    if (use > 0.5 && d > 0.3 && e.gate > 0) {\\n      if (!e.torn) {\\n        e.torn = true;\\n        award(sim, seat, 'MISS', seat.x, seat.y, 'stitch');\\n      }\\n    } else e.torn = false;\\n    if (use > 0.5 && d <= gateR && !g.hit) {\\n      g.hit = true;\\n      e.devSum = (e.devSum || 0) + d;\\n      e.devN = (e.devN || 0) + 1;\\n      e.gate += 1;\\n      sim.events.push({ type: 'gate', id: e.id, gate: e.gate });\\n      if (e.gate >= e.gates.length) {\\n        e.readyTie = true;\\n        e.tieT = 0;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction tieWound(sim, seat, e, fromAlt, auto) {\\n  if (e.done) return;\\n  e.done = true;\\n  e.alive = false;\\n  const mean = e.devN ? e.devSum / e.devN : 0;\\n  let grade = gradeBand(mean, sim.stitchGateR);\\n  if (auto) grade = grade === 'FLAWLESS' ? 'CLEAN' : grade;\\n  if (!fromAlt && !auto && seat.speed < 1.5) grade = grade === 'FLAWLESS' ? 'CLEAN' : grade;\\n  award(sim, seat, grade, seat.x, seat.y, 'tie');\\n  sim.events.push({ type: 'tied', id: e.id });\\n}\\n\\nfunction stepLaser(sim, seat, dt, use, power) {\\n  if (seat.laserVent > 0) {\\n    seat.laserVent -= dt;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (use <= 0.05) {\\n    seat.laserTime = 0;\\n    seat.laserOn = null;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  seat.laserTime = (seat.laserTime || 0) + dt;\\n  if (seat.laserTime >= 6) {\\n    seat.laserVent = 1.5;\\n    seat.laserTime = 0;\\n    sim.events.push({ type: 'vent', seat: seat.id });\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  const clamped = Math.max(0.3, Math.min(1, use));\\n  let hit = null;\\n  let hitD = 0.05;\\n  for (const e of sim.entities) {\\n    if (!e.alive || e.site !== seat.site || blocked(e) || !(e.hp > 0)) continue;\\n    if (e.kind === 'tremolo' && !(e.pinned > 0)) continue;\\n    if (e.kind === 'adagio' && !e.core) continue;\\n    if (e.kind === 'coda' && !e.coreOpen) continue;\\n    const d = dist(seat.x, seat.y, e.x, e.y);\\n    if (d <= hitD) {\\n      hitD = d;\\n      hit = e;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  if (!hit) {\\n    seat.offT = (seat.offT || 0) + dt;\\n    if (seat.offT > 0.25) {\\n      sim.hurt(sim.tuning.laserBurn * clamped * dt, 'burn');\\n      seat.burned = true;\\n      sim.events.push({ type: 'scorch', x: seat.x, y: seat.y });\\n    }\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  seat.offT = 0;\\n  // A beam on a baton also singes a cue sitting just beside it.\\n  for (const note of sim.entities) {\\n    if (!note.alive || note.kind !== 'note' || note.site !== seat.site || note === hit) continue;\\n    if (dist(seat.x, seat.y, note.x, note.y) > 0.14) continue;\\n    note.burnT = (note.burnT || 0) + dt;\\n    if (note.burnT >= 0.25) popNote(sim, seat, note);\\n  }\\n  if (hit.kind === 'note') {\\n    hit.burnT = (hit.burnT || 0) + dt;\\n    if (hit.burnT >= 0.25) popNote(sim, seat, hit);\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  let dps = sim.tuning.laserDps * clamped * power;\\n\",\"total_lines\":813}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"a68ca3e1-c1b4-4741-8e46-59981459d542"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_350","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"stepLaser skips entities based on a condition.\n\nDead batons cannot be primary hit targets while the laser is on. The patient scorchs after 0.25 seconds if the tip lingers. Side-burn only fires on a primary hit, so it stays off while the baton is dead. Notes spawn at [coda.x+0.2, coda.y]. The right baton starts at [coda.x+0.28, coda.y+0.05], 0.094 units away. After moving, the batons sit at [e.x±0.28, e.y], making the note distance 0.08.\n\nA note lasts five beats, or roughly 3.26 seconds at 92 BPM. The bar cycle runs four beats: downbeat resets dead baton HP to nine, beat two revives the arm, beat three spawns the note and triggers side-burn if beaming the right baton, and beat four is windup while the note burns. Killing a baton in about 0.3 seconds—nine HP at thirty damage per second—leaves only enough time to beam before the downbeat.\n\nThe arm stays dead through beats two, three, and four. It only revives on the next beat one. Because the arm is dead during beats three and four, the laser must remain off to avoid scorching the patient. Side-burn therefore cannot trigger while the note is alive.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e7d29c72-1140-4b4d-98df-05c57c6d878f-7","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function stepCoda|life|note|beatInBar|coreOpen|moveCoda","glob":"**/strains.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1500,"output_tokens":682,"cache_read_input_tokens":39680,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"e5ec0434-268b-4039-9478-b087d4bd224b"}
