{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_367","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Conductor must clear notes, spores, scratches, and batons before the phase ends.\n\nSpores and scratches drain health during the fight. The coda must die before that drain kills the bot. After the coda dies, the camp block ends and leftover spores and scratches gel automatically.\n\nEntry vitals of 34.7 fall below the 35 minimum required for the Normal bot. The Sloppy bot only needs rank ≥C, so it may not need that minimum. I am checking the summary to confirm.\n\nThe summary confirms the Sloppy bot only needs rank ≥C. It probably must still complete the phase rather than fail. A score ratio of at least 0.35 yields rank C on Easy. The normal bot had a 47.3 minimum vitals, but this bot enters at 34.7. vitalsMin tracks the lowest value ever reached.\n\nThe par score is 34249. A rank C requires a score of at least 11987. The current death score of 23794 would have earned an A if the phase had been completed. The priority is surviving and finishing the fight.\n\nThe bot will camp a dead baton with laser off to avoid spores. It will only fire at nearby notes and park otherwise. Every downbeat must be blocked to prevent scratches. Core damage is still required.\n\nThe downbeat after core is the leak. The plan is a two-phase opening without prelude. The bot stays on the baton when core opens. The arm resets to 9 health. Laser can then kill it in 0.3 seconds. The reaction delay of 0.25 seconds means the arm dies at t=0.55.\n\nThe two-phase opening leaves only a narrow window for core damage. Arriving at core takes roughly 0.95 seconds, so the bot can deal about 10 to 18 points of damage. The total phase time would be around 274 seconds, which is well below the 427-second 75% threshold and easily satisfies the sloppy bot's faster completion requirement.\n\nThe core opening lasts two beats at 92 BPM, or about 1.30 seconds. That is longer than the one-second estimate used earlier. The bot still needs to survive 17 openings and site moves without any drain.\n\nThe bot can kill the arm in 0.3 seconds, dealing about 31 HP per opening. Eight openings would take roughly 83 seconds, plus the conductor phase brings total time to about 204 seconds. That is 0.36 of the timer, which is acceptable for a sloppy bot. The bot will leave the dead baton the instant the arm reaches zero health.\n\nPre-arming the laser during beat 4 while sitting on the dead baton removes the reaction delay. The arm resets to 9 health at beat 1 with the laser already on, so it dies in 0.3 seconds. The sprint then arrives at roughly 0.7 seconds, leaving about 0.6 seconds of damage window. That yields approximately 54 HP per opening, matching the measured -58 damage.\n\nThe arm stays dead until the next beat 1. The bot must keep the laser on while camping that dead arm. A reaction delay would otherwise return when it re-arms the weapon.\n\nContinuous laser use would trigger the 6-second vent every 2.6-second bar, which would prevent killing the arm during its beat-1 reset. The bot must instead fire only at the exact moment of reset and when notes are present, then turn off to bank vent time. It can predict the next beat-1 reset using beatInBar.\n\nThe bot will fire the laser during beat 4 to pre-arm it for the next beat-1 reset. Laser use only accumulates while the weapon is active, and it resets to zero when the weapon is off. This means the bot can safely bank vent time between firing cycles without accumulating heat.\n\nThe bot will use a heat sink to avoid scorching while sitting on dead batons. It will singe any note within 0.2 of the baton even when the arm is dead. The laser will be fired during beat 4 to pre-heat for the next reset, and it will stay off otherwise to bank vent time.\n\nCore priority is now a two-step rule. If the remembered baton still has health, the bot kills it first. If the baton is dead, it beams the core. During beat 1 the arm resets to 9 health while the laser is already on, so the bot stays to kill it in 0.3 seconds before switching to core.\n\nThe prelude should be removed entirely. Parking on the core during beat 4 of a pre-opening bar would pull the bot away from the arm, preventing the laser from pre-heating for the next reset. The bot will instead stay on the arm, keep the laser on during beat 4 to pre-heat it, kill the arm at beat 1 in 0.3 seconds, then proceed to core.\n\nThe first opening may occur before the bot finishes traveling to the +x baton. That is acceptable; the bot will camp and catch the remaining openings.\n\nWith no spores or scratches present, health stays near 35 and the syringe threshold remains at 12. The bot will not use the syringe.\n\nThe syringe gate will be tightened. It will only trigger if the remembered baton is dead and the beat is not 4 or 1, or if vitals fall below 8. This prevents pulling off during a reset and wasting a downbeat.\n\nWhen the coda moves, old batons die and new ones spawn at full health. The bot must kill the new +x baton before the next downbeat lands. The move happens mid-opening, so the next beat 1 is roughly four beats later. The bot will site-switch to the new baton and kill it immediately.\n\nSite switching preserves the bot's local coordinates, so it lands near the new baton immediately. The trace confirms the bot can reach the new +x baton in time to kill it before the next downbeat.\n\nThe normal bot will not use the heat sink because it never fires on a dead baton while the laser is on. The score should remain 37227. Side-burn notes will be added to the heat sink loop. The prelude block will be removed entirely.\n\nA note that spawns at the start of beat 3 will pop reliably. The laser is off at that moment, so the bot waits for the 0.25-second reaction delay and then singes it. Beat 4 preheat catches any remaining notes.\n\nBecause the bot stays on the arm and singes every note, no spores are produced. Every downbeat finds the arm dead, so there are zero scratches.\n\nCore damage will average about 50 points per opening. Eight openings should kill the core in roughly 52 seconds. The bot may cross the 66% health threshold during the third or fourth opening, trigger a site move, re-camp, and continue.\n\nThe heat sink path is safe because the other baton is 0.56 units away and notes are 0.09 units away, so no other target within 0.05 blocks it. The camp block will preheat the laser on beats 1 and 4, or when health is above zero or a note is nearby, and otherwise park on the dead baton. The core block must come first but defer to the baton if it is still alive.\n\nThe syringe gate is being tightened further. It will now only allow syringing when the remembered baton is dead and the beat is not 4 or 1, unless vitals have dropped below 6. The old preemptive syringe caused fortissimo during recap, but in the conductor phase the real danger is leaving during beat 1. I also need to verify that the heat sink code does not accidentally prevent scorching while firing empty tissue near a dead baton.\n\nThe normal bot will not camp dead batons, so the heat sink should not trigger extra note pops or alter its score. I will check whether `blocked()` matters and confirm that exported baton health is zero. Side-burn notes will be added inline to match the file style.\n\nThe heat sink will return early when the baton is dead, so no damage or score is awarded. Laser time still accumulates before the hit search, but holding the weapon on a dead baton for beat 4 plus the kill and any note singe stays safely under the six-second vent limit.\n\nThe worst-case continuous laser duration is about 2.4 seconds, which stays safely under the six-second vent limit. Laser time resets when the bot parks between camp and core, so chaining multiple shots in one opening remains safe.\n\nDead batons remain alive with zero health, so the phase cannot end until they are cleared. The normal bot must clear them too, or the sloppy bot will never finish after the coda dies.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f22a39d9-a5fd-4ac3-88d3-44331ad98428-28","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js","offset":700,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f22a39d9-a5fd-4ac3-88d3-44331ad98428-29","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js","offset":400,"limit":100}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1897,"output_tokens":5490,"cache_read_input_tokens":70144,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"d66c37ba-444d-49c9-aba2-62c868076ce9"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-f22a39d9-a5fd-4ac3-88d3-44331ad98428-28","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"700→\\n  nudgeSite(seat, delta) {\\n    const sites = this.op.sites;\\n    const cur = sites.findIndex((s) => s.id === (this.couch ? this.activeSite : seat.site));\\n    const next = (cur + delta + sites.length) % sites.length;\\n    this.assignSite(seat, sites[next].id);\\n  }\\n\\n  assignSite(seat, id) {\\n    if (this.couch) {\\n710→      if (this.sharedSiteCd > 0 || id === this.activeSite) return;\\n      this.sharedSiteCd = 0.8;\\n      this.activeSite = id;\\n      for (const s of this.seats) s.site = id;\\n    } else {\\n      seat.site = id;\\n      this.activeSite = id;\\n    }\\n    this.events.push({ type: 'site', id, seat: seat.id });\\n  }\\n720→\\n  bark(key) {\\n    if (this.barkCd > 0 && this.lastBark === key) return;\\n    this.lastBark = key;\\n    this.barkCd = 1.5;\\n    this.events.push({ type: 'bark', key, who: this.voice() });\\n  }\\n\\n  voice() {\\n    if (this.op.voice === 'pip') return 'pip';\\n730→    if (this.op.doctor === 'ines' && this.op.id === 'legato') return 'bea';\\n    return 'bea';\\n  }\\n\\n  onRemoved(e) {\\n    if (e.kind === 'coda') {\\n      for (const a of this.entities) if (a.alive && a.kind === 'baton' && a.parent === e.id) a.alive = false;\\n    }\\n    if (e.kind === 'link') {\\n      const chain = this.entities.find((c) => c.id === e.chain);\\n740→      const link = chain?.links?.[e.index];\\n      if (link) link.tray = true;\\n    }\\n    if ((e.kind === 'shard' || e.kind === 'tumor') && !e.pooled) {\\n      e.pooled = true;\\n      this.spawn({ kind: 'pool', site: e.homeSite || e.site, at: [e.homeX ?? e.x, e.homeY ?? e.y], vol: e.kind === 'tumor' ? 0.3 : 0.4, cap: 0.5 });\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  onFeederDead() {}\",\"content_concise\":\"700→\\n  nudgeSite(seat, delta) {\\n    const sites = this.op.sites;\\n    const cur = sites.findIndex((s) => s.id === (this.couch ? this.activeSite : seat.site));\\n    const next = (cur + delta + sites.length) % sites.length;\\n    this.assignSite(seat, sites[next].id);\\n  }\\n\\n  assignSite(seat, id) {\\n    if (this.couch) {\\n710→      if (this.sharedSiteCd > 0 || id === this.activeSite) return;\\n      this.sharedSiteCd = 0.8;\\n      this.activeSite = id;\\n      for (const s of this.seats) s.site = id;\\n    } else {\\n      seat.site = id;\\n      this.activeSite = id;\\n    }\\n    this.events.push({ type: 'site', id, seat: seat.id });\\n  }\\n720→\\n  bark(key) {\\n    if (this.barkCd > 0 && this.lastBark === key) return;\\n    this.lastBark = key;\\n    this.barkCd = 1.5;\\n    this.events.push({ type: 'bark', key, who: this.voice() });\\n  }\\n\\n  voice() {\\n    if (this.op.voice === 'pip') return 'pip';\\n730→    if (this.op.doctor === 'ines' && this.op.id === 'legato') return 'bea';\\n    return 'bea';\\n  }\\n\\n  onRemoved(e) {\\n    if (e.kind === 'coda') {\\n      for (const a of this.entities) if (a.alive && a.kind === 'baton' && a.parent === e.id) a.alive = false;\\n    }\\n    if (e.kind === 'link') {\\n      const chain = this.entities.find((c) => c.id === e.chain);\\n740→      const link = chain?.links?.[e.index];\\n      if (link) link.tray = true;\\n    }\\n    if ((e.kind === 'shard' || e.kind === 'tumor') && !e.pooled) {\\n      e.pooled = true;\\n      this.spawn({ kind: 'pool', site: e.homeSite || e.site, at: [e.homeX ?? e.x, e.homeY ?? e.y], vol: e.kind === 'tumor' ? 0.3 : 0.4, cap: 0.5 });\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  onFeederDead() {}\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js\",\"offset\":700,\"limit\":50,\"raw_output\":\"\\n  nudgeSite(seat, delta) {\\n    const sites = this.op.sites;\\n    const cur = sites.findIndex((s) => s.id === (this.couch ? this.activeSite : seat.site));\\n    const next = (cur + delta + sites.length) % sites.length;\\n    this.assignSite(seat, sites[next].id);\\n  }\\n\\n  assignSite(seat, id) {\\n    if (this.couch) {\\n      if (this.sharedSiteCd > 0 || id === this.activeSite) return;\\n      this.sharedSiteCd = 0.8;\\n      this.activeSite = id;\\n      for (const s of this.seats) s.site = id;\\n    } else {\\n      seat.site = id;\\n      this.activeSite = id;\\n    }\\n    this.events.push({ type: 'site', id, seat: seat.id });\\n  }\\n\\n  bark(key) {\\n    if (this.barkCd > 0 && this.lastBark === key) return;\\n    this.lastBark = key;\\n    this.barkCd = 1.5;\\n    this.events.push({ type: 'bark', key, who: this.voice() });\\n  }\\n\\n  voice() {\\n    if (this.op.voice === 'pip') return 'pip';\\n    if (this.op.doctor === 'ines' && this.op.id === 'legato') return 'bea';\\n    return 'bea';\\n  }\\n\\n  onRemoved(e) {\\n    if (e.kind === 'coda') {\\n      for (const a of this.entities) if (a.alive && a.kind === 'baton' && a.parent === e.id) a.alive = false;\\n    }\\n    if (e.kind === 'link') {\\n      const chain = this.entities.find((c) => c.id === e.chain);\\n      const link = chain?.links?.[e.index];\\n      if (link) link.tray = true;\\n    }\\n    if ((e.kind === 'shard' || e.kind === 'tumor') && !e.pooled) {\\n      e.pooled = true;\\n      this.spawn({ kind: 'pool', site: e.homeSite || e.site, at: [e.homeX ?? e.x, e.homeY ?? e.y], vol: e.kind === 'tumor' ? 0.3 : 0.4, cap: 0.5 });\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  onFeederDead() {}\\n\",\"total_lines\":863}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-f22a39d9-a5fd-4ac3-88d3-44331ad98428-29","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"400→function decide(state, me, mem, opts, claims) {\\n  const tuning = state.tuning;\\n  const held = state.entities.find((e) => e.holder === me.id);\\n  if (held) return carry(me, held, tuning, opts);\\n\\n  if (state.arrest) {\\n    const eye = state.entities.find((e) => e.kind === 'fermata' && e.hp > 0);\\n    if (eye && !state.arrest.tutorial) {\\n      if (eye.site && eye.site !== me.site) {\\n        const idx = state.sites.indexOf(eye.site);\\n410→        const f = steer(me, eye.x, eye.y, 0.9, tuning, opts);\\n        if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n        f.use = 0;\\n        return f;\\n      }\\n      return beam(me, eye, tuning, opts);\\n    }\\n    return shock(me, opts);\\n  }\\n\\n420→  const bleeding = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'bleeder' && !e.clamped);\\n  const coreNow = state.entities.some((e) => (e.kind === 'coda' && e.coreOpen) || (e.kind === 'adagio' && e.hp > 0 && e.core));\\n  const codaUp = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'coda' && e.hp > 0);\\n  const windup = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'baton' && e.hp > 0 && e.windup);\\n  if (codaUp && (me.composure || 0) >= 100 && state.vitals < 62 && !coreNow) {\\n    return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, special: true, tool: me.tool };\\n  }\\n  const swelling = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'crescendo' && !e.exposed);\\n  const slow = (opts.reactionDelay || 0) > 0;\\n  // A delayed hand that leaves the conductor for the IV misses the baton and eats the downbeat.\\n430→  const healAt = codaUp ? (slow ? 12 : 46) : (swelling && slow ? 8 : 40);\\n  if (!coreNow && !(codaUp && windup) && state.vitals < healAt && (me.syringeCd || 0) <= 0 && (!bleeding || state.vitals < 22)) {\\n    return syringeAt(me, IV.x, IV.y, tuning, opts);\\n  }\\n\\n  if (!codaUp && (me.composure || 0) >= 100 && state.vitals < 50) {\\n    return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, special: true, tool: me.tool };\\n  }\\n\\n  if (slow && coreNow) {\\n440→    const core = state.entities.find((e) => (e.kind === 'coda' && e.coreOpen) || (e.kind === 'adagio' && e.hp > 0 && e.core));\\n    if (core) {\\n      if (core.site && core.site !== me.site) {\\n        const idx = state.sites.indexOf(core.site);\\n        const f = steer(me, core.x || 0, core.y || 0, 1.1, tuning, opts);\\n        if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n        f.use = 0;\\n        return f;\\n      }\\n      return core.kind === 'coda' ? beamCore(me, core, tuning, opts) : beam(me, core, tuning, opts);\\n450→    }\\n  }\\n\\n  const codaEnt = codaUp ? state.entities.find((e) => e.kind === 'coda' && e.hp > 0) : null;\\n  // Be on the center before the core opens. The opening is under a second.\\n  if (slow && codaEnt && !coreNow && state.bar % 4 === 3 && state.beatInBar === 4) {\\n    if (codaEnt.site && codaEnt.site !== me.site) {\\n      const idx = state.sites.indexOf(codaEnt.site);\\n      const f = steer(me, codaEnt.x || 0, codaEnt.y || 0, 1.05, tuning, opts);\\n      if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n460→      f.use = 0;\\n      return f;\\n    }\\n    return parkOn(me, codaEnt, tuning, opts);\\n  }\\n\\n  if (slow && codaUp && !coreNow) {\\n    // Stay on the +x arm after it drops to 0. A dead arm still blocks the downbeat,\\n    // and the cue note sits beside it. Retarget only when that arm is gone.\\n    const allBats = state.entities.filter((e) => e.kind === 'baton');\\n470→    let bat = allBats.find((b) => b.id === mem.batonId);\\n    if (!bat && allBats.length) {\\n      const live = allBats.filter((b) => b.hp > 0);\\n      const pool = live.length ? live : allBats;\\n      bat = pool.slice().sort((a, b) => {\\n        const da = Math.hypot(a.x - me.x, a.y - me.y) + (a.site === me.site ? 0 : 3) + (a.x < 0 ? 0.35 : 0);\\n        const db = Math.hypot(b.x - me.x, b.y - me.y) + (b.site === me.site ? 0 : 3) + (b.x < 0 ? 0.35 : 0);\\n        return da - db;\\n      })[0];\\n      mem.batonId = bat.id;\\n480→    }\\n    if (bat) {\\n      if (bat.site && bat.site !== me.site) {\\n        const idx = state.sites.indexOf(bat.site);\\n        const f = steer(me, bat.x || 0, bat.y || 0, 0.9, tuning, opts);\\n        if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n        f.use = 0;\\n        return f;\\n      }\\n      if ((bat.hp || 0) <= 0) return parkOn(me, bat, tuning, opts);\\n490→      return beamBaton(me, bat, tuning, opts);\\n    }\\n  }\\n  if (!codaUp) mem.batonId = 0;\\n\\n  const list = candidates(state, me, opts).filter((c) => !claims.has(c.e.id));\\n  if (list.length) {\\n    const pick = list[0];\\n    claims.add(pick.e.id);\\n    return actOn(state, me, pick.job, pick.e, mem, tuning, opts);\",\"content_concise\":\"400→function decide(state, me, mem, opts, claims) {\\n  const tuning = state.tuning;\\n  const held = state.entities.find((e) => e.holder === me.id);\\n  if (held) return carry(me, held, tuning, opts);\\n\\n  if (state.arrest) {\\n    const eye = state.entities.find((e) => e.kind === 'fermata' && e.hp > 0);\\n    if (eye && !state.arrest.tutorial) {\\n      if (eye.site && eye.site !== me.site) {\\n        const idx = state.sites.indexOf(eye.site);\\n410→        const f = steer(me, eye.x, eye.y, 0.9, tuning, opts);\\n        if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n        f.use = 0;\\n        return f;\\n      }\\n      return beam(me, eye, tuning, opts);\\n    }\\n    return shock(me, opts);\\n  }\\n\\n420→  const bleeding = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'bleeder' && !e.clamped);\\n  const coreNow = state.entities.some((e) => (e.kind === 'coda' && e.coreOpen) || (e.kind === 'adagio' && e.hp > 0 && e.core));\\n  const codaUp = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'coda' && e.hp > 0);\\n  const windup = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'baton' && e.hp > 0 && e.windup);\\n  if (codaUp && (me.composure || 0) >= 100 && state.vitals < 62 && !coreNow) {\\n    return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, special: true, tool: me.tool };\\n  }\\n  const swelling = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'crescendo' && !e.exposed);\\n  const slow = (opts.reactionDelay || 0) > 0;\\n  // A delayed hand that leaves the conductor for the IV misses the baton and eats the downbeat.\\n430→  const healAt = codaUp ? (slow ? 12 : 46) : (swelling && slow ? 8 : 40);\\n  if (!coreNow && !(codaUp && windup) && state.vitals < healAt && (me.syringeCd || 0) <= 0 && (!bleeding || state.vitals < 22)) {\\n    return syringeAt(me, IV.x, IV.y, tuning, opts);\\n  }\\n\\n  if (!codaUp && (me.composure || 0) >= 100 && state.vitals < 50) {\\n    return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, special: true, tool: me.tool };\\n  }\\n\\n  if (slow && coreNow) {\\n440→    const core = state.entities.find((e) => (e.kind === 'coda' && e.coreOpen) || (e.kind === 'adagio' && e.hp > 0 && e.core));\\n    if (core) {\\n      if (core.site && core.site !== me.site) {\\n        const idx = state.sites.indexOf(core.site);\\n        const f = steer(me, core.x || 0, core.y || 0, 1.1, tuning, opts);\\n        if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n        f.use = 0;\\n        return f;\\n      }\\n      return core.kind === 'coda' ? beamCore(me, core, tuning, opts) : beam(me, core, tuning, opts);\\n450→    }\\n  }\\n\\n  const codaEnt = codaUp ? state.entities.find((e) => e.kind === 'coda' && e.hp > 0) : null;\\n  // Be on the center before the core opens. The opening is under a second.\\n  if (slow && codaEnt && !coreNow && state.bar % 4 === 3 && state.beatInBar === 4) {\\n    if (codaEnt.site && codaEnt.site !== me.site) {\\n      const idx = state.sites.indexOf(codaEnt.site);\\n      const f = steer(me, codaEnt.x || 0, codaEnt.y || 0, 1.05, tuning, opts);\\n      if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n460→      f.use = 0;\\n      return f;\\n    }\\n    return parkOn(me, codaEnt, tuning, opts);\\n  }\\n\\n  if (slow && codaUp && !coreNow) {\\n    // Stay on the +x arm after it drops to 0. A dead arm still blocks the downbeat,\\n    // and the cue note sits beside it. Retarget only when that arm is gone.\\n    const allBats = state.entities.filter((e) => e.kind === 'baton');\\n470→    let bat = allBats.find((b) => b.id === mem.batonId);\\n    if (!bat && allBats.length) {\\n      const live = allBats.filter((b) => b.hp > 0);\\n      const pool = live.length ? live : allBats;\\n      bat = pool.slice().sort((a, b) => {\\n        const da = Math.hypot(a.x - me.x, a.y - me.y) + (a.site === me.site ? 0 : 3) + (a.x < 0 ? 0.35 : 0);\\n        const db = Math.hypot(b.x - me.x, b.y - me.y) + (b.site === me.site ? 0 : 3) + (b.x < 0 ? 0.35 : 0);\\n        return da - db;\\n      })[0];\\n      mem.batonId = bat.id;\\n480→    }\\n    if (bat) {\\n      if (bat.site && bat.site !== me.site) {\\n        const idx = state.sites.indexOf(bat.site);\\n        const f = steer(me, bat.x || 0, bat.y || 0, 0.9, tuning, opts);\\n        if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n        f.use = 0;\\n        return f;\\n      }\\n      if ((bat.hp || 0) <= 0) return parkOn(me, bat, tuning, opts);\\n490→      return beamBaton(me, bat, tuning, opts);\\n    }\\n  }\\n  if (!codaUp) mem.batonId = 0;\\n\\n  const list = candidates(state, me, opts).filter((c) => !claims.has(c.e.id));\\n  if (list.length) {\\n    const pick = list[0];\\n    claims.add(pick.e.id);\\n    return actOn(state, me, pick.job, pick.e, mem, tuning, opts);\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js\",\"offset\":400,\"limit\":100,\"raw_output\":\"function decide(state, me, mem, opts, claims) {\\n  const tuning = state.tuning;\\n  const held = state.entities.find((e) => e.holder === me.id);\\n  if (held) return carry(me, held, tuning, opts);\\n\\n  if (state.arrest) {\\n    const eye = state.entities.find((e) => e.kind === 'fermata' && e.hp > 0);\\n    if (eye && !state.arrest.tutorial) {\\n      if (eye.site && eye.site !== me.site) {\\n        const idx = state.sites.indexOf(eye.site);\\n        const f = steer(me, eye.x, eye.y, 0.9, tuning, opts);\\n        if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n        f.use = 0;\\n        return f;\\n      }\\n      return beam(me, eye, tuning, opts);\\n    }\\n    return shock(me, opts);\\n  }\\n\\n  const bleeding = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'bleeder' && !e.clamped);\\n  const coreNow = state.entities.some((e) => (e.kind === 'coda' && e.coreOpen) || (e.kind === 'adagio' && e.hp > 0 && e.core));\\n  const codaUp = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'coda' && e.hp > 0);\\n  const windup = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'baton' && e.hp > 0 && e.windup);\\n  if (codaUp && (me.composure || 0) >= 100 && state.vitals < 62 && !coreNow) {\\n    return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, special: true, tool: me.tool };\\n  }\\n  const swelling = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'crescendo' && !e.exposed);\\n  const slow = (opts.reactionDelay || 0) > 0;\\n  // A delayed hand that leaves the conductor for the IV misses the baton and eats the downbeat.\\n  const healAt = codaUp ? (slow ? 12 : 46) : (swelling && slow ? 8 : 40);\\n  if (!coreNow && !(codaUp && windup) && state.vitals < healAt && (me.syringeCd || 0) <= 0 && (!bleeding || state.vitals < 22)) {\\n    return syringeAt(me, IV.x, IV.y, tuning, opts);\\n  }\\n\\n  if (!codaUp && (me.composure || 0) >= 100 && state.vitals < 50) {\\n    return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, special: true, tool: me.tool };\\n  }\\n\\n  if (slow && coreNow) {\\n    const core = state.entities.find((e) => (e.kind === 'coda' && e.coreOpen) || (e.kind === 'adagio' && e.hp > 0 && e.core));\\n    if (core) {\\n      if (core.site && core.site !== me.site) {\\n        const idx = state.sites.indexOf(core.site);\\n        const f = steer(me, core.x || 0, core.y || 0, 1.1, tuning, opts);\\n        if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n        f.use = 0;\\n        return f;\\n      }\\n      return core.kind === 'coda' ? beamCore(me, core, tuning, opts) : beam(me, core, tuning, opts);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  const codaEnt = codaUp ? state.entities.find((e) => e.kind === 'coda' && e.hp > 0) : null;\\n  // Be on the center before the core opens. The opening is under a second.\\n  if (slow && codaEnt && !coreNow && state.bar % 4 === 3 && state.beatInBar === 4) {\\n    if (codaEnt.site && codaEnt.site !== me.site) {\\n      const idx = state.sites.indexOf(codaEnt.site);\\n      const f = steer(me, codaEnt.x || 0, codaEnt.y || 0, 1.05, tuning, opts);\\n      if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n      f.use = 0;\\n      return f;\\n    }\\n    return parkOn(me, codaEnt, tuning, opts);\\n  }\\n\\n  if (slow && codaUp && !coreNow) {\\n    // Stay on the +x arm after it drops to 0. A dead arm still blocks the downbeat,\\n    // and the cue note sits beside it. Retarget only when that arm is gone.\\n    const allBats = state.entities.filter((e) => e.kind === 'baton');\\n    let bat = allBats.find((b) => b.id === mem.batonId);\\n    if (!bat && allBats.length) {\\n      const live = allBats.filter((b) => b.hp > 0);\\n      const pool = live.length ? live : allBats;\\n      bat = pool.slice().sort((a, b) => {\\n        const da = Math.hypot(a.x - me.x, a.y - me.y) + (a.site === me.site ? 0 : 3) + (a.x < 0 ? 0.35 : 0);\\n        const db = Math.hypot(b.x - me.x, b.y - me.y) + (b.site === me.site ? 0 : 3) + (b.x < 0 ? 0.35 : 0);\\n        return da - db;\\n      })[0];\\n      mem.batonId = bat.id;\\n    }\\n    if (bat) {\\n      if (bat.site && bat.site !== me.site) {\\n        const idx = state.sites.indexOf(bat.site);\\n        const f = steer(me, bat.x || 0, bat.y || 0, 0.9, tuning, opts);\\n        if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n        f.use = 0;\\n        return f;\\n      }\\n      if ((bat.hp || 0) <= 0) return parkOn(me, bat, tuning, opts);\\n      return beamBaton(me, bat, tuning, opts);\\n    }\\n  }\\n  if (!codaUp) mem.batonId = 0;\\n\\n  const list = candidates(state, me, opts).filter((c) => !claims.has(c.e.id));\\n  if (list.length) {\\n    const pick = list[0];\\n    claims.add(pick.e.id);\\n    return actOn(state, me, pick.job, pick.e, mem, tuning, opts);\\n\",\"total_lines\":554}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"600ea2f2-6ba2-4130-a27d-6a0ff410949e"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_368","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A helper function is needed to aim the baton and avoid duplication.\n\nA `stickBaton` helper will be added near `beamBaton`. `tools.js` needs a heat sink fix in `stepLaser`. `bot.js` needs a syringe guard, core deferral to live arm, prelude removal, and camp laser timing. The coda core block must handle the baton when it is open and has health.\n\n`aimBaton` will steer to a baton at a different site or beam it directly. It is skipped when the baton is dead. A `tendBaton` helper for camp decisions is also being drafted.\n\n`tendBaton` will park the baton when it is dead and no note is nearby, or preheat on beats 1 and 4. It beams otherwise. The core block will run first to handle alive arms before the baton logic.\n\nThe camp block's beat 1 preheat is skipped when the core block is active. The core block handles opening beats instead. Laser commands queued on beat 4 will continue firing into beat 1 because of reaction delay. The core block now checks for slow and coreNow conditions.\n\nThe coda core block now locates the active baton by ID and health, then delegates to `tendBaton`. If no baton is selected, the bot will simply shoot the core. The syringe guard is being set to fire only on beats 1 and 4 during slow coda.\n\nThe syringe guard condition is being rewritten to use explicit `beatHot` and `armUp` flags instead of a single messy boolean.\n\nThe syringe guard now uses a `panic` flag for coda slow when vitals drop below 6. It fires only when no core is active, no windup is running, the bot is not bleeding or bleeding is severe, and either panic or neither beatHot nor armUp applies. This preserves original behavior outside coda and prevents syringes during active arms or hot beats.\n\nSyringe use during slow coda is being restricted to panic vitals below 6 when the arm is dead. This prevents missing the beat 4 preheat and beat 1 kill. A `holdPost` flag is being added to keep the laser active on beats 1, 4, and while the arm is alive.\n\nThe syringe guard now explicitly excludes `holdPost`, so the laser stays on during coda beats and while the arm is alive. The prelude block will be removed entirely. The heat sink fix in `tools.js` targets a dead baton at the same site within 0.05 distance, resets its off timer, and iterates over notes.\n\nThe heat sink now burns notes within 0.14 distance of a dead baton and pops them after 0.25 seconds. This simulation change may affect normal mode scores, so normal must be rechecked. Laser power is ignored by the sink, and note sites are already set at spawn.\n\nThe holdPost flag correctly covers beat 4 when the arm is dead, since the bot's windup check requires positive HP. When the arm is alive on beat 4, the existing `!(codaUp && windup)` guard already blocks syringes. The hush command fires when vitals drop below 62, composure reaches 100, and no core is active.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-00119ac4-672c-403e-88c4-93bd7d5e82f9-30","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js","offset":330,"limit":70}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7742,"output_tokens":2225,"cache_read_input_tokens":71936,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"6118fc67-d1e7-4e84-9655-1e808c37471a"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-00119ac4-672c-403e-88c4-93bd7d5e82f9-30","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"330→function carry(me, held, tuning, opts) {\\n  if (held.embedded) {\\n    const axis = ((held.axis ?? 0) * Math.PI) / 180;\\n    const mag = magFor(0.62, tuning, false);\\n    return {\\n      source: 'stick', x: Math.cos(axis) * mag, y: Math.sin(axis) * mag, use: 1, tool: 'forceps',\\n    };\\n  }\\n  if (overTray(me.x, me.y)) return hold('forceps', 0);\\n  return goTool(steer(me, TRAY_AIM.x, TRAY_AIM.y, 1.35, tuning, opts), 'forceps', 1);\\n340→}\\n\\nfunction shock(me, opts) {\\n  const delay = opts.reactionDelay || 0;\\n  const releaseAt = Math.max(0.5, 1.16 - delay);\\n  if ((me.charge || 0) < releaseAt) return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 1, steady: true, tool: me.tool };\\n  return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, steady: false, tool: me.tool };\\n}\\n\\nfunction scan(state, me, mem, tuning, opts) {\\n350→  if (mem.phase !== state.phase) {\\n    mem.phase = state.phase;\\n    mem.raster = 0;\\n    mem.dwell = 0;\\n    mem.sitePass = Math.max(0, state.sites.indexOf(me.site));\\n  }\\n  const site = state.sites[mem.sitePass % state.sites.length];\\n  if (me.site !== site) {\\n    return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, tool: 'scanner', site: mem.sitePass % state.sites.length };\\n  }\\n360→  const p = RASTER[Math.min(mem.raster, RASTER.length - 1)];\\n  const d = Math.hypot(me.x - p[0], me.y - p[1]);\\n  const f = steer(me, p[0], p[1], 0.7, tuning, opts);\\n  if (d < 0.08) {\\n    mem.dwell += 1 / 60;\\n    if (mem.dwell >= 0.7) {\\n      mem.dwell = 0;\\n      mem.raster += 1;\\n      if (mem.raster >= RASTER.length) {\\n        mem.raster = 0;\\n370→        mem.sitePass += 1;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  return goTool(f, 'scanner', 1);\\n}\\n\\nfunction unclamp(me, e, mem, tuning, opts, state) {\\n  if (e.site && state && e.site !== me.site && e.site !== 'tray') {\\n    const idx = state.sites.indexOf(e.site);\\n380→    const f = steer(me, e.x, e.y, 0.6, tuning, opts);\\n    if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n    f.use = 0;\\n    f.alt = false;\\n    return f;\\n  }\\n  const d = Math.hypot(me.x - e.x, me.y - e.y);\\n  if (d > 0.05) {\\n    const f = steer(me, e.x, e.y, 0.7, tuning, opts);\\n    f.alt = false;\\n390→    return f;\\n  }\\n  if (mem.altId === e.id) {\\n    mem.altId = 0;\\n    return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, alt: false };\\n  }\\n  mem.altId = e.id;\\n  return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, alt: true, tool: 'forceps' };\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"330→function carry(me, held, tuning, opts) {\\n  if (held.embedded) {\\n    const axis = ((held.axis ?? 0) * Math.PI) / 180;\\n    const mag = magFor(0.62, tuning, false);\\n    return {\\n      source: 'stick', x: Math.cos(axis) * mag, y: Math.sin(axis) * mag, use: 1, tool: 'forceps',\\n    };\\n  }\\n  if (overTray(me.x, me.y)) return hold('forceps', 0);\\n  return goTool(steer(me, TRAY_AIM.x, TRAY_AIM.y, 1.35, tuning, opts), 'forceps', 1);\\n340→}\\n\\nfunction shock(me, opts) {\\n  const delay = opts.reactionDelay || 0;\\n  const releaseAt = Math.max(0.5, 1.16 - delay);\\n  if ((me.charge || 0) < releaseAt) return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 1, steady: true, tool: me.tool };\\n  return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, steady: false, tool: me.tool };\\n}\\n\\nfunction scan(state, me, mem, tuning, opts) {\\n350→  if (mem.phase !== state.phase) {\\n    mem.phase = state.phase;\\n    mem.raster = 0;\\n    mem.dwell = 0;\\n    mem.sitePass = Math.max(0, state.sites.indexOf(me.site));\\n  }\\n  const site = state.sites[mem.sitePass % state.sites.length];\\n  if (me.site !== site) {\\n    return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, tool: 'scanner', site: mem.sitePass % state.sites.length };\\n  }\\n360→  const p = RASTER[Math.min(mem.raster, RASTER.length - 1)];\\n  const d = Math.hypot(me.x - p[0], me.y - p[1]);\\n  const f = steer(me, p[0], p[1], 0.7, tuning, opts);\\n  if (d < 0.08) {\\n    mem.dwell += 1 / 60;\\n    if (mem.dwell >= 0.7) {\\n      mem.dwell = 0;\\n      mem.raster += 1;\\n      if (mem.raster >= RASTER.length) {\\n        mem.raster = 0;\\n370→        mem.sitePass += 1;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  return goTool(f, 'scanner', 1);\\n}\\n\\nfunction unclamp(me, e, mem, tuning, opts, state) {\\n  if (e.site && state && e.site !== me.site && e.site !== 'tray') {\\n    const idx = state.sites.indexOf(e.site);\\n380→    const f = steer(me, e.x, e.y, 0.6, tuning, opts);\\n    if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n    f.use = 0;\\n    f.alt = false;\\n    return f;\\n  }\\n  const d = Math.hypot(me.x - e.x, me.y - e.y);\\n  if (d > 0.05) {\\n    const f = steer(me, e.x, e.y, 0.7, tuning, opts);\\n    f.alt = false;\\n390→    return f;\\n  }\\n  if (mem.altId === e.id) {\\n    mem.altId = 0;\\n    return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, alt: false };\\n  }\\n  mem.altId = e.id;\\n  return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, alt: true, tool: 'forceps' };\\n}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js\",\"offset\":330,\"limit\":70,\"raw_output\":\"function carry(me, held, tuning, opts) {\\n  if (held.embedded) {\\n    const axis = ((held.axis ?? 0) * Math.PI) / 180;\\n    const mag = magFor(0.62, tuning, false);\\n    return {\\n      source: 'stick', x: Math.cos(axis) * mag, y: Math.sin(axis) * mag, use: 1, tool: 'forceps',\\n    };\\n  }\\n  if (overTray(me.x, me.y)) return hold('forceps', 0);\\n  return goTool(steer(me, TRAY_AIM.x, TRAY_AIM.y, 1.35, tuning, opts), 'forceps', 1);\\n}\\n\\nfunction shock(me, opts) {\\n  const delay = opts.reactionDelay || 0;\\n  const releaseAt = Math.max(0.5, 1.16 - delay);\\n  if ((me.charge || 0) < releaseAt) return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 1, steady: true, tool: me.tool };\\n  return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, steady: false, tool: me.tool };\\n}\\n\\nfunction scan(state, me, mem, tuning, opts) {\\n  if (mem.phase !== state.phase) {\\n    mem.phase = state.phase;\\n    mem.raster = 0;\\n    mem.dwell = 0;\\n    mem.sitePass = Math.max(0, state.sites.indexOf(me.site));\\n  }\\n  const site = state.sites[mem.sitePass % state.sites.length];\\n  if (me.site !== site) {\\n    return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, tool: 'scanner', site: mem.sitePass % state.sites.length };\\n  }\\n  const p = RASTER[Math.min(mem.raster, RASTER.length - 1)];\\n  const d = Math.hypot(me.x - p[0], me.y - p[1]);\\n  const f = steer(me, p[0], p[1], 0.7, tuning, opts);\\n  if (d < 0.08) {\\n    mem.dwell += 1 / 60;\\n    if (mem.dwell >= 0.7) {\\n      mem.dwell = 0;\\n      mem.raster += 1;\\n      if (mem.raster >= RASTER.length) {\\n        mem.raster = 0;\\n        mem.sitePass += 1;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  return goTool(f, 'scanner', 1);\\n}\\n\\nfunction unclamp(me, e, mem, tuning, opts, state) {\\n  if (e.site && state && e.site !== me.site && e.site !== 'tray') {\\n    const idx = state.sites.indexOf(e.site);\\n    const f = steer(me, e.x, e.y, 0.6, tuning, opts);\\n    if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\\n    f.use = 0;\\n    f.alt = false;\\n    return f;\\n  }\\n  const d = Math.hypot(me.x - e.x, me.y - e.y);\\n  if (d > 0.05) {\\n    const f = steer(me, e.x, e.y, 0.7, tuning, opts);\\n    f.alt = false;\\n    return f;\\n  }\\n  if (mem.altId === e.id) {\\n    mem.altId = 0;\\n    return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, alt: false };\\n  }\\n  mem.altId = e.id;\\n  return { source: 'stick', x: 0, y: 0, use: 0, alt: true, tool: 'forceps' };\\n}\\n\\n\",\"total_lines\":554}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"f7ad4381-0bb5-404d-bf9c-51e5882c8834"}
