7194,\\\"par\\\":34249,\\\"miss\\\":0,\\\"phase\\\":\\\"conductor\\\",\\\"steps\\\":13573,\\\"kinds\\\":{\\\"bleeder\\\":4,\\\"fermata\\\":1,\\\"coda\\\":1,\\\"baton\\\":2,\\\"scratch\\\":11,\\\"note\\\":1}}\\n{\\\"id\\\":\\\"coda\\\",\\\"seats\\\":1,\\\"mode\\\":\\\"normal\\\",\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"failed\\\":null,\\\"t\\\":318.4,\\\"frac\\\":0.559,\\\"vmin\\\":47.3,\\\"rank\\\":\\\"S\\\",\\\"score\\\":37227,\\\"par\\\":34249,\\\"miss\\\":0,\\\"phase\\\":\\\"last-stop\\\",\\\"steps\\\":19102,\\\"kinds\\\":{\\\"bleeder\\\":4}}\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"command\":\"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer && node one.mjs coda 1 sloppy > coda-sloppy8.json && node one.mjs coda 1 normal > coda-normal8.json && echo DONE && cat coda-sloppy8.json && cat coda-normal8.json\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Re-smoke sloppy and normal coda\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6%2Fwork/01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710/terminal/call-e7e10887-5300-4364-b52d-54673055aa9b-38.log\",\"total_bytes\":464}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"1fbd592e-bcb4-4014-ab8c-764cc9f3e07e"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_373","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The normal score remains unchanged at 37227.\n\nThe sloppy lived longer at t=226 but still died in the conductor. Spores are gone from kinds. Eleven unblocked downbeats drain 2.64 HP per second. Downbeats are not being blocked. The arm fails to stay dead through beat one. A later trace will log bat HP and downbeat events.\n\nThe trace will log downbeat events with bat HP, beat, position, tool, and use. The 80-line conductor output is manageable. The singe works and spores are gone. The arm may not be dead at beat one because preheat reaction delay prevents killing before the next beat one. There is a 2.6-second window after reset to act.\n\nSeveral hypotheses explain why the arm survives beat one. The core may be targeted while the reset arm is ignored. New arms spawn at 9 HP and evade quick kills. Preheat might laser the dead arm, but the player returns to the core after a move, so the fresh arm survives until the next downbeat. Laser venting could also prevent the kill.\n\nThe downbeat check only blocks when at least one arm is dead. Eleven downbeats got through, so both arms were alive during those beats. The intended cycle works if the arm is killed within half a second after reset, keeping it dead for the next three beats. The failure is the following downbeat if that kill is missed.\n\nEleven misses out of roughly forty-six downbeats is about a quarter. The core-opening cycle should work: kill the arm on beat one, shoot the core for beats two and three, return to camp, preheat, and block the next beat one. The suspicion is that the initial kill during the opening beat one does not finish.\n\nThe failure is a full bar where both arms stay alive. The player leaves the arm at positive HP and never returns before the next beat one. The core block only ends when the arm reaches zero HP, so camp stays on the arm.\n\nSite moves spawn new arms at nine HP. The next beat one lands about three seconds after the move, so the player must reach and kill the new arm within roughly two seconds. If that fails, both arms survive the full bar.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2c461a46-de80-49f5-bea2-ef6cb5708949-39","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/strains.js","offset":320,"limit":25}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2c461a46-de80-49f5-bea2-ef6cb5708949-40","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"site === |organAt|sites\\[|function sitePos|layout","glob":"**/sim.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":829,"output_tokens":1336,"cache_read_input_tokens":87680,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"70ace403-9479-474c-ba4e-d749037ef0e7"}
