{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_374","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The coda retains its x and y coordinates while only the site changes.\n\nNew batons spawn at the same coordinates on the new site. The player must switch sites to reach the coda. The core block checks if the current site differs from the coda's site and switches toward it before shooting the core. New batons start at 9 HP. They are not killed while the core is open because the memory baton ID points to the dead old arm, leaving `arm` undefined.\n\nThe camp block selects a new +x baton when the memory baton ID is missing. The timing window from the move to beat 3 allows enough time to travel and kill. A risk remains that the next beat 1 arrives while the core is still open, preventing detection of the new arm.\n\nThe timing window is confirmed safe: the next beat 1 arrives two beats after the core closes. The 11 downbeats are being traced by adding downbeat logging to the scratch script, plus periodic coda HP updates.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-060e6eeb-cdb5-47c2-aa24-92849825e972-41","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/trace-boss.mjs","old_string":"  if (sim.events.some((e) => e.type === 'downbeat')) downs += 1;","new_string":"  if (sim.events.some((e) => e.type === 'downbeat')) {\n    downs += 1;\n    const seat = sim.seats[0];\n    const bats = sim.entities.filter((e) => e.kind === 'baton' && e.alive).map((b) => `${b.hp.toFixed(0)}@${b.x.toFixed(2)}`).join(',');\n    console.log('DOWN', sim.time.toFixed(2), 'beat', sim.beat.count, 'bar', sim.beat.bar, 'in', sim.state.beatInBar, 'bats', bats, 'pos', seat.x.toFixed(2), seat.y.toFixed(2), 'tool', seat.tool, 'use', seat.use.toFixed(2), 'site', seat.site, 'v', sim.vitals.toFixed(1), 'hp', (codaNow?.hp || 0).toFixed(0));\n  }\n  if (sim.events.some((e) => e.type === 'vent')) console.log('VENT', sim.time.toFixed(2));\n  if (sim.events.some((e) => e.type === 'codaMove')) console.log('MOVE', sim.time.toFixed(2), 'site', sim.events.find((e) => e.type === 'codaMove').site, 'v', sim.vitals.toFixed(1));"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2044,"output_tokens":904,"cache_read_input_tokens":88448,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"971b9b7e-4aa9-4b5b-b0c8-3c911de9692c"}
