{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_378","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The coda HP is zero at the first DOWN event at t=208. The open toggle also changes.\n\nThe downbeat loop in stepCoda is not gated on hp>0. Downbeats continue while the coda HP is zero.\n\nThe bot's codaUp check is false once the coda HP reaches zero. The camp block stops and the bot falls through to candidates. The coda becomes grabbable and needs forceps extraction. Downbeats continue because batons reset to 9 each beat. The bats alternate between positions near 0.30 and 0.95 while gelting.\n\nThe coda was killed around t=208. We spent 18 seconds failing to finish the phase while downbeats from the dead conductor drained us. Vitals dropped from 41 to 0 during this time. We did not extract immediately because the phase requires cleared notes, spores, scratches, batons, and poolsClear.\n\nThe coda entity likely lacks the 'coda' strain. The phase completion check `strainDead` looks for an alive entity with that specific strain. Without it, the check passes while the body is still alive, so extraction is not required.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ead53627-fc20-4788-8dd8-49f88b8de5db-45","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js","offset":750,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ead53627-fc20-4788-8dd8-49f88b8de5db-46","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"strain:","glob":"**/sim.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1004,"output_tokens":948,"cache_read_input_tokens":92928,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"a04377ea-eade-4825-bc84-d3e228cd0082"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-ead53627-fc20-4788-8dd8-49f88b8de5db-45","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"750→\\n  clamp01(v) { return Math.max(0, Math.min(100, v)); }\\n\\n  /** Hook spawn so children are created. */\\n  spawn(spec) {\\n    const e = Sim.prototype.spawnRaw ? null : null;\\n    return this._spawn(spec);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n760→// The class method spawn above is replaced by the implementation that also builds children.\\nSim.prototype._spawn = Sim.prototype.spawn;\\n\\nconst rawSpawn = function spawn(spec) {\\n  if (spec.ifMissing) {\\n    const site = spec.site || this.activeSite;\\n    if (this.entities.some((e) => e.alive && e.kind === spec.kind && e.site === site)) return null;\\n  }\\n  const site = spec.site || this.activeSite;\\n  const at = spec.at || [0, 0];\\n770→  const e = {\\n    id: this.nextId++, kind: spec.kind, site, x: at[0], y: at[1],\\n    alive: true, hidden: !!spec.hidden, marked: !spec.hidden, strain: spec.strain || null,\\n  };\\n  Object.assign(e, this.decorate(spec, e));\\n  if (spec.strain) e.strain = spec.strain;\\n  this.entities.push(e);\\n  this.afterSpawn(e);\\n  return e;\\n};\\n780→Sim.prototype.spawn = rawSpawn;\\n\\nSim.prototype.exportState = function exportState() {\\n  const num = (n) => (typeof n === 'number' ? Math.round(n * 1000) / 1000 : n);\\n  return {\\n    tick: this.tick,\\n    op: this.op.id,\\n    phase: this.phase?.id || null,\\n    phaseIndex: this.phaseIndex,\\n    objective: this.objective,\",\"content_concise\":\"750→\\n  clamp01(v) { return Math.max(0, Math.min(100, v)); }\\n\\n  /** Hook spawn so children are created. */\\n  spawn(spec) {\\n    const e = Sim.prototype.spawnRaw ? null : null;\\n    return this._spawn(spec);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n760→// The class method spawn above is replaced by the implementation that also builds children.\\nSim.prototype._spawn = Sim.prototype.spawn;\\n\\nconst rawSpawn = function spawn(spec) {\\n  if (spec.ifMissing) {\\n    const site = spec.site || this.activeSite;\\n    if (this.entities.some((e) => e.alive && e.kind === spec.kind && e.site === site)) return null;\\n  }\\n  const site = spec.site || this.activeSite;\\n  const at = spec.at || [0, 0];\\n770→  const e = {\\n    id: this.nextId++, kind: spec.kind, site, x: at[0], y: at[1],\\n    alive: true, hidden: !!spec.hidden, marked: !spec.hidden, strain: spec.strain || null,\\n  };\\n  Object.assign(e, this.decorate(spec, e));\\n  if (spec.strain) e.strain = spec.strain;\\n  this.entities.push(e);\\n  this.afterSpawn(e);\\n  return e;\\n};\\n780→Sim.prototype.spawn = rawSpawn;\\n\\nSim.prototype.exportState = function exportState() {\\n  const num = (n) => (typeof n === 'number' ? Math.round(n * 1000) / 1000 : n);\\n  return {\\n    tick: this.tick,\\n    op: this.op.id,\\n    phase: this.phase?.id || null,\\n    phaseIndex: this.phaseIndex,\\n    objective: this.objective,\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js\",\"offset\":750,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"\\n  clamp01(v) { return Math.max(0, Math.min(100, v)); }\\n\\n  /** Hook spawn so children are created. */\\n  spawn(spec) {\\n    const e = Sim.prototype.spawnRaw ? null : null;\\n    return this._spawn(spec);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n// The class method spawn above is replaced by the implementation that also builds children.\\nSim.prototype._spawn = Sim.prototype.spawn;\\n\\nconst rawSpawn = function spawn(spec) {\\n  if (spec.ifMissing) {\\n    const site = spec.site || this.activeSite;\\n    if (this.entities.some((e) => e.alive && e.kind === spec.kind && e.site === site)) return null;\\n  }\\n  const site = spec.site || this.activeSite;\\n  const at = spec.at || [0, 0];\\n  const e = {\\n    id: this.nextId++, kind: spec.kind, site, x: at[0], y: at[1],\\n    alive: true, hidden: !!spec.hidden, marked: !spec.hidden, strain: spec.strain || null,\\n  };\\n  Object.assign(e, this.decorate(spec, e));\\n  if (spec.strain) e.strain = spec.strain;\\n  this.entities.push(e);\\n  this.afterSpawn(e);\\n  return e;\\n};\\nSim.prototype.spawn = rawSpawn;\\n\\nSim.prototype.exportState = function exportState() {\\n  const num = (n) => (typeof n === 'number' ? Math.round(n * 1000) / 1000 : n);\\n  return {\\n    tick: this.tick,\\n    op: this.op.id,\\n    phase: this.phase?.id || null,\\n    phaseIndex: this.phaseIndex,\\n    objective: this.objective,\\n\",\"total_lines\":863}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-ead53627-fc20-4788-8dd8-49f88b8de5db-46","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,51,49,50,51,48,95,95,120,56,102,52,57,98,54,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,52,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,51,49,50,51,48,95,95,120,56,102,52,57,98,54,47,119,111,114,107,47,65,108,105,118,101,32,105,110,32,67,111,109,109,111,110,32,84,105,109,101,45,84,114,97,117,109,97,32,67,101,110,116,101,114,58,32,83,101,99,111,110,100,32,79,112,105,110,105,111,110,45,103,114,111,107,45,52,46,55,45,120,104,105,103,104,45,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,51,49,50,51,48,47,115,114,99,47,115,105,109,47,115,105,109,46,106,115,10,51,57,52,58,32,32,32,32,32,32,115,116,114,97,105,110,58,32,115,112,101,99,46,115,116,114,97,105,110,32,124,124,32,110,117,