{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_383","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking that `num(0)` evaluates to 0.\n\nVerified grabbable export and downed-coda handling. Confirmed dead-arm checks trigger right after kills. TendBaton site-switches correctly when targeting distant arms. Grab logic uses zero steering for delays over 0.22 seconds, one for over 0.06, and holds otherwise. Forceps grab radius is 0.1.\n\nChecking decide() placement for slow and syringe blocks. Verifying carry speed stays under pullTol during pulls to prevent tears. Noise could push speed over the limit, so tipSpeed 1.9 and stickCurve 1.7 are being checked.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-29a57fc3-2801-49ac-be81-e4af5425c0f0-51","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js","offset":430,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3597,"output_tokens":647,"cache_read_input_tokens":100608,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"71163f30-297e-436d-8f8e-422fc52cea1b"}
