{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_384","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Reviewing the gift block at line 454.\n\nThe gift block triggers Sforzando or Hush when Coda dies with full composure and low vitals. Composure likely stacks from CLEAN baton kills. This delays extraction by the gift animation. Hush would slow downbeats during extraction but costs a frame and seven seconds.\n\nExtract should run immediately after the slow block, before the gift check. This skips the gift animation and saves a frame. The gift path is pre-existing and will not be modified.\n\nExtracting before the gift check prevents the gift from firing when Coda is downed. The code now locates a dead Coda and selects a healthy baton arm to grab it.\n\nThe baton arm is chosen by distance, site alignment, and x-position. If no arms are available, the agent steers toward the downed Coda's site.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-34bd5afd-f198-4672-9e7d-9fe1efbf99a9-52","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js","old_string":"  const swelling = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'crescendo' && !e.exposed);\n  const slow = (opts.reactionDelay || 0) > 0;\n  // A delayed hand that leaves the conductor for the IV misses the baton and eats the downbeat.","new_string":"  const swelling = state.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'crescendo' && !e.exposed);\n  const slow = (opts.reactionDelay || 0) > 0;\n  // The downed conductor still strikes until it is on the tray. Pull it before anything else.\n  if (slow) {\n    const downed = state.entities.find((e) => e.kind === 'coda' && !(e.hp > 0) && e.grabbable && e.holder == null);\n    if (downed) {\n      const arms = state.entities.filter((e) => e.kind === 'baton');\n      if (arms.length && !arms.some((a) => !(a.hp > 0))) {\n        const pool = arms.filter((a) => a.hp > 0);\n        const bat = (pool.length ? pool : arms).slice().sort((a, b) => {\n          const da = Math.hypot(a.x - me.x, a.y - me.y) + (a.site === me.site ? 0 : 3) + (a.x < 0 ? 0.35 : 0);\n          const db = Math.hypot(b.x - me.x, b.y - me.y) + (b.site === me.site ? 0 : 3) + (b.x < 0 ? 0.35 : 0);\n          return da - db;\n        })[0];\n        mem.batonId = bat.id;\n        return tendBaton(state, me, bat, tuning, opts);\n      }\n      if (downed.site && downed.site !== me.site) {\n        const idx = state.sites.indexOf(downed.site);\n        const f = steer(me, downed.x || 0, downed.y || 0, 1.05, tuning, opts);\n        if (idx >= 0) f.site = idx;\n        f.use = 0;\n        return f;\n      }\n      return grab(me, downed, tuning, opts);\n    }\n  }\n  // A delayed hand that leaves the conductor for the IV misses the baton and eats the downbeat."}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1425,"output_tokens":1494,"cache_read_input_tokens":104192,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"df6226d8-12a4-49e2-bd84-e32c4207fbd1"}
