{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_386","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The sloppy coda test passed.\n\nSloppy rank is S with zero misses. The 506 ms finish beats the easy timer of 798 ms. Normal unchanged score is perfect. Next I will re-run the full sloppy set, GR seats 1-4, and legato.\n\nThe bot changes are isolated to coda paths. Heat sink, syringe holdPost, and tendBaton only trigger during coda, so other operations remain unaffected. BeamBaton is unchanged.\n\nGR 1–4 normal scores are next. GR 2 was fine before. The arrest site-switch is already on disk. Grand rounds might spawn coda later, so those results could be affected.\n\nI will run a bash loop over all nine operations to re-test sloppy and normal GR 1–4. The heat sink could also affect normal GR if the bot lasers a dead baton.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bb59e549-c144-41bf-8149-2f7b96c3beda-54","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/bots.mjs","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":561,"output_tokens":825,"cache_read_input_tokens":107136,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"3dc4d1c9-b4a0-4b76-826f-9fd6dea31228"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-bb59e549-c144-41bf-8149-2f7b96c3beda-54","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→import { Sim } from '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js';\\nimport { play } from '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/bot.js';\\n\\nconst ops = ['broken-glass', 'growth-spurt', 'adagio', 'staccato', 'legato', 'fermata', 'coda', 'last-patient', 'grand-rounds'];\\nconst order = { S: 0, A: 1, B: 2, C: 3, D: 4 };\\n\\nfunction line(tag, sim) {\\n  const frac = sim.op.timer ? (sim.time / sim.op.timer).toFixed(3) : '-';\\n  console.log([\\n10→    tag.padEnd(16),\\n    sim.op.id.padEnd(14),\\n    sim.complete ? 'OK' : 'FAIL:' + sim.failed,\\n    't=' + sim.time.toFixed(1),\\n    'frac=' + frac,\\n    'vmin=' + sim.vitalsMin.toFixed(1),\\n    'rank=' + (sim.rank?.id || '-'),\\n    'score=' + sim.score,\\n  ].join(' '));\\n}\\n20→\\nconsole.log('-- sloppy easy --');\\nfor (const id of ops) {\\n  if (id === 'last-patient') continue;\\n  const sim = new Sim({ op: id, seed: 1, difficulty: 'easy', physics: false });\\n  play(sim, { noise: 0.03, reactionDelay: 0.25 }, 400000);\\n  line('sloppy', sim);\\n}\\n\\nconsole.log('-- idle --');\\n30→for (const id of ops) {\\n  const sim = new Sim({ op: id, seed: 1, difficulty: 'resident', physics: false });\\n  let n = 0;\\n  while (!sim.over && n < 400000) { sim.step(); n += 1; }\\n  line('idle', sim);\\n}\\n\\nconsole.log('-- grand rounds seats --');\\nfor (const seats of [1, 2, 3, 4]) {\\n  const sim = new Sim({ op: 'grand-rounds', seed: 1, difficulty: 'resident', physics: false, players: seats });\\n40→  play(sim, {}, 400000);\\n  line('gr' + seats, sim);\\n}\\n