{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_387","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This runs sloppy, all, idle, and GR seats.\n\nSloppy Coda takes 30,000 steps. Idle runs reach 400,000 steps because the last patient never fails. Broken glass is 14,400 steps. Coda idle is 34,200 steps. GR finishes around 180 seconds, or about 11,000 steps.\n\nTotal steps are roughly 160,000 for sloppy, 550,000 for idle, and 48,000 for GR. The run will use a five-minute timeout and log to a scratch file. The bots script will be updated to print miss counts. Sloppy rank order will be checked against C. Normal full-table scores were confirmed before recent side-burn and heat sink changes.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e0961c22-f723-4fff-9a36-c47b322a9bb5-55","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/bots.mjs","old_string":"    'rank=' + (sim.rank?.id || '-'),\n    'score=' + sim.score,","new_string":"    'rank=' + (sim.rank?.id || '-'),\n    'miss=' + sim.misses,\n    'score=' + sim.score,"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1530,"output_tokens":606,"cache_read_input_tokens":107648,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"6dce2a05-aeaa-4724-8411-f89a2bd00302"}
