{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_389","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All sloppy tests passed with rank A or higher. Coda scored S and legato scored A.\n\nMisses were 4 for legato and 0 for all others. Idle tests failed as expected except Last Patient, which completed successfully. Coda and GR failed vitals rather than time. Both GR seats matched prior locked scores.\n\nGR seats 3 and 4 also passed. Seat 3 had a slight vmin change from 39.7 to 39.9 but still met the threshold. Seat 4 showed minor differences yet remained valid.\n\nNormal 1-player parScores are confirmed locked. Coda and GR 1 scores stayed unchanged, so heat sink did not affect them.\n\nGR 3 and 4 deltas likely reflect this turn's heat sink. Sloppy coda fraction is 0.889, exceeding the 75% data timer threshold, but sloppy mode is not bound by normal coda's 45-75% requirement.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Sloppy coda clears at rank S, and the other easy runs and all four Grand Rounds seats clear too. I’ll check the plan’s bot rules before locking that and moving on."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-982a8115-b93b-4086-b533-a03c16279266-57","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"45|sloppy|reactionDelay|parScore|Deviations","path":"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6%2Fwork/01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710/goal/plan.md"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":878,"output_tokens":1021,"cache_read_input_tokens":109824,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"fc8e64bf-6884-4c76-baec-3d3422d9057c"}
