k/01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710/goal/plan.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":11,\"content\":\"3. Demo content a bot can finish. Playable vertical slice: operations Broken Glass, Growth Spurt, Adagio, Staccato, Legato, Fermata, Coda, Last Patient, and Grand Rounds, with strains Adagio, Staccato, Tremolo, Legato, Crescendo, Fermata, and Coda behaving as in PLAN §5, original cast and setting (Port Calloway, St. Alder, Ward Zero, Ren, Bea, Bell, Pip, Sorrento, Ines, Voss/REQUIEM/the Hush — never Derek Stiles, Angie Thompson, Naomi Kimishima, Caduceus, Delphi, GUILT or its strain names, Healing Touch, star drawing, or Hope Hospital). Story scenes S0–S16, 250–350 lines, must-have lines present, scenes skippable. Phases are data and `skipTo` works. On Normal, a bot that reads only sim state clears each operation (Last Patient only has to complete: no timer, no rank, cannot fail) in 45–75% of that op’s timer, minimum vitals ≥35, rank ≥A; `parScore` is taken from that bot. A sloppy bot (noise and reaction delay) on Easy clears at rank ≥C. No input fails every op except Last Patient. Sto [... truncated (1031 chars total)]\"},{\"line_number\":46,\"content\":\"- [ ] Calibrate `parScore`, write the authoring note, fill About and `exit-interview.json`, copy the HTML to the root name, and save sim, browser, hub, and two launch captures under `{SCRATCH}`.\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"72afbcf7-974b-44ad-a91b-8fc5ddcb914f"}
