{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_403","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will write snapshot.js to pack exportState.\n\nA compact JSON codec with short keys and integer quantization will keep snapshots small. A test script will validate the busiest moment measurement. Keyframe and merged state will include world fields like tick, phase, vitals, score, and timer. Entity geometry for wounds, incisions, and gel zones will also be packed.\n\nStatic entity data belongs in the keyframe. The unreliable snapshot will only send ids, x, y, hp, and flags that changed. Decoding merges onto the last keyframe.\n\nA round-trip test will encode a keyframe, decode it, and compare view fields. Then it will encode state, apply it, and compare moving fields.\n\nThe byte cap is 1100 bytes. Sending all alive entities every tick would exceed this at high density. Only entities whose position or health changed will be included.\n\nAt the busiest moment, notes, adagio, feeders, and tips move. A compact JSON format is required for hub compatibility. The moving entity record will be `[id, x100, y100, hp10, flags]`. To stay within the 920-byte budget, unchanged-health entities may only send position, with health changes tracked separately.\n\nI will measure serialized JSON size with TextEncoder. If it exceeds 1100 bytes, I will drop unchanged entities and shed non-essential fields like names. I will append deviations now, then write the story, audio, view, UI, and app modules as large files.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7a6ca67b-0f39-4e5d-a80b-d283526e2101-89","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"^\\s+(connect|on|send|ready|finish|time|rng|answer|fail|active)\\s*[:(]|this\\.(connect|send|ready)","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/tools/vendor/session.js","head_limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7a6ca67b-0f39-4e5d-a80b-d283526e2101-90","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/tests/hub/site/harness.html","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":218,"output_tokens":861,"cache_read_input_tokens":153088,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"584ad95d-c8c3-4457-b4c2-e7269d525c6b"}
