{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_404","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The session client is minified.\n\nI'll write large batches of code to build a bootable game that passes tests. The plan covers a compact snapshot codec, story scenes and barks, and audio using pure OfflineAudioContext functions without DOM dependencies.\n\nThe remaining modules are view, input, UI, app, main.js, build.mjs, and tests. I will keep the code dense but complete. Browser tests require state hooks, test flags, and WebGL toggles.\n\nI am designing the director state machine to handle the full UI playthrough. It will advance story scenes, run bot operations, and display reports and credits. The director needs screens for title, menu, story, chart, operation, report, credits, fail, freeplay, lobby, settings, about, touch, pause, dev, and session card. I will also implement exact text requirements like the touch notice and 10-second attract mode.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d7bbc290-14f6-4495-ae4d-4c4d8267e7e4-91","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"skipTo|notesOffer|cheats","glob":"**/sim.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2820,"output_tokens":631,"cache_read_input_tokens":153216,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"78dbe55e-4d1a-4622-8ccc-b0219f0a6f80"}
