{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_429","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Story order: S0 (new game) first, then for each operation: before scene, chart, operation, after scene.\n\nOperations: broken-glass, growth-spurt, adagio, staccato, legato, fermata, coda, last-patient. Story, Chart, Operation, Report, and Credits must all be reached.\n\nStory scenes will be skipped with Tab. Charts begin with Enter. Operations run via test.bot(true) and test.warp(8), then pause one frame to show the report. Reports advance with Enter.\n\nThe Fail screen must be reachable. A test hook or menu path is needed, since pausing during an operation does not trigger failure.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b9527fe9-243d-4dfa-a092-aa11ec863ced-119","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"consult:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/data"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1573,"output_tokens":712,"cache_read_input_tokens":182912,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"8b732b8c-1624-44f0-ba26-e989fab9321a"}
