{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_441","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will read STAGE.md and follow its instructions. I will complete all items in PLAN.md that can be done on this computer. I will ensure everything TASK.md requires is present in this folder.\n\nStory scenes are mostly written. S14 Bea contains a lint-failing word. I still need to write barks, audio, view, input, shell, hub, build, and tests. I will check the current file state before continuing.\n\nI have mapped out the remaining work in twelve concrete steps. I will fix the lint issue first, then write barks, audio, view, input, shell, hub, build, and tests. I will also create authoring tools, exit interviews, root HTML, and run verification.\n\nI am reading the threejs-frame-conventions skill and existing source files to prepare for shell integration. The work folder contains STAGE.md, PLAN.md, and TASK.md.\n\nToken budget is 1.1M and elapsed time is 2h46m, so I will move fast and write complete files in batches. I am designing the audio engine with exact gain levels, an OfflineAudioContext scheduler, and deterministic oscillators to avoid Math.random.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The sim and story are in place. Next I’ll fix the one Bea line that would fail the data check, then build sound, the playable shell, and the hand-in files around the sim that already clears."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1eac60b3-8bef-411c-be75-6252452dc68d-0","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"scaffold","content":"Scaffold dev folder, RNG title, package, hub client, build, test runner","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"sim","content":"Headless sim: beat, vitals, scoring, tools, gifts, checkpoints, all ops and strains","status":"completed"},{"id":"bot-tests","content":"Keep dead baton camp, retest sloppy coda, then full sloppy + GR seats","status":"completed"},{"id":"story-audio","content":"Fix Bea line, barks, procedural music