{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_445","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a massive implementation.\n\nI'll read the simulation input and export state to wire everything correctly. Then I'll write large batches of files in this order: fix the Bea line, add barks, build an offline audio engine, create the view layer with ink rendering and simplified geometry, implement input and glyphs, and finally add UI CSS and DOM screens.\n\nNext I'll write the director, session, main.js, build script, and tests. Bot playthroughs are slow but manageable; the full suite should run in about 30 to 90 seconds.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c4f6e396-baef-42fd-bdcb-223fa63ca792-14","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js","offset":140,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c4f6e396-baef-42fd-bdcb-223fa63ca792-15","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js","offset":760,"limit":130}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c4f6e396-baef-42fd-bdcb-223fa63ca792-16","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/config/tuning.js","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c4f6e396-baef-42fd-bdcb-223fa63ca792-17","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/data/ops/index.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c4f6e396-baef-42fd-