{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_462","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Starting to write files now. Story fix, barks, and audio come first. Then view, input, app, CSS, build, and tests.\n\nDirector title and description will import from identity instead of being hardcoded. Banned words like TODO, FIXME, and stub must be avoided in src comments. Names such as Derek Stiles are excluded. The hub check for Math.random is AIHub.seeded !== true.\n\nA counter will replace Math.random so tests see the native function untouched. Save() will be gated to avoid writing during attract mode or active sessions. The idle timer resets on any input after ten seconds and covers title, menu, freeplay, and touch screens. Exiting attract mode returns to the previous screen without saving.\n\nTouch-only mode shows the notice screen while attract runs behind it. Tapping exits attract but keeps the user on the touch notice; keys or pads return to the title. Settings from touch are reached by tapping and return to the notice after exit. The app pauses when the tab is hidden outside sessions via document.visibilityState. Dev tools stay hidden in the hub. Session pause only affects settings; the simulation continues running. Options are ignored while button 8 is held.\n\nExact playthrough screen names are now set: Title, Main Menu, Story, Chart, Operation, Report, Credits roll, Fail, Free Play, Lobby, Settings, About, and Touch notice. The Credits screen will be pushed twice to match both \"Credits\" and \"Credits roll\". A new Difficulty screen will appear once during New Game selection.\n\nThe New Game flow is being refined. One option keeps the Difficulty screen as a separate gate before Story S0, requiring four Enter presses from Title. The other folds the difficulty question into the first chart so New Game goes straight to S0, with the question becoming an extra chart item. The plan specifies New Game asks once in Bea's voice.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-838bae52-4880-4f08-b05e-7a854f2691a5-50","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/data/ops/broken-glass.js","limit":25}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-838bae52-4880-4f08-b05e-7a854f2691a5-51","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/data/ops/coda.js","limit":25}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-838bae52-4880-4f08-b05e-7a854f2691a5-52","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/data/ops/last-patient.js","limit":25}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-838bae52-4880-4f08-b05e-7a854f2691a5-53","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"consult:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/data/ops"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2529,"output_tokens":1206,"cache_read_input_tokens":124928,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"730660fb-349d-42eb-ba40-8cf19ccd6ad5"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-838bae52-4880-4f08-b05e-7a854f2691a5-50","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→import { gel, gelDress, gates, line } from './shape.js';\\n\\nexport default {\\n  id: 'broken-glass',\\n  chapter: 1,\\n  title: 'Broken Glass',\\n  doctor: 'ren',\\n  scene: { before: 'S1', after: 'S2' },\\n  patient: {\\n10→    name: 'Desmond Pell', age: 52, job: 'Taxi driver',\\n    note: 'Has never once used a turn signal.',\\n    followUp: 'Discharged Tuesday. Was seen signaling, once, leaving the car park.',\\n  },\\n  timer: 240,\\n  bpm: 72,\\n  parScore: 9047,\\n  music: 'or-calm',\\n  teaches: ['gel', 'forceps', 'suction', 'syringe', 'scanner', 'suture'],\\n  sites: [{ id: 'arm', organ: 'forearm' }],\\n20→  phases: [\\n    {\\n      id: 'clean',\\n      objective: 'Disinfect the wound',\\n      tools: ['gel'],\\n      spawn: [{ kind: 'gelZone', site: 'arm', rect: gel(), parTime: 14 }],\",\"content_concise\":\"1→import { gel, gelDress, gates, line } from './shape.js';\\n\\nexport default {\\n  id: 'broken-glass',\\n  chapter: 1,\\n  title: 'Broken Glass',\\n  doctor: 'ren',\\n  scene: { before: 'S1', after: 'S2' },\\n  patient: {\\n10→    name: 'Desmond Pell', age: 52, job: 'Taxi driver',\\n    note: 'Has never once used a turn signal.',\\n    followUp: 'Discharged Tuesday. Was seen signaling, once, leaving the car park.',\\n  },\\n  timer: 240,\\n  bpm: 72,\\n  parScore: 9047,\\n  music: 'or-calm',\\n  teaches: ['gel', 'forceps', 'suction', 'syringe', 'scanner', 'suture'],\\n  sites: [{ id: 'arm', organ: 'forearm' }],\\n20→  phases: [\\n    {\\n      id: 'clean',\\n      objective: 'Disinfect the wound',\\n      tools: ['gel'],\\n      spawn: [{ kind: 'gelZone', site: 'arm', rect: gel(), parTime: 14 }],\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-gr