{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_463","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Beginning to write code. I'll batch the file writes.\n\nAdding an extra bell line with the exact ellipsis phrase for safety. Will run a quick node count on current lines while writing other files. Also fixing S14.\n\nStructuring the director with a single renderShell function for screen rendering. HUD updates every frame via textContent without full rebuilds. Focus and mouse interactions will use data-idx attributes on menu items. Keyboard controls include arrow keys, w/s, Enter/Space, Escape/Backspace, and Q/E for paging.\n\nTab will skip story. Digits 1-8 will trigger tools during operations. Menu keys will be blocked during active operations except for Escape and tool shortcuts. Story advances on Enter, Space, or click; Tab skips it. A hold-to-fast-forward feature will advance every 80ms after 0.4s. The dev screen will list safe jump buttons grouped by page.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-22a03c9a-1527-4f43-b5df-87d36b8f8103-54","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/sim.js","offset":560,"limit":70}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2396,"output_tokens":680,"cache_read_input_tokens":127360,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"7fd5669b-c8e3-4bfd-9894-250efd293ba6"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-22a03c9a-1527-4f43-b5df-87d36b8f8103-54","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"560→          kind: 'feeder', site: e.site, parent: e.id,\\n          at: [e.x + Math.cos((i / 4) * Math.PI * 2) * 0.28, e.y + Math.sin((i / 4) * Math.PI * 2) * 0.16],\\n          hp: 40,\\n        });\\n        child.parent = e.id;\\n      }\\n      e.armed = true;\\n    }\\n    if (e.kind === 'coda') {\\n      this.spawn({ kind: 'baton', site: e.site, parent: e.id, at: [e.x - 0.28, e.y + 0.05], hp: 9 });\\n570→      this.spawn({ kind: 'baton', site: e.site, parent: e.id, at: [e.x + 0.28, e.y + 0.05], hp: 9 });\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  hurt(amount, why) {\\n    if (this.cheats.lockVitals || this.noFail || this.lockFail) return;\\n    if (this.arrest?.holdVitals) {\\n      this.vitals = 15;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n580→    let d = amount * this.tuning.drainMult * this.mods.drain * (this.notes ? 0.7 : 1);\\n    const timed = why === 'bleed' || why === 'scratch' || why === 'spore' || why === 'tremolo' || why === 'crescendo' || why === 'overflow';\\n    if (timed) d *= this.drainScale();\\n    if (!d) return;\\n    this.vitals -= d;\\n    if (this.vitals < this.vitalsMin) this.vitalsMin = this.vitals;\\n    if (this.vitals <= 30 && this.vitals > 0) this.bark(this.vitals <= 15 ? 'vitalsCritical' : 'vitalsLow');\\n    if (why === 'bleed' || why === 'overflow') this.bark('bleeding');\\n  }\\n\\n590→  applyVitalsBounds() {\\n    if (!this.arrest?.holdVitals && this.vitals < this.vitalsMin) this.vitalsMin = this.vitals;\\n    if (this.over) return;\\n    if (!this.noFail && !this.lockFail && !this.cheats.lockVitals && this.vitals <= 0) {\\n      this.vitals = 0;\\n      this.fail('vitals');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (!this.noFail && !this.lockFail && !this.noTimer && this.timer <= 0) {\\n      this.timer = 0;\\n600→      this.fail('time');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (!this.noFail && !this.lockFail && this.misses >= this.missLimit) {\\n      this.fail('miss');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.vitals > 100) this.vitals = 100;\\n    if (this.vitals < 0) this.vitals = 0;\\n  }\\n610→\\n  fail(reason) {\\n    if (this.over || this.noFail || this.lockFail) return;\\n    this.over = true;\\n    this.failed = reason;\\n    this.complete = false;\\n    const id = this.phase?.id || '';\\n    this.failCount[id] = (this.failCount[id] || 0) + 1;\\n    this.notesOffer = this.failCount[id] >= 2;\\n    this.bark('fail');\\n620→    this.events.push({ type: 'fail', reason, notes: this.notesOffer });\\n  }\\n\\n  succeed() {\\n    if (this.over) return;\\n    const left = Math.max(0, this.timer);\\n    const bonus = (this.vitals * 20 + left * 5 + (this.misses === 0 ? 1500 : 0)) * this.mods.score;\\n    this.score += Math.round(bonus);\\n    this.over = true;\\n    this.complete = true;\",\"content_concise\":\"560→          kind: 'feeder', site: e.site, parent: e.id,\\n          at: [e.x + Math.cos((i / 4) * Math.PI * 2) * 0.28, e.y + Math.sin((i / 4) * Math.PI * 2) * 0.16],\\n          hp: 40,\\n        });\\n        child.parent = e.id;\\n      }\\n      e.armed = true;\\n    }\\n    if (e.kind === 'coda') {\\n      this.spawn({ kind: 'baton', site: e.site, parent: e.id, at: [e.x - 0.28, e.y + 0.05], hp: 9 });\\n570→      this.spawn({ kind: 'baton', site: e.site, parent: e.id, at: [e.x + 0.28, e.y + 0.05], hp: 9 });\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  hurt(amount, why) {\\n    if (this.cheats.lockVitals || this.noFail || this.lockFail) return;\\n    if (this.arrest?.holdVitals) {\\n      this.vitals = 15;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n580→    let d = amount * this.tuning.drainMult * this.mods.drain * (this.notes ? 0.7 : 1);\\n    const timed = why === 'bleed' || why === 'scratch' || why === 'spore' || why === 'tremolo' || why === 'crescendo' || why === 'overflow';\\n    if (timed) d *= this.drainScale();\\n    if (!d) return;\\n    this.vitals -= d;\\n    if (