{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_473","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The simulation barely uses random number generation beyond storing it.\n\nThe RNG setup is safe. I'll write the story patches and remaining files now. The organ geometry will be 64 by 40 segments to keep the launch screenshot fast under software WebGPU.\n\nShadow maps will be 1024. Particles will use an instanced quad mesh with dummy normals. A single `fieldToWorld` helper will map field coordinates to world space for every mesh.\n\nCamera position and target are set so the organ plane at y=0 is clearly visible. The drape will use a THREE.Shape with an elliptical hole to create the ring look.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-090fb964-1445-4686-b71f-12b9a9e6efd8-66","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"TODO|FIXME|placeholder|stub","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-090fb964-1445-4686-b71f-12b9a9e6efd8-67","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"Math\\.random","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-090fb964-1445-4686-b71f-12b9a9e6efd8-68","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"Derek|Angie|Naomi|Caduceus|Delphi|GUILT|Kyriaki|Healing Touch|Hope Hospital","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":187,"output_tokens":929,"cache_read_input_tokens":139264,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"b3d5e338-4b83-4