{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_475","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Gel rectangle corners are being calculated.\n\nLegato is inside the bounds. Path points will be lint-checked before any data changes. A comprehensive simulation test file is being written. GR snapshots will be captured by stepping play in chunks or wrapping.\n\nplay() offers no hook, so the simulation will be stepped manually in chunks to measure state between frames. Step counts for all modes are being tallied to estimate total runtime.\n\nIdle mode step counts are being tallied. The LP test will run 5000 frames to verify the noFail flag prevents failure. Total step estimates for normal, sloppy, and idle modes are roughly 116k, 125k, and 126k.\n\nThe full suite totals roughly 370,000 steps. The simulation will run in parallel using Node worker threads to utilize all 32 cores. Each operation will run in its own worker, with failures collected by the main process. Determinism and lint checks will remain in the main thread. Snapshots will be captured during the GR4 worker.\n\nWorkers will import the simulation via relative paths. The worker code will be written inline in a dedicated file. A random number generator comment needs fixing. PLAN.md deviations will be appended at the end. PROGRESS.md will be updated later. Files will be written in large batches, with the director being the longest.\n\nTests must not hardcode the title string in src/; they can import GAME_TITLE from identity.js instead. The about.json description should also omit the title, since that file is a source asset and the screen will display the title separately.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-460e0667-e604-4f1f-a7e1-731e6465bac9-70","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"Alive in Common Time","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_