{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_489","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The showsCard flag is set to true when the game connects with card:true and sends a ready signal.\n\nThe Enter handler will use window capture to fire before focused buttons intercept it. This prevents double answers when a button is active. Now writing the code.\n\nOrgan geometry will be 72 by 48. A simple ECG canvas will go in the HUD. The simulation test and game will be written in parallel. All banned teaching terms are already covered by the existing union of teaches.\n\nA speaker set will be defined from the eight named characters. The simulation test will verify specific must-have story strings, including lines about thirty-one years in the room, simulator experience, and the art of being wrong slowly enough to fix it.\n\nThe simulation test will also verify these additional must-have story strings: the heartbeat skip, the recombining endoparasite, the eulogy diagnosis, and the reference to Augustin.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ea6d9430-f7b3-473b-9bdd-cce6c1501789-84","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"He's a patient|She.s a patient|I have heard of that once|Everything went quiet|Tumors do not keep time|Please wash your hands|who WRITES|Bravo, Doctor|Your hands are excellent|cannot turn it off|He waits for the silence|For Augustin|I handed her the knife|Ms\\. Okonkwo|You cannot operate|hand me the instruments|You held the forceps|Let her go|Good hands","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/data/story/scenes.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1066,"output_tokens":899,"cache_read_input_tokens":155392,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"3c29b2f5-7e31-4468-a8b9-5c892d9f28a1"}
