ht\\\": \\\"^1.63.0\\\",\\n    \\\"three\\\": \\\"^0.180.0\\\"\\n  }\\n20→}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/package.json\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"{\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"alive-in-common-time\\\",\\n  \\\"private\\\": true,\\n  \\\"type\\\": \\\"module\\\",\\n  \\\"scripts\\\": {\\n    \\\"build\\\": \\\"node tools/build.mjs\\\",\\n    \\\"test\\\": \\\"node tests/run-all.mjs\\\",\\n    \\\"test:sim\\\": \\\"node tests/run-all.mjs sim\\\",\\n    \\\"test:browser\\\": \\\"node tests/run-all.mjs browser\\\",\\n    \\\"test:hub\\\": \\\"node tests/run-all.mjs hub\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"dependencies\\\": {\\n    \\\"@dimforge/rapier3d-compat\\\": \\\"^0.19.3\\\",\\n    \\\"@fontsource/bangers\\\": \\\"^5.3.0\\\",\\n    \\\"@fontsource/barlow-condensed\\\": \\\"^5.3.0\\\",\\n    \\\"esbuild\\\": \\\"^0.28.2\\\",\\n    \\\"playwright\\\": \\\"^1.63.0\\\",\\n    \\\"three\\\": \\\"^0.180.0\\\"\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":20}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-c5b95171-63e2-4ea7-8e40-f38727c5e4f1-7","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→# Progress\\n\\nTitle was chosen with `crypto.randomInt` from 50 candidates and stored only in `src/config/identity.js` inside the dev folder. No other source file may contain that string.\\n\\n## Done\\n\\n- Dev folder scaffold, package, vendored AI Hub session client 1.4.0 (hash matches RELEASES), harness files.\\n\\n## Now\\n10→\\n- Headless operation sim, operation data, bot, and sim tests.\\n\\n## Next\\n\\n- Three.js view, audio, shell, couch and hub session, then the hand-in files.\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→# Progress\\n\\nTitle was chosen with `crypto.randomInt` from 50 candidates and stored only in `src/config/identity.js` inside the dev folder. No other source file may contain that string.\\n\\n## Done\\n\\n- Dev folder scaffold, package, vendored AI Hub session client 1.4.0 (hash matches RELEASES), harness files.\\n\\n## Now\\n10→\\n- Headless operation sim, operation data, bot, and sim tests.\\n\\n## Next\\n\\n- Three.js view, audio, shell, couch and hub session, then the hand-in files.\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/PROGRESS.md\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"# Progress\\n\\nTitle was chosen with `crypto.randomInt` from 50 candidates and stored only in `src/config/identity.js` inside the dev folder. No other source file may contain that string.\\n\\n## Done\\n\\n- Dev folder scaffold, package, vendored AI Hub session client 1.4.0 (hash matches RELEASES), harness files.\\n\\n## Now\\n\\n- Headless operation sim, operation data, bot, and sim tests.\\n\\n## Next\\n\\n- Three.js view, audio, shell, couch and hub session, then the hand-in files.\\n\",\"total_lines\":15}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"950209f3-0ccb-469f-9c2e-cb1624e3c9f1"}
