rkKey(e);\\n    if (['Space', 'ArrowUp', 'ArrowDown', 'ArrowLeft', 'ArrowRight', ' '].includes(e.key) || e.code === 'Space') e.preventDefault();\\n    game.onKey?.(e);\\n  });\\n  window.addEventListener('keyup', markKey);\\n\\n  window.addEventListener('pointermove', (e) => {\\n    const dx = e.clientX - pointer.x;\\n    const dy = e.clientY - pointer.y;\\n    pointer.x = e.clientX;\\n    pointer.y = e.clientY;\\n    pointer.moved += Math.hypot(dx, dy);\\n    if (pointer.moved > 4) {\\n      device = 'mouse';\\n      pointer.moved = 4;\\n    }\\n    const item = e.target?.closest?.('[data-item]');\\n    pointer.hover = item ? item.dataset.item : null;\\n    if (pointer.hover) game.onHover?.(pointer.hover);\\n  });\\n  window.addEventListener('pointerdown', (e) => {\\n    device = 'mouse';\\n    pointer.down = true;\\n    pointer.button = e.button;\\n    pointer.x = e.clientX;\\n    pointer.y = e.clientY;\\n    game.audio?.resume?.();\\n  });\\n  window.addEventListener('pointerup', (e) => {\\n    pointer.down = false;\\n    const item = e.target?.closest?.('[data-item]');\\n    if (item) {\\n      pointer.clicked = item.dataset.item;\\n      game.onActivate?.(item.dataset.item);\\n    }\\n    const tool = e.target?.closest?.('[data-tool]');\\n    if (tool) game.onTool?.(tool.dataset.tool);\\n  });\\n  window.addEventListener('contextmenu', (e) => e.preventDefault());\\n  window.addEventListener('wheel', (e) => {\\n    if (game.screen === 'Operation') {\\n      const dir = e.deltaY > 0 ? 1 : -1;\\n      const i = WHEEL.indexOf(wheelPick);\\n      wheelPick = WHEEL[(i + dir + WHEEL.length) % WHEEL.length];\\n      game.onTool?.(wheelPick);\\n    }\\n  }, { passive: true });\\n\\n  function down(...names) {\\n    return names.some((n) => keys.has(n));\\n  }\\n\\n  function readPad(index) {\\n    const pads = navigator.getGamepads ? navigator.getGamepads() : [];\\n    const pad = pads[index];\\n    if (!pad || pad.mapping !== 'standard') return null;\\n    const b = (i) => pad.buttons[i] || { pressed: false, value: 0 };\\n    const axes = pad.axes || [0, 0, 0, 0];\\n    const active = b(0).pressed || b(1).pressed || b(7).value > 0.1 || Math.hypot(axes[2] || 0, axes[3] || 0) > DEAD || Math.hypot(axes[0] || 0, axes[1] || 0) > DEAD;\\n    if (active) {\\n      device = 'pad';\\n      seenPad = true;\\n    }\\n    return { pad, b, axes };\\n  }\\n\\n  function frameFromPad(index, settings) {\\n    const got = readPad(index);\\n    if (!got) return null;\\n    const { b, axes } = got;\\n    const swap = !!settings.swapSticks;\\n    const aimX = swap ? axes[0] : axes[2];\\n    const aimY = swap ? axes[1] : axes[3];\\n    const toolX = swap ? axes[2] : axes[0];\\n    const toolY = swap ? axes[3] : axes[1];\\n    const frame = emptyFrame();\\n    frame.source = 'stick';\\n    frame.x = aimX || 0;\\n    frame.y = -(aimY || 0);\\n    frame.use = Math.max(b(7).value || 0, b(0).pressed ? 1 : 0);\\n    frame.steady = b(6).pressed || b(6).value > 0.4;\\n    frame.alt = b(1).pressed;\\n    frame.syringe = b(2).pressed || b(14).pressed;\\n    frame.special = b(3).pressed || b(12).pressed;\\n    frame.swap = b(15).pressed;\\n    if (b(4).pressed) frame.siteDelta = -1;\\n    if (b(5).pressed) frame.siteDelta = 1;\\n    const picked = toolFromStick(toolX || 0, -(toolY || 0), wheelPick);\\n    if (Math.hypot(toolX || 0, toolY || 0) > 0.6) {\\n      wheelPick = picked;\\n      frame.tool = picked;\\n    }\\n    const prev = prevPad[index] || {};\\n    const edges = {\\n      confirm: b(0).pressed && !prev.confirm,\\n      back: b(1).pressed && !prev.back,\\n      pause: b(9).pressed && !prev.pause && !b(8).pressed,\\n      special: b(3).pressed && !prev.special,\\n      pageLeft: b(4).pressed && !prev.l1,\\n      pageRight: b(5).pressed && !prev.r1,\\n      create: b(8).pressed,\\n    };\\n    prevPad[index] = { confirm: b(0).pressed, back: b(1).pressed, pause: b(9).pressed, special: b(3).pressed, l1: b(4).pressed, r1: b(5).pressed };\\n    if (settings.rumble && got.pad.vibrationActuator && b(7).value > 0.8) {\\n      try { got.pad.vibrationActuator.playEffect('dual-rumble', { duration: 40, strongMagnitude: 0.2, weakMagnitude: 0.3 }); } catch { /* actuator missing */ }\\n    }\\n    return { frame, edges };\\n  }\\n\\n  function keyboardFrame(settings) {\\n    const frame = emptyFrame();\\n    const mouseAim = device === 'mouse' && game.view?.pointerToField;\\n    if (mouseAim && game.screen === 'Operation') {\\n      const p = game.view.pointerToField(pointer.x, pointer.y);\\n      frame.source = 'abs';\\n      frame.x = p.x;\\n      frame.y = p.y;\\n      frame.use = pointer.down && pointer.button === 0 ? 1 : 0;\\n      frame.alt = pointer.button === 2 && pointer.down;\\n    } else {\\n      let x = 0;\\n      let y = 0;\\n      if (down('KeyA', 'a', 'ArrowLeft')) x -= 1;\\n      if (down('KeyD', 'd', 'ArrowRight')) x += 1;\\n      if (down('KeyW', 'w', 'ArrowUp')) y += 1;\\n      if (down('KeyS', 's', 'ArrowDown')) y -= 1;\\n      frame.source = 'stick';\\n      frame.x = x;\\n      frame.y = y;\\n      frame.use = down('KeyJ', 'j', 'Enter') ? 1 : 0;\\n    }\\n    frame.steady = down('ShiftLeft', 'ShiftRight', 'Shift');\\n    frame.syringe = down('KeyF', 'f');\\n    frame.special = down('Space', ' ');\\n    frame.swap = down('KeyR', 'r');\\n    if (down('KeyQ', 'q')) frame.siteDelta = -1;\\n    if (down('KeyE', 'e')) frame.siteDelta = 1;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) {\\n      if (down(`Digit${i + 1}`, String(i + 1))) {\\n        wheelPick = WHEEL[i];\\n        frame.tool = WHEEL[i];\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (down('KeyC', 'c')) {\\n      frame.source = 'abs';\\n      frame.x = -1.05;\\n      frame.y = 0.62;\\n    }\\n    void settings;\\n    return frame;\\n  }\\n\\n  function menuEdges() {\\n    return {\\n      up: down('ArrowUp', 'KeyW', 'w'),\\n      down: down('ArrowDown', 'KeyS', 's'),\\n      left: down('ArrowLeft', 'KeyA', 'a'),\\n      right: down('ArrowRight', 'KeyD', 'd'),\\n      confirm: down('Enter', 'Space', ' '),\\n      back: down('Escape', 'Backspace'),\\n      skip: down('Tab'),\\n      pageLeft: down('KeyQ', 'q'),\\n      pageRight: down('KeyE', 'e'),\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  let menuLatch = {};\\n  function risingMenu() {\\n    const now = menuEdges();\\n    const edge = {};\\n    for (const k of Object.keys(now)) edge[k] = now[k] && !menuLatch[k];\\n    menuLatch = now;\\n    return edge;\\n\",\"total_lines\":240}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-124a1919-4da2-4809-8db2-e64b96c14500-18","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→import { scheduleTrack, TRACK_IDS } from './music.js';\\nimport { scheduleEffect, EFFECT_IDS } from './sfx.js';\\nimport { scheduleVoice, VOICE_IDS } from './voice.js';\\n\\nexport { TRACK_IDS, EFFECT_IDS, VOICE_IDS, scheduleTrack, scheduleEffect, scheduleVoice };\\n\\nexport function createAudio() {\\n  const AC = globalThis.AudioContext || globalThis.webkitAudioContext;\\n  const ctx = AC ? new AC() : null;\\n10→  const master = ctx ? ctx.createGain() : { gain: { value: 1 } };\\n  const music = ctx ? ctx.createGain() : { gain: { value: 0.1 } };\\n  const sfx = ctx ? ctx.createGain() : { gain: { value: 0.8 } };\\n  const voice = ctx ? ctx.createGain() : { gain: { value: 0.8 } };\\n  const hush = ctx ? ctx.createBiquadFilter() : null;\\n  music.gain.value = 0.1;\\n  sfx.gain.value = 0.8;\\n  voice.gain.value = 0.8;\\n  if (ctx) {\\n    hush.type = 'lowpass';\\n20→    hush.frequency.value = 18000;\\n    const comp = ctx.createDynamicsCompressor();\\n    comp.threshold.value = -12;\\n    comp.knee.value = 8;\\n    comp.ratio.value = 2.5;\\n    music.connect(hush);\\n    hush.connect(master);\\n    sfx.connect(master);\\n    voice.connect(master);\\n    master.connect(comp);\\n30→    comp.connect(ctx.destination);\\n  }\\n  let current = null;\\n  let unlocked = ctx ? ctx.state === 'running' : false;\\n\\n  function resume() {\\n    if (!ctx) return;\\n    if (ctx.state !== 'running') ctx.resume();\\n    unlocked = ctx.state === 'running';\\n  }\\n40→\\n  function playTrack(id, bpm) {\\n    if (!ctx) return;\\n    stopMusic();\\n    const specBpm = bpm || 80;\\n    current = { id, next: ctx.currentTime + 0.05, bpm: specBpm };\\n    scheduleAhead();\\n  }\\n\\n  function scheduleAhead() {\\n50→    if (!ctx || !current) return;\\n    const horizon = ctx.currentTime + 0.12;\\n    while (current.next < horizon) {\\n      scheduleTrack(ctx, music, current.id, current.next, 60 / current.bpm);\\n      current.next += 60 / current.bpm;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function stopMusic() {\\n    current = null;\\n60→  }\\n\\n  function effect(id) {\\n    if (!ctx) return;\\n    scheduleEffect(ctx, sfx, id, ctx.currentTime);\\n  }\\n\\n  function say(who, text) {\\n    if (!ctx || !text) return 0;\\n    return scheduleVoice(ctx, voice, who, text, ctx.currentTime);\\n70→  }\\n\\n  function setHush(on) {\\n    if (!hush || !ctx) return;\\n    hush.frequency.setTargetAtTime(on ? 300 : 18000, ctx.currentTime, 0.08);\\n  }\\n\\n  function setMusicGain(v) {\\n    music.gain.value = v;\\n  }\\n80→\\n  async function renderOffline(kind, id, text) {\\n    const OAC = globalThis.OfflineAudioContext;\\n    if (!OAC) return 0;\\n    const off = new OAC(1, 44100, 44100);\\n    const bus = off.createGain();\\n    bus.connect(off.destination);\\n    if (kind === 'music') scheduleTrack(off, bus, id, 0, 1);\\n    else if (kind === 'effect') scheduleEffect(off, bus, id, 0.05);\\n    else scheduleVoice(off, bus, id, text || 'Count with me, Doctor.', 0.02);\\n90→    const buf = await off.startRendering();\\n    const data = buf.getChannelData(0);\\n    let peak = 0;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < data.length; i += 8) peak = Math.max(peak, Math.abs(data[i]));\\n    return peak;\\n  }\\n\\n  return {\\n    ctx, music, sfx, voice, master,\\n    get unlocked() { return unlocked || (ctx && ctx.state === 'running'); },\\n100→    resume, playTrack, scheduleAhead, stopMusic, effect, say, setHush, setMusicGain, renderOffline,\\n  };\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→import { scheduleTrack, TRACK_IDS } from './music.js';\\nimport { scheduleEffect, EFFECT_IDS } from './sfx.js';\\nimport { scheduleVoice, VOICE_IDS } from './voice.js';\\n\\nexport { TRACK_IDS, EFFECT_IDS, VOICE_IDS, scheduleTrack, scheduleEffect, scheduleVoice };\\n\\nexport function createAudio() {\\n  const AC = globalThis.AudioContext || globalThis.webkitAudioContext;\\n  const ctx = AC ? new AC() : null;\\n10→  const master = ctx ? ctx.createGain() : { gain: { value: 1 } };\\n  const music = ctx ? ctx.createGain() : { gain: { value: 0.1 } };\\n  const sfx = ctx ? ctx.createGain() : { gain: { value: 0.8 } };\\n  const voice = ctx ? ctx.createGain() : { gain: { value: 0.8 } };\\n  const hush = ctx ? ctx.createBiquadFilter() : null;\\n  music.gain.value = 0.1;\\n  sfx.gain.value = 0.8;\\n  voice.gain.value = 0.8;\\n  if (ctx) {\\n    hush.type = 'lowpass';\\n20→    hush.frequency.value = 18000;\\n    const comp = ctx.createDynamicsCompressor();\\n    comp.threshold.value = -12;\\n    comp.knee.value = 8;\\n    comp.ratio.value = 2.5;\\n    music.connect(hush);\\n    hush.connect(master);\\n    sfx.connect(master);\\n    voice.connect(master);\\n    master.connect(comp);\\n30→    comp.connect(ctx.destination);\\n  }\\n  let current = null;\\n  let unlocked = ctx ? ctx.state === 'running' : false;\\n\\n  function resume() {\\n    if (!ctx) return;\\n    if (ctx.state !== 'running') ctx.resume();\\n    unlocked = ctx.state === 'running';\\n  }\\n40→\\n  function playTrack(id, bpm) {\\n    if (!ctx) return;\\n    stopMusic();\\n    const specBpm = bpm || 80;\\n    current = { id, next: ctx.currentTime + 0.05, bpm: specBpm };\\n    scheduleAhead();\\n  }\\n\\n  function scheduleAhead() {\\n50→    if (!ctx || !current) return;\\n    const horizon = ctx.currentTime + 0.12;\\n    while (current.next < horizon) {\\n      scheduleTrack(ctx, music, current.id, current.next, 60 / current.bpm);\\n      current.next += 60 / current.bpm;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function stopMusic() {\\n    current = null;\\n60→  }\\n\\n  function effect(id) {\\n    if (!ctx) return;\\n    scheduleEffect(ctx, sfx, id, ctx.currentTime);\\n  }\\n\\n  function say(who, text) {\\n    if (!ctx || !text) return 0;\\n    return scheduleVoice(ctx, voice, who, text, ctx.currentTime);\\n70→  }\\n\\n  function setHush(on) {\\n    if (!hush || !ctx) return;\\n    hush.frequency.setTargetAtTime(on ? 300 : 18000, ctx.currentTime, 0.08);\\n  }\\n\\n  function setMusicGain(v) {\\n    music.gain.value = v;\\n  }\\n80→\\n  async function renderOffline(kind, id, text) {\\n    const OAC = globalThis.OfflineAudioContext;\\n    if (!OAC) return 0;\\n    const off = new OAC(1, 44100, 44100);\\n    const bus = off.createGain();\\n    bus.connect(off.destination);\\n    if (kind === 'music') scheduleTrack(off, bus, id, 0, 1);\\n    else if (kind === 'effect') scheduleEffect(off, bus, id, 0.05);\\n    else scheduleVoice(off, bus, id, text || 'Count with me, Doctor.', 0.02);\\n90→    const buf = await off.startRendering();\\n    const data = buf.getChannelData(0);\\n    let peak = 0;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < data.length; i += 8) peak = Math.max(peak, Math.abs(data[i]));\\n    return peak;\\n  }\\n\\n  return {\\n    ctx, music, sfx, voice, master,\\n    get unlocked() { return unlocked || (ctx && ctx.state === 'running'); },\\n100→    resume, playTrack, scheduleAhead, stopMusic, effect, say, setHush, setMusicGain, renderOffline,\\n  };\\n}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/audio/engine.js\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":120,\"raw_output\":\"import { scheduleTrack, TRACK_IDS } from './music.js';\\nimport { scheduleEffect, EFFECT_IDS } from './sfx.js';\\nimport { scheduleVoice, VOICE_IDS } from './voice.js';\\n\\nexport { TRACK_IDS, EFFECT_IDS, VOICE_IDS, scheduleTrack, scheduleEffect, scheduleVoice };\\n\\nexport function createAudio() {\\n  const AC = globalThis.AudioContext || globalThis.webkitAudioContext;\\n  const ctx = AC ? new AC() : null;\\n  const master = ctx ? ctx.createGain() : { gain: { value: 1 } };\\n  const music = ctx ? ctx.createGain() : { gain: { value: 0.1 } };\\n  const sfx = ctx ? ctx.createGain() : { gain: { value: 0.8 } };\\n  const voice = ctx ? ctx.createGain() : { gain: { value: 0.8 } };\\n  const hush = ctx ? ctx.createBiquadFilter() : null;\\n  music.gain.value = 0.1;\\n  sfx.gain.value = 0.8;\\n  voice.gain.value = 0.8;\\n  if (ctx) {\\n    hush.type = 'lowpass';\\n    hush.frequency.value = 18000;\\n    const comp = ctx.createDynamicsCompressor();\\n    comp.threshold.value = -12;\\n    comp.knee.value = 8;\\n    comp.ratio.value = 2.5;\\n    music.connect(hush);\\n    hush.connect(master);\\n    sfx.connect(master);\\n    voice.connect(master);\\n    master.connect(comp);\\n    comp.connect(ctx.destination);\\n  }\\n  let current = null;\\n  let unlocked = ctx ? ctx.state === 'running' : false;\\n\\n  function resume() {\\n    if (!ctx) return;\\n    if (ctx.state !== 'running') ctx.resume();\\n    unlocked = ctx.state === 'running';\\n  }\\n\\n  function playTrack(id, bpm) {\\n    if (!ctx) return;\\n    stopMusic();\\n    const specBpm = bpm || 80;\\n    current = { id, next: ctx.currentTime + 0.05, bpm: specBpm };\\n    scheduleAhead();\\n  }\\n\\n  function scheduleAhead() {\\n    if (!ctx || !current) return;\\n    const horizon = ctx.currentTime + 0.12;\\n    while (current.next < horizon) {\\n      scheduleTrack(ctx, music, current.id, current.next, 60 / current.bpm);\\n      current.next += 60 / current.bpm;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function stopMusic() {\\n    current = null;\\n  }\\n\\n  function effect(id) {\\n    if (!ctx) return;\\n    scheduleEffect(ctx, sfx, id, ctx.currentTime);\\n  }\\n\\n  function say(who, text) {\\n    if (!ctx || !text) return 0;\\n    return scheduleVoice(ctx, voice, who, text, ctx.currentTime);\\n  }\\n\\n  function setHush(on) {\\n    if (!hush || !ctx) return;\\n    hush.frequency.setTargetAtTime(on ? 300 : 18000, ctx.currentTime, 0.08);\\n  }\\n\\n  function setMusicGain(v) {\\n    music.gain.value = v;\\n  }\\n\\n  async function renderOffline(kind, id, text) {\\n    const OAC = globalThis.OfflineAudioContext;\\n    if (!OAC) return 0;\\n    const off = new OAC(1, 44100, 44100);\\n    const bus = off.createGain();\\n    bus.connect(off.destination);\\n    if (kind === 'music') scheduleTrack(off, bus, id, 0, 1);\\n    else if (kind === 'effect') scheduleEffect(off, bus, id, 0.05);\\n    else scheduleVoice(off, bus, id, text || 'Count with me, Doctor.', 0.02);\\n    const buf = await off.startRendering();\\n    const data = buf.getChannelData(0);\\n    let peak = 0;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < data.length; i += 8) peak = Math.max(peak, Math.abs(data[i]));\\n    return peak;\\n  }\\n\\n  return {\\n    ctx, music, sfx, voice, master,\\n    get unlocked() { return unlocked || (ctx && ctx.state === 'running'); },\\n    resume, playTrack, scheduleAhead, stopMusic, effect, say, setHush, setMusicGain, renderOffline,\\n  };\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":102}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-124a1919-4da2-4809-8db2-e64b96c14500-19","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/** Live tuning. Sliders mutate the object the sim reads every step. */\\nexport const TUNING_DEFAULTS = Object.freeze({\\n  tipSpeed: 1.9,\\n  stickCurve: 1.7,\\n  aimAssist: 0.35,\\n  steadyFactor: 0.4,\\n  scalpelTol: 0.055,\\n  pullTol: 1.6,\\n  suctionRate: 1.0,\\n10→  gelRadius: 0.16,\\n  stitchGateR: 0.07,\\n  laserDps: 30,\\n  laserBurn: 2,\\n  scannerRadius: 0.3,\\n  clampWindow: 0.18,\\n  defibWindow: 0.30,\\n  drainMult: 1,\\n  timerMult: 1,\\n  tempoPressure: 60,\\n20→  stabilizerHeal: 15,\\n  stabilizerCooldown: 3,\\n  missLimit: 8,\\n  strainHpMult: 1,\\n  strainSpeedMult: 1,\\n  spawnRateMult: 1,\\n  composureGain: 1,\\n  hushDuration: 7,\\n  hushTimeScale: 0.25,\\n  sforzandoStun: 3,\\n30→  sforzandoDamage: 0.25,\\n  sforzandoToolMult: 2,\\n  sforzandoDuration: 6,\\n});\\n\\nexport const TUNING_RANGES = Object.freeze({\\n  tipSpeed: [0.8, 3.5],\\n  stickCurve: [1, 3],\\n  aimAssist: [0, 1],\\n  steadyFactor: [0.2, 0.8],\\n40→  scalpelTol: [0.02, 0.12],\\n  pullTol: [0.6, 3],\\n  suctionRate: [0.3, 3],\\n  gelRadius: [0.08, 0.3],\\n  stitchGateR: [0.03, 0.15],\\n  laserDps: [10, 80],\\n  laserBurn: [0, 6],\\n  scannerRadius: [0.15, 0.5],\\n  clampWindow: [0.06, 0.4],\\n  defibWindow: [0.1, 0.6],\\n50→  drainMult: [0, 3],\\n  timerMult: [0.5, 2],\\n  tempoPressure: [0, 120],\\n  stabilizerHeal: [5, 30],\\n  stabilizerCooldown: [0.5, 8],\\n  missLimit: [3, 20],\\n  strainHpMult: [0.3, 3],\\n  strainSpeedMult: [0.3, 2.5],\\n  spawnRateMult: [0.3, 2.5],\\n  composureGain: [0.2, 3],\\n60→  hushDuration: [2, 15],\\n  hushTimeScale: [0.05, 0.7],\\n  sforzandoStun: [1, 6],\\n  sforzandoDamage: [0.05, 0.6],\\n  sforzandoToolMult: [1.2, 4],\\n  sforzandoDuration: [2, 12],\\n});\\n\\nexport const TUNING_PAGES = Object.freeze([\\n  { id: 'hands', label: 'Hands', keys: ['tipSpeed', 'stickCurve', 'aimAssist', 'steadyFactor'] },\\n70→  { id: 'tools', label: 'Tools', keys: ['scalpelTol', 'pullTol', 'suctionRate', 'gelRadius', 'stitchGateR', 'laserDps', 'laserBurn', 'scannerRadius', 'clampWindow', 'defibWindow'] },\\n  { id: 'patient', label: 'Patient', keys: ['drainMult', 'timerMult', 'tempoPressure', 'stabilizerHeal', 'stabilizerCooldown', 'missLimit'] },\\n  { id: 'strains', label: 'Strains', keys: ['strainHpMult', 'strainSpeedMult', 'spawnRateMult'] },\\n  { id: 'gifts', label: 'Gifts', keys: ['composureGain', 'hushDuration', 'hushTimeScale', 'sforzandoStun', 'sforzandoDamage', 'sforzandoToolMult', 'sforzandoDuration'] },\\n]);\\n\\nexport function createTuning(over) {\\n  return { ...TUNING_DEFAULTS, ...over };\\n}\\n\\n80→/** Copy defaults back onto a live object so holders of the reference see the reset. */\\nexport function resetTuning(live, keys) {\\n  const list = keys ?? Object.keys(TUNING_DEFAULTS);\\n  for (const k of list) live[k] = TUNING_DEFAULTS[k];\\n  return live;\\n}\\n\\nexport const DIFFICULTY = Object.freeze({\\n  intern: { id: 'intern', label: 'Intern', drains: 0.6, timers: 1.4, tol: 1.4, miss: 12, hp: 0.85 },\\n  resident: { id: 'resident', label: 'Resident', drains: 1, timers: 1, tol: 1, miss: 8, hp: 1 },\\n90→  attending: { id: 'attending', label: 'Attending', drains: 1.35, timers: 0.85, tol: 0.8, miss: 5, hp: 1.2 },\\n});\\n\\nexport function resolveDifficulty(id) {\\n  if (id === 'easy') return DIFFICULTY.intern;\\n  if (id === 'normal' || !id) return DIFFICULTY.resident;\\n  if (id === 'hard') return DIFFICULTY.attending;\\n  return DIFFICULTY[id] ?? DIFFICULTY.resident;\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/** Live tuning. Sliders mutate the object the sim reads every step. */\\nexport const TUNING_DEFAULTS = Object.freeze({\\n  tipSpeed: 1.9,\\n  stickCurve: 1.7,\\n  aimAssist: 0.35,\\n  steadyFactor: 0.4,\\n  scalpelTol: 0.055,\\n  pullTol: 1.6,\\n  suctionRate: 1.0,\\n10→  gelRadius: 0.16,\\n  stitchGateR: 0.07,\\n  laserDps: 30,\\n  laserBurn: 2,\\n  scannerRadius: 0.3,\\n  clampWindow: 0.18,\\n  defibWindow: 0.30,\\n  drainMult: 1,\\n  timerMult: 1,\\n  tempoPressure: 60,\\n20→  stabilizerHeal: 15,\\n  stabilizerCooldown: 3,\\n  missLimit: 8,\\n  strainHpMult: 1,\\n  strainSpeedMult: 1,\\n  spawnRateMult: 1,\\n  composureGain: 1,\\n  hushDuration: 7,\\n  hushTimeScale: 0.25,\\n  sforzandoStun: 3,\\n30→  sforzandoDamage: 0.25,\\n  sforzandoToolMult: 2,\\n  sforzandoDuration: 6,\\n});\\n\\nexport const TUNING_RANGES = Object.freeze({\\n  tipSpeed: [0.8, 3.5],\\n  stickCurve: [1, 3],\\n  aimAssist: [0, 1],\\n  steadyFactor: [0.2, 0.8],\\n40→  scalpelTol: [0.02, 0.12],\\n  pullTol: [0.6, 3],\\n  suctionRate: [0.3, 3],\\n  gelRadius: [0.08, 0.3],\\n  stitchGateR: [0.03, 0.15],\\n  laserDps: [10, 80],\\n  laserBurn: [0, 6],\\n  scannerRadius: [0.15, 0.5],\\n  clampWindow: [0.06, 0.4],\\n  defibWindow: [0.1, 0.6],\\n50→  drainMult: [0, 3],\\n  timerMult: [0.5, 2],\\n  tempoPressure: [0, 120],\\n  stabilizerHeal: [5, 30],\\n  stabilizerCooldown: [0.5, 8],\\n  missLimit: [3, 20],\\n  strainHpMult: [0.3, 3],\\n  strainSpeedMult: [0.3, 2.5],\\n  spawnRateMult: [0.3, 2.5],\\n  composureGain: [0.2, 3],\\n60→  hushDuration: [2, 15],\\n  hushTimeScale: [0.05, 0.7],\\n  sforzandoStun: [1, 6],\\n  sforzandoDamage: [0.05, 0.6],\\n  sforzandoToolMult: [1.2, 4],\\n  sforzandoDuration: [2, 12],\\n});\\n\\nexport const TUNING_PAGES = Object.freeze([\\n  { id: 'hands', label: 'Hands', keys: ['tipSpeed', 'stickCurve', 'aimAssist', 'steadyFactor'] },\\n70→  { id: 'tools', label: 'Tools', keys: ['scalpelTol', 'pullTol', 'suctionRate', 'gelRadius', 'stitchGateR', 'laserDps', 'laserBurn', 'scannerRadius', 'clampWindow', 'defibWindow'] },\\n  { id: 'patient', label: 'Patient', keys: ['drainMult', 'timerMult', 'tempoPressure', 'stabilizerHeal', 'stabilizerCooldown', 'missLimit'] },\\n  { id: 'strains', label: 'Strains', keys: ['strainHpMult', 'strainSpeedMult', 'spawnRateMult'] },\\n  { id: 'gifts', label: 'Gifts', keys: ['composureGain', 'hushDuration', 'hushTimeScale', 'sforzandoStun', 'sforzandoDamage', 'sforzandoToolMult', 'sforzandoDuration'] },\\n]);\\n\\nexport function createTuning(over) {\\n  return { ...TUNING_DEFAULTS, ...over };\\n}\\n\\n80→/** Copy defaults back onto a live object so holders of the reference see the reset. */\\nexport function resetTuning(live, keys) {\\n  const list = keys ?? Object.keys(TUNING_DEFAULTS);\\n  for (const k of list) live[k] = TUNING_DEFAULTS[k];\\n  return live;\\n}\\n\\nexport const DIFFICULTY = Object.freeze({\\n  intern: { id: 'intern', label: 'Intern', drains: 0.6, timers: 1.4, tol: 1.4, miss: 12, hp: 0.85 },\\n  resident: { id: 'resident', label: 'Resident', drains: 1, timers: 1, tol: 1, miss: 8, hp: 1 },\\n90→  attending: { id: 'attending', label: 'Attending', drains: 1.35, timers: 0.85, tol: 0.8, miss: 5, hp: 1.2 },\\n});\\n\\nexport function resolveDifficulty(id) {\\n  if (id === 'easy') return DIFFICULTY.intern;\\n  if (id === 'normal' || !id) return DIFFICULTY.resident;\\n  if (id === 'hard') return DIFFICULTY.attending;\\n  return DIFFICULTY[id] ?? DIFFICULTY.resident;\\n}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/config/tuning.js\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"/** Live tuning. Sliders mutate the object the sim reads every step. */\\nexport const TUNING_DEFAULTS = Object.freeze({\\n  tipSpeed: 1.9,\\n  stickCurve: 1.7,\\n  aimAssist: 0.35,\\n  steadyFactor: 0.4,\\n  scalpelTol: 0.055,\\n  pullTol: 1.6,\\n  suctionRate: 1.0,\\n  gelRadius: 0.16,\\n  stitchGateR: 0.07,\\n  laserDps: 30,\\n  laserBurn: 2,\\n  scannerRadius: 0.3,\\n  clampWindow: 0.18,\\n  defibWindow: 0.30,\\n  drainMult: 1,\\n  timerMult: 1,\\n  tempoPressure: 60,\\n  stabilizerHeal: 15,\\n  stabilizerCooldown: 3,\\n  missLimit: 8,\\n  strainHpMult: 1,\\n  strainSpeedMult: 1,\\n  spawnRateMult: 1,\\n  composureGain: 1,\\n  hushDuration: 7,\\n  hushTimeScale: 0.25,\\n  sforzandoStun: 3,\\n  sforzandoDamage: 0.25,\\n  sforzandoToolMult: 2,\\n  sforzandoDuration: 6,\\n});\\n\\nexport const TUNING_RANGES = Object.freeze({\\n  tipSpeed: [0.8, 3.5],\\n  stickCurve: [1, 3],\\n  aimAssist: [0, 1],\\n  steadyFactor: [0.2, 0.8],\\n  scalpelTol: [0.02, 0.12],\\n  pullTol: [0.6, 3],\\n  suctionRate: [0.3, 3],\\n  gelRadius: [0.08, 0.3],\\n  stitchGateR: [0.03, 0.15],\\n  laserDps: [10, 80],\\n  laserBurn: [0, 6],\\n  scannerRadius: [0.15, 0.5],\\n  clampWindow: [0.06, 0.4],\\n  defibWindow: [0.1, 0.6],\\n  drainMult: [0, 3],\\n  timerMult: [0.5, 2],\\n  tempoPressure: [0, 120],\\n  stabilizerHeal: [5, 30],\\n  stabilizerCooldown: [0.5, 8],\\n  missLimit: [3, 20],\\n  strainHpMult: [0.3, 3],\\n  strainSpeedMult: [0.3, 2.5],\\n  spawnRateMult: [0.3, 2.5],\\n  composureGain: [0.2, 3],\\n  hushDuration: [2, 15],\\n  hushTimeScale: [0.05, 0.7],\\n  sforzandoStun: [1, 6],\\n  sforzandoDamage: [0.05, 0.6],\\n  sforzandoToolMult: [1.2, 4],\\n  sforzandoDuration: [2, 12],\\n});\\n\\nexport const TUNING_PAGES = Object.freeze([\\n  { id: 'hands', label: 'Hands', keys: ['tipSpeed', 'stickCurve', 'aimAssist', 'steadyFactor'] },\\n  { id: 'tools', label: 'Tools', keys: ['scalpelTol', 'pullTol', 'suctionRate', 'gelRadius', 'stitchGateR', 'laserDps', 'laserBurn', 'scannerRadius', 'clampWindow', 'defibWindow'] },\\n  { id: 'patient', label: 'Patient', keys: ['drainMult', 'timerMult', 'tempoPressure', 'stabilizerHeal', 'stabilizerCooldown', 'missLimit'] },\\n  { id: 'strains', label: 'Strains', keys: ['strainHpMult', 'strainSpeedMult', 'spawnRateMult'] },\\n  { id: 'gifts', label: 'Gifts', keys: ['composureGain', 'hushDuration', 'hushTimeScale', 'sforzandoStun', 'sforzandoDamage', 'sforzandoToolMult', 'sforzandoDuration'] },\\n]);\\n\\nexport function createTuning(over) {\\n  return { ...TUNING_DEFAULTS, ...over };\\n}\\n\\n/** Copy defaults back onto a live object so holders of the reference see the reset. */\\nexport function resetTuning(live, keys) {\\n  const list = keys ?? Object.keys(TUNING_DEFAULTS);\\n  for (const k of list) live[k] = TUNING_DEFAULTS[k];\\n  return live;\\n}\\n\\nexport const DIFFICULTY = Object.freeze({\\n  intern: { id: 'intern', label: 'Intern', drains: 0.6, timers: 1.4, tol: 1.4, miss: 12, hp: 0.85 },\\n  resident: { id: 'resident', label: 'Resident', drains: 1, timers: 1, tol: 1, miss: 8, hp: 1 },\\n  attending: { id: 'attending', label: 'Attending', drains: 1.35, timers: 0.85, tol: 0.8, miss: 5, hp: 1.2 },\\n});\\n\\nexport function resolveDifficulty(id) {\\n  if (id === 'easy') return DIFFICULTY.intern;\\n  if (id === 'normal' || !id) return DIFFICULTY.resident;\\n  if (id === 'hard') return DIFFICULTY.attending;\\n  return DIFFICULTY[id] ?? DIFFICULTY.resident;\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":98}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-124a1919-4da2-4809-8db2-e64b96c14500-20","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/** Compact snapshots. Unreliable `s` sheds static geometry. Keyframe `k` round-trips the view. */\\n\\nconst Q = 100;\\n\\nfunction q(n) {\\n  return typeof n === 'number' && Number.isFinite(n) ? Math.round(n * Q) : 0;\\n}\\nfunction u(n) {\\n  return n / Q;\\n10→}\\n\\nconst FLAG_BITS = ['hidden', 'marked', 'tray', 'clamped', 'grabbable', 'exposed', 'fleeing', 'embedded', 'core', 'coreOpen', 'windup', 'readyTie', 'cut', 'started', 'tutorial'];\\n\\nfunction flagBits(e) {\\n  let b = 0;\\n  for (let i = 0; i < FLAG_BITS.length; i++) if (e[FLAG_BITS[i]]) b |= 1 << i;\\n  return b;\\n}\\nfunction applyBits(o, b) {\\n20→  if (!b) return;\\n  for (let i = 0; i < FLAG_BITS.length; i++) if (b & (1 << i)) o[FLAG_BITS[i]] = true;\\n}\\n\\nfunction packEntity(e) {\\n  const row = {\\n    i: e.id, k: e.kind, s: e.site, x: q(e.x || 0), y: q(e.y || 0), f: flagBits(e),\\n  };\\n  if (e.hp != null) row.h = q(e.hp);\\n  if (e.holder != null) row.ho = e.holder;\\n30→  if (e.need) row.n = e.need;\\n  if (e.strain) row.st = e.strain;\\n  if (e.vol != null) row.v = q(e.vol);\\n  if (e.size != null) row.z = q(e.size);\\n  if (e.coverage != null) row.c = q(e.coverage);\\n  if (e.pinned) row.p = q(e.pinned);\\n  if (e.stunned) row.sn = q(e.stunned);\\n  if (e.axis != null) row.ax = e.axis;\\n  if (e.embed != null) row.em = q(e.embed);\\n  if (e.pull != null) row.pu = q(e.pull);\\n40→  if (e.along != null) row.al = q(e.along);\\n  if (e.gate != null) row.ga = e.gate;\\n  if (e.parent != null) row.pa = e.parent;\\n  if (e.chain != null) row.ch = e.chain;\\n  if (e.index != null) row.ix = e.index;\\n  if (e.chainActive != null) row.ca = e.chainActive;\\n  if (e.x1 != null) row.x1 = q(e.x1);\\n  if (e.y1 != null) row.y1 = q(e.y1);\\n  if (e.x2 != null) row.x2 = q(e.x2);\\n  if (e.y2 != null) row.y2 = q(e.y2);\\n50→  if (e.rect) row.r = e.rect.map(q);\\n  if (e.points) row.pts = e.points.flatMap((p) => [q(p[0]), q(p[1])]);\\n  if (e.gates) row.g = e.gates.map((g) => [q(g.x), q(g.y), g.hit ? 1 : 0]);\\n  return row;\\n}\\n\\nfunction unpackEntity(row) {\\n  const e = { id: row.i, kind: row.k, site: row.s, x: u(row.x), y: u(row.y), alive: true };\\n  applyBits(e, row.f || 0);\\n  if (row.h != null) e.hp = u(row.h);\\n60→  if (row.ho != null) e.holder = row.ho;\\n  if (row.n) e.need = row.n;\\n  if (row.st) e.strain = row.st;\\n  if (row.v != null) e.vol = u(row.v);\\n  if (row.z != null) e.size = u(row.z);\\n  if (row.c != null) e.coverage = u(row.c);\\n  if (row.p) e.pinned = u(row.p);\\n  if (row.sn) e.stunned = u(row.sn);\\n  if (row.ax != null) e.axis = row.ax;\\n  if (row.em != null) e.embed = u(row.em);\\n70→  if (row.pu != null) e.pull = u(row.pu);\\n  if (row.al != null) e.along = u(row.al);\\n  if (row.ga != null) e.gate = row.ga;\\n  if (row.pa != null) e.parent = row.pa;\\n  if (row.ch != null) e.chain = row.ch;\\n  if (row.ix != null) e.index = row.ix;\\n  if (row.ca != null) e.chainActive = row.ca;\\n  if (row.x1 != null) e.x1 = u(row.x1);\\n  if (row.y1 != null) e.y1 = u(row.y1);\\n  if (row.x2 != null) e.x2 = u(row.x2);\\n80→  if (row.y2 != null) e.y2 = u(row.y2);\\n  if (row.r) e.rect = row.r.map(u);\\n  if (row.pts) {\\n    e.points = [];\\n    for (let i = 0; i < row.pts.length; i += 2) e.points.push([u(row.pts[i]), u(row.pts[i + 1])]);\\n  }\\n  if (row.g) e.gates = row.g.map((g) => ({ x: u(g[0]), y: u(g[1]), hit: !!g[2] }));\\n  return e;\\n}\\n\\n90→function packSeat(s) {\\n  return [s.id, q(s.x), q(s.y), s.tool, q(s.use || 0), s.site, q(s.composure || 0), s.score || 0, s.combo || 0, s.out ? 1 : 0, s.color || '', q(s.charge || 0)];\\n}\\n\\nfunction unpackSeat(row, prev) {\\n  const base = prev || {};\\n  return {\\n    ...base,\\n    id: row[0], x: u(row[1]), y: u(row[2]), tool: row[3], use: u(row[4]), site: row[5],\\n    composure: u(row[6]), score: row[7], combo: row[8], out: !!row[9], color: row[10] || base.color,\\n100→    charge: u(row[11] || 0),\\n    name: base.name, gift: base.gift, stats: base.stats || { Cuts: 0, Stitches: 0, Burns: 0, Saves: 0, Accuracy: 100 },\\n  };\\n}\\n\\n/** Fields the operative view reads. A decoded snapshot must carry all of them. */\\nexport const VIEW_FIELDS = ['tick', 'op', 'phase', 'vitals', 'timer', 'score', 'bpm', 'beat', 'beatInBar', 'bar', 'site', 'hush', 'arrest', 'seats', 'entities', 'phaseTools', 'sites', 'flags', 'objective'];\\n\\nfunction worldOf(state) {\\n  return {\\n110→    tick: state.tick, op: state.op, phase: state.phase, phaseIndex: state.phaseIndex,\\n    objective: state.objective, vitals: state.vitals, vitalsMin: state.vitalsMin,\\n    timer: state.timer, score: state.score, misses: state.misses, combo: state.combo,\\n    bpm: state.bpm, beat: state.beat, beatInBar: state.beatInBar, beatPhase: state.beatPhase,\\n    bar: state.bar, site: state.site, doctor: state.doctor, hush: state.hush,\\n    arrest: state.arrest, complete: state.complete, failed: state.failed, over: state.over,\\n    rank: state.rank, phaseTools: state.phaseTools, sites: state.sites, flags: state.flags,\\n    notes: state.notes, clampsUsed: state.clampsUsed,\\n  };\\n}\\n120→\\nexport function keyframeOf(sim) {\\n  const state = sim.state || sim;\\n  const msg = {\\n    t: 'k',\\n    w: worldOf(state),\\n    ents: (state.entities || []).map(packEntity),\\n  };\\n  msg.seats = (state.seats || []).map((s) => ({\\n    id: s.id, name: s.name, color: s.color, gift: s.gift, stats: s.stats,\\n130→    x: q(s.x), y: q(s.y), tool: s.tool, use: q(s.use || 0), site: s.site,\\n    composure: q(s.composure || 0), score: s.score || 0, combo: s.combo || 0, out: !!s.out,\\n    charge: q(s.charge || 0),\\n  }));\\n  return msg;\\n}\\n\\nexport function unreliableOf(sim, sinceTick = -1) {\\n  const state = sim.state || sim;\\n  const mv = [];\\n140→  fo