     skip: down('Tab'),\\n      pageLeft: down('KeyQ', 'q'),\\n190→      pageRight: down('KeyE', 'e'),\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  let menuLatch = {};\\n  function risingMenu() {\\n    const now = menuEdges();\\n    const edge = {};\\n    for (const k of Object.keys(now)) edge[k] = now[k] && !menuLatch[k];\\n    menuLatch = now;\\n200→    return edge;\\n  }\\n\\n  function poll() {\\n    const settings = game.settings || {};\\n    const seats = [];\\n    const pad0 = frameFromPad(0, settings);\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) {\\n      const got = i === 0 ? pad0 : frameFromPad(i, settings);\\n      if (got && (i > 0 || device === 'pad')) seats.push({ index: i, ...got });\\n210→    }\\n    if (device !== 'pad') {\\n      const frame = keyboardFrame(settings);\\n      if (seats[0]?.index === 0 && device === 'pad') {\\n        /* pad owns seat 0 */\\n      } else {\\n        seats.unshift({ index: 0, frame, edges: {} });\\n      }\\n    }\\n    const set = device === 'pad' ? (settings.glyphs === 'xbox' ? 'xbox' : 'playstation') : (device === 'mouse' ? 'mouse' : 'keyboard');\\n220→    document.documentElement.dataset.promptSet = set;\\n    const held = menuEdges();\\n    return { device, promptSet: set, seenPad, seats, menu: risingMenu(), held, hover: pointer.hover, clicked: pointer.clicked };\\n  }\\n\\n  function takeClick() {\\n    const id = pointer.clicked;\\n    pointer.clicked = null;\\n    return id;\\n  }\\n230→\\n  return {\\n    poll, takeClick, WHEEL,\\n    get device() { return device; },\\n    get seenPad() { return seenPad; },\\n    get promptSet() {\\n      return device === 'pad' ? ((game.settings?.glyphs === 'xbox') ? 'xbox' : 'playstation') : (device === 'mouse' ? 'mouse' : 'keyboard');\\n    },\\n    notePad() { seenPad = true; device = 'pad'; },\\n  };\\n240→}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"180→  function menuEdges() {\\n    return {\\n      up: down('ArrowUp', 'KeyW', 'w'),\\n      down: down('ArrowDown', 'KeyS', 's'),\\n      left: down('ArrowLeft', 'KeyA', 'a'),\\n      right: down('ArrowRight', 'KeyD', 'd'),\\n      confirm: down('Enter', 'Space', ' '),\\n      back: down('Escape', 'Backspace'),\\n      skip: down('Tab'),\\n      pageLeft: down('KeyQ', 'q'),\\n190→      pageRight: down('KeyE', 'e'),\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  let menuLatch = {};\\n  function risingMenu() {\\n    const now = menuEdges();\\n    const edge = {};\\n    for (const k of Object.keys(now)) edge[k] = now[k] && !menuLatch[k];\\n    menuLatch = now;\\n200→    return edge;\\n  }\\n\\n  function poll() {\\n    const settings = game.settings || {};\\n    const seats = [];\\n    const pad0 = frameFromPad(0, settings);\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) {\\n      const got = i === 0 ? pad0 : frameFromPad(i, settings);\\n      if (got && (i > 0 || device === 'pad')) seats.push({ index: i, ...got });\\n210→    }\\n    if (device !== 'pad') {\\n      const frame = keyboardFrame(settings);\\n      if (seats[0]?.index === 0 && device === 'pad') {\\n        /* pad owns seat 0 */\\n      } else {\\n        seats.unshift({ index: 0, frame, edges: {} });\\n      }\\n    }\\n    const set = device === 'pad' ? (settings.glyphs === 'xbox' ? 'xbox' : 'playstation') : (device === 'mouse' ? 'mouse' : 'keyboard');\\n220→    document.documentElement.dataset.promptSet = set;\\n    const held = menuEdges();\\n    return { device, promptSet: set, seenPad, seats, menu: risingMenu(), held, hover: pointer.hover, clicked: pointer.clicked };\\n  }\\n\\n  function takeClick() {\\n    const id = pointer.clicked;\\n    pointer.clicked = null;\\n    return id;\\n  }\\n230→\\n  return {\\n    poll, takeClick, WHEEL,\\n    get device() { return device; },\\n    get seenPad() { return seenPad; },\\n    get promptSet() {\\n      return device === 'pad' ? ((game.settings?.glyphs === 'xbox') ? 'xbox' : 'playstation') : (device === 'mouse' ? 'mouse' : 'keyboard');\\n    },\\n    notePad() { seenPad = true; device = 'pad'; },\\n  };\\n240→}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/input/input.js\",\"offset\":180,\"limit\":150,\"raw_output\":\"  function menuEdges() {\\n    return {\\n      up: down('ArrowUp', 'KeyW', 'w'),\\n      down: down('ArrowDown', 'KeyS', 's'),\\n      left: down('ArrowLeft', 'KeyA', 'a'),\\n      right: down('ArrowRight', 'KeyD', 'd'),\\n      confirm: down('Enter', 'Space', ' '),\\n      back: down('Escape', 'Backspace'),\\n      skip: down('Tab'),\\n      pageLeft: down('KeyQ', 'q'),\\n      pageRight: down('KeyE', 'e'),\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  let menuLatch = {};\\n  function risingMenu() {\\n    const now = menuEdges();\\n    const edge = {};\\n    for (const k of Object.keys(now)) edge[k] = now[k] && !menuLatch[k];\\n    menuLatch = now;\\n    return edge;\\n  }\\n\\n  function poll() {\\n    const settings = game.settings || {};\\n    const seats = [];\\n    const pad0 = frameFromPad(0, settings);\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) {\\n      const got = i === 0 ? pad0 : frameFromPad(i, settings);\\n      if (got && (i > 0 || device === 'pad')) seats.push({ index: i, ...got });\\n    }\\n    if (device !== 'pad') {\\n      const frame = keyboardFrame(settings);\\n      if (seats[0]?.index === 0 && device === 'pad') {\\n        /* pad owns seat 0 */\\n      } else {\\n        seats.unshift({ index: 0, frame, edges: {} });\\n      }\\n    }\\n    const set = device === 'pad' ? (settings.glyphs === 'xbox' ? 'xbox' : 'playstation') : (device === 'mouse' ? 'mouse' : 'keyboard');\\n    document.documentElement.dataset.promptSet = set;\\n    const held = menuEdges();\\n    return { device, promptSet: set, seenPad, seats, menu: risingMenu(), held, hover: pointer.hover, clicked: pointer.clicked };\\n  }\\n\\n  function takeClick() {\\n    const id = pointer.clicked;\\n    pointer.clicked = null;\\n    return id;\\n  }\\n\\n  return {\\n    poll, takeClick, WHEEL,\\n    get device() { return device; },\\n    get seenPad() { return seenPad; },\\n    get promptSet() {\\n      return device === 'pad' ? ((game.settings?.glyphs === 'xbox') ? 'xbox' : 'playstation') : (device === 'mouse' ? 'mouse' : 'keyboard');\\n    },\\n    notePad() { seenPad = true; device = 'pad'; },\\n  };\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":240}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-caae561b-a99a-4934-aeb9-c74da1a4afc9-23","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→export const GRADE_POINTS = Object.freeze({ FLAWLESS: 300, CLEAN: 150, ROUGH: 50, MISS: -100 });\\nexport const GRADE_POISE = Object.freeze({ FLAWLESS: 10, CLEAN: 5, ROUGH: 0, MISS: -10 });\\n\\nconst RANK_ROWS = Object.freeze([\\n  ['S', 0.9, 'Chief of Surgery'],\\n  ['A', 0.75, 'Attending'],\\n  ['B', 0.55, 'Resident'],\\n  ['C', 0.35, 'Intern'],\\n  ['D', -Infinity, 'Malpractice Suit Pending'],\\n10→]);\\n\\nexport function comboMult(combo) {\\n  return Math.min(2, 1 + 0.05 * combo);\\n}\\n\\nexport function rankFor(score, par, cap) {\\n  const ratio = par > 0 ? score / par : (score > 0 ? 1 : 0);\\n  let idx = RANK_ROWS.length - 1;\\n  for (let i = 0; i < RANK_ROWS.length; i++) {\\n20→    if (ratio >= RANK_ROWS[i][1]) { idx = i; break; }\\n  }\\n  if (cap) {\\n    const capIdx = RANK_ROWS.findIndex((r) => r[0] === cap);\\n    if (capIdx >= 0 && idx < capIdx) idx = capIdx;\\n  }\\n  const row = RANK_ROWS[idx];\\n  return { id: row[0], title: row[2], ratio };\\n}\\n\\n30→export function award(sim, seat, grade, x, y, why) {\\n  const base = GRADE_POINTS[grade];\\n  const mult = comboMult(seat.combo);\\n  const points = Math.round(base * mult * sim.mods.score);\\n  sim.score += points;\\n  seat.score += points;\\n  seat.graded = (seat.graded || 0) + 1;\\n  if (grade === 'FLAWLESS' || grade === 'CLEAN') {\\n    seat.clean = (seat.clean || 0) + 1;\\n    seat.combo += 1;\\n40→    if (seat.combo > seat.bestCombo) seat.bestCombo = seat.combo;\",\"content_concise\":\"1→export const GRADE_POINTS = Object.freeze({ FLAWLESS: 300, CLEAN: 150, ROUGH: 50, MISS: -100 });\\nexport const GRADE_POISE = Object.freeze({ FLAWLESS: 10, CLEAN: 5, ROUGH: 0, MISS: -10 });\\n\\nconst RANK_ROWS = Object.freeze([\\n  ['S', 0.9, 'Chief of Surgery'],\\n  ['A', 0.75, 'Attending'],\\n  ['B', 0.55, 'Resident'],\\n  ['C', 0.35, 'Intern'],\\n  ['D', -Infinity, 'Malpractice Suit Pending'],\\n10→]);\\n\\nexport function comboMult(combo) {\\n  return Math.min(2, 1 + 0.05 * combo);\\n}\\n\\nexport function rankFor(score, par, cap) {\\n  const ratio = par > 0 ? score / par : (score > 0 ? 1 : 0);\\n  let idx = RANK_ROWS.length - 1;\\n  for (let i = 0; i < RANK_ROWS.length; i++) {\\n20→    if (ratio >= RANK_ROWS[i][1]) { idx = i; break; }\\n  }\\n  if (cap) {\\n    const capIdx = RANK_ROWS.findIndex((r) => r[0] === cap);\\n    if (capIdx >= 0 && idx < capIdx) idx = capIdx;\\n  }\\n  const row = RANK_ROWS[idx];\\n  return { id: row[0], title: row[2], ratio };\\n}\\n\\n30→export function award(sim, seat, grade, x, y, why) {\\n  const base = GRADE_POINTS[grade];\\n  const mult = comboMult(seat.combo);\\n  const points = Math.round(base * mult * sim.mods.score);\\n  sim.score += points;\\n  seat.score += points;\\n  seat.graded = (seat.graded || 0) + 1;\\n  if (grade === 'FLAWLESS' || grade === 'CLEAN') {\\n    seat.clean = (seat.clean || 0) + 1;\\n    seat.combo += 1;\\n40→    if (seat.combo > seat.bestCombo) seat.bestCombo = seat.combo;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/scoring.js\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"export const GRADE_POINTS = Object.freeze({ FLAWLESS: 300, CLEAN: 150, ROUGH: 50, MISS: -100 });\\nexport const GRADE_POISE = Object.freeze({ FLAWLESS: 10, CLEAN: 5, ROUGH: 0, MISS: -10 });\\n\\nconst RANK_ROWS = Object.freeze([\\n  ['S', 0.9, 'Chief of Surgery'],\\n  ['A', 0.75, 'Attending'],\\n  ['B', 0.55, 'Resident'],\\n  ['C', 0.35, 'Intern'],\\n  ['D', -Infinity, 'Malpractice Suit Pending'],\\n]);\\n\\nexport function comboMult(combo) {\\n  return Math.min(2, 1 + 0.05 * combo);\\n}\\n\\nexport function rankFor(score, par, cap) {\\n  const ratio = par > 0 ? score / par : (score > 0 ? 1 : 0);\\n  let idx = RANK_ROWS.length - 1;\\n  for (let i = 0; i < RANK_ROWS.length; i++) {\\n    if (ratio >= RANK_ROWS[i][1]) { idx = i; break; }\\n  }\\n  if (cap) {\\n    const capIdx = RANK_ROWS.findIndex((r) => r[0] === cap);\\n    if (capIdx >= 0 && idx < capIdx) idx = capIdx;\\n  }\\n  const row = RANK_ROWS[idx];\\n  return { id: row[0], title: row[2], ratio };\\n}\\n\\nexport function award(sim, seat, grade, x, y, why) {\\n  const base = GRADE_POINTS[grade];\\n  const mult = comboMult(seat.combo);\\n  const points = Math.round(base * mult * sim.mods.score);\\n  sim.score += points;\\n  seat.score += points;\\n  seat.graded = (seat.graded || 0) + 1;\\n  if (grade === 'FLAWLESS' || grade === 'CLEAN') {\\n    seat.clean = (seat.clean || 0) + 1;\\n    seat.combo += 1;\\n    if (seat.combo > seat.bestCombo) seat.bestCombo = seat.combo;\\n\",\"total_lines\":56}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-caae561b-a99a-4934-aeb9-c74da1a4afc9-24","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/** Story scenes S0–S16. One shout per scene. Bea says \\\"good\\\" only in S16. */\\n\\nconst line = (who, mood, text, shout = false) => (shout ? { who, mood, text, shout: true } : { who, mood, text });\\n\\nexport const CHAPTERS = ['Scrub In', 'First Movement', 'Dissent', 'Coda'];\\n\\nexport const SCENES = [\\n  {\\n    id: 'S0', chapter: 'Scrub In', where: 'OR 3 at night', set: 'or', music: 'story-tense',\\n10→    lines: [\\n      line('narration', 'quiet', 'Rain on the harbor glass. OR 3 is dark, and the table is empty.'),\\n      line('narration', 'quiet', 'An envelope slides under the door. No footsteps follow it.'),\\n      line('ren', 'nervous', 'Hello? The night list said the room was closed.'),\\n      line('narration', 'quiet', 'The monitor switches itself on. It beeps, in time, with no patient.'),\\n      line('ren', 'nervous', 'That is a pulse. There is nobody on the table.'),\\n      line('narration', 'quiet', 'A silhouette beyond the gallery glass lifts a baton.'),\\n      line('voss', 'calm', 'Count with me, Doctor. You already know the tempo.'),\\n      line('ren', 'shaky', 'Who is in the gallery? The board went home.'),\\n      line('voss', 'calm', 'Home is a tempo, not a place.'),\\n20→      line('narration', 'quiet', 'The envelope is sheet music. The clef is a heart.'),\\n      line('ren', 'quiet', 'I should call Bea. I should call anyone.'),\\n      line('voss', 'pleased', 'Call the room. It will answer in four.'),\\n      line('narration', 'sting', 'The beeps land on the bar line. The silhouette bows.', true),\\n      line('ren', 'quiet', 'I am the surgeon on call. I am still here.'),\\n      line('narration', 'quiet', 'The light over the table warms, though nobody touched it.'),\\n      line('voss', 'soft', 'Scrub in. The first movement is already late.'),\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n30→    id: 'S1', chapter: 'Scrub In', where: 'Corridor outside OR 3', set: 'corridor', music: 'story-calm',\\n    lines: [\\n      line('bea', 'stern', 'Thirty-one years in this room, child. You are the ninth boy they have told me is gifted.'),\\n      line('ren', 'nervous', 'I-I\\\\'ve only ever done this on the simulator!'),\\n      line('bea', 'dry', 'Then simulate faster.'),\\n      line('ren', 'earnest', 'The attending is stuck in the flood traffic. Dispatch said I was all there is.'),\\n      line('bea', 'stern', 'Then you are all there is. Wash to the elbow. Both of them.'),\\n      line('ren', 'quiet', 'The patient is a taxi driver. Windshield in the forearm.'),\\n      line('bea', 'brisk', 'That is a shard of windshield, not a sacrament. Take it out.'),\\n      line('ren', 'nervous', 'If I nick the artery—'),\\n40→      line('bea', 'firm', 'You will not. And if you do, you will say so out loud.'),\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/** Story scenes S0–S16. One shout per scene. Bea says \\\"good\\\" only in S16. */\\n\\nconst line = (who, mood, text, shout = false) => (shout ? { who, mood, text, shout: true } : { who, mood, text });\\n\\nexport const CHAPTERS = ['Scrub In', 'First Movement', 'Dissent', 'Coda'];\\n\\nexport const SCENES = [\\n  {\\n    id: 'S0', chapter: 'Scrub In', where: 'OR 3 at night', set: 'or', music: 'story-tense',\\n10→    lines: [\\n      line('narration', 'quiet', 'Rain on the harbor glass. OR 3 is dark, and the table is empty.'),\\n      line('narration', 'quiet', 'An envelope slides under the door. No footsteps follow it.'),\\n      line('ren', 'nervous', 'Hello? The night list said the room was closed.'),\\n      line('narration', 'quiet', 'The monitor switches itself on. It beeps, in time, with no patient.'),\\n      line('ren', 'nervous', 'That is a pulse. There is nobody on the table.'),\\n      line('narration', 'quiet', 'A silhouette beyond the gallery glass lifts a baton.'),\\n      line('voss', 'calm', 'Count with me, Doctor. You already know the tempo.'),\\n      line('ren', 'shaky', 'Who is in the gallery? The board went home.'),\\n      line('voss', 'calm', 'Home is a tempo, not a place.'),\\n20→      line('narration', 'quiet', 'The envelope is sheet music. The clef is a heart.'),\\n      line('ren', 'quiet', 'I should call Bea. I should call anyone.'),\\n      line('voss', 'pleased', 'Call the room. It will answer in four.'),\\n      line('narration', 'sting', 'The beeps land on the bar line. The silhouette bows.', true),\\n      line('ren', 'quiet', 'I am the surgeon on call. I am still here.'),\\n      line('narration', 'quiet', 'The light over the table warms, though nobody touched it.'),\\n      line('voss', 'soft', 'Scrub in. The first movement is already late.'),\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n30→    id: 'S1', chapter: 'Scrub In', where: 'Corridor outside OR 3', set: 'corridor', music: 'story-calm',\\n    lines: [\\n      line('bea', 'stern', 'Thirty-one years in this room, child. You are the ninth boy they have told me is gifted.'),\\n      line('ren', 'nervous', 'I-I\\\\'ve only ever done this on the simulator!'),\\n      line('bea', 'dry', 'Then simulate faster.'),\\n      line('ren', 'earnest', 'The attending is stuck in the flood traffic. Dispatch said I was all there is.'),\\n      line('bea', 'stern', 'Then you are all there is. Wash to the elbow. Both of them.'),\\n      line('ren', 'quiet', 'The patient is a taxi driver. Windshield in the forearm.'),\\n      line('bea', 'brisk', 'That is a shard of windshield, not a sacrament. Take it out.'),\\n      line('ren', 'nervous', 'If I nick the artery—'),\\n40→      line('bea', 'firm', 'You will not. And if you do, you will say so out loud.'),\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/data/story/scenes.js\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"/** Story scenes S0–S16. One shout per scene. Bea says \\\"good\\\" only in S16. */\\n\\nconst line = (who, mood, text, shout = false) => (shout ? { who, mood, text, shout: true } : { who, mood, text });\\n\\nexport const CHAPTERS = ['Scrub In', 'First Movement', 'Dissent', 'Coda'];\\n\\nexport const SCENES = [\\n  {\\n    id: 'S0', chapter: 'Scrub In', where: 'OR 3 at night', set: 'or', music: 'story-tense',\\n    lines: [\\n      line('narration', 'quiet', 'Rain on the harbor glass. OR 3 is dark, and the table is empty.'),\\n      line('narration', 'quiet', 'An envelope slides under the door. No footsteps follow it.'),\\n      line('ren', 'nervous', 'Hello? The night list said the room was closed.'),\\n      line('narration', 'quiet', 'The monitor switches itself on. It beeps, in time, with no patient.'),\\n      line('ren', 'nervous', 'That is a pulse.