{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_523","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The hub must be ready without a key within 20 seconds.\n\nCard answers must be entered within 3 seconds of the ready signal. Both directions must show traffic. The host must finish with valid standings before time expires. A host leaving voids the round. Clients must not finish from a non-host. The server records its own copy as played. No protocol errors or rate warnings may occur.\n\nNo console errors, alerts, or websocket issues are allowed. The 4-player WebGL scenario must also pass. Each run lasts roughly 20 to 40 seconds. Six hub runs may take several minutes. Four software WebGPU iframes risk out-of-memory errors. The harness does not use a no-render flag. Views initialize on every page. The server has no view. Two players plus the server means three pages with two WebGPU renderers. Four players need four renderers. Shadow maps and organ textures are already modest.\n\nClients must send idle messages so traffic flows both ways. The host sends status and key updates; clients send idle signals; the server receives idle and sends status. On a host leave, clients receive a leave event followed by an end event with void standings, then stop their pumps. When time-up arrives, the host calls finish immediately using the grace period from the event.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-77549a88-d1fb-46f0-ad81-bbc2b5dae10e-64","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"scores|standings|won|stats|awards","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/tests/hub/site/round.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-77549a88-d1fb-46f0-ad81-bbc2b5dae10e-65","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/tests/hub/site/round.js","offset":400,"limit":120}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3655,"output_tokens":730,"cache_read_input_tokens":124672,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"a7857282-6d54-45d5-9668-cbd7ff1d849d"}
