3,101,46,32,80,111,115,116,45,99,114,101,100,105,116,115,58,32,97,32,110,101,119,32,101,110,118,101,108,111,112,101,44,32,109,97,114,107,101,100,32,42,79,112,117,115,32,50,42,32,124,10,56,48,53,58,116,111,111,108,115,47,118,101,110,100,111,114,47,115,101,115,115,105,111,110,46,106,115,32,116,104,101,32,104,117,98,32,99,108,105,101,110,116,44,32,118,101,114,98,97,116,105,109,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":6,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/PLAN.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":98,\"content\":\"- Ren: \\\"I-I've only ever done this on the simulator!\\\" / Bea: \\\"Then simulate faster.\\\"\"},{\"line_number\":181,\"content\":\"New Game asks once, in Bea's voice (\\\"How much do you hate yourself, child?\\\"), and every chart can change it.\"},{\"line_number\":346,\"content\":\"Delivered as short scenes on a 3D stage (§9.5). Cross, Enter, Space or a click advances; hold to fast-forward; Triangle or Tab skips the scene, with a prompt on screen. Write 250 to 350 lines in total, in `src/data/story/`. The beats and must-have lines below are fixed; the rest is yours. Chapter names: **Scrub In**, **First Movement**, **Dissent**, **Coda**.\"},{\"line_number\":348,\"content\":\"| # | When | Where | Beats and must-have lines |\"},{\"line_number\":366,\"content\":\"| S16 | After | St. Alder, morning | Patients' cameos. Pip in student-nurse scrubs. Bea, with a cane, watches Ren close a wound and, for the only time in the game: **\\\"Good hands, child.\\\"** Credits roll over attract footage. Post-credits: a new envelope, marked *Opus 2* |\"},{\"line_number\":805,\"content\":\"tools/vendor/session.js the hub client, verbatim\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"cc140ca3-b0b5-4b61-8543-8f5a7c52de28"}
