{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_595","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Resuming from where I left off.\n\nI will read STAGE.md and TASK.md first. Then I will write tests/run-all.mjs to run the simulation tests. After that I will continue with browser and hub tests, documentation, and the exit interview.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The build and menu smoke are in place. Next I’ll wire the sim test runner and run it against the shipped sim."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4830f654-7f51-42b6-a76e-463dc890c60b-0","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"scaffold","content":"Scaffold dev folder, RNG title, package, hub client, build, test runner","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"view","content":"Three.js toon/ink field, instruments, HUD, pad/mouse/keys","status":"completed"},{"id":"shell","content":"Menus, chart, free play, settings, glyphs, touch, save, about, attract, dev","status":"completed"},{"id":"multi","content":"Couch co-op and hub session until harness passes","status":"pending"},{"id":"finish","content":"parScore, authoring note, exit interview, root HTML, verification logs","status":"pending"},{"id":"simtests","content":"Write and run sim suite (rules + worker pool)","status":"in_progress"}],"merge":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4830f654-7f51-42b6-a76e-463dc890c60b-1","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/tests/sim/worker.mjs","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4830f654-7f51-42b6-a76e-463dc890c60b-2","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/package.json"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4830f654-7f51-42b6-a76e-463dc890c60b-3","name"