{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_617","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Clicks already trigger game.onActivate on pointerup, so takeClick is unnecessary.\n\nHover correctly triggers onHover and moves focus. Pad tests require addInitScript before page load. The tip speed test will simulate a full right stick input for one second using step-based updates. I am checking how solo mode assigns seat zero to pad devices in feedSim.\n\nSolo mode routes pad seat zero through frameFromPad, while non-pad devices use keyboard seat zero. Aim assist must be disabled to avoid skewing tip speed, and this can be done by setting state().tuning.aimAssist to zero from the page. The test will then apply a full right stick input for sixty steps.\n\nTip speed will be measured by comparing tip x delta against the tipSpeed value. Keyboard WASD input in test mode requires holding keys via Playwright keyboard.down, stepping sixty times, then releasing with keyboard.up. During operation, onKey exits early because inPlay is true, so WASD only triggers markKey and does not set pending menu state.\n\nTool selection via keyboard digits requires holding the key down across test steps, since Playwright press releases immediately. Left stick tool picking will use axes[0] flicks and needs glyphs.js to determine toolFromStick behavior.\n\nR2 analog input must reach the simulation. The current state tips omit a use field, so I will expose it to verify gel application.\n\nI will add `use` to the public state tips so the test can observe the shipped input path without reaching into closures. I also need to verify that `pointerToField` in `createPointerCamera` correctly converts absolute mouse coordinates.\n\nHover over a menu item to verify focusId changes. Click the Free Play button to activate it.\n\nAfter pad activity, the device dataset should read \"playstation\". After keyboard input, it should read \"keyboard\". Settings glyphs can be switched from xbox to pad.\n\nIn dev mode, skip to an operation and press Escape during play to enter pause. Step into the overlay, then select Dev Mode or click data-item=dev. Run each DEV_ID via devRun. Adjust a tuning slider and check simulation behavior. Reset-all restores defaults.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d65cc44e-2643-4dfd-b0fb-1a37d35775dd-52","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js","offset":1678,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d65cc44e-2643-4dfd-b0fb-1a37d35775dd-53","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function toolFromStick|export function toolFromStick","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/input/glyphs.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d65cc44e-2643-4dfd-b0fb-1a37d35775dd-54","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pointerToField|function createPointerCamera","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/view"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6344,"output_tokens":1425,"cache_read_input_tokens":91136,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"99cf8684-e66e-4a5c-8970-929731f15f63"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-d65cc44e-2643-4dfd-b0fb-1a37d35775dd-52","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1678→    },\\n    async startStandalone() {\\n1680→      model.mode = 'standalone';\\n      model.lastInput = performance.now();\\n      if (wantsTouch()) setScreen('Touch notice');\\n      else setScreen('Title');\\n      try { document.body.focus(); } catch { /* focus is a courtesy */ }\\n      raf = requestAnimationFrame(loop);\\n      timer = setInterval(() => {\\n        if (model.mode === 'session') return;\\n        checkAttract();\\n        if (model.attract.on && model.test) {\\n1690→          for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) stepOnce();\\n        }\\n      }, 250);\\n      await bootView();\\n      present();\\n      draw();\\n    },\\n  };\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1678→    },\\n    async startStandalone() {\\n1680→      model.mode = 'standalone';\\n      model.lastInput = performance.now();\\n      if (wantsTouch()) setScreen('Touch notice');\\n      else setScreen('Title');\\n      try { document.body.focus(); } catch { /* focus is a courtesy */ }\\n      raf = requestAnimationFrame(loop);\\n      timer = setInterval(() => {\\n        if (model.mode === 'session') return;\\n        checkAttract();\\n        if (model.attract.on && model.test) {\\n1690→          for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) stepOnce();\\n        }\\n      }, 250);\\n      await bootView();\\n      present();\\n      draw();\\n    },\\n  };\\n}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js\",\"offset\":1678,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"    },\\n    async startStandalone() {\\n      model.mode = 'standalone';\\n      model.lastInput = performance.now();\\n      if (wantsTouch()) setScreen('Touch notice');\\n      else setScreen('Title');\\n      try { document.body.focus(); } catch { /* focus is a courtesy */ }\\n      raf = requestAnimationFrame(loop);\\n      timer = setInterval(() => {\\n        if (model.mode === 'session') return;\\n        checkAttract();\\n        if (model.attract.on && model.test) {\\n          for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) stepOnce();\\n        }\\n      }, 250);\\n      await bootView();\\n      present();\\n      draw();\\n    },\\n  };\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":1698}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-d65cc44e-2643-4dfd-b0fb-1a37d35775dd-53","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,51,49,50,51,48,95,95,120,56,102,52,57,98,54,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,49,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,51,49,50,51,48,95,95,120,56,102,52,57,98,54,47,119,111,114,107,47,65,108,105,118,101,32,105,110,32,67,111,109,109,111,110,32,84,105,109,101,45,84,114,97,117,109,97,32,67,101,110,116,101,114,58,32,83,101,99,111,110,100,32,79,112,105,110,105,111,110,45,103,114,111,107,45,52,46,55,45,120,104,105,103,104,45,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,51,49,50,51,48,47,115,114,99,47,105,110,112,117,116,47,103,108,121,112,104,115,46,106,115,10,53,54,58,101,120,112,111,114,116,32,102,117,110,99,116,105,111,110,32,116,111,111,108,70,114,111,109,83,116,105,99,107,40,120,44,32,121,44,32,112,114,101,118,41,32,123,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108