{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_622","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The simulation passed. I will add use-to-state tips and write a careful browser suite.\n\nCounting DEV_IDS to locate the hands slider page for live tuning.\n\nTipSpeed is on page 9 of the dev menu. The test will use `window.__game.devRun` to trigger tools directly, since that method is always available. The plan requires reaching dev from pause, running each tool once without error, adjusting a slider live, and resetting to restore defaults.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e853924c-8959-42e4-ba0f-ca476601ccac-64","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function writeSetting|function resetTuning","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e853924c-8959-42e4-ba0f-ca476601ccac-65","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/dev.js","offset":40,"limit":180}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3551,"output_tokens":676,"cache_read_input_tokens":107136,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"65efb212-0763-4df6-9399-1c17831794a4"}
