{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_639","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Arrow keys during play return early in onKey without setting pending.\n\nArrow keys during the Card screen are ignored. The onKey handler returns early for all keys in that mode, so arrows cannot navigate.\n\nEnter answers correctly. Poke does not set repeat. Window-level key listeners catch keydown events even when focus is on the body or a button, since KeyboardEvent bubbles.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b1fb641a-f140-49a8-8aa7-ba22a2c23bca-90","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function unreliableOf|function applyUnreliable|function keyframeOf","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/sim/snapshot.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":761,"output_tokens":626,"cache_read_input_tokens":146688,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"cae15bec-6d1d-48d0-a78f-c845c4332a6a"}
