{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-19257137-72ad-41d3-9045-82d2f18271c9-120","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"274→    check('xbox prompt set', (await page.evaluate(() => document.documentElement.dataset.promptSet)) === 'xbox', 'set');\\n    const saved = await page.evaluate(() => localStorage.getItem('st-alder-chart'));\\n    await page.reload({ waitUntil: 'domcontentloaded' });\\n    await page.waitForFunction(() => window.__game?.state?.().glyphSet === 'xbox');\\n    check('save survives reload', saved && (await page.evaluate(() => localStorage.getItem('st-alder-chart'))) === saved, 'storage');\\n\\n280→    await press(page, 'Enter');\\n    await press(page, 'ArrowDown');\\n    await press(page, 'ArrowDown');\\n    await press(page, 'Enter');\\n    check('lobby opens', (await page.evaluate(() => window.__game.state().screen)) === 'Lobby', 'screen');\\n    await page.evaluate(() => {\\n      window.__pads[0].buttons[0] = { pressed: true, touched: true, value: 1 };\\n      window.__pads[1].buttons[0] = { pressed: true, touched: true, value: 1 };\\n      window.__game.test.step(1);\\n      window.__pads[0].buttons[0] = { pressed: false, touched: false, value: 0 };\\n290→      window.__pads[1].buttons[0] = { pressed: false, touched: false, value: 0 };\\n      window.__game.test.step(1);\\n    });\\n    await press(page, 'Enter');\\n    const couch = await page.evaluate(() => {\\n      window.__game.state().tuning.aimAssist = 0;\\n      window.__pads[0].axes[2] = 1;\\n      window.__pads[1].axes[2] = -1;\\n      window.__game.test.step(40);\\n      window.__pads[0].axes[2] = 0;\\n300→      window.__pads[1].axes[2] = 0;\\n      const tips = window.__game.state().tips;\\n      window.__game.test.bot(true);\\n      window.__game.test.step(2400);\\n      const later = window.__game.state().tips;\\n      return {\\n        screen: window.__game.state().screen,\\n        dx: tips.map((t) => t.x),\\n        scores: later.filter((t) => t.id === 0 || t.id === 1).map((t) => t.score),\\n      };\\n310→    });\\n    check('two tips move', couch.dx[0] > couch.dx[1] + 0.4, JSON.stringify(couch.dx));\\n    check('both seats score', couch.scores.length === 2 && couch.scores.every((n) => n > 0), JSON.stringify(couch.scores));\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"274→    check('xbox prompt set', (await page.evaluate(() => document.documentElement.dataset.promptSet)) === 'xbox', 'set');\\n    const saved = await page.evaluate(() => localStorage.getItem('st-alder-chart'));\\n    await page.reload({ waitUntil: 'domcontentloaded' });\\n    await page.waitForFunction(() => window.__game?.state?.().glyphSet === 'xbox');\\n    check('save survives reload', saved && (await page.evaluate(() => localStorage.getItem('st-alder-chart'))) === saved, 'storage');\\n\\n280→    await press(page, 'Enter');\\n    await press(page, 'ArrowDown');\\n    await press(page, 'ArrowDown');\\n    await press(page, 'Enter');\\n    check('lobby opens', (await page.evaluate(() => window.__game.state().screen)) === 'Lobby', 'screen');\\n    await page.evaluate(() => {\\n      window.__pads[0].buttons[0] = { pressed: true, touched: true, value: 1 };\\n      window.__pads[1].buttons[0] = { pressed: true, touched: true, value: 1 };\\n      window.__game.test.step(1);\\n      window.__pads[0].buttons[0] = { pressed: false, touched: false, value: 0 };\\n290→      window.__pads[1].buttons[0] = { pressed: false, touched: false, value: 0 };\\n      window.__game.test.step(1);\\n    });\\n    await press(page, 'Enter');\\n    const couch = await page.evaluate(() => {\\n      window.__game.state().tuning.aimAssist = 0;\\n      window.__pads[0].axes[2] = 1;\\n      window.__pads[1].axes[2] = -1;\\n      window.__game.test.step(40);\\n      window.__pads[0].axes[2] = 0;\\n300→      window.__pads[1].axes[2] = 0;\\n      const tips = window.__game.state().tips;\\n      window.__game.test.bot(true);\\n      window.__game.test.step(2400);\\n      const later = window.__game.state().tips;\\n      return {\\n        screen: window.__game.state().screen,\\n        dx: tips.map((t) => t.x),\\n        scores: later.filter((t) => t.id === 0 || t.id === 1).map((t) => t.score),\\n      };\\n310→    });\\n    check('two tips move', couch.dx[0] > couch.dx[1] + 0.4, JSON.stringify(couch.dx));\\n    check('both seats score', couch.scores.length === 2 && couch.scores.every((n) => n > 0), JSON.stringify(couch.scores));\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/tests/browser/suite.mjs\",\"offset\":274,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"    check('xbox prompt set', (await page.evaluate(() => document.documentElement.dataset.promptSet)) === 'xbox', 'set');\\n    const saved = await page.evaluate(() => localStorage.getItem('st-alder-chart'));\\n    await page.reload({ waitUntil: 'domcontentloaded' });\\n    await page.waitForFunction(() => window.__game?.state?.().glyphSet === 'xbox');\\n    check('save survives reload', saved && (await page.evaluate(() => localStorage.getItem('st-alder-chart'))) === saved, 'storage');\\n\\n    await press(page, 'Enter');\\n    await press(page, 'ArrowDown');\\n    await press(page, 'ArrowDown');\\n    await press(page, 'Enter');\\n    check('lobby opens', (await page.evaluate(() => window.__game.state().screen)) === 'Lobby', 'screen');\\n    await page.evaluate(() => {\\n      window.__pads[0].buttons[0] = { pressed: true, touched: true, value: 1 };\\n      window.__pads[1].buttons[0] = { pressed: true, touched: true, value: 1 };\\n      window.__game.test.step(1);\\n      window.__pads[0].buttons[0] = { pressed: false, touched: false, value: 0 };\\n      window.__pads[1].buttons[0] = { pressed: false, touched: false, value: 0 };\\n      window.__game.test.step(1);\\n    });\\n    await press(page, 'Enter');\\n    const couch = await page.evaluate(() => {\\n      window.__game.state().tuning.aimAssist = 0;\\n      window.__pads[0].axes[2] = 1;\\n      window.__pads[1].axes[2] = -1;\\n      window.__game.test.step(40);\\n      window.__pads[0].axes[2] = 0;\\n      window.__pads[1].axes[2] = 0;\\n      const tips = window.__game.state().tips;\\n      window.__game.test.bot(true);\\n      window.__game.test.step(2400);\\n      const later = window.__game.state().tips;\\n      return {\\n        screen: window.__game.state().screen,\\n        dx: tips.map((t) => t.x),\\n        scores: later.filter((t) => t.id === 0 || t.id === 1).map((t) => t.score),\\n      };\\n    });\\n    check('two tips move', couch.dx[0] > couch.dx[1] + 0.4, JSON.stringify(couch.dx));\\n    check('both seats score', couch.scores.length === 2 && couch.scores.every((n) => n > 0), JSON.stringify(couch.scores));\\n\\n\",\"total_lines\":457}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"1cde1ae7-778f-45aa-b2bc-3bec14ed7389"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_657","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A bug was identified: after reload, waitForFunction may resolve the glyphSet xbox while the system is still on Boot instead of Title.\n\ncreateApp loads settings and sets glyphSet to xbox before __game exists. startStandalone then assigns __game while the screen is still Boot. waitForFunction can therefore resolve early during Boot.\n\nThe Enter key is consumed during Boot before Title appears, so the confirmation does nothing useful. The fix is to wait for both screen === 'Title' and glyphSet === 'xbox'. A second bug was also spotted in the first scripted load.\n\nThe first scripted load is fine. The 2400 couch bot steps should finish well under the 120-second timeout. A missed Enter key or focus issue on Begin could leave the screen stuck on Operation. Pad buttons are recreated as new objects each frame, but prevPad in the closure still tracks pressed state correctly.\n\nAfter reload, the pad initialization script runs again and pads are fresh. The lobby join uses pads, and step sets the device to pad.\n\nAbout headings might fail if the credits page or escape key is present. This will be checked during testing.\n\nThe slider page innerText only includes tipSpeed on that page, so DEV button labels won't interfere. ArrowRight on focus 0 nudges tipSpeed right.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8b5c33e4-a84b-4fb1-92b6-984dba151726-121","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/tests/browser/suite.mjs","old_string":"    await page.waitForFunction(() => window.__game?.state?.().glyphSet === 'xbox');","new_string":"    await page.waitForFunction(() => window.__game?.state?.().screen === 'Title' && window.__game.state().glyphSet === 'xbox');"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8b5c33e4-a84b-4fb1-92b6-984dba151726-122","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230\" && node --check tests/browser/suite.mjs && node --check tests/hub/suite.mjs && node --check tests/run-all.mjs && node tools/build.mjs","description":"Syntax-check suites and rebuild the game HTML"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":969,"output_tokens":1199,"cache_read_input_tokens":180736,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"77947bda-6653-45db-a51b-9a0f34c82ebe"}
