{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_658","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The build succeeded. The search_replace for wait likely ran in parallel with the build.\n\nThe build bundles source files, not the test file, so the wait fix remains isolated. I will start the browser test suite in the background and draft docs/AUTHORING.md while it runs. I will check ink.js against the plan later.\n\nThe browser suite will run for 5–15 minutes. I will check the log if it fails early. I am also scanning for a likely first failure: attract timing with bootView running fast in norender mode.\n\nThe Title-to-attract timing is sound. The wait begins when Title appears, so the 10-second window should be satisfied. Keyboard aim is also correct: Playwright sends KeyD and key d, markKey registers them, and keyboardFrame checks KeyD across 60 steps.\n\nAim assist is confirmed at zero after skipTo. Stick movement covers 1.9 units across sixty frames. KeyD is not misread as a pad input. The hover test depends on quit completing first.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4e4a9499-07e8-4da2-9416-9770b5a4d421-123","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230\" && node tests/run-all.mjs browser > \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/browser.log\" 2>&1; echo EXIT:$? >> \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/browser.log\"","description":"Run the browser suite into the scratch log","block_until_ms":0}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4e4a9499-07e8-4da2-9416-9770b5a4d421-124","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49