{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_667","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"No renderer process is listed as a direct child.\n\nThe renderer likely runs under the zygote process. The browser is idle at 0.5% CPU, probably stuck on a long waitForFunction timeout. The attract wait throws after 13 seconds, which browserTests catches and then proceeds to touch tests.\n\nThe boot function waits for the game object for 30 seconds. The default timeout is set to 120 seconds only after that. The reload triggers a waitForFunction for the Title screen without an explicit timeout, so it uses the 120-second default.\n\nThe process is still running, so boot completed successfully. The Title screen is likely missing due to a JavaScript error or a hang during the reload.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c2960096-04c5-4149-9916-a5d8eee31583-140","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"ps -eo pid,ppid,etime,pcpu,cmd | awk '$2==508268 || $2==508285 || $2==508266 || $1==508285'","description":"Find the suite renderer process and its CPU"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1235,"output_tokens":557,"cache_read_input_tokens":202880,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"38aebe3d-bf5a-4ba8-a988-9cb954dd4ae2"}
