{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_676","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The bug is clear. Enter/Cross does not activate menu items when paused during an operation because of `model`.\n\nThe exact condition is `screen !== 'Operation'`. ArrowDown still works during pause because moveFocus ignores the screen. The confirm and menu.down events do not occur in one step. After opening the dev overlay, KeyE pages until tipSpeed is visible, then ArrowRight nudges. There is a concern that \"tipSpeed\" might appear earlier in DEV_IDS.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fc9469c6-569d-4ac1-a343-bd463fd582a6-18","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"tipSpeed|TUNING_PAGES|TUNING_RANGES","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/config/tuning.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fc9469c6-569d-4ac1-a343-bd463fd582a6-19","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"screen !== 'Operation'|overlay","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3339,"output_tokens":427,"cache_read_input_tokens":65024,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"9ce06be7-0559-437e-9c8d-e4d70498854f"}
