{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_683","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Touch flow and backends tests passed. 49 tests succeeded. The 5 remaining failures are in scripted tests before the throw.\n\nGPU boots also succeeded. The 49 passed tests break down into roughly 15 packaging checks, 13 scripted pre-failure tests, 4 explicit failures, and 12 touch and webkit tests.\n\nBackend counts add up to 54 completed checks. Next: fix director confirm, harden the slider distance test against clamp, and verify couch menu navigation.\n\nPad and keyboard confirm logic checks out. The couch Enter key should correctly switch the device back to keyboard before firing confirmation.\n\nSeat 0 starts at x=-1.05 and y=0.62, while seat 1 starts at x=-1.05 and y=0.498. Both seats share the same x coordinate.\n\nTip distance after 40 frames at speed 1.9 is roughly 1.77, safely beyond the 0.4 threshold. The test disables aim assist.\n\nBot scores after 2400 steps may not reach broken-glass thresholds in grand rounds, but some scoring should occur. Playthrough caps at 240 seconds. Each bot operation chunk uses 900 steps, or 15 simulation seconds per iteration.\n\nThe playthrough should finish within the 240-second wall. Eight operations at roughly twenty chunks each yield about one hundred sixty evaluate calls, which should be fast enough with physics disabled.\n\nThe earlyReached list merges correctly after the reload. Fail, Free Play, Lobby, Settings, and About are already in the list because the script visited them before the reload.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6d1c5fe6-46d4-4681-9efd-3a783e790e33-29","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function startOperation|physics","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequenc