{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_701","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\"Dev Mode\" only appears in pause items.\n\nThe pause menu is confirmed active. The down arrow bug likely stems from a logic error where inPlay remains true during pause, or from Playwright's key press timing and repeat handling.\n\nThe smoke test steps through the pause menu four times. The Dev Mode check passed, so the overlay is still active. A failed operation would have cleared the overlay and removed that text.\n\nA stuck Escape key is unlikely. The keyup removes Escape from the keys set, so the back edge registers false and pending.pause remains true.\n\nThe ArrowDown press sequence appears correct. The next suspect is a stuck pad button or axis triggering an unintended pause edge. I will inspect the getGamepads stub.\n\nThe gamepad stub is not the culprit. Both pads report all edges as false.\n\nAttention is shifting to the HUD site buttons. A mouse hover at 62%, 40% might land on a data-item button, which would trigger onHover and change model.focus.\n\nThe operation screen returns no items, so site buttons cannot interfere. Focus resets to zero when the pause overlay opens. I will run a reproduction test that logs focus and pause menu state after each press. If it passes, attract mode, reload, or timing differences are the next suspects.\n\nThe suite waits over eighteen seconds for attract mode. That delay is unlikely to affect input handling.\n\nA leftover localStorage save from a previous run could alter menus, but it would not trigger pause during an operation.\n\nThe current suspicion is document visibility. Headless mode might fire a hidden event that pauses the simulation.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-28e4911c-74b0-4cad-a518-619f5c58da5e-53","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"ls -1 \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work\"/*.html | wc -l; ls -l \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work\"/*.html","description":"List root HTML files and sizes"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1866,"output_tokens":1229,"cache_read_input_tokens":111616,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"b488cd68-58f5-498e-94f7-dbb4885a0c72"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-28e4911c-74b0-4cad-a518-619f5c58da5e-53","content":"{\"type\":\"Bash\",\"output\":[49,10,45,114,119,45,114,45,45,114,45,45,32,49,32,109,105,99,104,97,32,109,105,99,104,97,32,51,51,57,56,53,51,49,32,78,111,118,32,32,53,32,48,51,58,50,55,32,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,51,49,50,51,48,95,95,120,56,102,52,57,98,54,47,119,111,114,107,47,65,108,105,118,101,32,105,110,32,67,111,109,109,111,110,32,84,105,109,101,45,84,114,97,117,109,97,32,67,101,110,116,101,114,58,32,83,101,99,111,110,100,32,79,112,105,110,105,111,110,45,103,114,111,107,45,52,46,55,45,120,104,105,103,104,45,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,51,49,50,51,48,46,104,116,109,108,10],\"output_for_prompt\":\"exit: 0\\n1\\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 3398531 Nov  5 03:27 /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230.html\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"command\":\"ls -1 \\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work\\\"/*.html | wc -l; ls -l \\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work\\\"/*.html\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"List root HTML files and sizes\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6%2Fwork/01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710/terminal/call-28e4911c-74b0-4cad-a518-619f5c58da5e-53.log\",\"total_bytes\":217}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uui