{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_721","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The order of visited pages is Free Play, About, and Settings.\n\nThe glyph save test reloads the page before earlyReached is captured. Free Play, About, and Settings are skipped in that snapshot. The later playthrough captures Title, Main Menu, Story, Chart, Operation, Report, and Credits. The merged result still lacks those three pages.\n\nThe glyph reload is a separate earlier reset that wipes reached before the playthrough snapshot. The fix is to call a note() helper before every reload, collecting visited pages into a Set, then merge all three snapshots at the end.\n\nThe helper will be named `noteReached` and called before both reloads and at the end. The initial reload at line 116 is harmless because Title is visited again.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Free Play, Settings, and About were opened, then a reload wiped `reached` before it was recorded. I'll snapshot that list before each reload."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f1d6ff3a-5db8-45a9-81ad-f71fb70d279d-84","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/tests/browser/suite.mjs","old_string":"    page.setDefaultTimeout(120000);\n    await page.evaluate(() => localStorage.clear());","new_string":"    page.setDefaultTimeout(120000);\n    const visited = new Set();\n    const noteReached = async () => {\n      const names = await page.evaluate(() => window.__game?.state?.().reached || []);\n      for (const name of names) visited.add(name);\n    };\n    await page.evaluate(() => localStorage.clear());"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f1d6ff3a-5db8-45a9-81ad-f71fb70d279d-85","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/wo