{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_726","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"While the hub runs, I'll prepare non-browser deliverables that don't require its results.\n\nI'll append the five deviations to PLAN.md and draft a PROGRESS.md update. I'll review exit-interview fields for later, but won't write that file yet since hub results are unknown. I'll also delete the smoke script.\n\nI'll check docs/AUTHORING.md and read session.js for possible fixes. I'll append the deviations to PLAN.md now, then wait three minutes on the hub.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4a7a3854-f1a7-4f52-af4d-d5a6244f5cb8-94","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/PLAN.md","old_string":"| Exit interview, parses as JSON | §19 |","new_string":"| Exit interview, parses as JSON | §19 |\n\n## Deviations\n- Grand Rounds waves at 45s, 90s, 130s, and 165s (plan: 60, 135, 210, 255) so a one-player finish stays inside 45–75% of the 5:00 timer.\n- Coda batons are 9 HP so one beat of laser drops an arm; the plan text reads about 0.5 s.\n- Coda cue notes live 5 beats, and a beam resting on a dropped baton singes a cue within 0.14 without scorching.\n- The grande Adagio has 100 HP, not 150.\n- Growth Spurt's crash sets vitals to 48 and drains 1/s, not 35 and 3/s."}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4a7a3854-f1a7-4f52-af4d-d5a6244f5cb8-95","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"rm -f \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/pause-smoke.mjs\"","description":"Remove the temporary pause smoke script"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1638,"output_tokens":741,"cache_read_input_tokens":150528,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"b765d552-4