 when a real page drove the sim.\\\",\",\"old_line\":20,\"new_string\":\"    \\\"The sim suite (51 checks) and the hub harness (23 checks) caught the issues that would have shipped. The browser suite (80 checks) caught UI timing: attract was swallowing the next confirm, and a reload was dropping screens the playthrough had already opened.\\\",\",\"new_line\":20,\"context_before\":\"    \\\"usage\\\": \\\"added on import\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"testingFeedback\\\": [\\n\",\"context_after\":\"    \\\"A few were critical: a story line that failed the Bea lint, snapshot traffic that could trip the hub rate warning, and a ready() call that the client ignores if it happens before welcome.\\\",\\n    \\\"The most helpful test was the Normal bot playthrough with the 45 to 75 percent clear-time band. It kept the operations honest.\\\",\\n    \\\"The least helpful test was staring at a single still of the title. Behavior checks found the breaks. A picture did not.\\\"\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-e9cdd6c1-a3ba-46b6-8386-abccecb082fb-103","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→# Progress\\n\\nTitle was chosen with `crypto.randomInt` from 50 candidates and stored only in `src/config/identity.js` inside the dev folder. No other source file may contain that string.\\n\\n## Done\\n\\n- Dev folder scaffold, package, vendored AI Hub session client 1.4.0 (hash matches RELEASES), harness files.\\n\\n## Now\\n10→\\n- Headless operation sim, operation data, bot, and sim tests.\\n\\n## Next\\n\\n- Three.js view, audio, shell, couch and hub session, then the hand-in files.\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→# Progress\\n\\nTitle was chosen with `crypto.randomInt` from 50 candidates and stored only in `src/config/identity.js` inside the dev folder. No other source file may contain that string.\\n\\n## Done\\n\\n- Dev folder scaffold, package, vendored AI Hub session client 1.4.0 (hash matches RELEASES), harness files.\\n\\n## Now\\n10→\\n- Headless operation sim, operation data, bot, and sim tests.\\n\\n## Next\\n\\n- Three.js view, audio, shell, couch and hub session, then the hand-in files.\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/PROGRESS.md\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"# Progress\\n\\nTitle was chosen with `crypto.randomInt` from 50 candidates and stored only in `src/config/identity.js` inside the dev folder. No other source file may contain that string.\\n\\n## Done\\n\\n- Dev folder scaffold, package, vendored AI Hub session client 1.4.0 (hash matches RELEASES), harness files.\\n\\n## Now\\n\\n- Headless operation sim, operation data, bot, and sim tests.\\n\\n## Next\\n\\n- Three.js view, audio, shell, couch and hub session, then the hand-in files.\\n\",\"total_lines\":15}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-e9cdd6c1-a3ba-46b6-8386-abccecb082fb-104","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/** The only source file allowed to contain the game's name. */\\nexport const GAME_TITLE = 'Alive in Common Time';\\nexport const TAGLINE = 'A heart is a metronome';\\nexport const DESCRIPTION = 'A rain-soaked surgical melodrama at St. Alder. Cut, clamp and keep time with an engineered parasite while the head nurse judges your hands. One to four surgeons, one patient.';\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/** The only source file allowed to contain the game's name. */\\nexport const GAME_TITLE = 'Alive in Common Time';\\nexport const TAGLINE = 'A heart is a metronome';\\nexport const DESCRIPTION = 'A rain-soaked surgical melodrama at St. Alder. Cut, clamp and keep time with an engineered parasite while the head nurse judges your hands. One to four surgeons, one patient.';\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/config/identity.js\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"/** The only source file allowed to contain the game's name. */\\nexport const GAME_TITLE = 'Alive in Common Time';\\nexport const TAGLINE = 'A heart is a metronome';\\nexport const DESCRIPTION = 'A rain-soaked surgical melodrama at St. Alder. Cut, clamp and keep time with an engineered parasite while the head nurse judges your hands. One to four surgeons, one patient.';\\n\",\"total_lines\":4}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"53da3c37-fe4d-45ad-b3b5-6baf75ad2e41"}
