1,114,97,116,105,111,110,32,105,110,32,100,97,110,103,101,114,44,32,72,117,115,104,44,32,101,97,99,104,32,115,116,114,97,105,110,32,111,110,99,101,44,32,82,101,112,111,114,116,44,32,83,101,116,116,105,110,103,115,44,32,65,98,111,117,116,44,32,115,101,115,115,105,111,110,32,99,97,114,100,46,32,65,100,100,32,111,110,101,32,72,85,68,32,112,111,114,116,114,97,105,116,32,97,110,100,32,111,110,101,32,99,117,116,45,105,110,58,32,102,97,99,101,115,32,109,117,115,116,32,98,101,32,117,112,114,105,103,104,116,46,32,76,111,111,107,32,102,111,114,58,32,116,101,120,116,32,108,101,103,105,98,105,108,105,116,121,32,102,114,111,109,32,116,101,110,32,102,101,101,116,44,32,105,110,107,32,113,117,97,108,105,116,121,44,32,111,118,101,114,108,97,112,115,46,32,70,105,120,32,119,104,97,116,32,121,111,117,32,115,101,101,46,10,49,50,48,56,58,124,32,72,101,97,100,108,101,115,115,32,116,101,115,116,115,44,32,111,110,101,32,99,111,109,109,97,110,100,44,32,102,97,105,108,117,114,101,115,32,97,110,100,32,97,32,99,111,117,110,116,44,32,97,32,102,117,108,108,32,115,99,114,105,112,116,101,100,32,112,108,97,121,116,104,114,111,117,103,104,44,32,115,99,114,101,101,110,115,104,111,116,115,32,111,110,108,121,32,119,104,101,110,32,110,101,101,100,101,100,44,32,110,111,32,114,101,118,105,101,119,32,115,117,98,97,103,101,110,116,115,32,124,32,194,167,49,55,32,124,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":9,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/PLAN.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":423,\"content\":\"### 8.4 Ten-foot rules (tests can't judge these; check at 1920×1080)\"},{\"line_number\":792,\"content\":\"These are all reproduced in §17: it plays shared worlds at 2, 3 and 4 players at 150 ± 50 ms and 5% loss, with a player leaving; `scenario=host-leave`; `scenario=server` at 2 players. It checks the client is exactly one unmodified copy (SHA-256, §16.2). Then, on its own: opens the page, presses Enter, Space, Enter, Space, checks that nothing threw, `AIHub.active` is false, `Math.random` is untouched, and the screenshot isn't blank.\"},{\"line_number\":928,\"content\":\"**Use these five flags.** Your brief's machine notes list a shorter set (`--enable-unsafe-webgpu --enable-features=Vulkan --use-webgpu-adapter=swiftshader`). On this computer, those alone **lose the device right after the first frame** (console: \\\"A valid external Instance reference no longer exists\\\"), which is why a screenshot comes out blank. With the hub's flags, frames draw, `page.screenshot` works, and pixel readback works:\"},{\"line_number\":1036,\"content\":\"Tune `line`, thresholds and colors to taste at 1920×1080. If you add outline-worthy color edges (a stripe on one surface), remember the filter only sees depth and normal breaks, so paint them dark.\"},{\"line_number\":1101,\"content\":\"## 17. Testing\"},{\"line_number\":1118,\"content\":\"- Boots on `webgpu` with flags and `webgl2` without; no page errors on either; screenshot not blank (PNG well above a blank page's size). WebKit boots.\"},{\"line_number\":1141,\"content\":\"Wait for `body[data-complete=\\\"true\\\"]` (allow 300 s), and require `window.__hubCheck.pass === true` and **no console line starting `[AIHub]`**. Use a 1280×860 viewport. Run all five with the §16.3 flags, and the 4-player run once more without them (WebGL2). Then **on its own:** load the page, wait 2.5 s, press Enter, Space, Enter, Space with 500 ms gaps, wait 2 s; require no page errors, `AIHub.active === false`, `AIHub.seeded !== true`, and a non-blank screenshot.\"},{\"line_number\":1143,\"content\":\"**Screenshots, only for what scripts can't judge.** At 1920×1080: Title, Main Menu, one story scene with a shout, Operation at a calm moment, Operation in danger, Hush, each strain once, Report, Settings, About, session card. Add one HUD portrait and one cut-in: faces must be upright. Look for: text legibility from ten feet, ink quality, overlaps. Fix what you see.\"},{\"line_number\":1208,\"content\":\"| Headless tests, one command, failures and a count, a full scripted playthrough, screenshots only when needed, no review subagents | §17 |\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-6aaee4e8-12e5-483e-969f-f574d6595cac-119","content":"{\"type\":\"TaskOutput\",\"Result\":{\"task_id\":\"0d21b7f9-d52f-4aae-a595-50047ffbc86e\",\"command\":\"node \\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/launch.mjs\\\" > \\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/launch.log\\\" 2>&1; echo EXIT:$? >> \\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/launch.log\\\"\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"exit_code\":0,\"started\":\"2026-11-05T10:49:46Z\",\"ended\":\"2026-11-05T10:50:15Z\",\"duration_secs\":29.351529688,\"output\":\"\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6%2Fwork/01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710/terminal/call-61478861-3b7d-4b6d-bb67-51cfc1a47529-117.log\",\"truncated\":false,\"truncation_hint\":\"[truncated - use read_file on output_file for full content]\",\"raw_output_bytes\":0}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"87f43c7c-4b11-454e-ae5b-2862b45380ce"}
