{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-6f89a6bb-8a7f-44a3-a881-674ab0a73d08-120","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→(node:604598) Warning: The 'NO_COLOR' env is ignored due to the 'FORCE_COLOR' env being set.\\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\\nrun 1\\n  game true screen Title backend webgpu\\n  canvas 1280x720 client 1280x720\\n  tip -1.05 -> 0.849999999999999\\n  painted 1 of 921600\\n  errors none\\nrun 2\\n10→  game true screen Title backend webgpu\\n  canvas 1280x720 client 1280x720\\n  tip -1.05 -> 0.849999999999999\\n  painted 1 of 921600\\n  errors none\\nagree size true client true moved true painted true quiet true webgpu true\\nEXIT:0\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→(node:604598) Warning: The 'NO_COLOR' env is ignored due to the 'FORCE_COLOR' env being set.\\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\\nrun 1\\n  game true screen Title backend webgpu\\n  canvas 1280x720 client 1280x720\\n  tip -1.05 -> 0.849999999999999\\n  painted 1 of 921600\\n  errors none\\nrun 2\\n10→  game true screen Title backend webgpu\\n  canvas 1280x720 client 1280x720\\n  tip -1.05 -> 0.849999999999999\\n  painted 1 of 921600\\n  errors none\\nagree size true client true moved true painted true quiet true webgpu true\\nEXIT:0\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/launch.log\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"(node:604598) Warning: The 'NO_COLOR' env is ignored due to the 'FORCE_COLOR' env being set.\\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\\nrun 1\\n  game true screen Title backend webgpu\\n  canvas 1280x720 client 1280x720\\n  tip -1.05 -> 0.849999999999999\\n  painted 1 of 921600\\n  errors none\\nrun 2\\n  game true screen Title backend webgpu\\n  canvas 1280x720 client 1280x720\\n  tip -1.0