{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_747","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The operation field shows the patient, gel tool, HUD, vitals at 100, a 4:00 timer, and a heart rate of 72.\n\nBoth launches agree. The gel cursor moved from -1.05 to 0.85. The field is substantially filled. A bottom \"CC\" button is clipped at 1280x720. This matches the plan's overlap check.\n\nThe HTML font scales with viewport height. At 720 pixels the text is only two-thirds of the 1080 design size. Fixed rem values may still overflow and clip. The plan requires checking at 1920x1080 for ten-foot legibility and overlap issues. If clipping persists at 1080, a fix will be needed.\n\nThe clipped bottom control is a real visual bug. I will inspect the right-side button CSS for overflow at 1080. I will also take a 1920x1080 screenshot of the operation to confirm the clipping.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Both launches draw the same operation on WebGPU. The bottom prompt is cut off, so I'll check the layout at the design size."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-69af289b-6e81-4ddf-b4c2-0b3d22c7e5cc-123","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"prompt|rail|SPACE|stabilizer|position:\\s*fixed|overflow","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/ui/ui.css"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-69af289b-6e81-4ddf-b4c2-0b3d22c7e5cc-124","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"gift|stabilizer|prompt","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2579,"output_tokens":768,"cache_read_input_tokens":180096,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-d