ine the browser bundle so `file://` works. Use the five WebGPU flags from PLAN §16.3, not the shorter set in TASK.md. One browser at a time. Stop only processes this work started, by PID.\\n\\n## Task checklist\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\\n## Risks / Contradictions\\n- TASK.md’s shorter WebGPU flags drop the device after the first frame on this machine; PLAN §16.3’s five flags are the ones that draw. A blank readback with those five flags is an app bug, not an excuse to skip the launch check.\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-57989395-7171-438f-911b-92a108af16f4-138","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"# Progress\\n\\nThe title was chosen with `crypto.randomInt` from 50 candidates and stored only in `src/config/identity.js` inside the dev folder. No other source file may contain that string.\\n\\n## Done\\n\\n- Dev folder, package, vendored AI Hub session client 1.4.0, and the single-file build.\\n- Headless sim, operations, bot, and sim suite: 0 failed, 51 passed.\\n- View, audio, menus, save, attract, dev mode, couch, and hub session.\\n- Browser suite: 0 failed, 80 passed. Hub harness: 0 failed, 23 passed.\\n- Authoring note, About data, and exit interview.\\n\\n## Now\\n\\n- Two WebGPU launches of the root page, then the package check.\\n\\n## Next\\n\\n- Nothing further once those logs are saved.\\n\",\"new_string\":\"# Progress\\n\\nThe title was chosen with `crypto.randomInt` from 50 candidates and stored only in `src/config/identity.js` inside the dev folder. No other source file may contain that string.\\n\\n## Done\\n\\n- Dev folder, package, vendored AI Hub session client 1.4.0, and the single-file build.\\n- Headless sim, operations, bot, and sim suite: 0 failed, 51 passed.\\n- View, audio, menus, save, attract, dev mode, couch, and hub session.\\n- Browser suite: 0 failed, 80 passed. Hub harness: 0 failed, 23 passed.\\n- Authoring note, About data, exit interv