{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_782","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"feedSim checks sim.over and setScreen Report.\n\nsucceed() sets complete and over. The full portrait screenshot may show a small plane at the bottom of the camera. The cut-in mesh appears during story shout(true).\n\nStory mode hides the portrait and shows story busts. The cut-in mesh is a child of the OR camera, which may not be the story camera. Story busts are placed at y=-0.4 z=0 x=±2.1. The OR camera is at (0, 3.55, 1.65) looking at (0, 0.1, 0.06).\n\nThe cut-in mesh sits at (0.7, 0.25, -1.6) directly in front of the camera. It remains visible in both modes while active. Story-shout.png will cover it. A dedicated cut-in screenshot is also needed. The HUD portrait appears during operation and is covered by op-calm.png. A zoomed portrait.png copy may be taken.\n\nI will save hud-portrait.png from the operation shot and cut-in.png from the story shout. I will not fake or alter the scene for a better capture. If the portrait is too small to judge, I may check its 3D placement.\n\nThe portrait plane is 0.7 units wide at a distance of 1.4, giving it an angular size of roughly 28 degrees. It sits below center and may overlap the HUD bark. The cut-in mesh is similarly large. A second browser session will be used for the session card.\n\nThe harness will be served over HTTP to avoid iframe and file:// restrictions. The session card screenshot must be taken during the 10-second splash screen before the round begins, since the card remains visible while AIHub.time() is -Infinity.\n\nThe harness will load game.html with webgl=1 and no GPU flags for speed. The card UI is DOM-based and does not need WebGPU. I will hide the harness chrome via CSS after loading and set the iframe to 1920x1080 so the card can be judged at ten-foot scale.\n\nThe iframe will fill the 1920x1080 viewport after hiding the harness header and sidebar. WebGL boot at this resolution may take 10–20 seconds, so a 120-second timeout is needed. I must avoid auto=1 because that would start the round and hide the card. I will poll quickly to capture the Card screen before the splash timer expires.\n\nThe 10-second splash timer begins at round start, not page load, so slow game loading could expire it early. I will capture the Card screen as soon as the iframe state reads `screen === 'Card'`. I will verify the three HTML files match the latest build by checking their sizes during script setup. Menu navigation will use real keyboard input rather than evaluate.\n\nThe about screen is reached by moving focus down four times from the main menu and pressing Enter. Settings is accessed by moving down three times and pressing Enter, then closed with Escape to return to the menu. devRun is a real API path that opens the scene directly, which is acceptable for reaching a shout line. The title screen must be exited quickly to avoid triggering the attract mode.\n\nWebGPU initialization at 1920 resolution may exceed the 10-second Title wall-clock limit. If so, attract mode starts before the screenshot is taken, and the title image would show an attract demo instead of the title screen. The title must be captured immediately upon detection, before that threshold.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e7ddcb08-d615-4c3c-a252-a69e6220986c-61","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"attract","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js","head_limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e7ddcb08-d615-4c3c-a252-a69e6220986c-62","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js","offset":1338,"limit":50}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":595,"output_tokens":1873,"cache_read_input_tokens":106240,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"6d2211f0-22e0-4fc4-9a93-19786bb5f751"}
