",\\\"fs\\\":35,\\\"small\\\":false,\\\"clip\\\":false,\\\"unsafe\\\":true,\\\"key\\\":false,\\\"x\\\":96,\\\"y\\\":990,\\\"w\\\":1728,\\\"h\\\":44}\\nstory line NARRATION The beeps land on the bar line. The silhouette bows.\\nstory-shout.png screen=Story phase=null vitals= attract=false bytes=3111027 issues=1\\n  {\\\"text\\\":\\\"OR 3 at night\\\",\\\"fs\\\":16,\\\"small\\\":true,\\\"clip\\\":false,\\\"unsafe\\\":false,\\\"key\\\":false,\\\"x\\\":96,\\\"y\\\":70,\\\"w\\\":1728,\\\"h\\\":19}\\n\\n\\nWaited the requested 120s. Unless the user specified, do not kill this task just because this wait returned. It is still working. You will be notified automatically when it completes. Do other work, or wait again with a longer timeout_ms.\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6%2Fwork/01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710/terminal/call-907100ef-c7e0-4329-b5da-46fa3fbce81a-80.log\",\"truncated\":false,\"truncation_hint\":\"[truncated - use read_file on output_file for full content]\",\"raw_output_bytes\":4179}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"c130da3e-f4b6-4937-8a32-5eac98acb519"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_798","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The script is progressing. A title shot accidentally caught the attract sequence.\n\nThe 10-second attract timer likely fired because the page had already been on the title screen for over 8 seconds before the shot began.\n\nWebGPU initialization during idle time counts toward the 10-second attract timer. The title.png image is actually the attract HUD, not the title screen. I will recapture the title after exiting attract immediately.\n\nsettings.png is actually the Lobby screen, not Settings. The arrow key focus movement or Enter behavior differs from expectations. Pressing Enter while attract is active exits the attract menu rather than opening the main menu.\n\nThe second Enter press successfully exited attract and reached the Main Menu. The focus behavior that sent three downs to Lobby instead of Settings remains unexplained.\n\nThe focus logic should have reached Settings after three downs, yet the script landed on Lobby. An extra down press or an unexpected activation path for Settings versus Rounds is suspected. Key repeat was ruled out.\n\nThe main menu shot captured attract as false, ruling out a fresh attract trigger during the 1.8-second wait. The lobby text visible in settings.png confirms the script landed on Lobby instead of Settings. I will examine the activate functions for both settings and rounds to find the focus mismatch.\n\nThree downs landed on Grand Rounds instead of Settings. The focus may have started at index 1, or the first ArrowDown was consumed by the attract menu. I will inspect how pending.down is set in onKey and step, since press() fires keydown and keyup before advancing.\n\nI checked whether the keyup event clears pending.down before step() runs. I also considered if the keydown handler moves focus immediately while step() does it again, causing a double move per press. That would shift focus by six positions across five items, landing on free rather than lobby, so this theory does not explain the result.\n\nThe double-move theory is ruled out. Six downs would land on About or Free Play, not Lobby. Only two downs occurred, so the first ArrowDown was likely lost. I will read moveFocus and onKey carefully to find why.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ca015bc6-4859-4787-8074-977e6287916a-82","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js","offset":850,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ca015bc6-4859-4787-8074-977e6287916a-83","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function onKey|pending\\.|keydown","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/input/input.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1977,"output_tokens":1510,"cache_read_input_tokens":133120,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"b9c153d6-8187-4c8f-87bf-6a9c15e61726"}
