{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_804","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Pixel samples confirm a large pale region at the top center of title.png and main-menu.png.\n\nf4efe4 is the UI cream. It marks menu buttons, bark bubbles, and wheel areas in both images.\n\nThe top pale blob is not UI cream. It is a lit skin tone, likely from the portrait or lamp. The wide band spans about 40% of the width and 25% of the height.\n\nThe organ is dark, so it cannot be the pale blob. The blob is likely the portrait plane or lamp. Its position at the top suggests the camera local Y axis may be inverted.\n\nThe portrait mesh is positioned at y = -0.55, which should place it below the center. The top placement of the pale blob may instead be caused by incorrect scaling or a misidentified geometry.\n\nThe portrait texture is a 256x256 bust rendered by bustCam. If the camera is too close or the bust is too large, the texture captures a pale head or chin cropped at the top of the frame. This would match the observed pale blob exactly. The camera looks down from above, so the plane should sit below center. The reason it appears at the top remains unclear.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a1b210ae-542a-4d30-871a-56c77ae487c0-97","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/view/renderer.js","offset":250,"limit":120}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1918,"output_tokens":1073,"cache_read_input_tokens":154240,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"bf864c55-0ff1-4bb6-a4e5-a5838cd09ee5"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-a1b210ae-542a-4d30-871a-56c77ae487c0-97","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"250→\\n  let juice = null;\\n  try {\\n    await RAPIER.init();\\n    juice = new RAPIER.World({ x: 0, y: -4, z: 0 });\\n  } catch {\\n    juice = null;\\n  }\\n\\n  const mode = { name: 'or' };\\n260→  let painted = false;\\n  let shake = 0;\\n  let boil = 1;\\n\\n  function resize() {\\n    const w = canvas.clientWidth || window.innerWidth || 1280;\\n    const h = canvas.clientHeight || window.innerHeight || 720;\\n    renderer.setSize(w, h, false);\\n    if (mode.name === 'story') placeStoryCamera(camera, w / h);\\n    else placeOrCamera(camera, w / h);\\n270→  }\\n\\n  function setOrgan(organId) {\\n    or.remove(organ);\\n    organ.geometry.dispose();\\n    organ = makeOrgan(organId || 'forearm');\\n    or.add(organ);\\n  }\\n\\n  function ensureTip(seat) {\\n280→    let rig = tips.get(seat.id);\\n    if (!rig) {\\n      rig = new THREE.Group();\\n      const ring = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.TorusGeometry(0.08, 0.012, 6, 12), toon({ color: seat.color || '#e8443a' }));\\n      ring.rotation.x = Math.PI / 2;\\n      rig.add(ring);\\n      for (const k of tools) {\\n        const m = toolMesh(k);\\n        m.visible = k === (seat.tool || 'gel');\\n        rig.add(m);\\n290→      }\\n      or.add(rig);\\n      tips.set(seat.id, rig);\\n    }\\n    return rig;\\n  }\\n\\n  function sync(state, dt = 0.016) {\\n    if (!state) return;\\n    const organId = state.organ || state.siteOrgan || 'forearm';\\n300→    if (organ.userData.organ !== organId) {\\n      organ.userData.organ = organId;\\n      setOrgan(organId);\\n      organ.userData.organ = organId;\\n    }\\n    const beat = state.beatPhase || 0;\\n    if (organ.userData.beat) organ.userData.beat.value = Math.sin(beat * Math.PI * 2) * 0.5 + 0.5;\\n    mixer.update(dt);\\n    const danger = state.vitals != null ? Math.max(0, (40 - state.vitals) / 40) : 0;\\n    if (ink) {\\n310→      ink.u.danger.value = danger * boil;\\n      ink.u.hushRadius.value = state.hush ? Math.min(1.8, (state.hushT || 0.4) * 2) : 0;\\n      ink.u.flash.value = Math.max(0, (ink.u.flash.value || 0) - dt * 2);\\n      ink.u.speedLines.value = Math.max(0, (ink.u.speedLines.value || 0) - dt);\\n    }\\n    const seen = new Set();\\n    for (const seat of state.seats || []) {\\n      if (seat.out) continue;\\n      const rig = ensureTip(seat);\\n      const p = fieldToWorld(seat.x, seat.y, 0.16);\\n320→      rig.position.lerp(p, 0.65);\\n      rig.rotation.z = -0.4;\\n      for (const child of rig.children) {\\n        if (child.userData?.kind) child.visible = child.userData.kind === (seat.tool || 'gel');\\n      }\\n      seen.add(seat.id);\\n      if (ink && seat.id === state.seats[0]?.id) {\\n        const ndc = p.clone().project(camera);\\n        ink.u.hushCenter.value.set((ndc.x + 1) / 2, (1 - ndc.y) / 2);\\n      }\\n330→    }\\n    for (const [id, rig] of tips) {\\n      if (!seen.has(id)) { or.remove(rig); tips.delete(id); }\\n    }\\n    const have = new Set();\\n    for (const e of state.entities || []) {\\n      if (e.site && state.site && e.site !== state.site) continue;\\n      have.add(e.id);\\n      let mesh = entities.get(e.id);\\n      if (!mesh || mesh.userData.kind !== e.kind) {\\n340→        if (mesh) or.remove(mesh);\\n        mesh = e.kind === 'adagio' ? skinnedAdagio() : entityMesh(e.kind);\\n        mesh.userData.kind = e.kind;\\n        or.add(mesh);\\n        entities.set(e.id, mesh);\\n      }\\n      const lift = e.kind === 'gelZone' || e.kind === 'pool' ? 0.02 : 0.08 + (e.size || 0) * 0.05;\\n      mesh.position.copy(fieldToWorld(e.x || 0, e.y || 0, lift));\\n      const s = 0.7 + Math.min(1.4, (e.size || 0.3));\\n      mesh.scale.setScalar(e.kind === 'coda' ? 1.3 : s);\\n350→      if (mesh.userData.bone) mesh.userData.bone.rotation.z = Math.sin((state.beat || 0) * 0.7) * 0.4;\\n    }\\n    for (const [id, mesh] of entities) {\\n      if (!have.has(id)) { or.remove(mesh); entities.delete(id); }\\n    }\\n    if (shake > 0) {\\n      camera.position.x += (Math.sin(shake * 40) * 0.02);\\n      shake = Math.max(0, shake - dt);\\n    }\\n  }\\n360→\\n  function showStory(setName, leftWho, rightWho) {\\n    mode.name = 'story';\\n    or.visible = false;\\n    story.visible = true;\\n    portrait.visible = false;\\n    if (storySet !== setName) {\\n      story.clear();\\n      story.add(storyRoom(setName || 'or'));\\n      storySet = setName;\",\"content_concise\":\"250→\\n  let juice = null;\\n  try {\\n    await RAPIER.init();\\n    juice = new RAPIER.World({ x: 0, y: -4, z: 0 });\\n  } catch {\\n    juice = null;\\n  }\\n\\n  const mode = { name: 'or' };\\n260→  let painted = false;\\n  let shake = 0;\\n  let boil = 1;\\n\\n  function resize() {\\n    const w = canvas.clientWidth || window.innerWidth || 1280;\\n    const h = canvas.clientHeight || window.innerHeight || 720;\\n    renderer.setSize(w, h, false);\\n    if (mode.name === 'story') placeStoryCamera(camera, w / h);\\n    else placeOrCamera(camera, w / h);\\n270→  }\\n\\n  function setOrgan(organId) {\\n    or.remove(organ);\\n    organ.geometry.dispose();\\n    organ = makeOrgan(organId || 'forearm');\\n    or.add(organ);\\n  }\\n\\n  function ensureTip(seat) {\\n280→    let rig = tips.get(seat.id);\\n    if (!rig) {\\n      rig = new THREE.Group();\\n      const ring = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.TorusGeometry(0.08, 0.012, 6, 12), toon({ color: seat.color || '#e8443a' }));\\n      ring.rotation.x = Math.PI / 2;\\n      rig.add(ring);\\n      for (const k of tools) {\\n        const m = toolMesh(k);\\n        m.visible = k === (seat.tool || 'gel');\\n        rig.add(m);\\n290→      }\\n      or.add(rig);\\n      tips.set(seat.id, rig);\\n    }\\n    return rig;\\n  }\\n\\n  function sync(state, dt = 0.016) {\\n    if (!state) return;\\n    const organId = state.organ || state.siteOrgan |