{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-eb2e7464-e7f8-4028-bdd4-ccd504c2ca96-106","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"ImageContent\":{\"data\":\"\",\"mime_type\":\"image/jpeg\"}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-eb2e7464-e7f8-4028-bdd4-ccd504c2ca96-107","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"ImageContent\":{\"data\":\"\",\"mime_type\":\"image/jpeg\"}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-eb2e7464-e7f8-4028-bdd4-ccd504c2ca96-108","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"ImageContent\":{\"data\":\"\",\"mime_type\":\"image/jpeg\"}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-eb2e7464-e7f8-4028-bdd4-ccd504c2ca96-109","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"ImageContent\":{\"data\":\"\",\"mime_type\":\"image/jpeg\"}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-eb2e7464-e7f8-4028-bdd4-ccd504c2ca96-110","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"ImageContent\":{\"data\":\"\",\"mime_type\":\"image/jpeg\"}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"f8af4381-d26b-4aab-b277-ee421fc375b1"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_811","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The image descriptions keep referring to the top shape as a chin or lamp shade with speed lines.\n\nThe adagio shot's speed lines match the ink filter or line boil plus the lamp. The main-menu.png description still shows operation HUD text despite the log indicating the Main Menu screen. The vision model may be describing a composite of canvas and DOM text, with the menu logo possibly invisible.\n\nThe screenshot cannot be the main menu DOM. Operation HUD elements like DEMO and \"Disinfect the wound\" are still visible, which contradicts the log showing attract=false and screen=Main Menu. The state or rendering logic is inconsistent.\n\nThe screenshot may have been overwritten by a later main-menu.png. The vision model might be hallucinating the operation HUD while the menu is actually present. The shot() function waits for state before taking the screenshot, so the file on disk could be stale.\n\nThe audit found zero issues on the main menu, confirming the DOM was indeed the menu at that moment. The operation HUD text would have been flagged if present. This means the menu DOM is there and the 3D operation is behind it. The vision model failed to see the menu text despite its large logo.\n\nThe menu text might be invisible due to matching background color or zero opacity. The vision model may have focused on the center 3D scene and hallucinated the HUD text. Objectives are DOM elements, not painted canvas. A race condition is also possible: the screenshot could capture a later frame after the attract mode restarted and repainted the HUD, while the audit captured the menu state.\n\nThe 10-second attract mode makes a race condition unlikely. The screenshot is taken after the audit, so the DOM should already be the menu. A pixel sample of main-menu.png shows teal pixels where the \"DEMO\" text would appear, not white. This suggests the screenshot may actually show the operation HUD rather than the main menu.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b7e9efe4-fddd-450c-ae04-69af5aaec3ec-111","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"S=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/shots\"\nmagick \"$S/main-menu.png\" -crop 700x900+40+40 \"$S/crop-menu-left.jpg\"\nmagick \"$S/main-menu.png\" -crop 500x200+1400+0 \"$S/crop-menu-tr.jpg\"\nmagick \"$S/story-shout.png\" -crop 700x500+80+280 \"$S/crop-faces.jpg\"\nmagick \"$S/op-calm.png\" -crop 700x400+600+0 \"$S/crop-lamp.jpg\"\nmagick \"$S/strain-coda.png\" -resize 960x540 \"$S/preview-coda.jpg\"\necho ok","description":"Crop menu, faces, and lamp regions"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3512,"output_tokens":1137,"cache_read_input_tokens":181632,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"a9853ec6-9f15-49a7-8f87-29f358bb4a91"}
