{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_816","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A scale of 0.35 at y=2.2 has a bottom value of 1.\n\nThe lamp will be repositioned at y=2.15 with scale 0.22 to avoid off-screen clipping. It may be hidden if it still dominates. The portrait might be hidden behind the dark tray or below the screen.\n\nThe portrait will be placed at camera-local y = -0.269 and x = -0.15. It will sit low in the frame, slightly left of center, so it remains visible without covering the wound.\n\nThe portrait cannot sit at the bottom center because the bark would cover it. It must be placed beside the bark instead, such as to the left of the bubble.\n\nThe portrait will be placed at (0, -0.34, -1.65) with size 0.42 by 0.42. It sits low in the frame and clips slightly at the bottom edge.\n\nA cut-in for the story camera will be placed at (0.55, 0.12, -2.4) with size 0.85 by 0.55. Both planes are fully inside the viewport.\n\nA cream border plane will sit behind the cut-in. Both the frame and cut-in will be parented to a shared group that hides when the OR camera is active.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4455c5b0-2a17-4105-8af1-7343ec81fb32-119","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"uvs.setXY|phiLength|thetaLength","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/node_modules/three/src/geometries/SphereGeometry.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1131,"output_tokens":1144,"cache_read_input_tokens":192640,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"df88f495-95d2-4c95-b694-cdbf81767d02"}
