{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_821","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will read STAGE.md and follow its instructions to complete the remaining tasks.\n\nResuming from where I left off. I will kill leftover processes, rebuild the project, fix race conditions in shots.mjs, recapture screenshots, review the PNGs, rerun the browser suite, and update PROGRESS.md.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The visual edits are in source and the shipped page is still the old build. I’ll confirm those edits, clear any leftover browser from the failed shot run, then rebuild and recapture."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-22fb6309-4803-443b-9f38-f6eee64016df-0","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"fix","content":"Fix ten-foot type, ink, or overlap the shots show","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"shots","content":"Capture 1920x1080 screens PLAN asks for and inspect them","status":"pending"},{"id":"verify","content":"Rebuild and re-check anything the fixes change","status":"pending"}],"merge":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-22fb6309-4803-443b-9f38-f6eee64016df-1","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/.grok/bundled/skills/long-running-background-tasks/SKILL.md","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-22fb6309-4803-443b-9f38-f6eee64016df-2","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"ss -ltnp 2>/dev/null | grep -E '45741|chromium|chrome' || true; pgrep -af 'chromium|chrome|shots.mjs|playwright' | head -40; echo '---'; ls -la \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/shots.mjs\" 2>/dev/null; echo '---html---'; ls -la \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/\"*.html 2>/dev/null | head -5","description":"Find leftover browsers and shipped HTML"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":26339,"output_tokens":675,"cache_read_input