{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_826","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can keep the last input fresh during screenshots by dispatching a pointermove or a key that doesn't change menus.\n\nAny key press sets lastInput. On the Title screen, any key also triggers pending.confirm.\n\nPointer events refresh lastInput without setting pending, so they won't trigger menu exits. They only exit attract mode when it is active.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0fca46e8-a659-4e82-9742-0ae4d53e7788-15","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"onPointer|pointerdown|mousemove|addEventListener","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src","glob":"*.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0fca46e8-a659-4e82-9742-0ae4d53e7788-16","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js","offset":1660,"limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7898,"output_tokens":593,"cache_read_input_tokens":59648,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"aa468140-476e-496b-a5f3-78b2203b4ee0"}
