{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_829","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Pointerdown keep-awake is safe for menus if pointerup is not followed by a button press.\n\nPointerdown exits attract mode and blocks the menu. The title screenshot must run while the keep-awake interval is active. blockMenu needs to be cleared before the confirm step so Enter reaches the Main Menu.\n\nA single Enter press clears blockMenu and triggers the menu confirm in the same step. This cleanly exits the title screen.\n\nSettings navigation will use a `gotoFocus` helper that presses ArrowDown until the target focusId appears on the Main Menu, then presses Enter. The summary indicates the settings focusId is 'settings'.\n\nAbout navigation loops from Main Menu back to the story focus, then continues until focusId is 'about'. Card capture waits for the iframe game state to reach the 'Card' screen. The 10-second SPLASH timeout may be insufficient because WebGL boot of a 3.4MB page takes a few seconds.\n\nThe Card screenshot must happen immediately when the screen reaches Card, before the splash transitions to Operation. Harness chrome should be hidden during capture. Browser and server cleanup belongs in a try/finally block. The card evaluation bug assumes the game object exists whenever the iframe is present, so it should only run after confirming the screen is Card. Portrait visibility during story mode needs checking against cutGroup visibility.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a9c60a44-310e-4af9-914c-6ab9d88f7941-23","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function resize|function placeStoryCamera|mode\\.name|storyCam","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/view/renderer.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a9c60a44-310e-4af9-914c-6ab9d88f7941-24","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js","offset":520,"limit":140}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4630,"output_tokens":984,"cache_read_input_tokens":71808,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"0e8b8522-bdd9-4f97-bee9-5ac1bc33a47f"}
