{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_841","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The organ is centered at NDC y=0.039.\n\nA lamp at y=1.55 with scale 0.35 produces a thin visible band near the top of the frame. The organ at y=0.04 remains clear. This creates a visible rim that reads as a lamp.\n\nThe organ plane is 3.6 by 2.5 units, rotated to the XZ plane at y=0.08. Its far edge projects higher than its near edge. A lamp at y=1.45 with scale 0.35 would sit within this upper band.\n\nThe portrait overlaps the organ center and must be moved to a corner. It will be placed at (-0.62, -0.32, -1.65) with size 0.16 by 0.16. The NDC position is being computed.\n\nThe portrait spans NDC x -0.78 to -0.60 and y -0.79 to -0.48. It sits near the bottom of the viewport, so the bottom-left UI wheel may overlap it.\n\nThe portrait overlaps the tool wheel vertically. A lower-right placement is being considered to avoid this. Alternatively, a mid-left position beside the wound is being evaluated.\n\nThe portrait will be placed at NDC (-0.72, -0.35). This position sits on the left side, mid-low, and above the bottom UI wheel.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d929253f-3608-410f-9c5a-4aec3e7cc50f-40","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/project.mjs","old_string":"const organ = ndc(cam, new THREE.Vector3(0, 0.08, 0));\nconsole.log('organ', JSON.stringify(organ));","new_string":"const organPts = [];\nfor (const x of [-1.8, 0, 1.8]) for (const z of [-1.25, 0, 1.25]) organPts.push(ndc(cam, new THREE.Vector3(x, 0.08, z)));\nconsole.log('organ', JSON.stringify(organPts));"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1878,"output_tokens":1415,"cache_read_input_tokens":94848,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a