{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_848","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A bug was found: draw() calls showOr() every frame during operation, forcing the portrait to stay visible.\n\nshowOr() also calls placeLamp(false) every frame during operation. Menu present() ordering is correct.\n\nStory draw() calls present() every frame, recreating busts each time. This is a pre-existing issue and will be left alone.\n\nUpdating project.mjs with new portrait and cut coordinates plus the lamp peek. Rewriting shots.mjs from scratch to replace shot functions, navigation, card handling, and final logic. Overwriting PNGs instead of deleting preview JPGs. Installing a keep-awake timer immediately after boot to prevent idle sleep during title screenshots.\n\nThe keep-awake script fires pointerdown events at 4,4 every 1.5 seconds to prevent idle sleep. This risks moving the device tip during operation shots, since test.step may read pointer position at that coordinate. Need to verify whether the simulation uses absolute mouse position during test steps.\n\nPointer events would shift the tool tip to the corner during operation shots because the simulation reads absolute pointer position. Menu shots are safe. Operation shots do not need keep-awake since attract mode is already exited. The keep-awake interval will be left running only during title and menu navigation.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-139a692c-fb96-42c2-99f6-4b5799bbc9ff-54","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/input/input.js","offset":100,"limit":120}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":924,"output_tokens":836,"cache_read_input_tokens":106112,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"8b340e92-93d2-4016-bb1f-fc9830d1168e"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-139a692c-fb96-42c2-99f6-4b5799bbc9ff-54","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"100→    const swap = !!settings.swapSticks;\\n    const aimX = swap ? axes[0] : axes[2];\\n    const aimY = swap ? axes[1] : axes[3];\\n    const toolX = swap ? axes[2] : axes[0];\\n    const toolY = swap ? axes[3] : axes[1];\\n    const frame = emptyFrame();\\n    frame.source = 'stick';\\n    frame.x = aimX || 0;\\n    frame.y = -(aimY || 0);\\n    frame.use = Math.max(b(7).value || 0, b(0).pressed ? 1 : 0);\\n110→    frame.steady = b(6).pressed || b(6).value > 0.4;\\n    frame.alt = b(1).pressed;\\n    frame.syringe = b(2).pressed || b(14).pressed;\\n    frame.special = b(3).pressed || b(12).pressed;\\n    frame.swap = b(15).pressed;\\n    if (b(4).pressed) frame.siteDelta = -1;\\n    if (b(5).pressed) frame.siteDelta = 1;\\n    const picked = toolFromStick(toolX || 0, -(toolY || 0), wheelPick);\\n    if (Math.hypot(toolX || 0, toolY || 0) > 0.6) {\\n      wheelPick = picked;\\n120→      frame.tool = picked;\\n    }\\n    const prev = prevPad[index] || {};\\n    const up = b(12).pressed || (axes[1] || 0) < -0.55;\\n    const down = b(13).pressed || (axes[1] || 0) > 0.55;\\n    const edges = {\\n      confirm: b(0).pressed && !prev.confirm,\\n      back: b(1).pressed && !prev.back,\\n      pause: b(9).pressed && !prev.pause && !b(8).pressed,\\n      special: b(3).pressed && !prev.special,\\n130→      pageLeft: b(4).pressed && !prev.l1,\\n      pageRight: b(5).pressed && !prev.r1,\\n      up: up && !prev.up,\\n      down: down && !prev.down,\\n      create: b(8).pressed,\\n      more: (b(3).pressed && !prev.special),\\n    };\\n    prevPad[index] = {\\n      confirm: b(0).pressed, back: b(1).pressed, pause: b(9).pressed, special: b(3).pressed,\\n      l1: b(4).pressed, r1: b(5).pressed, up, down,\\n140→    };\\n    if (settings.rumble && got.pad.vibrationActuator && b(7).value > 0.8) {\\n      try { got.pad.vibrationActuator.playEffect('dual-rumble', { duration: 40, strongMagnitude: 0.2, weakMagnitude: 0.3 }); } catch { /* actuator missing */ }\\n    }\\n    return { frame, edges };\\n  }\\n\\n  function keyboardFrame(settings) {\\n    const frame = emptyFrame();\\n    const mouseAim = device === 'mouse' && game.view?.pointerToField;\\n150→    if (mouseAim && game.screen === 'Operation') {\\n      const p = game.view.pointerToField(pointer.x, pointer.y);\\n      frame.source = 'abs';\\n      frame.x = p.x;\\n      frame.y = p.y;\\n      frame.use = pointer.down && pointer.button === 0 ? 1 : 0;\\n      frame.alt = pointer.button === 2 && pointer.down;\\n    } else {\\n      let x = 0;\\n      let y = 0;\\n160→      if (down('KeyA', 'a', 'ArrowLeft')) x -= 1;\\n      if (down('KeyD', 'd', 'ArrowRight')) x += 1;\\n      if (down('KeyW', 'w', 'ArrowUp')) y += 1;\\n      if (down('KeyS', 's', 'ArrowDown')) y -= 1;\\n      frame.source = 'stick';\\n      frame.x = x;\\n      frame.y = y;\\n      frame.use = down('KeyJ', 'j', 'Enter') ? 1 : 0;\\n    }\\n    frame.steady = down('ShiftLeft', 'ShiftRight', 'Shift');\\n170→    frame.syringe = down('KeyF', 'f');\\n    frame.special = down('Space', ' ');\\n    frame.swap = down('KeyR', 'r');\\n    if (down('KeyQ', 'q')) frame.siteDelta = -1;\\n    if (down('KeyE', 'e')) frame.siteDelta = 1;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) {\\n      if (down(`Digit${i + 1}`, String(i + 1))) {\\n        wheelPick = WHEEL[i];\\n        frame.tool = WHEEL[i];\\n      }\\n180→    }\\n    if (down('KeyC', 'c')) {\\n      frame.source = 'abs';\\n      frame.x = -1.05;\\n      frame.y = 0.62;\\n    }\\n    void settings;\\n    return frame;\\n  }\\n\\n190→  function menuEdges() {\\n    return {\\n      up: down('ArrowUp', 'KeyW', 'w'),\\n      down: down('ArrowDown', 'KeyS', 's'),\\n      left: down('ArrowLeft', 'KeyA', 'a'),\\n      right: down('ArrowRight', 'KeyD', 'd'),\\n      confirm: down('Enter', 'Space', ' '