{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_859","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Updating the about section to use one slide per head. Adjusting page count, focus logic, and turnPage so arrow highlights stay on the correct tab.\n\nAdding a page counter to the about slides. Reducing source fields per page from four to three to prevent overflow. Adjusting feedback paragraphs to one or two lines based on length.\n\nCredits will use size 3. Source fields will use size 1 if any line exceeds 160 characters, otherwise size 3. The source section is estimated at roughly 450 pixels tall.\n\nConfirmed three source lines fit within the page height even with wrapping. Credits will use size 3. Long feedback arrays will use size 1, with each paragraph as its own page. The aboutSlides function must include the renderer line in credits. The About screen focus will match model.page so the arrow stays on the correct tab.\n\nAbout page buttons will highlight independently of menuBlock. turnPage will set focus to the head index instead of the slide index to avoid out-of-range values.\n\nThe `headFocus` helper will map a slide index back to its tab index by matching the slide head against `aboutItems`. `aboutItems` needs a `head` property. `moveFocus` and `pageCount` also need fixes. The slides array is cheap to rebuild because `aboutData` is cached. The renderer line in credits may change with the backend but the total slide count stays fixed. Next steps are to implement these edits, run the shots script, and build. About navigation IDs like `about:5` will point to the first slide of each head.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e0d7ae75-b6d3-4bd6-b893-5b731efc9564-67","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js","old_string":"  function aboutItems() {\n    return ABOUT_HEADS.map(([, label], i) => ({ id: `about:${i}`, label }));\n  }","new_string":"  function aboutSlides() {\n    const data = aboutData();\n    const slides = [];\n    for (const [key, label] of ABOUT_HEADS) {\n      let lines = [];\n      if (key === 'credits') {\n        lines = [...(Array.isArray(data.credits) ? data.credits : []), `Renderer: ${model.view?.backend || 'none'}`];\n      } else {\n        const block = data[key];\n        if (block && !Array.isArray(block) && typeof block === 'object') {\n          lines = Object.entries(block).map(([k, v]) => `${k}: ${v}`);\n        } else if (Array.isArray(block)) lines = block.map(String);\n      }\n      const size = lines.some((line) => line.length > 140) ? 1 : 3;\n      const count = Math.max(1, Math.ceil(lines.length / size));\n      for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\n        slides.push({ head: key, label, lines: lines.slice(i * size, (i + 1) * size), part: i + 1, parts: count });\n      }\n    }\n    return slides;\n  }\n\n  function aboutItems() {\n    const slides = aboutSlides();\n    return ABOUT_HEADS.map(([key, label]) => {\n      const first = Math.max(0, slides.findIndex((s) => s.head === key));\n      return { id: `about:${first}`, label, head: key };\n    });\n  }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e0d7ae75-b6d3-4bd6-b893-5b731efc9564-68","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js","old_string":"    if (model.screen === 'About') return ABOUT_HEADS.length;","new_string":"    if (model.screen === 'About') return Math.max(1, aboutSlides().length);"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e0d7ae75-b6d3-4bd6-b893-5b731efc9564-69","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: