{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_860","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The default focus for the About section returns a model.\n\nsetScreen correctly resets the page to 0 when leaving non-About screens. The About tab buttons now use head matching instead of btn() to prevent double focus classes.\n\nAbout's currentItems and Confirm/Enter behavior are confirmed correct. I will now update shots.mjs and verify present() for syntax errors.\n\nshowOr runs every draw frame and hides the lamp during operations. Menus only peek once. The title screen peeks correctly on its first frame after setScreen. The showOr and present call order is correct. resize is synchronous.\n\nStory draw calls present every frame without touching the lamp. The source is ready for a major shots.mjs rewrite. project.mjs will be deleted after verification to keep scratch clean.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f481334e-6d97-4e0a-9616-a726e81c3bb9-72","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js","offset":543,"limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3315,"output_tokens":777,"cache_read_input_tokens":121472,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"3fb0eeea-986b-4893-9f46-464e7dda1eec"}
