{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_870","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Title and main menu captured with attract disabled and zero issues.\n\nSettings opened. A log watcher will poll shots-run.log for the EXIT marker to detect when the run finishes.\n\nThe watcher will only wake on the EXIT marker. Page errors are expected and not crashes, so they won't trigger a false failure.\n\nThe monitor will also wake if the log stops growing for three minutes. I'll wait on the shot task with a ten-minute timeout instead of using a separate watcher.\n\nI'll read title.png and main-menu.png now to check their appearance while the shot run continues. Any needed fixes can be applied after the run finishes.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-eb5cb94e-afa7-4e91-9834-509780e86ba2-87","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/shots/title.png"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-eb5cb94e-afa7-4e91-9834-509780e86ba2-88","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/shots/main-menu.png"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1045,"output_tokens":819,"cache_read_input_tokens":135808,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"f6faedd4-1de7-47f9-942d-8b1c9ddbc735"}
