{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_883","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The card screen was at 1920x1080 before the frame.\n\nThe iframe evaluate call failed because `__game` was undefined inside the frame. The screenshot was skipped and the process exited with an error. The parent evaluate could see `contentWindow.__game`, but the frame's own `window.__game` was missing. Cross-origin issues seem unlikely.\n\nThe frame found by URL search may differ from the polled iframe. The game script might not have loaded in that specific execution context. A reload between polling and evaluation seems unlikely.\n\nThe root cause is now clear. The parent page URL contains `game.html` as a query parameter, so `frames().find(...).url().includes('game.html')` matched the parent page instead of the iframe. The evaluate call therefore ran in the parent context where `window.__game` was undefined. The fix is to match the frame whose URL path ends with `game.html`.\n\nThe frame search will use `new URL(f.url()).pathname.endsWith('game.html')` to avoid matching the parent page. The screenshot should run before the audit so a failed audit does not skip it. The browser closed properly in the finally block. The card poll succeeded.\n\nThe audit will be wrapped in try/catch so the screenshot is not skipped if it fails. The danger vitals crop failed with a \"No directory\" error, which is odd because the shots directory exists; the crop output path may be invalid.\n\nThe crop command likely failed because the output path was invalid. I will rebuild the CSS and clear the game state before recapturing the remaining screens. The new captures will include about, op-calm, hud-portrait, hush, danger, strains, and report.\n\nTitle, menu, settings, and story do not need recapturing. Story does not use vitals. Operation shots need recapturing because the margin changes affect the HUD and speed lines.\n\nCard will be recaptured after the rebuild so its hub copy matches the updated build. A small reshoot.mjs script will handle only about, operations, and card to speed up the process.\n\nThe reshoot script will be a small partial that targets only about, operations, and card. A full capture takes about five minutes, so the partial should finish in roughly three. I will also verify no Chromium processes remain from the failed run, and check fermata, coda, report, and settings while preparing the script.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-48c1f72c-fee9-4138-8ab1-f1473f9d4821-113","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function patchLive|data-live","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-48c1f72c-fee9-4138-8ab1-f1473f9d4821-114","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"SCRATCH=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/shots\"\nmagick \"$SCRATCH/op-danger.png\" -crop 360x200+900+60 +repage \"$SCRATCH/crop-danger-num.png\" && echo cropped\npgrep -af 'x8f49b6.*chrome|shots.mjs' | head -5 || echo 'no leftover shots'","description":"Crop danger HUD and check leftover browsers"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1591,"output_tokens":1456,"cache_read_input_tokens":161920,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"f069eb2b-7da6-4976-9223-7b94f5de694f"}
