{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_890","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The session pump calls model.paint() every tick at line 311.\n\nThe standalone loop never calls paint(), so the HUD freezes. patchLive() should be called from draw() or model.paint() from the loop instead. paint() is heavier when signals change often, but patchLive() updates numbers, timer, and score. playEvent also sets model.bark without calling paint(), so bark text stays stale until a paint occurs.\n\naskBea sets bark and calls paint(true), but playEvent does not. feedSim runs playEvent without painting, so the bark DOM stays stale until another paint occurs.\n\nPhase ID is in the paint signature, but nothing triggers paint when the phase changes during stepOnce. The HUD therefore freezes at the initial setScreen('Operation') state, leaving objectives, bark, and vitals static for the entire operation. The loop only calls stepOnce and draw, and draw never paints, so this bug is real and must be fixed.\n\nThe cleanest fix is to call paint(false) at the end of stepOnce when the screen is Operation or attract. The paint signature includes phase, over, and bark text but not vitals. This rebuilds the HUD only when those change, otherwise patchLive updates just the numbers. The overhead is small because full rebuilds are rare.\n\nThe paint call should live in a finally block at the end of stepOnce. This catches early returns from menus and sim changes without duplicating code. Setting busy to false before painting avoids re-entry issues.\n\nRe-entry is impossible because paint does not call stepOnce. Double paints are harmless. The finally block still runs after early returns, so busy is always cleared before painting. Attract mode will also refresh its HUD.\n\nThe paint signature already includes the attract operation index, so attract mode HUD updates correctly. Test mode will show danger HUD changes immediately because test.step calls stepOnce and triggers paint. Performance is acceptable since building a signature string each frame is cheap. Existing tests that snapshot DOM vitals may start passing, but those that expect frozen HTML snapshots would fail. Calling paint from the finally block is safe because it runs after feedSim completes. One remaining issue: paint() returns early when `!ui`.\n\nsetScreen already triggers paint(true) during stepOnce, so the extra finally paint(false) is safe and will not double-paint. In pause mode, feedSim exits early because playing requires !overlay, but the finally block still runs and patchLive updates only the numbers if the signature matches.\n\nThe card frame bug in the shots script also needs fixing.\n\nI will implement the paint fix and the card frame bug fix in the shots script. Then I will rebuild and reshoot the ops, about, and card images. A shorter reshoot.mjs script will be faster.\n\nA single reshoot script will boot once and cover about, all operations, and the card. About requires title-to-menu navigation. The settings screen is skipped because it uses buttons and has no vitals margin.\n\nTitle, menu, and story shots will be left unchanged because the note margin only affects .note elements. Settings will be recaptured since the margin change could shift its layout. The operation set, about screen, and card still need fresh captures.\n\nStory shots remain valid because the lamp peek, faces, and shout speedline clear are unchanged. The card frame finder will use a pathname check on the frame URL instead of an audit, and it will catch evaluation errors. I am also checking whether session.js paints from the client side.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3aa3fc15-e267-4577-8dab-a5415ec22ee0-125","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js","old_string":"      tickAudio();\n    } finally {\n      busy = false;\n    }\n  }","new_string":"      tickAudio();\n    } finally {\n      busy = false;\n      if (model.screen === 'Operation' || model.attract.on) paint(false);\n    }\n  }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3aa3fc15-e267-4577-8dab-a5415ec22ee0-126","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/shots.mjs","old_string":"  say('card screen ' + JSON.stringify(found));\n  if (found.screen === 'Card') {\n    const frame = page2.frames().find((f) => f.url().includes('game.html'));\n    if (frame) {\n      const issues = await frame.evaluate(() => {","new_string":"  say('card screen ' + JSON.stringify(found));\n  if (found.screen === 'Card') {\n    await page2.screenshot({ path: path.join(OUT, 'session-card.png'), animations: 'disabled' });\n    say('session-card bytes ' + statSync(path.join(OUT, 'session-card.png')).size + ' cardErrors ' + cardErrors.length);\n    const frame = page2.frames().find((f) => {\n      try { return new URL(f.url()).pathname.endsWith('/game.html'); } catch { return false; }\n    });\n    if (frame) {\n      const issues = await frame.evaluate(() => {"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":870,"output_tokens":2406,"cache_read_input_tokens":170880,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"a71bc6bb-9cbb-47e4-9bad-e116f2c76f7d"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-3aa3fc15-e267-4577-8dab-a5415ec22ee0-125","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"      tickAudio();\\n    } finally {\\n      busy = false;\\n    }\\n  }\",\"new_string\":\"      tickAudio();\\n    } finally {\\n      busy = false;\\n      if (model.screen === 'Operation' || model.attract.on) paint(false);\\n    }\\n  }\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"      tickAudio();\\n    } finally {\\n      busy = false;\\n    }\\n  }\",\"old_line\":1338,\"new_string\":\"      tickAudio();\\n    } finally {\\n      busy = false;\\n      if (model.screen === 'Operation' || model.attract.on) paint(false);\\n    }\\n  }\",\"new_line\":1338,\"context_before\":\"          setScreen(prev || 'Main Menu');\\n        }\\n      }\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\\n  function btn(item, index) {\\n    const on = index === model.focus ? ' on' : '';\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-3aa3fc15-e267-4577-8dab-a5415ec22ee0-126","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"  say('card screen ' + JSON.stringify(found));\\n  if (found.screen === 'Card') {\\n    const frame = page2.frames().find((f) => f.url().includes('game.html'));\\n    if (frame) {\\n      const issues = await frame.evaluate(() => {\",\"new_string\":\"  say('card screen ' + JSON.stringify(found));\\n  if (found.screen === 'Card') {\\n    await page2.screenshot({ path: path.join(OUT, 'session-card.png'), animations: 'disabled' });\\n    say('session-card bytes ' + statSync(path.join(OUT, 'session-card.png')).size + ' cardErrors ' + cardErrors.length);\\n    const frame = page2.frames().find((f) => {\\n      try { return new URL(f.url()).pathname.endsWith('/game.html'); } catch { return false; }\\n    });\\n    if (frame) {\\n      const issues = await frame.evaluate(() => {\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/shots.mjs has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/shots.mjs has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/shots.mjs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"  say('card screen ' + JSON.stringify(found));\\n  if (found.screen === 'Card') {\\n    const frame = page2.frames().find((f) => f.url().includes('game.html'));\\n    if (frame) {\\n      const issues = await frame.evaluate(() => {\",\"old_line\":271,\"new_string\":\"  say('card screen ' + JSON.stringify(found));\\n  if (found.screen === 'Card') {\\n    await page2.screenshot({ path: path.join(OUT, 'session-card.png'), animations: 'disabled' });\\n    say('session-card bytes ' + statSync(path.join(OUT, 'session-card.png')).size + ' cardErrors ' + cardErrors.length);\\n    const frame = page2.frames().find((f) => {\\n      try { return new URL(f.url()).pathname.endsWith('/game.html'); } catch { return false; }\\n    });\\n    if (frame) {\\n      const issues = await frame.evaluate(() => {\",\"new_line\":271,\"context_before\":\"    }\\n    return { screen: last };\\n  });\\n\",\"context_after\":\"        const vh = innerHeight;\\n        const vw = innerWidth;\\n        const min = 34 * (vh / 1080);\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"a125a5e8-136c-4257-b871-42d7bc2ace0d"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_891","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-71dfabbc-1ea6-4876-b40a-f442f4eb1833-127","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/shots.mjs","offset":250,"limit":70}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2667,"output_tokens":112,"cache_read_input_tokens":171648,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"7d68e207-eb0d-4cf6-8698-6f8f84869147"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-71dfabbc-1ea6-4876-b40a-f442f4eb1833-127","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"250→  await page2.addInitScript(() => {\\n    const style = document.createElement('style');\\n    style.textContent = 'header,aside{display:none!important}main{display:block!important}#grid{padding:0!important;height:100vh}.cell__bar{display:none!important}iframe{width:100vw!important;height:100vh!important;border:0}';\\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => document.documentElement.append(style));\\n  });\\n  await page2.goto(cardUrl, { waitUntil: 'domcontentloaded' });\\n  const found = await page2.evaluate(async () => {\\n    const deadline = performance.now() + 15000;\\n    let last = 'missing';\\n    while (performance.now() < deadline) {\\n260→      const frame = document.querySelector('iframe');\\n      let game = null;\\n      try { game = frame && frame.contentWindow && frame.contentWindow.__game; } catch { game = null; }\\n      if (game && game.state) {\\n        last = game.state().screen;\\n        if (last === 'Card') return { screen: 'Card', w: frame.clientWidth, h: frame.clientHeight };\\n      }\\n      await new Promise((r) => setTimeout(r, 100));\\n    }\\n    return { screen: last };\\n270→  });\\n  say('card screen ' + JSON.stringify(found));\\n  if (found.screen === 'Card') {\\n    await page2.screenshot({ path: path.join(OUT, 'session-card.png'), animations: 'disabled' });\\n    say('session-card bytes ' + statSync(path.join(OUT, 'session-card.png')).size + ' cardErrors ' + cardErrors.length);\\n    const frame = page2.frames().find((f) => {\\n      try { return new URL(f.url()).pathname.endsWith('/game.html'); } catch { return false; }\\n    });\\n    if (frame) {\\n      const issues = await frame.evaluate(() => {\\n280→        const vh = innerHeight;\\n        const vw = innerWidth;\\n        const min = 34 * (vh / 1080);\\n        const safe = { l: vw * 0.05, t: vh * 0.05, r: vw * 0.95, b: vh * 0.95 };\\n        const rows = [];\\n        for (const el of document.querySelectorAll('#ui *')) {\\n          if (el.closest('svg, .glyph')) continue;\\n          const hasText = [...el.childNodes].some((n) => n.nodeType === 3 && n.textContent.trim());\\n          if (!hasText) continue;\\n          const r = el.getBoundingClientRect();\\n290→          if (r.width < 2 || r.height < 2) continue;\\n          const fs = parseFloat(getComputedStyle(el).fontSize);\\n          const key = el.classList.contains('logo');\\n          const small = fs + 0.6 < (key ? 56 * (vh / 1080) : min);\\n          const unsafe = r.top < safe.t - 2 || r.bottom > safe.b + 2 || r.left < safe.l - 2 || r.right > safe.r + 2;\\n          if (small || unsafe) rows.push({ text: el.textContent.trim().slice(0, 50), fs: Math.round(fs), y: Math.round(r.top), bottom: Math.round(r.bottom) });\\n        }\\n        return { rows, screen: window.__game.state().screen, box: { w: innerWidth, h: innerHeight } };\\n      });\\n      say('card audit ' + JSON.stringify(issues));\\n300→    }\\n    await page2.screenshot({ path: path.join(OUT, 'session-card.png'), animations: 'disabled' });\\n    say('session-card bytes ' + statSync(path.join(OUT, 'session-card.png')).size + ' cardErrors ' + cardErrors.length);\\n  } else {\\n    say('card missed, not writing a wrong frame');\\n  }\\n  for (const e of cardErrors.slice(0, 8)) say('CARDERR ' + e.slice(0, 200));\\n\\n  writeFileSync(path.join(OUT, 'shots.log'), log.join('\\\\n') + '\\\\n');\\n  say('done');\\n310→  } finally {\\n    if (browser) await browser.close().catch(() => {});\\n    if (server) server.close();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nmain().catch((err) => {\\n  console.error(err);\\n  writeFileSync(path.join(OUT, 'shots.log'), log.join('\\\\n') + '\\\\n' + err.stack + '\\\\n');\\n  process.exit(1);\",\"content_concise\":\"250→  await page2.addInitScript(() => {\\n    const style = document.createElement('style');\\n    style.textContent = 'header,aside{display:none!important}main{display:block!important}#grid{padding:0!important;height:100vh}.cell__bar{display:none!important}iframe{width:100vw!important;height:100vh!important;border:0}';\\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => document.documentElement.append(style));\\n  });\\n  await page2.goto(cardUrl, { waitUntil: 'domcontentloaded' });\\n  const found = await page2.evaluate(async () => {\\n    const deadline = performance.now() + 15000;\\n    let last = 'missing';\\n    while (performance.now() < deadline) {\\n260→      const frame = document.querySelector('iframe');\\n      let game = null;\\n      try { game = frame && frame.contentWindow && frame.contentWindow.__game; } catch { game = null; }\\n      if (game && game.state) {\\n        last = game.state().screen;\\n        if (last === 'Card') return { screen: 'Card', w: frame.clientWidth, h: frame.clientHeight };\\n      }\\n      await new Promise((r) => setTimeout(r, 100));\\n    }\\n    return { screen: last };\\n270→  });\\n  say('card screen ' + JSON.stringify(found));\\n  if (found.screen === 'Card') {\\n    await page2.screenshot({ path: path.join(OUT, 'session-card.png'), animations: 'disabled' });\\n    say('session-card bytes ' + statSync(path.join(OUT, 'session-card.png')).size + ' cardErrors ' + cardErrors.length);\\n    const frame = page2.frames().find((f) => {\\n      try { return new URL(f.url()).pathname.endsWith('/game.html'); } catch { return false; }\\n    });\\n    if (frame) {\\n      const issues = await frame.evaluate(() => {\\n280→        const vh = innerHeight;\\n        const vw = innerWidth;\\n        const min = 34 * (vh / 1080);\\n        const safe = { l: vw * 0.05, t: vh * 0.05, r: vw * 0.95, b: vh * 0.95 };\\n        const rows = [];\\n        for (const el of document.querySelectorAll('#ui *')) {\\n          if (el.closest('svg, .glyph')) continue;\\n          const hasText = [...el.childNodes].some((n) => n.nodeType === 3 && n.textContent.trim());\\n          if (!hasText) continue;\\n          const r = el.getBoundingClientRect();\\n290→          if (r.width < 2 || r.height < 2) continue;\\n          const fs = parseFloat(getComputedStyle(el).fontSize);\\n          const key = el.classList.contains('logo');\\n          const small = fs + 0.6 < (key ? 56 * (vh / 1080) : min);\\n          const unsafe = r.top < safe.t - 2 || r.bottom > safe.b + 2 || r.left < safe.l - 2 || r.right > safe.r + 2;\\n          if (small || unsafe) rows.push({ text: el.textContent.trim().slice(0, 50), fs: Math.round(fs), y: Math.round(r.top), bottom: Math.round(r.bottom) });\\n        }\\n        return { rows, screen: window.__game.state().screen, box: { w: innerWidth, h: innerHeight } };\\n      });\\n      say('card audit ' + JSON.stringify(issues));\\n300→    }\\n    await page2.screenshot({ path: path.join(OUT, 'session-card.png'), animations: 'disabled' });\\n    say('session-card bytes ' + statSync(path.join(OUT, 'session-card.png')).size + ' cardErrors ' + cardErrors.length);\\n  } else {\\n    say('card missed, not writing a wrong frame');\\n  }\\n  for (const e of cardErrors.slice(0, 8)) say('CARDERR ' + e.slice(0, 200));\\n\\n  writeFileSync(path.join(OUT, 'shots.log'), log.join('\\\\n') + '\\\\n');\\n  say('done');\\n310→  } finally {\\n    if (browser) await browser.close().catch(() => {});\\n    if (server) server.close();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nmain().catch((err) => {\\n  console.error(err);\\n  writeFileSync(path.join(OUT, 'shots.log'), log.join('\\\\n') + '\\\\n' + err.stack + '\\\\n');\\n  process.exit(1);\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/shots.mjs\",\"offset\":250,\"limit\":70,\"raw_output\":\"  await page2.addInitScript(() => {\\n    const style = document.createElement('style');\\n    style.textContent = 'header,aside{display:none!important}main{display:block!important}#grid{padding:0!important;height:100vh}.cell__bar{display:none!important}iframe{width:100vw!important;height:100vh!important;border:0}';\\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => document.documentElement.append(style));\\n  });\\n  await page2.goto(cardUrl, { waitUntil: 'domcontentloaded' });\\n  const found = await page2.evaluate(async () => {\\n    const deadline = performance.now() + 15000;\\n    let last = 'missing';\\n    while (performance.now() < deadline) {\\n      const frame = document.querySelector('iframe');\\n      let game = null;\\n      try { game = frame && frame.contentWindow && frame.contentWindow.__game; } catch { game = null; }\\n      if (game && game.state) {\\n        last = game.state().screen;\\n        if (last === 'Card') return { screen: 'Card', w: frame.clientWidth, h: frame.clientHeight };\\n      }\\n      await new Promise((r) => setTimeout(r, 100));\\n    }\\n    return { screen: last };\\n  });\\n  say('card screen ' + JSON.stringify(found));\\n  if (found.screen === 'Card') {\\n    await page2.screenshot({ path: path.join(OUT, 'session-card.png'), animations: 'disabled' });\\n    say('session-card bytes ' + statSync(path.join(OUT, 'session-card.png')).size + ' cardErrors ' + cardErrors.length);\\n    const frame = page2.frames().find((f) => {\\n      try { return new URL(f.url()).pathname.endsWith('/game.html'); } catch { return false; }\\n    });\\n    if (frame) {\\n      const issues = await frame.evaluate(() => {\\n        const vh = innerHeight;\\n        const vw = innerWidth;\\n        const min = 34 * (vh / 1080);\\n        const safe = { l: vw * 0.05, t: vh * 0.05, r: vw * 0.95, b: vh * 0.95 };\\n        const rows = [];\\n        for (const el of document.querySelectorAll('#ui *')) {\\n          if (el.closest('svg, .glyph')) continue;\\n          const hasText = [...el.childNodes].some((n) => n.nodeType === 3 && n.textContent.trim());\\n          if (!hasText) continue;\\n          const r = el.getBoundingClientRect();\\n          if (r.width < 2 || r.height < 2) continue;\\n          const fs = parseFloat(getComputedStyle(el).fontSize);\\n          const key = el.classList.contains('logo');\\n          const small = fs + 0.6 < (key ? 56 * (vh / 1080) : min);\\n          const unsafe = r.top < safe.t - 2 || r.bottom > safe.b + 2 || r.left < safe.l - 2 || r.right > safe.r + 2;\\n          if (small || unsafe) rows.push({ text: el.textContent.trim().slice(0, 50), fs: Math.round(fs), y: Math.round(r.top), bottom: Math.round(r.bottom) });\\n        }\\n        return { rows, screen: window.__game.state().screen, box: { w: innerWidth, h: innerHeight } };\\n      });\\n      say('card audit ' + JSON.stringify(issues));\\n    }\\n    await page2.screenshot({ path: path.join(OUT, 'session-card.png'), animations: 'disabled' });\\n    say('session-card bytes ' + statSync(path.join(OUT, 'session-card.png')).size + ' cardErrors ' + cardErrors.length);\\n  } else {\\n    say('card missed, not writing a wrong frame');\\n  }\\n  for (const e of cardErrors.slice(0, 8)) say('CARDERR ' + e.slice(0, 200));\\n\\n  writeFileSync(path.join(OUT, 'shots.log'), log.join('\\\\n') + '\\\\n');\\n  say('done');\\n  } finally {\\n    if (browser) await browser.close().catch(() => {});\\n    if (server) server.close();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nmain().catch((err) => {\\n  console.error(err);\\n  writeFileSync(path.join(OUT, 'shots.log'), log.join('\\\\n') + '\\\\n' + err.stack + '\\\\n');\\n  process.exit(1);\\n\",\"total_lines\":320}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"335d145d-ba57-4f4c-a99e-cc932e2fd75a"}
