{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_893","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The full shots script rewrites the title.\n\nA full rerun of the shots script is worth the five minutes for consistency. It will recapture everything against the new HTML. The extra paint calls during the danger loop are cheap.\n\nFrequent bark updates will rebuild innerHTML and slow the browser suite, but this is necessary for a correct HUD. The finally paint block during menu navigation will not reset focus, since focus changes already trigger a full paint. A minor edge case during Operation screen blockMenu returns is acceptable.\n\nNo infinite loop risk exists between paint, setScreen, and stepOnce. The director script will be checked with node --check. Attract mode calls stepOnce from both the timer and test.step, but this is safe.\n\nI will delete temporary crop and preview files from the shots folder before finishing, leaving only the named PNGs. The shots.log from the failed run is already present. I am starting the build now and will run the full shots script in the background.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bdcc84e8-19f4-4dc5-9c98-e508b039da0e-129","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"node --check \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js\" && cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230\" && node tools/build.mjs","description":"Rebuild HTML after HUD and About fixes"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":283,"output_tokens":777,"cache_read_input_tokens":175488,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"cda1192d-56