tes=3417841 issues=0\\nmain-menu.png screen=Main Menu phase=null vitals= attract=false bytes=3426984 issues=0\\nopened Settings focus music\\nsettings.png screen=Settings phase=null vitals= attract=false bytes=3447350 issues=0\\nafter settings back Main Menu focus story\\nopened About\\nabout.png screen=About phase=null vitals= attract=false bytes=3488980 issues=0\\nstory line NARRATION The beeps land on the bar line. The silhouette bows.\\nstory-shout.png screen=Story phase=null vitals= attract=false bytes=3169381 issues=0\\ncut-in.png screen=Story phase=null vitals= attract=false bytes=3184033 issues=0\\ngo broken-glass glass -> Operation glass vitals=100\\nop-calm.png screen=Operation phase=glass vitals=100 attract=false bytes=3283197 issues=0\\nhud-portrait.png screen=Operation phase=glass vitals=100 attract=false bytes=3282607 issues=0\\nhush.png screen=Operation phase=glass vitals=100 attract=false bytes=2075526 issues=0\\ngo broken-glass glass -> Operation glass vitals=100\\npage.evaluate: Target crashed \\n    at main (/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/shots.mjs:212:25) {\\n  log: [],\\n  name: \\u001b[32m'Error'\\u001b[39m\\n}\\nEXIT:1\\n\",\"total_lines\":26}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"e0a37554-0f4a-481c-8255-e9b9e81a0ba5"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_911","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The crash persists at the same line even after removing paint from stepOnce.\n\nThe paint-per-step theory is wrong. The crash now hits at 30 steps, so the cause must be elsewhere. The simulation code itself hasn't changed, and the view's per-frame resize and placeLamp calls were already present.\n\nThe crash occurs during test.step(30) itself, not during screenshot. Memory exhaustion from earlier screenshots is unlikely because the previous run survived a 1000-step evaluate with the same screenshots. The synchronous evaluate rules out paint running during the step.\n\nThe crash is not a thrown exception. It is a hard process crash. The spawn-bleeder step runs before the 30-step loop, so the first iteration itself is failing. I will read line 212 exactly.\n\nThe crash may be an infinite loop in stepOnce. The new suspect is playEvent calling setSpeaker, which creates a fresh Three.js bust mesh on every bark. If bleeders bark each step, the old meshes are never disposed and memory leaks until the browser watchdog kills the tab.\n\nThe leak is confirmed. setSpeaker removes the old bust from the scene but never disposes its geometry, material, or canvas texture. The earlier successful run predated this change, so it avoided the memory spike.\n\nThirty barks alone leak only about sixty megabytes. The real danger is many events per step; thirty steps of ten events each could reach six hundred megabytes, on top of the existing WebGPU scene and prior screenshots. The fix is to dispose the old bust before replacing it and skip rebuilding when the speaker identity and mouth expression have not changed.\n\nA recursive `disposeObject` helper is being drafted to walk the bust group and dispose every geometry, material, and texture before replacing it. The `setSpeaker` function will also cache the current speaker key so it skips rebuilding when the identity and mouth expression have not changed.\n\nshowStory also leaks busts because draw calls present() every frame, but that is pre-existing and was not the cause of the current crash. The new setSpeaker leak in playEvent is the real culprit. I will add the dispose helper and speaker-key cache to fix it, and also dispose old busts inside showStory when replacing them.\n\nshowStory leaks two busts every frame during story playback. That alone can reach about 120 megabytes across several seconds of rAF, compounding memory pressure before the danger steps begin. The fix is to skip rebuilding when the same people are already showing.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0c1ea312-8f07-4365-9efb-e4fca683baaa-150","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/view/renderer.js","offset":380,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0c1ea312-8f07-4365-9efb-e4fca683baaa-151","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function bustFor","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/view/renderer.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1053,"output_tokens":1552,"cache_read_input_tokens":191744,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"7252925f-3fae-4f01-a33e-d2f45f4a5971"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-0c1ea312-8f07-4365-9efb-e4fca683baaa-150","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"380→    mode.name = 'story';\\n    or.visible = false;\\n    story.visible = true;\\n    portrait.visible = false;\\n    if (storySet !== setName) {\\n      story.clear();\\n      story.add(storyRoom(setName || 'or'));\\n      storySet = setName;\\n    }\\n    if (busts.left) story.remove(busts.left);\\n390→    if (busts.right) story.remove(busts.right);\\n    busts.left = bustFor(leftWho || 'ren', { mouth: 'shut' });\\n    busts.right = bustFor(rightWho || 'bea', { mouth: 'shut' });\\n    busts.left.position.set(-2.1, -0.4, 0);\\n    busts.right.position.set(2.1, -0.4, 0);\\n    // +Y rotation swings local +Z toward world +X. Turn each face in toward the camera.\\n    busts.left.rotation.y = 0.4;\\n    busts.right.rotation.y = -0.4;\\n    story.add(busts.left, busts.right);\\n    resize();\\n400→  }\\n\\n  function showOr() {\\n    mode.name = 'or';\\n    or.visible = true;\\n    story.visible = false;\\n    portrait.visible = true;\\n    placeLamp(false);\\n    resize();\\n  }\\n410→\\n  function setSpeaker(who, expr) {\\n    bustScene.remove(bust);\\n    bust = bustFor(who || 'bea', expr || { mouth: 'shut' });\\n    bust.position.y = 0.2;\\n    bustScene.add(bust);\\n  }\\n\\n  function shout(on) {\\n    cutGroup.visible = !!on;\\n420→    if (ink) ink.u.speedLines.value = on ? 1 : 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  function setPortrait(on) {\\n    portrait.visible = !!on;\\n  }\\n\\n  function flash() {\\n    if (ink) ink.u.flash.value = 1;\\n    shake = 0.25;\",\"content_concise\":\"380→    mode.name = 'story';\\n    or.visible = false;\\n    story.visible = true;\\n    portrait.visible = false;\\n    if (storySet !== setName) {\\n      story.clear();\\n      story.add(storyRoom(setName || 'or'));\\n      storySet = setName;\\n    }\\n    if (busts.left) story.remove(busts.left);\\n390→    if (busts.right) story.remove(busts.right);\\n    busts.left = bustFor(leftWho || 'ren', { mouth: 'shut' });\\n    busts.right = bustFor(rightWho || 'bea', { mouth: 'shut' });\\n    busts.left.position.set(-2.1, -0.4, 0);\\n    busts.right.position.set(2.1, -0.4, 0);\\n    // +Y rotation swings local +Z toward world +X. Turn each face in toward the camera.\\n    busts.left.rotation.y = 0.4;\\n    busts.right.rotation.y = -0.4;\\n    story.add(busts.left, busts.right);\\n    resize();\\n400→  }\\n\\n  function showOr() {\\n    mode.name = 'or';\\n    or.visible = true;\\n    story.visible = false;\\n    portrait.visible = true;\\n    placeLamp(false);\\n    resize();\\n  }\\n410→\\n  function setSpeaker(who, expr) {\\n    bustScene.remove(bust);\\n    bust = bustFor(who || 'bea', expr || { mouth: 'shut' });\\n    bust.position.y = 0.2;\\n    bustScene.add(bust);\\n  }\\n\\n  function shout(on) {\\n    cutGroup.visible = !!on;\\n420→    if (ink) ink.u.speedLines.value = on ? 1 : 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  function setPortrait(on) {\\n    portrait.visible = !!on;\\n  }\\n\\n  function flash() {\\n    if (ink) ink.u.flash.value = 1;\\n    shake = 0.25;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/view/renderer.js\",\"offset\":380,\"limit\":50,\"raw_output\":\"    mode.name = 'story';\\n    or.visible = false;\\n    story.visible = true;\\n    portrait.visible = false;\\n    if (storySet !== setName) {\\n      story.clear();\\n      story.add(storyRoom(setName || 'or'));\\n      storySet = setName;\\n    }\\n    if (busts.left) story.remove(busts.left);\\n    if (busts.right) story.remove(busts.right);\\n    busts.left = bustFor(leftWho || 'ren', { mouth: 'shut' });\\n    busts.right = bustFor(rightWho || 'bea', { mouth: 'shut' });\\n    busts.left.position.set(-2.1, -0.4, 0);\\n    busts.right.position.set(2.1, -0.4, 0);\\n    // +Y rotation swings local +Z toward world +X. Turn each face in toward the camera.\\n    busts.left.rotation.y = 0.4;\\n    busts.right.rotation.y = -0.4;\\n    story.add(busts.left, busts.right);\\n    resize();\\n  }\\n\\n  function showOr() {\\n    mode.name = 'or';\\n    or.visible = true;\\n    story.visible = false;\\n    portrait.visible = true;\\n    placeLamp(false);\\n    resize();\\n  }\\n\\n  function setSpeaker(who, expr) {\\n    bustScene.remove(bust);\\n    bust = bustFor(who || 'bea', expr || { mouth: 'shut' });\\n    bust.position.y = 0.2;\\n    bustScene.add(bust);\\n  }\\n\\n  function shout(on) {\\n    cutGroup.visible = !!on;\\n    if (ink) ink.u.speedLines.value = on ? 1 : 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  function setPortrait(on) {\\n    portrait.visible = !!on;\\n  }\\n\\n  function flash() {\\n    if (ink) ink.u.flash.value = 1;\\n    shake = 0.25;\\n\",\"total_lines\":489}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-0c1ea312-8f07-4365-9efb-e4fca683baaa-151","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,51,49,50,51,48,95,95,120,56,102,52,57,98,54,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,78,111,32,109,97,116,99,104,101,115,32,102,111,117,110,100,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":1,\"match_count\":0,\"file_matches\":[]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"f2b0c537-6e05-4bde-a31e-7d2f0df4865c"}
