{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_913","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will add disposeBust and cache keys.\n\nA new `disposeTree` helper will recursively dispose geometries and materials. `showStory` will skip rebuilding when the cast key matches the previous one.\n\nOld busts will be removed and disposed before new ones are created. Resize will only run when a new cast set is actually shown.\n\n`setSpeaker` will skip rebuilding when the speaker and expression key match the previous one. It will also remove and dispose the old bust before creating a new one. `story.clear()` will traverse and dispose existing story nodes when the set changes.\n\nThe story group itself cannot be disposed directly. Its children will be traversed and disposed before clearing the group. The cast key and bust references will be reset afterward. The danger crash likely stems from memory leaks caused by unreleased busts during stories, which should resolve once the leak is fixed.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-dd2fade2-16f0-43e1-acf5-fdfdac721402-153","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/view/renderer.js","old_string":"  let storySet = null;\n  const busts = { left: null, right: null };","new_string":"  let storySet = null;\n  let storyCast = '';\n  let speakerKey = '';\n  const busts = { left: null, right: null };\n\n  function disposeTree(obj) {\n    if (!obj) return;\n    obj.traverse((node) => {\n      node.geometry?.dispose?.();\n      const mats = node.material;\n      if (!mats) return;\n      for (const m of (Array.isArray(mats) ? mats : [mats])) {\n        m.map?.dispose?.();\n        m.dispose?.();\n      }\n    });\n  }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-dd2fade2-16f0-43e1-acf5-fdfdac721402-154","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/view/renderer.js","old_string":"    if (storySet !== setName) {\n      story.clear();\n      story.add(storyRoom(setName || 'or'));\n      storySet = setName;\n    }\n    if (busts.left) story.remove(busts.left);\n    if (busts.right) story.remove(busts.right);\n    busts.left = bustFor(leftWho || 'ren', { mouth: 'shut' });\n    busts.right = bustFor(rightWho || 'bea', { mouth: 'shut' });\n    busts.left.position.set(-2.1, -0.4, 0);\n    busts.right.position.set(2.1, -0.4, 0);\n    // +Y rotation swings local +Z toward world +X. Turn each face in toward the camera.\n    busts.left.rotation.y = 0.4;\n    busts.right.rotation.y = -0.4;\n    story.add(busts.left, busts.right);\n    resize();\n  }","new_string":"    if (storySet !== setName) {\n      for (const child of [...story.children]) disposeTree(child);\n      story.clear();\n      story.add(storyRoom(setName || 'or'));\n      storySet = setName;\n      storyCast = '';\n      busts.left = null;\n      busts.right = null;\n    }\n    const castKey = `${leftWho || 'ren'}|${rightWho || 'bea'}`;\n    if (storyCast !== castKey) {\n      if (busts.left) { story.remove(busts.left); disposeTree(busts.left); }\n      if (busts.right) { story.remove(busts.right); disposeTree(busts.right); }\n      busts.left = bustFor(leftWho || 'ren', { mouth: 'shut' });\n      busts.right = bustFor(rightWho || 'bea', { mouth: 'shut' });\n      busts.left.position.set(-2.1, -0.4, 0);\n      busts.right.position.set(2.1, -0.4, 0);\n      // +Y rotation swings local +Z toward world +X. Turn each face in toward the camera.\n      busts.left.rotation.y = 0.4;\n      busts.right.rotation.y = -0.4;\n      story.add(busts.left, busts.right);\n      storyCast = castKey;\n    }\n    resize();\n  }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-dd2fade2-16f0-43e1-acf5-fdfdac721402-155","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/view/renderer.js","old_string":"  function setSpeaker(who, expr) {\n    bustScene.remove(bust);\n    bust = bustFor(who || 'bea', expr || { mouth: 'shut' });\n    bust.position.y = 0.2;\n    bustScene.add(bust);\n  }","new_string":"  function setSpeaker(who, expr) {\n    const key = `${who || 'bea'}:${expr?.mouth || 'shut'}`;\n    if (key === speakerKey) return;\n    speakerKey = key;\n    bustScene.remove(bust);\n    disposeTree(bust);\n    bust = bustFor(who || 'bea', expr || { mouth: 'shut' });\n    bust.position.y = 0.2;\n    bustScene.add(bust);\n  }"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":407,"output_tokens":1803,"cache_read_input_tokens":194816,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"18230ee1-a3fe-467b-a167-2779025385ea"}
