{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_920","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The shots look good overall.\n\nDanger shows correct vitals and red vignette. Fermata has readable red edges and a blue eye. Coda shows the conductor and site labels. The creature is small but visible. The session card has a layout issue: the portrait overlaps the Ready and More Time buttons.\n\nThe portrait overlap on the session card is unexpected. The Card present() path calls setPortrait(false), so the portrait should be hidden. Session mode may skip this call because draw() returns early.\n\nThe session pump calls syncFromSim, which triggers showOr() and sets the portrait visible. The card UI shows a countdown and green circle over the 3D scene.\n\nThe portrait is visible by default because the view boots with it on. startSession never calls present, so the portrait stays visible during the card screen. The fix is to hide the portrait unless the screen is Operation or attract, and stop showOr from forcing it on.\n\nThe director should call setPortrait directly rather than relying on showOr, since the view lacks screen context. The portrait likely remains visible because syncFromSim does not run during the card phase.\n\nThe fix is to set `portrait.visible = false` immediately after creating the portrait mesh. `showOr` will then only turn it back on during operations, keeping it hidden for the card screen.\n\nI will hide the portrait at creation and only reveal it through showOr. I need to check whether session boot triggers showOr before the card appears. After fixing the overlap, I will recapture just the card screen rather than rerunning the full shot set. The \"8890\" on the card is likely the countdown timer.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4f63c441-6b26-4966-9f1a-027cdab35b3a-165","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js","offset":1555,"limit":50}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5012,"output_tokens":1216,"cache_read_input_tokens":200320,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"b48f47b3-612d-44fc-8664-14280dab813d"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-4f63c441-6b26-4966-9f1a-027cdab35b3a-165","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1555→    h.className = 'logo';\\n    h.textContent = GAME_TITLE;\\n    const tag = document.createElement('p');\\n    tag.className = 'tag';\\n    tag.textContent = TAGLINE;\\n1560→    const goal = document.createElement('p');\\n    goal.className = 'obj';\\n    goal.textContent = 'Keep the patient alive and finish the operation together';\\n    const list = document.createElement('div');\\n    list.className = 'seats';\\n    const ready = new Set(model.card?.ready || []);\\n    for (const p of model.sessionInfo?.players || []) {\\n      const seat = document.createElement('div');\\n      seat.className = 'seat';\\n      if (/^#[0-9a-fA-F]{3,8}$/.test(p.color || '')) seat.style.color = p.color;\\n1570→      seat.textContent = `${p.name || 'Surgeon'}${ready.has(p.id) ? ' ready' : ''}`;\\n      list.append(seat);\\n    }\\n    const secs = document.createElement('p');\\n    secs.className = 'vitals';\\n    if (model.card?.left != null) secs.textContent = String(Math.max(0, Math.ceil(model.card.left)));\\n    const how = document.createElement('p');\\n    how.className = 'note';\\n    how.textContent = 'Aim with the right stick or the mouse. Use with R2 or click. Tools are the left stick or the number keys.';\\n    const menu = document.createElement('div');\\n1580→    menu.className = 'menu';\\n    for (const item of [{ id: 'ready', label: 'Ready' }, { id: 'more', label: 'More Time' }]) {\\n      const b = document.createElement('button');\\n      b.type = 'button';\\n      b.className = 'item';\\n      b.dataset.item = item.id;\\n      b.textContent = item.label;\\n      menu.append(b);\\n    }\\n    wrap.append(h, tag, goal, list, secs, how, menu);\\n1590→    ui.append(wrap);\\n  }\\n\\n  function state() {\\n    const sim = model.sim;\\n    const net = !sim ? model.netState : null;\\n    const seats = sim?.seats || net?.seats || [];\\n    const seat = seats.find((s) => !s.out) || seats[0];\\n    const items = currentItems();\\n    const rank = sim?.rank?.id || (typeof net?.rank === 'string' ? net.rank : net?.rank?.id) || null;\\n1600→    return {\\n      screen: model.screen,\\n      op: sim?.op?.id || net?.op || null,\\n      phase: sim?.phase?.id || net?.phase || null,\\n      vitals: sim ? sim.vitals : (net?.vitals ?? null),\",\"content_concise\":\"1555→    h.className = 'logo';\\n    h.textContent = GAME_TITLE;\\n    const tag = document.createElement('p');\\n    tag.className = 'tag';\\n    tag.textContent = TAGLINE;\\n1560→    const goal = document.createElement('p');\\n    goal.className = 'obj';\\n    goal.textContent = 'Keep the patient alive and finish the operation together';\\n    const list = document.createElement('div');\\n    list.className = 'seats';\\n    const ready = new Set(model.card?.ready || []);\\n    for (const p of model.sessionInfo?.players || []) {\\n      const seat = document.createElement('div');\\n      seat.className = 'seat';\\n      if (/^#[0-9a-fA-F]{3,8}$/.test(p.color || '')) seat.style.color = p.color;\\n1570→      seat.textContent = `${p.name || 'Surgeon'}${ready.has(p.id) ? ' ready' : ''}`;\\n      list.append(seat);\\n    }\\n    const secs = document.createElement('p');\\n    secs.className = 'vitals';\\n    if (model.card?.left != null) secs.textContent = String(Math.max(0, Math.ceil(model.card.left)));\\n    const how = document.createElement('p');\\n    how.className = 'note';\\n    how.textContent = 'Aim with the right stick or the mouse. Use with R2 or click. Tools are the left stick or the number keys.';\\n    const menu = document.createElement('div');\\n1580→    menu.className = 'menu';\\n    for (const item of [{ id: 'ready', label: 'Ready' }, { id: 'more', label: 'More Time' }]) {\\n      const b = document.createElement('button');\\n      b.type = 'button';\\n      b.classNam