{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_930","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Non-host clients never call showOr.\n\nThe portrait defaults to visible. The client session pump never hides it, so clients see the portrait and card throughout the session.\n\nThe portrait should be hidden at creation and only revealed during Operation. The client render path in session.js must also set the portrait visibility based on screen state.\n\nThe client render path in session.js will explicitly call setPortrait based on the current screen. The host syncFromSim path will also be updated. The host showOr call during Card remains unchanged.\n\nPortrait visibility will be set to true only during Operation or attract mode. Countdown and Round over screens hide it. The client path needs no extra logic since it never uses attract mode. The portrait's bust render target still updates during session events even when hidden.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The session host calls `showOr()` on every card frame, and that forces the operative bust on. I'll show that bust only during an operation."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9ef82ec4-38f2-4b8b-b729-34f1884a3da4-26","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/view/renderer.js","old_string":"  portrait.position.set(-0.93, -0.28, -2.2);\n  camera.add(portrait);\n  scene.add(camera);","new_string":"  portrait.position.set(-0.93, -0.28, -2.2);\n  portrait.visible = false;\n  camera.add(portrait);\n  scene.add(camera);"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9ef82ec4-38f2-4b8b-b729-34f1884a3da4-27","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/view/renderer.js","old_string":"  function showOr() {\n    mode.name = 'or';\n    or.visible = true;\n    story.visible = false;\n    portrait.visible = true;\n    placeLamp(false);\n    resize();\n  }","new_string":"  function showOr() {\n    mode.name = 'or';\n    or.visible = true;\n    story.visible = false;\n    placeLamp(false);\n    resize();\n  }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9ef82ec4-38f2-4b8b-b729-34f1884a3da4-28","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js","old_string":"    } else if (model.screen === 'Operation' || model.attract.on || model.screen === 'Chart') {\n      view.showOr?.();\n      view.shout?.(false);\n    } else {","new_string":"    } else if (model.screen === 'Operation' || model.attract.on || model.screen === 'Chart') {\n      view.showOr?.();\n      view.setPortrait?.(model.screen === 'Operation' || !!model.attract.on);\n      view.shout?.(false);\n    } else {"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9ef82ec4-38f2-4b8b-b729-34f1884a3da4-29","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js","old_string":"      model.view.showOr?.();\n      model.view.sync(decorateState(model.sim.state), 1 / 60);","new_string":"      model.view.showOr?.();\n      model.view.setPortrait?.(model.screen === 'Operation' || !!model.attract.on);\n      model.view.sync(decorateState(model.sim.state), 1 / 60);"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9ef82ec4-38f2-4b8b-b729-34f1884a3da4-30","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js","o