{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_943","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Package checks are independent of the portrait fix. The session banner client hash remains unchanged.\n\nI will re-run the checks after the build if extraction is quick. The HTML rebuild does not change the session client slice or names, so the package log remains valid. Next priorities are build, card shot, inspect, browser, launches, and hub. I will also verify that exit-interview.json exists and parses correctly.\n\nI will write card-shot.mjs and restore launch.mjs, then build. The card shot script will wait for the Card screen to render, allow extra time for portrait hiding to settle, and then take a screenshot.\n\nI will verify the portrait is not visible in the screenshot. The bust sits at camera position (-0.93, -0.28, -2.2) in the lower left. Buttons are in the menu at the bottom of the card text flow. I will also check ui.css for .screen.card to confirm no CSS overlap.\n\nThe green vitals number \"8890\" might also overlap the lower-left buttons. I will check the new screenshot before deciding whether to fix it.\n\nI will read the existing session-card.png to inspect the layout before writing scripts. I will check for running Chromium processes and run `node tools/build.mjs` from the dev folder without setting HOME, using `node --check` on the three files. The build overwrites tests/hub/site/game.html.\n\nThe card script will be copied from the card section of shots.mjs. launch.mjs will be restored with four-decimal precision and a filled-count suffix for its log line, plus a paintOk threshold of 0.08. A second screenshot will capture the painted field after the move.\n\nThe launch verifier requires both runs to agree on the painted fraction. I will capture a before-and-after pair of PNGs to make the tip movement visually obvious, since two identical post-input frames might not clearly show the delta.\n\nLaunch verification will use two sequential runs rather than a before-and-after pair. The launch sequence waits for the Title screen up to 60 seconds, skips to the game, steps instantly, waits 1.2 seconds, and screenshots. Total launch time may reach three minutes. I will start the build first, then run the card shot with a long blocking wait, followed by the remaining tasks sequentially since only one browser can run at a time. I will also check for any existing browser processes before starting.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1d23b29a-6b9d-4a3f-8440-93e7f1be5ea3-54","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js","offset":630,"limit":25}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1d23b29a-6b9d-4a3f-8440-93e7f1be5ea3-55","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/session.js","offset":290,"limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1d23b29a-6b9d-4a3f-8440-93e7f1be5ea3-56","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/shots/session-card.png"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":460,"output_tokens":1514,"cache_read_input_tokens":87424,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"b61700c2-5443-42f1-ac8f-ed5669a6893c"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-1d23b29a-6b9d-4a3f-8440-93e7f1be5ea3-54","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"630→    audio.scheduleAhead();\\n    if (model.remoteEvents?.length) {\\n      for (const ev of model.remoteEvents) playEvent(ev);\\n      model.remoteEvents = [];\\n    }\\n  }\\n  model.tickAudio = tickAudio;\\n\\n  function syncFromSim() {\\n    if (!model.view || !model.sim || model.norender) return;\\n640→    model.painting = true;\\n    try {\\n      model.view.showOr?.();\\n      model.view.setPortrait?.(model.screen === 'Operation' || !!model.attract.on);\\n      model.view.sync(decorateState(model.sim.state), 1 / 60);\\n    } catch { /* the next pump draws */ }\\n    const drawn = model.view.render?.();\\n    if (drawn?.then) drawn.then(() => { model.painting = false; }, () => { model.painting = false; });\\n    else model.painting = false;\\n  }\\n650→  model.syncFromSim = syncFromSim;\\n\\n  function askBea() {\\n    const text = barkText('idle', null, (model.sim?.tick || 0) % 3);\\n    audio.say('bea', text);\",\"content_concise\":\"630→    audio.scheduleAhead();\\n    if (model.remoteEvents?.length) {\\n      for (const ev of model.remoteEvents) playEvent(ev);\\n      model.remoteEvents = [];\\n    }\\n  }\\n  model.tickAudio = tickAudio;\\n\\n  function syncFromSim() {\\n    if (!model.view || !model.sim || model.norender) return;\\n640→    model.painting = true;\\n    try {\\n      model.view.showOr?.();\\n      model.view.setPortrait?.(model.screen === 'Operation' || !!model.attract.on);\\n      model.view.sync(decorateState(model.sim.state), 1 / 60);\\n    } catch { /* the next pump draws */ }\\n    const drawn = model.view.render?.();\\n    if (drawn?.then) drawn.then(() => { model.painting = false; }, () => { model.painting = false; });\\n    else model.painting = false;\\n  }\\n650→  model.syncFromSim = syncFromSim;\\n\\n  function askBea() {\\n    const text = barkText('idle', null, (model.sim?.tick || 0) % 3);\\n    audio.say('bea', text);\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js\",\"offset\":630,\"limit\":25,\"raw_output\":\"    audio.scheduleAhead();\\n    if (model.remoteEvents?.length) {\\n      for (const ev of model.remoteEvents) playEvent(ev);\\n      model.remoteEvents = [];\\n    }\\n  }\\n  model.tickAudio = tickAudio;\\n\\n  function syncFromSim() {\\n    if (!model.view || !model.sim || model.norender) return;\\n    model.painting = true;\\n    try {\\n      model.view.showOr?.();\\n      model.view.setPortrait?.(model.screen === 'Operation' || !!model.attract.on);\\n      model.view.sync(decorateState(model.sim.state), 1 / 60);\\n    } catch { /* the next pump draws */ }\\n    const drawn = model.view.render?.();\\n    if (drawn?.then) drawn.then(() => { model.painting = false; }, () => { model.painting = false; });\\n    else model.painting = false;\\n  }\\n  model.syncFromSim = syncFromSim;\\n\\n  function askBea() {\\n    const text = barkText('idle', null, (model.sim?.tick || 0) % 3);\\n    audio.say('bea', text);\\n\",\"total_lines\":1754}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-1d23b29a-6b9d-4a3f-8440-93e7f1be5ea3-55","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"290→      model.sessionPause = !model.sessionPause;\\n    } else if (model.sessionPause && (sample.menu.back || sample.seats.some((s) => s.edges?.back))) {\\n      model.sessionPause = false;\\n    } else if (model.sessionPause) {\\n      model.applySettings?.(sample);\\n    }\\n    model.tickAudio?.();\\n    if (!info.server && model.view && !model.painting) {\\n      if (info.isHost && model.sim) model.syncFromSim?.();\\n      else if (model.netState) {\\n300→        const st = model.netState;\\n        const me = st.seats?.find