{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_946","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Adding CSS to keep the countdown in the left column.\n\ntext-align: left is the correct fix for the countdown position. Now writing scripts and building. Also checking whether the note text might cross the wound.\n\nThe note text is readable and won't cover buttons. The card script will wait roughly 800ms after Card creation to ensure the portrait hides before screenshotting. The portrait now stays hidden until Operation, unlike the old version where showOr forced it visible.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-eb0e2f73-d577-4222-9f94-190cef2e83d6-59","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/ui/ui.css","old_string":".card { gap: 0.8rem; }","new_string":".card { gap: 0.8rem; }\n.card .vitals { text-align: left; }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-eb0e2f73-d577-4222-9f94-190cef2e83d6-60","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"screenshot|toHaveScreenshot|card","glob":"**/tests/hub/**/*.{mjs,js}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-eb0e2f73-d577-4222-9f94-190cef2e83d6-61","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/tests/run-all.mjs","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2877,"output_tokens":728,"cache_read_input_tokens":92032,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"5fc5b6a8-dc97-4942-ae8d-86cd908eac57"}
