{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_954","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The portrait is gone. Ready and More Time are clear.\n\nCountdown 6166 sits left-aligned under Red Fox. The aim note crosses the lower wound but remains readable. A small instrument near the title slightly overlaps the tagline. The tagline is still readable.\n\nThe tool is only a minor overlap, not a text blocker. The main defect is fixed. Other shots are from the previous build. The operation HUD and other screens are unchanged. The verifier checks images for ten-foot issues.\n\nThe operation rendering matches the previous build. I will re-run the browser suite and two launches because the shipped page and session.js changed. Memory is tight, so the suite may be slower or get killed.\n\nI will run the browser suite with output to browser.log. I will set block_until_ms to 180 seconds so launches wait for completion, though it may background if slower than expected.\n\nI will start the browser suite in the background. I will check the hand-in files and update the todos while it runs. I will monitor for completion.\n\nThe browser suite uses the already-built root HTML, so it does not rebuild. The hub suite also reads from the updated game.html. I will verify that root HTML size matches dist and game.html. I will check that exit-interview.json parses correctly. I will confirm the title is absent from any edited files. PROGRESS.md will be updated after tests pass.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e693a646-ede6-4276-8b04-4c730b0f293d-71","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"fix","status":"completed"},{"id":"shots","status":"completed","content":"Session card recaptured: Ready and More Time are clear"},{"id":"verify","status":"in_progress"}],"merge":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e693a646-ede6-4276-8b04-4c730b0f293d-72","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs