{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_964","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The hub contains six WebGPU and WebGL runs plus one standalone run.\n\nEach run waits for 8000 ms of play plus boot. The existing hub.log is from an older build. game.html bytes changed, so the hub must be re-run to verify the current code.\n\nRe-running the hub is risky because six browsers with SwiftShader may exhaust memory, but the previous run succeeded in this environment. I will wait up to ten minutes and retry if it fails from out-of-memory. The browser suite packaging passed and the additional package checks did not change.\n\nI will grep the source for banned words while the hub starts. The existing package.log is sufficient if those checks still pass. I will delete crop images at the end.\n\nThe launch image description lists only eight of ten tools. Syringe and defib may be cut off at the bottom. The sim log can remain unchanged because the simulator was not modified.\n\nThe verifier flagged a bottom HUD cutoff bug. The calm viewport fit ten tools, but the 720 launch viewport likely clips the bottom two. I will check the WHEEL definition and the 1920 op-calm shot.\n\nI will crop the bottom-left of launch-1.png to verify whether syringe and defib are clipped. If they are hidden, I will fix the wheel layout. The 720p launch viewport may not fit all ten tools.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-378817dd-6ff9-4d2b-8496-d1a5dab75213-86","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"const WHEEL|WHEEL =","glob":"**/*.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-378817dd-6ff9-4d2b-8496-d1a5dab75213-87","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230\" && node tests/run-all.mjs hub > \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tm