{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_983","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The card's `left` property is measured in milliseconds.\n\nThe game renders `Math.ceil(model.card.left)`, which produces 6166 instead of the expected seconds. This confirms a bug where milliseconds are displayed as seconds.\n\nThe hub harness likely does not verify the displayed countdown number. The screenshot shows 6166 rather than a 3-2-1 countdown. This reveals two distinct issues: the milliseconds display bug and the missing countdown sequence.\n\nThe 3-2-1 countdown is a separate phase that begins after the card event, once AIHub.time() becomes negative. The card phase occurs before start, when time is -Infinity, so it cannot display the countdown sequence.\n\nThe fix is to divide `card.left` by 1000 before displaying it. I am now checking session.js to see if the 3-2-1 countdown UI appears when AIHub.time() turns negative after the round starts.\n\nThe screenshot confirms a concrete defect in shipped behavior. PLAN §14.4 explicitly requires seconds left and a 3-2-1 countdown, so this is a direct violation of the objective. The acceptance criterion for \"own card\" is too vague to override this requirement.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-23996478-8a46-4cf5-ad77-f6d03eab2b6d-31","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"countdown|3-2-1|goAt|clock < 0|time\\(\\)","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src","glob":"*.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-23996478-8a46-4cf5-ad77-f6d03eab2b6d-32","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/session.js","offset":250,"limit":200}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2273,"output_tokens":969,"cache_read_input_tokens":68352,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"3cdf5005-021d-4c2a-8941-ba63bcf554d6"}
