{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_986","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Line 260 of session.js sets `goAt` to the current time plus a message delay value.\n\nThe `start` message carries `in` as milliseconds until start. The game pump skips its screen transition block while the clock is negative, so the screen remains 'Card' and never reaches 'Countdown'. It only switches to 'Operation' once the clock hits zero.\n\nThe card's `left` field renders the raw splash countdown in milliseconds. PLAN §14.4 explicitly requires a 3-2-1 countdown from AIHub.time(). This is a real defect: the card displays 6166 instead of roughly six seconds. The hub harness passed because it does not verify this visual countdown. A visible bug in shipped behavior is grounds to refute otherwise complete work.\n\nThe host simulation timer uses setTimeout instead of requestAnimationFrame. It caps steps at five per pump and delta time at 0.05 seconds, so a slow tab could fall behind. This is not a criterion bug. The client correctly overwrites local tip coordinates before rendering.\n\nThe vendor hub calls `AIHub.ready()` at the start of `runSession`, which may occur before the welcome message arrives. The client ignores early `ready()` calls until it is welcomed, so this could be a race condition.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-eca35bba-b6d8-45e8-88cf-df7fddaef32e-37","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"AIHub\\.ready|welcomed|on\\('welcome'","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src","glob":"*.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-eca35bba-b6d8-45e8-88cf-df7fddaef32e-38","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/tools/vendor/session.js","offset":220,"limit":55}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1073,"output_tokens":851,"cache_read_input_tokens":75392,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"46d186ec-c93d-4aa4-b645-63df0d16614f"}
