{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_992","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The launch loads the real page and waits for the title. It then skips to the broken-glass test hook and drives stick input via test.\n\nThe painted fraction is 67%, well above the 8% threshold, and the image shows a substantially filled canvas. The launch gate passes. The card countdown bugs remain the outstanding issue.\n\nThe countdown number 6166 is the defect. The director shows seconds but with wrong units, and the 3-2-1 sequence never appears. Existing hub tests only check pass flags, not card digits, so this bug shipped. The fix is to divide card.left by 1000 to display seconds.\n\nThe `if (clock >= 0)` gate prevents the Countdown branch from ever running, so the 3-2-1 sequence never appears. A test should assert that the card shows a small seconds value and that the screen displays 3, 2, or 1 during the start countdown. The harness source confirms `left` is in milliseconds.\n\nThe verdict files are being written now. The bugs are in shipped code, not untestable units, so the implementer should fix the code and add a test that drives the real session card. Blocking is none and confidence is high.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1351fb92-1187-4b26-90e9-6aefcae35448-48","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"card","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/tools/vendor/session.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2531,"output_tokens":1091,"cache_read_input_tokens":86912,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"27a5f78e-2c47-43c3-9f76-f459417b5b71"}
