{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-61e72497-ec6d-43cb-8a20-70bfae96752c-50","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"259→    if (m.type === 'start') {\\n260→      goAt = now() + Number(m.in || 0);\\n      emit('start', [{ in: Number(m.in || 0) }]);\\n    } else if (m.type === 'message') {\\n      emit('message', [m.data, m.from]);\\n    } else if (m.type === 'leave') {\\n      hub.players = hub.players.filter(function (p) {\\n        return p.id !== m.id;\\n      });\\n      emit('leave', [{ id: m.id, reason: m.reason }]);\\n    } else if (m.type === 'time-up') {\\n270→      emit('time-up', [{ graceMs: m.graceMs }]);\\n    } else if (m.type === 'end') {\\n      ended = true;\\n      if (progressTimer) clearTimeout(progressTimer);\\n      emit('end', [{ reason: m.reason, standings: m.standings || null }]);\\n    } else {\\n      // An event this client has never heard of: hand it on as it came.\\n      var detail = {};\\n      for (var k in m) if (own(m, k) && k !== 'aihub' && k !== 'type') detail[k] = m[k];\\n      emit(m.type, [detail]);\\n280→    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function info() {\\n    var out = {};\\n    for (var key in hub) if (own(hub, key) && typeof hub[key] !== 'function' && !KEEP[key]) out[key] = hub[key];\\n    out.players = hub.players.slice();\\n    return out;\\n  }\",\"content_concise\":\"259→    if (m.type === 'start') {\\n260→      goAt = now() + Number(m.in || 0);\\n      emit('start', [{ in: Number(m.in || 0) }]);\\n    } else if (m.type === 'message') {\\n      emit('message', [m.data, m.from]);\\n    } else if (m.type === 'leave') {\\n      hub.players = hub.players.filter(function (p) {\\n        return p.id !== m.id;\\n      });\\n      emit('leave', [{ id: m.id, reason: m.reason }]);\\n    } else if (m.type === 'time-up') {\\n270→      emit('time-up', [{ graceMs: m.graceMs }]);\\n    } else if (m.type === 'end') {\\n      ended = true;\\n      if (progressTimer) clearTimeout(progressTimer);\\n      emit('end', [{ reason: m.reason, standings: m.standings || null }]);\\n    } else {\\n      // An event this client has never heard of: hand it on as it came.\\n      var detail = {};\\n      for (var k in m) if (own(m, k) && k !== 'aihub' && k !== 'type') detail[k] = m[k];\\n      emit(m.type, [detail]);\\n280→    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function info() {\\n    var out = {};\\n    for (var key in hub) if (own(hub, key) && typeof hub[key] !== 'function' && !KEEP[key]) out[key] = hub[key];\\n    out.players = hub.players.slice();\\n    return out;\\n  }\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/tools/vendor/session.js\",\"offset\":259,\"limit\":30,\"raw_output\":\"    if (m.type === 'start') {\\n      goAt = now() + Number(m.in || 0);\\n      emit('start', [{ in: Number(m.in || 0) }]);\\n    } else if (m.type === 'message') {\\n      emit('message', [m.data, m.from]);\\n    } else if (m.type === 'leave') {\\n      hub.players = hub.players.filter(function (p) {\\n        return p.id !== m.id;\\n      });\\n      emit('leave', [{ id: m.id, reason: m.reason }]);\\n    } else if (m.type === 'time-up') {\\n      emit('time-up', [{ graceMs: m.graceMs }]);\\n    } else if (m.type === 'end') {\\n      ended = true;\\n      if (progressTimer) clearTimeout(progressTimer);\\n      emit('end', [{ reason: m.reason, standings: m.standings || null }]);\\n    } else {\\n      // An event this client has never heard of: hand it on as it came.\\n      var detail = {};\\n      for (var k in m) if (own(m, k) && k !== 'aihub' && k !== 'type') detail[k] = m[k];\\n      emit(m.type, [detail]);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function info() {\\n    var out = {};\\n    for (var key in hub) if (own(hub, key) && typeof hub[key] !== 'function' && !KEEP[key]) out[key] = hub[key];\\n    out.players = hub.players.slice();\\n    return out;\\n  }\\n\",\"total_lines\":488}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"b60c2c1d-6089-49d8-b449-838a0776aefc"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_995","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Card events pass through unchanged with `left` in milliseconds.\n\nThe bug is confirmed: `left` is in milliseconds but the game displays it as seconds. The implementer needs to divide by 1000 before rendering. The countdown logic also has a dead branch because `if (clock >= 0)` never triggers when `AIHub.time()` is negative.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The card shows raw milliseconds, and the 3-2-1 countdown never runs. I’ll record that as a refute."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7a48e303-d383-4bfa-9ddd-cf46b0b8ea3b-51","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/goal-verdict-c4cb33e83374-1-0.json","content":"{\n  \"refuted\": true,\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"bug\",\n      \"location\": \"Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js:1578\",\n      \"detail\": \"Session card prints Math.ceil(card.left) but the hub card event's left is milliseconds (harness tickCard: splashUntil - now). shots/session-card.png shows 6166 beside Red Fox, not seconds left. Divide by 1000 before display.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"bug\",\n      \"location\": \"Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/session.js:282\",\n      \"detail\": \"PLAN §14.4 3-2-1 is dead: the Countdown branch is inside `if (clock >= 0)` while AIHub.time() is negative for countdownMs (3000). Screen stays Card, then jumps to Operation; countN is never 3, 2, or 1. Switch to Countdown while time is finite and negative, and keep the sim gated on time >= 0.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"gap\",\n      \"location\": \"tests/hub or tests/browser session card\",\n      \"detail\": \"No test reads the shipped card/countdown DOM. Add one that drives the real hub card (or session page) and asserts the visible seconds are a small integer matching ceil(left/1000), and that during the start countdown the visible digit is 3, 2, or 1 before the operation starts.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"evidence\": \"session-card.png shows 6166; director.js:1578 ceils raw card.left; harness.html:274 sends ms; session.js:282-287 countdown only runs when clock >= 0; round.js countdownMs is 3000. Suites otherwise green (sim 51, browser 80, hub 23).\",\n  \"confidence\": \"high\",\n  \"blocking\": \"none\",\n  \"details_md\": \"The sim, browser, and hub suites are green, and both WebGPU launches paint a 1280×720 field with a moving tip. The session card does not.\\n\\nThe hub card event's `left` is milliseconds (`splashUntil - performance.now()` in `tests/hub/site/harness.html`). `paintCard` prints `Math.ceil(model.card.left)` with no conversion (`director.js:1578`). The captured 1920×1080 card shows **6166** next to the seat, not seconds remaining.\\n\\nThe 3-2-1 countdown required by PLAN §14.4 is unreachable. `round.js` starts the round with `countdownMs: 3000`, so `AIHub.time()` is negative until go. `session.js:282` only enters the countdown update when `clock >= 0`, and the `clock < 0` assignments inside that block never run. The Countdown screen in `director.js` is therefore dead; the card stays up and then the operation starts.\\n\\nNothing in the hub or browser suite reads that number or the countdown digit, which is why 23 hub checks still passed. Fix both paths and assert them on the real card.\"\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7a48e303-d383-4bfa-9ddd-cf46b0b8ea3b-52","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/goal-classifier-c4cb33e83374-1-skeptic-0.md","content":"The sim, browser, and hub suites are green, and both WebGPU launches paint a 1280×720 field with a moving tip. The session card does not.\n\nThe hub card event's `left` is milliseconds (`splashUntil - performance.now()` in `tests/hub/site/harness.html`). `paintCard` prints `Math.ceil(model.card.left)` with no conversion (`director.js:1578`). The captured 1920×1080 card shows **6166** next to the seat, not seconds remaining.\n\nThe 3-2-1 countdown required by PLAN §14.4 is unreachable. `round.js` starts the round with `countdownMs: 3000`, so `AIHub.time()` is negative until go. `session.js:282` only enters the countdown update when `clock >= 0`, and the `clock < 0` assignments inside that block never run. The Countdown screen in `director.js` is therefore dead; the card stays up and then the operation starts.\n\nNothing in the hub or browser suite reads that number or the countdown digit, which is why 23 hub checks still passed. Fix both paths and assert them on the real card.\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":570,"output_tokens":1503,"cache_read_input_tokens":90880,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"751b8972-325a-46df-b7f1-1222ce7b4be7"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-7a48e303-d383-4bfa-9ddd-cf46b0b8ea3b-51","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"{\\n  \\\"refuted\\\": true,\\n  \\\"findings\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"kind\\\": \\\"bug\\\",\\n      \\\"location\\\": \\\"Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js:1578\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"Session card prints Math.ceil(card.left) but the hub card event's left is milliseconds (harness tickCard: splashUntil - now). shots/session-card.png shows 6166 beside Red Fox, not seconds left. Divide by 1000 before display.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"kind\\\": \\\"bug\\\",\\n      \\\"location\\\": \\\"Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/session.js:282\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"PLAN §14.4 3-2-1 is dead: the Countdown branch is inside `if (clock >= 0)` while AIHub.time() is negative for countdownMs (3000). Screen stays Card, then jumps to Operation; countN is never 3, 2, or 1. Switch to Countdown while time is finite and negative, and keep the sim gated on time >= 0.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"kind\\\": \\\"gap\\\",\\n      \\\"location\\\": \\\"tests/hub or tests/browser session card\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"No test reads the shipped card/countdown DOM. Add one that drives the real hub card (or session page) and asserts the visible seconds are a small integer matching ceil(left/1000), and that during the start countdown the visible digit is 3, 2, or 1 before the operation starts.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"session-card.png shows 6166; director.js:1578 ceils raw card.left; harness.html:274 sends ms; session.js:282-287 countdown only runs when clock >= 0; round.js countdownMs is 3000. Suites otherwise green (sim 51, browser 80, hub 23).\\\",\\n  \\\"confidence\\\": \\\"high\\\",\\n  \\