countdown required by PLAN §14.4 is unreachable. `round.js` starts the round with `countdownMs: 3000`, so `AIHub.time()` is negative until go. `session.js:282` only enters the countdown update when `clock >= 0`, and the `clock < 0` assignments inside that block never run. The Countdown screen in `director.js` is therefore dead; the card stays up and then the operation starts.\\\\n\\\\nNothing in the hub or browser suite reads that number or the countdown digit, which is why 23 hub checks still passed. Fix both paths and assert them on the real card.\\\"\\n}\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-7a48e303-d383-4bfa-9ddd-cf46b0b8ea3b-52","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"The sim, browser, and hub suites are green, and both WebGPU launches paint a 1280×720 field with a moving tip. The session card does not.\\n\\nThe hub card event's `left` is milliseconds (`splashUntil - performance.now()` in `tests/hub/site/harness.html`). `paintCard` prints `Math.ceil(model.card.left)` with no conversion (`director.js:1578`). The captured 1920×1080 card shows **6166** next to the seat, not seconds remaining.\\n\\nThe 3-2-1 countdown required by PLAN §14.4 is unreachable. `round.js` starts the round with `countdownMs: 3000`, so `AIHub.time()` is negative until go. `session.js:282` only enters the countdown update when `clock >= 0`, and the `clock < 0` assignments inside that block never run. The Countdown screen in `director.js` is therefore dead; the card stays up and then the operation starts.\\n\\nNothing in the hub or browser suite reads that number or the countdown digit, which is why 23 hub checks still passed. Fix both paths and assert them on the real card.\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/goal-c