{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1002","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"`card.left` is measured in milliseconds as `splashUntil - now`.\n\nThe harness only resends when the displayed second changes. The visible countdown uses `Math.max(0, Math.ceil(card.left / 1000))`. It shows nothing while `card.left` is null.\n\nThe paint signature will change each event because the raw millisecond value updates continuously. Rebuilding once per second is acceptable.\n\nThe displayed countdown number freezes between card events until the next one arrives roughly one second later. The Countdown screen logic sets `model.countN` to `Math.max(1, Math.ceil(-clock / 1000))` when the clock is negative.\n\nThe Countdown branch was unreachable because the block only ran when `clock >= 0`. The fix gates it on `Number.isFinite(clock) && clock < 0` so the screen switches to Countdown during negative time. The Operation branch stays under `clock >= 0`.\n\nThe Operation branch resets `countN` to zero and marks the screen reached. The simulation step is already gated on `clock >= 0`, so it does not run during countdown. Because the paint signature includes both `screen` and `countN`, the DOM updates automatically when either changes.\n\nThe Countdown screen will render a large digit via innerHTML with the big class. The director paint function must execute so the countdown is actually visible.\n\nThe visible countdown digit should read 3, 2, or 1 before the operation begins. The existing simulation step gate remains active during countdown. Portrait is hidden while Countdown is active and the countdown DOM covers the screen. Once releaseRound occurs, splashUntil becomes null, left becomes null, and starting becomes true.\n\nThe card event handler only switches the screen back to Card when the clock is exactly -Infinity. During a finite negative countdown, it leaves the Countdown screen alone.\n\nA single frame of Card with no seconds may appear after release while the clock is still -Infinity, before the pump switches to Countdown. The test must verify that visible seconds are small integers matching ceil(left/1000), and that the countdown digit reads 3, 2, or 1 during the start countdown.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1e2a2c84-6794-446b-b4f0-58ad04a92158-115","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js","offset":1596,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1e2a2c84-6794-446b-b4f0-58ad04a92158-116","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/tests/hub/site/harness.html","offset":160,"limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1e2a2c84-6794-446b-b4f0-58ad04a92158-117","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"SPLASH_MS|auto","glob":"**/tests/hub/site/harness.html"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2289,"output_tokens":1726,"cache_read_input_tokens":143744,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"2bb8c61e-8b06-48f2-8269-278ba84649ed"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-1e2a2c84-6794-446b-b4f0-58ad04a92158-115","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1596→  function state() {\\n    const sim = model.sim;\\n    const net = !sim ? model.netState : null;\\n    const seats = sim?.seats || net?.seats || [];\\n1600→    const seat = seats.find((s) => !s.out) || seats[0];\\n    const items = currentItems();\\n    const rank = sim?.rank?.id || (typeof net?.rank === 'string' ? net.rank : net?.rank?.id) || null;\\n    return {\\n      screen: model.screen,\\n      op: sim?.op?.id || net?.op || null,\\n      phase: sim?.phase?.id || net?.phase || null,\\n      vitals: sim ? sim.vitals : (net?.vitals ?? null),\\n      timer: sim ? sim.timer : (net?.timer ?? null),\\n      score: sim ? sim.score : (net?.score ?? 0),\\n1610→      rank,\\n      bpm: sim ? sim.beat.bpm : (net?.bpm ?? null),\\n      beat: sim ? sim.beat.count : (net?.beat ?? 0),\\n      site: sim ? sim.activeSite : (net?.site ?? null),\\n      tool: seat?.tool || null,\\n      tips: seats.map((s) => ({ id: s.id, x: s.x, y: s.y, tool: s.tool, score: s.score || 0, use: s.use || 0 })),\\n      focusId: items[model.focus]?.id || null,\\n      promptSet: model.input?.promptSet || document.documentElement.dataset.promptSet || 'keyboard',\\n      glyphSet: model.settings.glyphs || 'playstation',\\n      attract: !!model.attract.on,\\n1620→      devOpen: model.overlay === 'dev',\\n      renderBackend: model.view?.backend || 'none',\\n      musicGain: model.audio?.music?.gain?.value ?? 0.1,\\n      tuning: model.tuning,\\n      reached: [...model.reached],\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  const api = {\\n    state,\\n1630→    audio,\\n    devRun(id, arg) { return runDev(model, id, arg); },\\n  };\\n  if (model.test) {\\n    api.test = {\\n      step(n) {\\n        const count = Math.max(0, n | 0);\\n        for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) stepOnce();\\n      },\\n      warp(n) { model.warp = n | 0; },\\n1640→      input(frame) { model.override = frame || null; },\\n      bot(on, opts) {\\n        model.botOn = !!on;\\n        if (opts) model.botOpts = opts;\\n      },\\n      skipTo(op, phase) {\",\"content_concise\":\"1596→  function state() {\\n    const sim = model.sim;\\n    const net = !sim ? model.netState : null;\\n    const seats = sim?.seats || net?.seats || [];\\n1600→    const seat = seats.find((s) => !s.out) || seats[0];\\n    const items = currentItems();\\n    const rank = sim?.rank?.id || (typeof net?.rank === 'string' ? net.rank : net?.rank?.id) || null;\\n    return {\\n      screen: model.screen,\\n      op: sim?.op?.id || net?.op || null,\\n      phase: sim?.phase?.id || net?.phase || null,\\n      vitals: sim ? sim.vitals : (net?.vitals ?? null),\\n      timer: sim ? sim.timer : (net?.timer ?? null),\\n      score: sim ? sim.score : (net?.score ?? 0),\\n1610→      rank,\\n      bpm: sim ? sim.beat.bpm : (net?.bpm ?? null),\\n      beat: sim ? sim.beat.count : (net?.beat ?? 0),\\n      site: sim ? sim.activeSite : (net?.site ?? null),\\n      tool: seat?.tool || null,\\n      tips: seats.map((s) => ({ id: s.id, x: s.x, y: s.y, tool: s.tool, score: s.score || 0, use: s.use || 0 })),\\n      focusId: items[model.focus]?.id || null,\\n      promptSet: model.input?.promptSet || document.documentElement.dataset.promptSet || 'keyboard',\\n      glyphSet: model.settings.glyphs || 'playstation',\\n      attract: !!model.attract.on,\\n1620→      devOpen: model.overlay === 'dev',\\n      renderBackend: model.view?.backend || 'none',\\n      musicGain: model.audio?.music?.gain?.value ?? 0.1,\\n      tuning: model.tuning,\\n      reached: [...model.reached],\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  const api = {\\n    state,\\n1630→    audio,\\n    devRun(id, arg) { return runDev(model, id, arg); },\\n  };\\n  if (model.test) {\\n    api.test = {\\n      step(n) {\\n        const count = Math.max(0, n | 0);\\n        for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) stepOnce();\\n      },\\n      warp(n) { model.warp = n | 0; },\\n1640→      input(frame) { model.override = frame || null; },\\n      bot(on, opts) {\\n        model.botOn = !!on;\\n        if (opts) model.botOpts = opts;\\n      },\\n      skipTo(op, phase) {\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/app/director.js\",\"offset\":1596,\"limit\":50,\"raw_output\":\"  function state() {\\n    const sim = model.sim;\\n    const net = !sim ? model.netState : null;\\n    const seats = sim?.seats || net?.seats || [];\\n    const seat = seats.find((s) => !s.out) || seats[0];\\n    const items = currentItems();\\n    const rank = sim?.rank?.id || (typeof net?.rank === 'string' ? net.rank : net?.rank?.id) || null;\\n    return {\\n      screen: model.screen,\\n      op: sim?.op?.id || net?.op || null,\\n      phase: sim?.phase?.id || net?.phase || null,\\n      vitals: sim ? sim.vitals : (net?.vitals ?? null),\\n      timer: sim ? sim.timer : (net?.timer ?? null),\\n      score: sim ? sim.score : (net?.score ?? 0),\\n      rank,\\n      bpm: sim ? sim.beat.bpm : (net?.bpm ?? null),\\n      beat: sim ? sim.beat.count : (net?.beat ?? 0),\\n      site: sim ? sim.activeSite : (net?.site ?? null),\\n      tool: seat?.tool || null,\\n      tips: seats.map((s) => ({ id: s.id, x: s.x, y: s.y, tool: s.tool, score: s.score || 0, use: s.use || 0 })),\\n      focusId: items[model.focus]?.id || null,\\n      promptSet: model.input?.promptSet || document.documentElement.dataset.promptSet || 'keyboard',\\n      glyphSet: model.settings.glyphs || 'playstation',\\n      attract: !!model.attract.on,\\n      devOpen: model.overlay === 'dev',\\n      renderBackend: model.view?.backend || 'none',\\n      musicGain: model.audio?.music?.gain?.value ?? 0.1,\\n      tuning: model.tuning,\\n      reached: [...model.reached],\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  const api = {\\n    state,\\n    audio,\\n    devRun(id, arg) { return runDev(model, id, arg); },\\n  };\\n  if (model.test) {\\n    api.test = {\\n      step(n) {\\n        const count = Math.max(0, n | 0);\\n        for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) stepOnce();\\n      },\\n      warp(n) { model.warp = n | 0; },\\n      input(frame) { model.override = frame || null; },\\n      bot(on, opts) {\\n        model.botOn = !!on;\\n        if (opts) model.botOpts = opts;\\n      },\\n      skipTo(op, phase) {\\n\",\"total_lines\":1754}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-1e2a2c84-6794-446b-b4f0-58ad04a92158-116","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"160→  applyNet();\\n  const game = $('game').value.trim();\\n  if (!game) return null;\\n  if (!gameUrl(game)) {\\n    log(`Not loading ${game}: the harness only plays pages from this site.`);\\n    return null;\\n  }\\n  const n = Math.max(1, Math.min(4, Number($('players').value) || 2));\\n  const metas = await metasOf(game);\\n  const mode = modeOf(metas?.mode);\\n170→  const limitMs = params.has('limit') ? Number(params.get('limit')) * 1000 : limitFor(metas?.minutes);\\n  const seed = params.has('seed') ? Number(params.get('seed')) >>> 0 : crypto.getRandomValues(new Uint32Array(1))[0];\\n  const round = ++roundNo;\\n  const players = Array.from({ length: n }, (_, slot) => ({ key: `p${slot}`, slot, name: NAMES[slot] }));\\n  const hubEnd = net.endpoint('hub');\\n  const grid = $('grid');\\n  grid.replaceChildren();\\n  const copies = n + (serverMode ? 1 : 0);\\n  grid.style.gridTemplateColumns = copies > 1 ? '1fr 1fr' : '1fr';\\n  grid.style.gridTemplateRows = `repeat(${Math.ceil(copies / (copies > 1 ? 2 : 1))}, 1fr)`;\\n180→\\n  const state = { round, n, metas, mode, limitMs, seed, players, cells: [], hubEnd, status: null, record: null, hidden: false, splashUntil: performance.now() + SPLASH_MS, answers: { ready: new Set(), more: new Set() } };\\n  current = state;\\n  log(`round ${round}: 