{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1010","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Clicking should work. Enter will serve as a backup if clicking is unreliable.\n\nThe viewport will be set to 1280x860 so the iframe is large enough for reliable clicking. The test must use the real button and avoid calling AIHub.answer directly. Expected seconds should be computed dynamically from cardLeft rather than hardcoded.\n\ncardLeft will be added to state() so the test can read the hub value directly. The DOM text will be asserted as a small integer, and cardLeft may also be exposed via a data attribute on the element.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-72246f4f-fd71-4a64-a2ac-5ba883526339-130","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/main.js","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":608,"output_tokens":539,"cache_read_input_tokens":161664,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"131be666-c07b-4ae3-abed-68d59b3ba832"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-72246f4f-fd71-4a64-a2ac-5ba883526339-130","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→import { createApp } from './app/director.js';\\n\\nconst params = new URLSearchParams(location.search);\\nconst app = createApp({ params });\\nwindow.__game = app.api;\\nconst info = await AIHub.connect({ mode: 'shared-world', seats: [1, 4], card: true });\\nif (info) app.startSession(info);\\nelse await app.startStandalone();\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→import { createApp } from './app/director.js';\\n\\nconst params = new URLSearchParams(location.search);\\nconst app = createApp({ params });\\nwindow.__game = app.api;\\nconst info = await AIHub.connect({ mode: 'shared-world', seats: [1, 4], card: true });\\nif (info) app.startSession(info);\\nelse await app.startStandalone();\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/src/main.js\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"import { createApp } from './app/director.js';\\n\\nconst params = new URLSearchParams(location.search);\\nconst app = createApp({ params });\\nwindow.__game = app.api;\\nconst info = await AIHub.connect({ mode: 'shared-world', seats: [1, 4], card: true });\\nif (info) app.startSession(info);\\nelse await app.startStandalone();\\n\",\"total_lines\":8}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"fed032d5-eb80-45b1-8d90-d63b8fe95374"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1011","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"`__game.state()` is always available.\n\nAdding `cardLeft` and `countN` to the state object. The countdown element will use the existing `.big` class. The paint function will accept a displayed second parameter to avoid unnecessary rebuilds. It will skip rendering when the remaining time is null.\n\nThe countdown screen will switch via direct assignment to avoid resetting focus. The pump already calls paint at the end, and the signature changes when the screen or countN updates. A potential issue with `model.paint` being `() => paint(false)` was noted.\n\nThe countdown section is transparent, so the canvas behind it remains visible. The test reads textContent rather than checking visibility, so the large centered number is fine. The card paint will use seconds, and the vitals element will receive a `data-card-secs` attribute to prevent stray numbers from being detected.\n\nThe test will assert the card timer is a small integer between 0 and 30 seconds, matching Math.ceil(left / 1000). The countdown screen must display a visible digit of 1, 2, or 3.\n\nThe countdown test will verify that the state's `countN` matches the visible digit to avoid stale DOM readings. In the hub suite, the card countdown test will run first so failures surface quickly; existing tests follow sequentially.\n\nThe card test uses WebGL without GPU flags for speed and lower memory. game.html must be rebuilt before the test because the harness reads the build copy. The browser suite packaging needs no changes. The hub test count will rise from 23 to 26, so about.json should be updated to reflect the new total.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8f2762d3-af53-4d59-a563-f62fd4bc688c-131","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"23 checks|80 checks|51 checks","glob":"**/*.{js,mjs,json,md}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":731,"output_tokens":1119,"cache_read_input_tokens":162176,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"47fcaf7a-ee0e-46a8-9341-dbb8f5bdd0a8"}
