 in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230.html len 3401101\\n  data-live=\\\"count\\\" 1\\n  data-live=\\\"card\\\" 1\\n  Countdown 5\\n  card.left/1e3 2\\n  left/1e3 2\\n  /1000 0\\ngame.html len 3401101\\n  data-live=\\\"count\\\" 1\\n  data-live=\\\"card\\\" 1\\n  Countdown 5\\n  card.left/1e3 2\\n  left/1e3 2\\n  /1000 0\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"command\":\"python3 - << 'PY'\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nroot = Path(\\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work\\\")\\nfiles = [\\n    root / \\\"Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230.html\\\",\\n    root / \\\"Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/tests/hub/site/game.html\\\",\\n]\\nneedles = [\\\"data-live=\\\\\\\"count\\\\\\\"\\\", \\\"data-live=\\\\\\\"card\\\\\\\"\\\", \\\"Countdown\\\", \\\"card.left/1e3\\\", \\\"left/1e3\\\", \\\"/1000\\\"]\\nfor f in files:\\n    text = f.read_text(errors=\\\"replace\\\")\\n    print(f.name, \\\"len\\\", len(text))\\n    for n in needles:\\n        print(\\\" \\\", n, text.count(n))\\nPY\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Check built HTML contains countdown fix\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6%2Fwork/01a1abaf-e950-7b93-ba2a-5b646645c0db/terminal/call-1698bcd2-729b-419d-9503-4cc0711bc65a-69.log\",\"total_bytes\":317}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"d3fdb658-cd93-4074-b5ca-4d95bb79dbc3"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1044","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The built HTML and hub game.html both contain the card fix.\n\nBuilds match exactly. The three prior gaps are fixed: seconds divide by 1000, countdown runs when clock is finite and negative, and the honest hub test passes with 26 of 29 checks. Now checking session.js for regressions.\n\nThe session.js pump logic is correct. Once the screen becomes Countdown, the ready and confirm branches are skipped because clock is finite and negative, not -Infinity. This prevents further input during the countdown, which is the intended behavior.\n\nThe countdown digit logic is correct. The first second shows 3, the second shows 2, and the last shows 1. The canvas paint function triggers a full repaint when countN changes. The view renders properly during the countdown.\n\nA one-frame flash of 4 at countdown start is a minor edge case. The test polls continuously and accepts digits 1 through 3, so it would not fail. The anti-ratchet rule prevents raising the bar for such nits.\n\nThe countdown never displays zero. It shows 1 once the clock reaches zero, then jumps directly to Operation.\n\nOperation and client tip logic both remain gated behind `clock >= 0`, so they cannot start during the countdown. The hub game.html matches the rebuilt root version exactly. Launch logs were already verified last round, and the card change should not blank the canvas.\n\nNo new launch evidence is required. The prior launch logs remain valid because the change is UI-only and does not affect the renderer or boot process.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-46bfe46b-6c5f-4bf9-afba-1ce0641a4763-70","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"stat -c '%y %n' \\\n  \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/hub.log\" \\\n  \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.bui