{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1069","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe 26 passed tests confirm the fix is present in the built game.html. The prior gap of 23 checks plus 3 new ones equals 26, matching the final response and hub.log.\n\nThe test reads the real DOM and state().cardLeft. If the display did not divide, the card would show ~6000–10000 seconds. That would fail both the shown <= 30 check and the equality check againstThe three prior gaps are now fixed. Math.ceil(left / 1000). The test is therefore honest.\n\nThe countdown test is also honest. It requires a digit of 1, 2, or 3 on the live element and a later Operation screen. A dead countdown would leave the digit empty and skip that screen.\n\nI will verify that hub.log is newer than\n\ndirector.js now correctly the source changes  displays the roundedand that the built bundle card count. session.js matches. I will extract the countdown logic gates countdown and from game.html as a Operation on a valid quick spot-check. non-negative clock. The hub suite passes 26 tests with zero failures.\n\nThe session-card screenshot may be stale. If the code fix was applied but the image still shows 6166, the observation would not contradict the fix. The hub suite remains the definitive gating test. I will hunt for real defects in the shipped behavior.\n\nNo new defects were found. The countN edge\n\nI will inspect the screenshot directly. case is not a real \n\nI am checking whether the hub protocol sendsissue. card.left in seconds rather than milliseconds. The vendor client forwards the card event unchanged, so the game receives whatever unit the hub provides. The plan specifies seconds left from the card event.\n\nIf the real hub sends card.left in seconds, dividing by 1000 would be wrong and produce 0 for any remaining time under 1000 seconds. The prior skeptic explicitly stated that the harness sends milliseconds, so the division is correct.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a67300c4-b161-4a83-846b-7a5c922e7ec3-27","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"card\\.left|left:","glob":"**/{PLAN.md,docs/**,**/bridge.js,**/session.js,**/AUTHORING.md}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a67300c4-b161-4a83-846b-7a5c922e7ec3-28","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"type === 'card'|card:","glob":"**/tools/vendor/session.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a67300c4-b161-4a83-846b-7a5c922e7ec3-29","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/shots/session-card.png"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6417,"output_tokens":1161,"cache_read_input_tokens":59008,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"7798e982-9ae0-473a-a539-9a1b24f19d02"}
