(session.js:283, director.js:1582); session-card.png shows 6.\\\",\\n  \\\"confidence\\\": \\\"high\\\",\\n  \\\"blocking\\\": \\\"none\\\",\\n  \\\"details_md\\\": \\\"Prior gaps are fixed. The session card divides hub milliseconds by 1000, the 3-2-1 runs while `AIHub.time()` is negative with the sim still gated on `time >= 0`, and `tests/hub/suite.mjs` `cardCountdown` reads that DOM on the real harness iframe. Captured `hub.log` (after the rebuilt root HTML and `tests/hub/site/game.html`, which match) is `0 failed, 26 passed` — the previous 23 plus the three card checks. `shots/session-card.png` shows `6` beside Red Fox, not `6166`.\\\"\\n}\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-0191aed8-1e90-4902-a156-1506c65a392e-27","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"# Skeptic re-check (round 2)\\n\\nNot refuted. Each prior gap is fixed in source, in the inlined hand-in, and in a hub run taken after that rebuild.\\n\\n## Card seconds\\n\\n`director.js` `paintCard` (line 1582) and `patchLive` (line 1464) both set the live card node to `Math.max(0, Math.ceil(model.card.left / 1000))`. The harness still sends milliseconds (`tickCard`: `splashUntil - performance.now()`). The minified root HTML and `tests/hub/site/game.html` are identical and contain `Math.ceil(C.card.left/1e3)`. `shots/session-card.png` (05:28, after the 05:22 build) shows **6** beside Red Fox, with Ready and More Time clear — not 6166.\\n\\n## 3-2-1\\n\\n`session.js` lines 282–292: while `Number.isFinite(clock) && clock < 0` and the screen is Card or Countdown, the screen becomes Countdown and `countN` is `Math.max(1, Math.ceil(-clock / 1000))`. Operation is entered only in the `clock >= 0` branch. Host `sim.step` and client integrate stay inside `clock >= 0` (lines 213 and 258). The same gate is in the bundle (`J>=0&&i.sim&&A.isHost` before the countdown assignment). `director.js` lines 1390–1391 paint `[data-live=\\\"count\\\"]` from `countN`.\\n\\n## Test\\n\\n`tests/hub/suite.mjs` `cardCountdown` loads the harness copy of the built page, waits until the Card DOM is non-empty, and asserts the visible integer equals `ceil(state().cardLeft / 1000)` and is in 0..30. It then presses Ready and requires a visible countdown digit of 1, 2, or 3 before the screen is Operation. That is the real iframe DOM, not a re-implementation. `hub.log` at 05:26 (after the bundle) is `0 failed, 26 passed` and exit 0. 26 is the old 23 plus these three checks (`card seconds`, `countdown digit`, `card page errors`). Browser log is `0 failed, 80 passed`. Both WebGPU launches still report a 1280×720 canvas, a moved tip, and ~0.67 painted.\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/goal-classifier-c4cb33e83374-2-skeptic-1.md has been created.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/goal-classifier-c4cb33e83374-2-skeptic-1.md has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/goal-classifier-c4cb33e83374-2-skeptic-1.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"# Skeptic re-check (round 2)\\n\\nNot refuted. Each prior gap is fixed in source, in the inlined hand-in, and in a hub run taken after that rebuild.\\n\\n## Card seconds\\n\\n`director.js` `paintCard` (line 1582) and `patchLive` (line 1464) both set the live card node to `Math.max(0, Math.ceil(model.card.left / 1000))`. The harness still sends milliseconds (`tickCard`: `splashUntil - performance.now()`). The minified root HTML and `tests/hub/site/game.html` are identical and contain `Math.ceil(C.card.left/1e3)`. `shots/session-card.png` (05:28, after the 05:22 build) shows **6** beside Red Fox, with Ready and More Time clear — not 6166.\\n\\n## 3-2-1\\n\\n`session.js` lines 282–292: while `Number.isFinite(clock) && clock < 0` and the screen is Card or Countdown, the screen becomes Countdown and `countN` is `Math.max(1, Math.ceil(-clock / 1000))`. Operation is entered only in the `clock >= 0` branch. Host `sim.step` and client integrate stay inside `clock >= 0` (lines 213 and 258). The same gate is in the bundle (`J>=0&&i.sim&&A.isHost` before the countdown assignment). `director.js` lines 1390–1391 paint `[data-live=\\\"count\\\"]` from `countN`.\\n\\n## Test\\n\\n`tests/hub/suite.mjs` `cardCountdown` loads the harness copy of the built page, waits until the Card DOM is non-empty, and asserts the visible integer equals `ceil(state().cardLeft / 1000)` and is in 0..30. It then presses Ready and requires a visible countdown digit of 1, 2, or 3 before the screen is Operation. That is the real iframe DOM, not a re-implementation. `hub.log` at 05:26 (after the bundle) is `0 failed, 26 passed` and exit 0. 26 is the old 23 plus these three checks (`card seconds`, `countdown digit`, `card page errors`). Browser log is `0 failed, 80 passed`. Both WebGPU launches still report a 1280×720 canvas, a moved tip, and ~0.67 painted.\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"59245404-6347-49e1-aaf6-a197ae15d420"}
