{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1078","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The implementation looks correct.\n\nThe test results are honest. The bundle is current. The hub log shows 26 passed and zero failed. The screenshot displays \"6\" rather than 6166. The simulation gate at line 213 is confirmed in the built bundle.\n\nThe 252-second gap between the HTML build and hub.log is suspicious. Six GPU harness runs could each take up to 300 seconds, so the total suite should be much longer. The runs may have finished quickly with bots.\n\nThe 252-second duration is plausible once WebGPU loading overhead and the eight-second play parameter are factored in. The card-only test path was considered but ruled out because the log reports twenty-six passed tests, matching the full suite count.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-63291a3b-c971-433c-adcb-e9dcbe8ada0b-43","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/work/Alive in Common Time-Trauma Center: Second Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-231230/tests/run-all.mjs","offset":90,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-63291a3b-c971-433c-adcb-e9dcbe8ada0b-44","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/browser.log"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-63291a3b-c971-433c-adcb-e9dcbe8ada0b-45","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/implementer/shots/card-shot.log"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":863,"output_tokens":739,"cache_read_input_tokens":80640,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa56-6231-7cf0-a666-df5fbb090710","uuid":"68d9e3b0-9e3c-4d2c-b749-e39297ca4a40"}
