ore Time are unobstructed.\\n\\n## 3-2-1\\n\\n`session.js:282-292`: while `AIHub.time()` is finite and negative, the screen becomes `Countdown` and `countN` is `ceil(-clock/1000)` (at least 1). The operation screen is entered only once time is `>= 0`. The host sim step stays inside `if (clock >= 0 && model.sim && info.isHost)` at `session.js:213`. The same ternary is in both bundles. A late card event forces `Card` only while `time() === -Infinity` (`session.js:111`), so it does not cancel the countdown.\\n\\n## DOM test\\n\\n`tests/hub/suite.mjs` `cardCountdown` loads the real harness and `game.html`, waits until the iframe is on `Card` with a non-empty `[data-live=\\\"card\\\"]`, and checks that text is an integer 0–30 equal to `ceil(state().cardLeft / 1000)`. It then answers Ready and requires `[data-live=\\\"count\\\"]` to be 1, 2, or 3 before the screen becomes `Operation`. That function is called from `hubTests()`, which `tests/run-all.mjs` runs. Check count is 3 (card) + 18 (six harness rows) + 5 (alone) = 26. Captured log: `0 failed, 26 passed`, exit 0.\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/goal-classifier-c4cb33e83374-2-skeptic-2.md has been created.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/goal-classifier-c4cb33e83374-2-skeptic-2.md has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-231230__x8f49b6/tmp/grok-goal-c4cb33e83374/goal-classifier-c4cb33e83374-2-skeptic-2.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"# Skeptic 2 — prior gaps\\n\\nNot refuted. All three prior gaps are fixed in the shipped source and in both built pages (root HTML and `tests/hub/site/game.html`, same bytes, built after the source edit). `implementer/hub.log` is newer than those bun